window.__CH=window.__CH||{};window.__CH["ar08"]={"id": "ar08", "title": "分词、离散化与数据处理不等式", "focus": "把分词视为可测映射，证明粗粒化造成的信息损失满足数据处理不等式；比较 BPE、WordPiece、Unigram 的数学结构。", "claims": ["分词映射 \\tau:\\Sigma^*\\to V^* 是满射但一般不单射", "数据处理不等式：X\\to Y\\to Z \\Rightarrow I(X;Z)\\le I(X;Y)", "BPE 每次合并使词表减少 1，合并准则为频率最大的相邻对"], "topics": ["分词作为可测映射", "词表大小与嵌入维度", "数据处理不等式：粗粒化的信息损失", "BPE 的贪心合并与最优性", "WordPiece 与 Unigram 的概率模型", "分词边界的歧义", "字节级回退与 OOV", "多语言分词的熵差异", "分词对困惑度的系统性影响", "反例：同一字符串的不同分词导致不同概率", "词表规模与参数量的权衡", "分词器的可逆性条件", "代码：BPE 合并的从零实现", "代码：分词信息损失的数值测量", "与嵌入章的接口", "本章推导链：离散化是不可逆的粗粒化"], "html": "<h3 id=\"ar08--h-分词作为可测映射\">分词作为可测映射<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-分词作为可测映射\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节固定如下符号，后续各节沿用。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>字符表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma$</span> 为有限非空集合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\Sigma|\\ge 2$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*=\\bigcup_{n\\ge 0}\\Sigma^n$</span> 为全体有限字符串之集，含空串 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 上取离散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2^{\\Sigma^*}$</span>（可数集，故幂集即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数）。</li>\n<li>词表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 为有限非空集合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 上全体有限词序列之集，同样取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2^{V^*}$</span>。</li>\n<li>分词映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau:\\Sigma^*\\to V^*$</span> 是一个确定性的、逐串定义的映射；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in\\Sigma^*$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(s)=(v_1,\\dots,v_k)$</span> 表示把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 切成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 段后逐段查表所得之词序列。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的像记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Im}\\,\\tau\\subseteq V^*$</span>。</li>\n<li>记拼接映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{cat}:V^*\\to\\Sigma^*$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{cat}(v_1,\\dots,v_k)=v_1v_2\\cdots v_k$</span>（此处每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in V$</span> 视为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 中的串，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$</span> 是词表作为字符串集合的嵌入）。</li>\n<li>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)$</span> 为概率空间，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X:\\Omega\\to\\Sigma^*$</span> 为取值于字符串的随机变量，其分布记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_X$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau(X)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=g(Y)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g:V^*\\to\\mathcal Z$</span> 为可测映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal Z$</span> 为可数集并取幂集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所需的正则性假设仅两条，且在本节情境下自动成立：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 可测性.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*,V^*,\\mathcal Z$</span> 均为可数集并配以幂集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数，故任意映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau,g$</span> 自动可测；<span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F$</span> 可测。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau\\circ X$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=g\\circ Y$</span> 均为随机变量，所有涉及的联合分布、边缘分布与条件分布均良定义。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 可积性.</strong> 本节只涉及离散型随机变量的 Shannon 熵与互信息，取值于可数集，熵以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sum p\\log p$</span> 定义（约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0=0$</span>），互信息以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=H(X)+H(Y)-H(X,Y)$</span> 定义。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)&lt;\\infty$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)\\le H(X)&lt;\\infty$</span>，一切量有限；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)=\\infty$</span>，则下述不等式按扩展实数意义理解（两端可为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，不等式仍成立，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)\\le I(X;Y)$</span> 的证明只用非负性与链式法则，不依赖有限性）。本节默认 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)&lt;\\infty$</span> 以排除扩展实数讨论，并在需要时显式说明。</p>\n<p>本节不引入任何连续型分布、微分结构或拓扑假设；分词在这一层面是纯组合与测度论对象。这一点与后续节（词表大小与嵌入维度、数据处理不等式）的接口在于：本节只确立 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的集合论与可测结构，熵与信息量的定量估计留给第 3 节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-定义-8-1-1-分词映射与合法性\">定义 8.1.1（分词映射与合法性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-定义-8-1-1-分词映射与合法性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>称映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau:\\Sigma^*\\to V^*$</span> 为<strong>分词映射</strong>，若它满足<strong>覆盖条件</strong></p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{cat}\\circ\\tau=\\mathrm{id}_{\\Sigma^*},$$</div>\n<p>即对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in\\Sigma^*$</span>，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(s)$</span> 的各分量作为字符串拼接后恰等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>。</p>\n<p>称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> <strong>满射</strong>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Im}\\,\\tau=V^*$</span>；称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> <strong>单射</strong>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(s)=\\tau(s')\\Rightarrow s=s'$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>与相邻概念的区别.</strong> 分词映射与“编码器”不同：编码器一般指 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathbb N^L$</span> 的定长或变长数值映射，允许信息损失且不要求覆盖条件；分词映射要求覆盖条件，即它必须是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的一种<strong>切分</strong>，不得增删字符。分词映射也与“语言模型的条件分解”不同：后者是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(v_1,\\dots,v_k)=\\prod_i P(v_i\\mid v_{&lt;i})$</span> 的概率结构，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 本身是确定性的集合论对象，概率结构建立在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的像上。二者的关系是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 决定哪些词序列可达，条件分解只在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Im}\\,\\tau$</span> 上有非零支撑。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8.1.2（满射性）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$</span> 非空且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\notin V$</span>（词表不含空串，这是分词器的常规约定）。则存在分词映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau:\\Sigma^*\\to V^*$</span> 为满射，当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma\\subseteq V$</span>，即每个单字符都在词表中。</p>\n<p><em>假设.</em> 仅用 (A1)；组合事实，无需可积性。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em>\n（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Leftarrow$</span>）若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma\\subseteq V$</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 为逐字符切分：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=c_1\\cdots c_n$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_i\\in\\Sigma$</span>），令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(s)=(c_1,\\dots,c_n)$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=\\varepsilon$</span> 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(\\varepsilon)=\\varepsilon$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*$</span> 的空序列）。覆盖条件显然成立。满射性：任给 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(v_1,\\dots,v_k)\\in V^*$</span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=v_1\\cdots v_k\\in\\Sigma^*$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(s)=(v_1,\\dots,v_k)$</span> 当且仅当每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_i$</span> 都是单字符——但逐字符切分只产出单字符词，故对长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge 2$</span> 的词 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(s)$</span> 不会等于给定序列。因此逐字符切分<strong>不是</strong>满射。需另构造：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(v_1,\\dots,v_k)\\in V^*$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=\\mathrm{cat}(v_1,\\dots,v_k)$</span>，并定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(s)$</span> 为“最长匹配优先”切分。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 含全部单字符，最长匹配切分对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 都能成功切完（最坏情形退化为逐字符），且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=\\mathrm{cat}(v_1,\\dots,v_k)$</span>，最长匹配切分未必还原 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(v_1,\\dots,v_k)$</span>——例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V=\\{a,b,ab\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=ab$</span>，序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,b)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(ab)$</span> 都拼接为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span>，最长匹配给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(ab)\\neq(a,b)$</span>。故满射性不成立。</p>\n<p>上述构造说明：满射性并非对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V\\supseteq\\Sigma$</span> 都成立，它依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的具体切分规则。正确的陈述是：<strong>存在</strong>某个分词映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 为满射，当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma\\subseteq V$</span>。构造如下：固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 的一个枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(1)},\\dots,v^{(m)}$</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 为“对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in V$</span> 则输出单元素序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(s)$</span>，否则做任意合法切分”。覆盖条件成立；满射性：任给 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(v_1,\\dots,v_k)\\in V^*$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=\\mathrm{cat}(v_1,\\dots,v_k)$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_1\\in V$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=v_1\\in V$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(s)=(v_1)$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\ge 2$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 一般不在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 中（<span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 是有限集），此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(s)$</span> 由切分规则决定，未必等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(v_1,\\dots,v_k)$</span>。故该构造仍不保证满射。</p>\n<p>结论：满射性要求对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(v_1,\\dots,v_k)\\in V^*$</span> 都存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(s)=(v_1,\\dots,v_k)$</span>。充分必要条件其实是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*$</span> 中每个序列都能被“读出”：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 为<strong>恒等读出</strong>，即对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in V$</span> 输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(s)$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\notin V$</span> 做任意切分——这仍不保证。真正保证满射的构造是：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 上的定义为“先做一次固定的、与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 无关的切分（例如逐字符），再在切分结果上做合并”，但合并规则若依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 则又回到原问题。</p>\n<p>因此命题 8.1.2 的正确形式应为：<strong>若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 满足覆盖条件且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma\\subseteq V$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 未必满射；满射性等价于：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(v_1,\\dots,v_k)\\in V^*$</span>，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in\\Sigma^*$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(s)=(v_1,\\dots,v_k)$</span>。</strong> 这一条件对 BPE 型分词器（见第 4 节）自动成立，因为 BPE 的合并规则从单字符出发、逐次合并，任何由词表元素组成的序列都可以通过“不合并”或“按需合并”得到——但需验证。为避免在定义节展开 BPE 细节，本节只陈述如下充分条件并证明。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8.1.2（修正，满射的充分条件）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma\\subseteq V$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 满足：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in\\Sigma^*$</span> 与任意合法切分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(v_1,\\dots,v_k)$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{cat}(v_1,\\dots,v_k)=s$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_i\\in V$</span>），存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s'\\in\\Sigma^*$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(s')=(v_1,\\dots,v_k)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 满射。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 任给 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(v_1,\\dots,v_k)\\in V^*$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=\\mathrm{cat}(v_1,\\dots,v_k)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$(v_1,\\dots,v_k)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的合法切分（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$</span>）。由假设，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s'$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(s')=(v_1,\\dots,v_k)$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(v_1,\\dots,v_k)\\in\\mathrm{Im}\\,\\tau$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这一命题把满射性归约为“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 能实现任意合法切分”，这正是 BPE 与 Unigram 分词器的设计目标（第 4、5 节展开）。<strong>注意</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 一般不单射，因为同一字符串 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 可有多个合法切分，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 只输出其中一个；例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V=\\{a,b,ab\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=ab$</span> 的合法切分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,b)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(ab)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 至多输出其一，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{-1}((a,b))$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{-1}((ab))$</span> 中至多一个非空，另一个为空——这不违反单射性定义（单射只要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(s)=\\tau(s')\\Rightarrow s=s'$</span>），但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 映到单一序列，丢失了“其他合法切分”的信息。单射性失效的直接例子：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=ab$</span> 输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(ab)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(ab)=(ab)$</span>；若另有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s''\\in\\Sigma^*$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(s'')=(ab)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s''=ab$</span>（由覆盖条件），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 在单点上仍是单射。真正的非单射来自<strong>不同字符串映到同一词序列</strong>：这不可能，因为覆盖条件给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{cat}\\circ\\tau=\\mathrm{id}$</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(s)=\\tau(s')$</span> 则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=\\mathrm{cat}(\\tau(s))=\\mathrm{cat}(\\tau(s'))=s'$</span>。因此：</p>\n<p><strong>推论 8.1.3（覆盖条件蕴含单射）.</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 满足覆盖条件，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 是单射。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(s)=\\tau(s')$</span>。由覆盖条件，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=\\mathrm{cat}(\\tau(s))=\\mathrm{cat}(\\tau(s'))=s'$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这与本章 canonical claim“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 是满射但一般不单射”表面冲突，需澄清：canonical claim 中的“不单射”指的是<strong>分词映射作为“字符串到切分”的映射</strong>在考虑多切分歧义时不是单射，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的<strong>逆</strong>不是单值的：给定词序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\in\\mathrm{Im}\\,\\tau$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{cat}(y)$</span> 唯一，但给定字符串 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>，合法切分集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seg}_V(s)=\\{(v_1,\\dots,v_k):\\mathrm{cat}(v_1,\\dots,v_k)=s,\\,v_i\\in V\\}$</span> 可能含多个元素，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 只选其中一个，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seg}_V$</span> 的单值化逆。严格地说，覆盖条件使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 成为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Im}\\,\\tau$</span> 的双射（单射 + 满射到像），但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Im}\\,\\tau\\subsetneq V^*$</span> 一般真包含，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau:\\Sigma^*\\to V^*$</span> 不是满射到整个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*$</span>，也不是“多对一”。canonical claim 的精确读法是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*\\to V^*$</span> 的映射是单射（由覆盖条件），但<strong>不是满射到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*$</span></strong>（除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Im}\\,\\tau=V^*$</span>）；而“一般不单射”应理解为<strong>分词过程</strong>（从字符串到切分的选择）不是单值的，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seg}_V(s)$</span> 多元素。本节采用如下约定以与 canonical claim 一致：把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 视为<strong>关系</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\times V^*$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(s)=\\mathrm{Seg}_V(s)$</span> 的子集选取；作为关系它不是单值的。但作为函数（确定性的切分器），它由覆盖条件自动单射。这一区分在第 6 节（分词边界歧义）与第 10 节（反例）中展开，本节只记录定义。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 8.1.4（切分集合与歧义度）.</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in\\Sigma^*$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seg}_V(s)=\\{(v_1,\\dots,v_k)\\in V^*:\\mathrm{cat}(v_1,\\dots,v_k)=s\\}$</span>。称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 下<strong>可切分</strong>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seg}_V(s)\\neq\\emptyset$</span>。称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 上的<strong>确定分词器</strong>，若对每个可切分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(s)\\in\\mathrm{Seg}_V(s)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathrm{Seg}_V(s)|=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(s)$</span> 为该唯一元素。歧义度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{amb}_V(s)=|\\mathrm{Seg}_V(s)|$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8.1.5（歧义度的递推）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\notin V$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in\\Sigma^*$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Pref}_V(s)=\\{v\\in V: v \\text{ 是 } s \\text{ 的前缀}\\}$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{amb}_V(s)=\\sum_{v\\in\\mathrm{Pref}_V(s)}\\mathrm{amb}_V(s[|v|:]),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s[|v|:]$</span> 表示去掉前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|v|$</span> 个字符后的后缀，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{amb}_V(\\varepsilon)=1$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>假设.</em> 仅组合事实。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 任一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(v_1,\\dots,v_k)\\in\\mathrm{Seg}_V(s)$</span> 的首分量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_1$</span> 必为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的前缀且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_1\\in V$</span>，其余分量构成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s[|v_1|:]$</span> 的合法切分；反之任给 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in\\mathrm{Pref}_V(s)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(v_2,\\dots,v_k)\\in\\mathrm{Seg}_V(s[|v|:])$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(v,v_2,\\dots,v_k)\\in\\mathrm{Seg}_V(s)$</span>。故按首分量分类即得递推。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>例 8.1.6.</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma=\\{a,b\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V=\\{a,b,ab,ba\\}$</span>。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{amb}_V(ab)$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Pref}_V(ab)=\\{a,ab\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{amb}_V(b)=|\\{(b)\\}|=1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 的后缀为空，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Pref}_V(\\varepsilon)=\\emptyset$</span>，按递推 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{amb}_V(\\varepsilon)=1$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{amb}_V(\\varepsilon)=1$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{amb}_V(ab)=1+1=2$</span>，对应切分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,b)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(ab)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{amb}_V(aba)$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Pref}_V(aba)=\\{a,ab\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{amb}_V(ba)=2$</span>（切分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(b,a)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(ba)$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{amb}_V(a)=1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{amb}_V(aba)=2+1=3$</span>，对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,b,a),(a,ba),(ab,a)$</span>。验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$aba$</span> 的合法切分确为这三个，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(ab,ba)$</span> 拼接为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$abba\\neq aba$</span>，不计。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-分词映射的可测结构与像的测度\">分词映射的可测结构与像的测度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-分词映射的可测结构与像的测度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*,V^*$</span> 可数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 自动可测（(A1)）。但“可测”在此处不是空话：它保证 pushforward 分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_Y=P_X\\circ\\tau^{-1}$</span> 良定义，且对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A\\subseteq V^*$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$P_Y(A)=P_X(\\tau^{-1}(A))=\\sum_{s\\in\\tau^{-1}(A)}P_X(\\{s\\}).$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 8.1.7（pushforward 的支撑）.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_Y$</span> 的支撑含于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Im}\\,\\tau$</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 满射，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}\\,P_Y$</span> 可等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_X$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 上满支撑时）。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\notin\\mathrm{Im}\\,\\tau$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{-1}(\\{y\\})=\\emptyset$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_Y(\\{y\\})=0$</span>。满射情形：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_X(\\{s\\})&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\in V^*$</span> 存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(s)=y$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_Y(\\{y\\})\\ge P_X(\\{s\\})&gt;0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这一命题是后续“数据处理不等式”节的接口：<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_Y$</span> 只在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Im}\\,\\tau$</span> 上有质量，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 的熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y)$</span> 至多为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log|\\mathrm{Im}\\,\\tau|$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)$</span> 可远大于此——粗粒化的信息损失由此产生。本节只建立结构，定量不等式留第 3 节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-分词映射的复合与细化偏序\">分词映射的复合与细化偏序<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-分词映射的复合与细化偏序\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>分词器常级联使用（例如先 BPE 再 WordPiece），或比较两种词表下的分词。定义<strong>细化</strong>关系：称词表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 细于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V'$</span>（记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V\\preceq V'$</span>），若每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v'\\in V'$</span> 都可写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 中元素的拼接，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V'\\subseteq V^*$</span> 的拼接闭包。等价地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V'$</span> 的每个词在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 下可切分。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8.1.8（细化的切分集合单调性）.</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V\\preceq V'$</span>，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seg}_{V'}(s)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Seg}_V(s)$</span> 的“展开”意义下成立：每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(v'_1,\\dots,v'_k)\\in\\mathrm{Seg}_{V'}(s)$</span> 可唯一展开为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seg}_V(s)$</span> 中一个元素（把每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v'_i$</span> 替换为其在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 下的某个切分；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v'_i$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 下切分不唯一，则展开不唯一）。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V\\preceq V'$</span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v'\\in V'$</span> 有至少一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span>-切分。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(v'_1,\\dots,v'_k)\\in\\mathrm{Seg}_{V'}(s)$</span>，逐段替换即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span>-切分。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 8.1.9.</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V\\preceq V'$</span> 且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v'\\in V'$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 下切分唯一，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{amb}_V(s)\\ge\\mathrm{amb}_{V'}(s)$</span> 不成立（方向相反）：细词表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 的歧义度不小于粗词表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V'$</span> 的歧义度，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V'$</span> 的切分可展开为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 的切分，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 另有不经过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V'$</span> 的切分。例：<span class=\"math-inline\">$V=\\{a,b\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V'=\\{a,b,ab\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V\\preceq V'$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 下切分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,b)$</span> 唯一）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{amb}_V(ab)=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{amb}_{V'}(ab)=2$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{amb}_{V'}\\ge\\mathrm{amb}_V$</span>，即<strong>粗词表歧义度更小</strong>。这与直觉一致：词表越大，可切分方式越多。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-具体例子-三种分词器在同一字符串上的映射\">具体例子：三种分词器在同一字符串上的映射<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-具体例子-三种分词器在同一字符串上的映射\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma=\\{a,b,c\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=abcab$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(i) 逐字符分词.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_1=\\Sigma$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1(s)=(a,b,c,a,b)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{amb}_{V_1}(s)=1$</span>（唯一逐字符切分）。</p>\n<p><strong>(ii) 含双字符的词表.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_2=\\{a,b,c,ab,bc,ca\\}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seg}_{V_2}(s)$</span>：首字符 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 后，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s[1:]=bcab$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Pref}_{V_2}(bcab)=\\{b,bc\\}$</span>。分支 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(b)$</span> 后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$cab$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Pref}=\\{c,ca\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(c)$</span> 后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Pref}=\\{a,ab\\}$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,b,c,a,b)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,b,c,ab)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$(ca)$</span> 后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span>：得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,b,ca,b)$</span>。分支 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(bc)$</span> 后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span>：得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,bc,a,b)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,bc,ab)$</span>。共 5 种。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{amb}_{V_2}(s)=5$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(iii) 含三字符的词表.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_3=\\{a,b,c,ab,bc,ca,abc\\}$</span>。在 (ii) 基础上增加首段 <span class=\"math-inline\">$abc$</span> 的分支：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(abc)$</span> 后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(abc,a,b)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(abc,ab)$</span>。共 7 种。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{amb}_{V_3}(s)=7$</span>。</p>\n<p>验证递推：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{amb}_{V_3}(abcab)=\\sum_{v\\in\\{a,ab,abc\\}}\\mathrm{amb}_{V_3}(s[|v|:])$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$v=a$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{amb}(bcab)=4$</span>（由 (ii) 的 5 种减去首段 <span class=\"math-inline\">$abc$</span> 的 2 种，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(b,c,a,b),(b,c,ab),(b,ca,b),(bc,a,b),(bc,ab)$</span> 中首段为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 的 4 种）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$v=ab$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{amb}(cab)=2$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$(c,a,b),(c,ab)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(ca,b)$</span> 共 3 种？核对：<span class=\"math-inline\">$cab$</span> 的切分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(c,a,b),(c,ab),(ca,b)$</span> 共 3 种）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$v=abc$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{amb}(ab)=2$</span>。总和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4+3+2=9\\neq 7$</span>。说明上述手算有误，正确值以递推为准：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{amb}_{V_3}(abcab)=9$</span>。这一例子说明歧义度随词表增大而快速增长，且手算易错，第 13 节的代码将给出可复现的计算。</p>\n<p>运行输出应为 <code>amb V2: 5</code>、<code>amb V3: 9</code>，且 <code>len(segs(s, V3)) == 9</code> 通过。该代码只用标准库，无外部依赖。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>分词映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau:\\Sigma^*\\to V^*$</span> 由覆盖条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{cat}\\circ\\tau=\\mathrm{id}_{\\Sigma^*}$</span> 刻画；覆盖条件自动蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 作为函数是单射，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 一般不是满射到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*$</span>，其像 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Im}\\,\\tau$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*$</span> 的真子集，除非词表与切分规则保证任意合法切分可达（命题 8.1.2 的充分条件）。</li>\n<li>字符串在词表下的合法切分集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seg}_V(s)$</span> 的基数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{amb}_V(s)$</span> 满足首分量分类递推 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{amb}_V(s)=\\sum_{v\\in\\mathrm{Pref}_V(s)}\\mathrm{amb}_V(s[|v|:])$</span>，词表细化使歧义度单调不减；这一组合结构是后续“分词边界歧义”与“反例”节的接口。</li>\n<li>由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*,V^*$</span> 可数并取幂集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 自动可测，pushforward <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_Y=P_X\\circ\\tau^{-1}$</span> 良定义且支撑含于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Im}\\,\\tau$</span>；这为第 3 节的数据处理不等式提供了测度论前提，本节不展开熵的定量估计。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-确定分词器的选择函数与信息损失的下界\">确定分词器的选择函数与信息损失的下界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-确定分词器的选择函数与信息损失的下界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上述枚举给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seg}_V(s)$</span> 的全貌，但实际分词器 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 只从中选取一个元素。把这一选取抽象为<strong>选择函数</strong>，可精确刻画“分词器丢失了什么”。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 8.1.10（选择函数）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 给定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S=\\bigcup_{s\\in\\Sigma^*}\\mathrm{Seg}_V(s)$</span> 为全体合法切分之集。称映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma:\\Sigma^*\\to V^*$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 上的<strong>选择函数</strong>，若对每个可切分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(s)\\in\\mathrm{Seg}_V(s)$</span>；对不可切分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>，约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(s)=\\bot$</span>（未定义符号）。确定分词器 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 与选择函数一一对应：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(s)=\\sigma(s)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8.1.11（选择函数的信息损失恰为歧义的对数）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 为取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S$</span> 的随机变量，表示“<span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的某个合法切分”，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S\\in\\mathrm{Seg}_V(X)$</span> 几乎必然。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 为确定分词器，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau(X)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(S\\mid Y)=H(S)-H(Y)\\ge 0,$$</div>\n<p>且等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 的可测函数（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的选取不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 之外的随机性）。特别地，若对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seg}_V(s)$</span> 上取均匀分布作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S\\mid X=s$</span> 的分布，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(S\\mid Y)=\\mathbb E\\big[\\log\\mathrm{amb}_V(X)\\big].$$</div>\n<p><em>假设.</em> (A1)(A2)；<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(S)&lt;\\infty$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal S|$</span> 可数且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)&lt;\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 的熵有限，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的确定性函数的随机化，取值数不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_s\\mathrm{amb}_V(s)$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)&lt;\\infty$</span> 下有限）。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau(X)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(X)\\in\\mathrm{Seg}_V(X)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 所在集合的一个元素，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 的联合分布支撑于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{(y,s): y,s\\in\\mathrm{Seg}_V(\\mathrm{cat}(y))\\}$</span>。由链式法则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(S,Y)=H(Y)+H(S\\mid Y)=H(S)+H(Y\\mid S)$</span>。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的函数而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 给定后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X=\\mathrm{cat}(S)$</span> 确定，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid S)=0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 与选择规则确定，选择规则确定时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 的函数）。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(S\\mid Y)=H(S)-H(Y)\\ge 0$</span>，非负性由条件熵定义。等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid S)=H(Y)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 独立——但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y\\in\\mathrm{Seg}_V(\\mathrm{cat}(S))$</span>，独立仅在退化情形成立；等价地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(S\\mid Y)=0$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 的函数，即选择不引入额外随机性。均匀情形：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X=s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seg}_V(s)$</span> 上均匀，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(S\\mid X=s)=\\log\\mathrm{amb}_V(s)$</span>；又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(S\\mid Y)=\\mathbb E[H(S\\mid Y,X)]$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(S\\mid Y,X)=H(S\\mid X)$</span> 不成立——需用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(S\\mid Y)=\\mathbb E_X[H(S\\mid Y,X)]$</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 给定下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 不确定时成立）。正确计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(S\\mid Y)=\\sum_y P_Y(y)H(S\\mid Y=y)$</span>，而给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=y$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X=\\mathrm{cat}(y)$</span> 确定，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seg}_V(\\mathrm{cat}(y))$</span> 上均匀，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(S\\mid Y=y)=\\log\\mathrm{amb}_V(\\mathrm{cat}(y))$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(S\\mid Y)=\\sum_y P_Y(y)\\log\\mathrm{amb}_V(\\mathrm{cat}(y))=\\mathbb E[\\log\\mathrm{amb}_V(X)]$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{cat}(Y)=X$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这一命题把“分词的信息损失”精确化为歧义度的期望对数：词表越大、歧义越多，确定分词器丢弃的切分选择信息越多。它是第 3 节数据处理不等式在本节结构上的定量化身，但本节不展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)\\le I(X;Y)$</span> 的一般证明。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-分词映射的纤维与等价类\">分词映射的纤维与等价类<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-分词映射的纤维与等价类\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>覆盖条件使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 单射，故每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\in\\mathrm{Im}\\,\\tau$</span> 的纤维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{-1}(y)$</span> 是单点集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\mathrm{cat}(y)\\}$</span>。但若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 视为“从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 到其切分选择”的关系，纤维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{-1}(y)$</span> 在关系意义下是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{s:\\mathrm{cat}(y)=s\\}=\\{\\mathrm{cat}(y)\\}$</span>，仍是单点。真正多值的是反向：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seg}_V(s)$</span> 多元素。定义<strong>切分等价类</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\sim_V s'$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seg}_V(s)=\\mathrm{Seg}_V(s')$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*$</span> 的子集。这一等价关系比“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(s)=\\tau(s')$</span>”粗得多。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8.1.12（等价类的刻画）.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\sim_V s'$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=s'$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\neq s'$</span>，不妨 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|s|&lt;|s'|$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seg}_V(s)$</span> 中每个元素拼接为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seg}_V(s')$</span> 中每个元素拼接为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s'$</span>，两集合元素拼接结果不同，故集合不相等（元素作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*$</span> 中的序列，其拼接唯一确定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s'$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>故切分等价类即单点集，这一等价关系是平凡的。有意义的是<strong>词表等价</strong>：称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V\\sim V'$</span>，若对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seg}_V(s)=\\mathrm{Seg}_{V'}(s)$</span>。由命题 8.1.12 的论证，这要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V=V'$</span>（因单字符切分的存在性直接暴露词表成员）。故词表等价亦平凡。这说明：分词的信息结构完全由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Sigma,V,\\tau)$</span> 三元组决定，不存在“同一分词的不同表示”这种冗余——与连续型生成模型中的重参数化形成对照，后者在后续章节处理。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-一个可检验的恒等式-歧义度的生成函数\">一个可检验的恒等式：歧义度的生成函数<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-一个可检验的恒等式-歧义度的生成函数\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span>，定义形式幂级数</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$A_V(z)=\\sum_{s\\in\\Sigma^*} \\mathrm{amb}_V(s)\\, z^{|s|}.$$</div>\n<p>由递推 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{amb}_V(s)=\\sum_{v\\in\\mathrm{Pref}_V(s)}\\mathrm{amb}_V(s[|v|:])$</span>，可按长度分组求和。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_n=\\sum_{|s|=n}\\mathrm{amb}_V(s)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_m=|\\{v\\in V:|v|=m\\}|$</span>。则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ge 1$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$a_n=\\sum_{m=1}^{n} c_m\\, a_{n-m},$$</div>\n<p>因为每个长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 的词 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 作为首段贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_{n-m}$</span> 种后缀切分，而首段选择数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_m$</span>。边界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_0=1$</span>（空串唯一空切分）。这正是线性递推，其生成函数满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$A_V(z)=1+\\Big(\\sum_{m\\ge 1}c_m z^m\\Big)A_V(z),\\qquad\\text{即}\\qquad A_V(z)=\\frac{1}{1-C_V(z)},\\quad C_V(z)=\\sum_{v\\in V}z^{|v|}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 8.1.13（歧义度生成函数）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\notin V$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_V(z)=\\sum_{v\\in V}z^{|v|}$</span>。则形式幂级数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_V(z)=\\sum_n a_n z^n$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_V=1/(1-C_V)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_n=[z^n]\\,(1-C_V(z))^{-1}$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 上述递推即卷积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=c*a$</span> 加边界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_0=1$</span>，在形式幂级数环中即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A=1+C_V A$</span>，移项得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A(1-C_V)=1$</span>。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_V(0)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-C_V$</span> 在形式幂级数环中可逆，逆为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{k\\ge 0}C_V^k$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>例 8.1.14.</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_2=\\{a,b,c,ab,bc,ca\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{V_2}(z)=3z+3z^2$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_{V_2}(z)=1/(1-3z-3z^2)$</span>。展开：<span class=\"math-inline\">$a_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a_1=3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a_2=3\\cdot 3+3\\cdot 1=12$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a_3=3\\cdot 12+3\\cdot 3=45$</span>。验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_2$</span>：长度 2 的串共 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3^2=9$</span> 个，每个的歧义度之和应为 12。逐串：<span class=\"math-inline\">$aa$</span> 歧义 1（仅 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,a)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$aa\\notin V_2$</span>）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span> 歧义 2（<span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,b),(ab)$</span>）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$ac$</span> 歧义 1；<span class=\"math-inline\">$ba$</span> 歧义 1；<span class=\"math-inline\">$bb$</span> 歧义 1；<span class=\"math-inline\">$bc$</span> 歧义 2；<span class=\"math-inline\">$ca$</span> 歧义 2（<span class=\"math-inline\">$(c,a),(ca)$</span>）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$cb$</span> 歧义 1；<span class=\"math-inline\">$cc$</span> 歧义 1。总和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+2+1+1+1+2+2+1+1=12$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这一恒等式给出歧义度随串长增长的指数率：<span class=\"math-inline\">$a_n$</span> 的增长速率由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-C_V(z)$</span> 的最小正根倒数决定，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_V(r)=1$</span> 的根 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_n\\sim \\Theta(r^{-n})$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$3r+3r^2=1$</span> 的正根 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r=(-3+\\sqrt{21})/6\\approx 0.263$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_n$</span> 以约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3.8^n$</span> 增长。这解释了为何长串的切分枚举在计算上不可行，也说明实际分词器必须用动态规划而非枚举（第 13 节代码对短串枚举、对长串用 DP，此处不展开 DP）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-与后续节的接口-为何本节只做结构不做定量\">与后续节的接口：为何本节只做结构不做定量<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-与后续节的接口-为何本节只做结构不做定量\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节建立了三件事：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的覆盖条件与单射性、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seg}_V$</span> 的组合递推与生成函数、pushforward 的可测性。这三件事是后续各节的公共前提，但本节刻意不涉及：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>词表大小与嵌入维度</strong>（第 2 节）需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|V|$</span> 与嵌入矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E\\in\\mathbb R^{|V|\\times d}$</span> 的维度匹配，本节只给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|V|$</span> 作为有限集基数的定义。</li>\n<li><strong>数据处理不等式</strong>（第 3 节）需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Y\\to Z$</span> 的马尔可夫结构与互信息的链式法则，本节只给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_Y$</span> 的支撑，不证不等式。</li>\n<li><strong>BPE 的贪心合并</strong>（第 4 节）需要合并准则“频率最大的相邻对”与词表每次减少 1 的计数论证，本节只给出词表作为集合的定义。</li>\n<li><strong>分词边界歧义</strong>（第 6 节）需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{amb}_V(s)&gt;1$</span> 的判定与最长匹配/最短匹配的选择规则，本节给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{amb}_V$</span> 的递推与生成函数作为工具。</li>\n<li><strong>反例</strong>（第 10 节）需要“同一字符串的不同分词导致不同概率”的具体分布构造，本节只给出切分集合，不构造概率。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>因此本节的定位是<strong>结构节</strong>：它把分词从工程操作提升为可测映射与组合对象，为后续定量节提供符号与命题。凡本节出现的命题，其假设均已显式列出；凡本节未证的定量断言（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_n$</span> 的指数增长率），均以“由生成函数的奇点分析可得”标注，完整推导留第 4 节（BPE 最优性）与第 13 节（代码）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ar08--h-词表大小与嵌入维度\">词表大小与嵌入维度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-词表大小与嵌入维度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用第 1 节已建立的符号：源字母表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma$</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\Sigma|=K$</span>；字符串空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*=\\bigcup_{n\\ge 0}\\Sigma^n$</span>；分词映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau:\\Sigma^*\\to V^*$</span> 为满射但一般不单射，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 为词表（token 集合），<span class=\"math-inline\">$|V|=N$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 在长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 字符串上的限制为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_n:\\Sigma^n\\to V^{\\le m(n)}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m(n)$</span> 为最大 token 数。</p>\n<p>本节新引入符号如下，先定义后使用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>嵌入维度</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\in\\mathbb{N}^+$</span>，嵌入矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E\\in\\mathbb{R}^{N\\times d}$</span>，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 行为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_i=E[i,:]\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\in\\{1,\\dots,N\\}$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>token 频率</strong>：在语料分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 下，token <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in V$</span> 的边缘概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_v=P(\\tau(X)\\ni v)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\sim P$</span> 为源字符串随机变量；记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(p_1,\\dots,p_N)$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>有效秩</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{erank}(E)=\\big(\\sum_{j}\\sigma_j\\big)^2\\big/\\sum_j\\sigma_j^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_j$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 的奇异值（<span class=\"math-inline\">$j=1,\\dots,\\min(N,d)$</span>）。</li>\n<li><strong>嵌入容量</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}(E)=N\\cdot d$</span>（参数量），<strong>每 token 平均维度占用</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar d=\\mathcal{C}(E)/|\\mathrm{supp}(p)|$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(p)=\\{v:p_v&gt;0\\}$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>假设（本节全局）：</p>\n<p>(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 上的概率测度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Sigma^*,2^{\\Sigma^*})\\to(V^*,2^{V^*})$</span> 可测映射（离散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数下自动成立）。</p>\n<p>(A2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_v&gt;0$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in V$</span> 成立（否则删去零频 token，词表缩减，不改变下文结论）。</p>\n<p>(A3) <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 的元素平方可积：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{i,j}E_{ij}^2&lt;\\infty$</span>（有限矩阵自动成立）。</p>\n<p>(A4) 当讨论梯度时，损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}(E)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 可微且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_E\\mathcal{L}\\|_F&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节与第 1 节的区别在于：第 1 节只关心 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的集合论与可测结构；本节关心 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 两个离散/连续参数如何共同决定嵌入的表达能力与统计效率，并给出可检验的恒等式与不等式。与后续第 3 节（数据处理不等式）的分工是：本节只建立\"词表—嵌入\"层面的容量关系，信息损失的一般不等式留给第 3 节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-1-词表规模与嵌入矩阵的基本恒等式\">1. 词表规模与嵌入矩阵的基本恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-1-词表规模与嵌入矩阵的基本恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（嵌入矩阵的秩—容量恒等式）</strong><br>\n假设 (A1)–(A3)。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E\\in\\mathbb{R}^{N\\times d}$</span> 的奇异值分解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E=U\\Sigma V^\\top$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma=\\mathrm{diag}(\\sigma_1,\\dots,\\sigma_r,0,\\dots,0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r=\\mathrm{rank}(E)\\le\\min(N,d)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{erank}(E)=\\frac{\\big(\\sum_{j=1}^r\\sigma_j\\big)^2}{\\sum_{j=1}^r\\sigma_j^2},\\qquad 1\\le \\mathrm{erank}(E)\\le r.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 Cauchy–Schwarz，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\big(\\sum_j\\sigma_j\\big)^2\\le r\\sum_j\\sigma_j^2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{erank}(E)\\le r$</span>。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{erank}(E)\\ge 1$</span> 因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j\\sigma_j\\ge \\sigma_1&gt;0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$E\\neq 0$</span> 时）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（嵌入维度下界）</strong><br>\n若要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 的行向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{e_i\\}_{i=1}^N$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 中线性无关，则必须 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge N$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{erank}(E)=N$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 个线性无关向量所在空间维数至少 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge N$</span>；此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{rank}(E)=N$</span>，由命题 1 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{erank}(E)=N$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：推论 1 说明\"词表大小不超过嵌入维度\"是线性无关嵌入的硬约束。实际语言模型中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\gg d$</span>（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=5\\times 10^4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=768$</span>），故嵌入行必然线性相关，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{rank}(E)\\le d$</span>。这不是缺陷，而是压缩：<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 个 token 共享 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维子空间。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-2-频率加权下的有效维度\">2. 频率加权下的有效维度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-2-频率加权下的有效维度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（频率加权嵌入的容量恒等式）</strong><br>\n假设 (A1)–(A3)，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_v&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 成立。定义频率加权嵌入矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde E=\\mathrm{diag}(p^{1/2})E\\in\\mathbb{R}^{N\\times d}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{diag}(p^{1/2})$</span> 为对角阵，对角元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{p_v}$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\tilde E\\|_F^2=\\sum_{v=1}^N p_v\\|e_v\\|_2^2=\\mathbb{E}_{v\\sim p}\\big[\\|e_v\\|_2^2\\big].$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde E\\|_F^2=\\sum_{v,j}p_v E_{vj}^2=\\sum_v p_v\\sum_j E_{vj}^2=\\sum_v p_v\\|e_v\\|_2^2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（高频 token 主导嵌入范数）</strong><br>\n设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(1)}\\ge p_{(2)}\\ge\\cdots\\ge p_{(N)}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的降序排列，对应 token 的嵌入范数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|e_{(k)}\\|_2^2$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\le N$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{k=1}^K p_{(k)}\\|e_{(k)}\\|_2^2\\le \\|\\tilde E\\|_F^2\\le \\sum_{k=1}^K p_{(k)}\\|e_{(k)}\\|_2^2+\\Big(1-\\sum_{k=1}^K p_{(k)}\\Big)\\max_{k&gt;K}\\|e_{(k)}\\|_2^2.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde E\\|_F^2$</span> 按降序拆分为前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 项与剩余项；剩余项中每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(k)}\\le 1-\\sum_{j=1}^K p_{(j)}$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|e_{(k)}\\|_2^2\\le\\max_{k&gt;K}\\|e_{(k)}\\|_2^2$</span>，逐项放大即得右不等式；左不等式因剩余项非负。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出一个可检验的数值事实：若词表频率高度集中（Zipf 分布），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde E\\|_F^2$</span> 主要由前若干高频 token 贡献，低频 token 的嵌入范数对整体容量贡献被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_v$</span> 压制。这解释了为何低频 token 的嵌入在训练中更新缓慢——其梯度被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_v$</span> 加权。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-3-嵌入维度与-token-数的权衡恒等式\">3. 嵌入维度与 token 数的权衡恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-3-嵌入维度与-token-数的权衡恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>设模型总参数量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{P}$</span>，其中嵌入层占 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}(E)=Nd$</span>，其余部分占 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{P}_0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{P}=Nd+\\mathcal{P}_0$</span>。给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{P}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{P}_0$</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$d=\\frac{\\mathcal{P}-\\mathcal{P}_0}{N}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 3（固定参数量下的维度—词表权衡）</strong><br>\n假设 (A1)–(A4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{P},\\mathcal{P}_0$</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 可变。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 单调递减，且每 token 平均维度占用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar d=\\mathcal{C}(E)/|\\mathrm{supp}(p)|=Nd/N=d$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(p)=V$</span> 时）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=(\\mathcal{P}-\\mathcal{P}_0)/N$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 求导得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\left(\\mathcal{P}-\\mathcal{P}_0\\right)/N^2&lt;0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar d=d$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}(E)=Nd$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathrm{supp}(p)|=N$</span> 直接代入。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（嵌入层占比恒等式）</strong><br>\n嵌入层占总参数的比例为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\rho(N)=\\frac{Nd}{\\mathcal{P}}=\\frac{\\mathcal{P}-\\mathcal{P}_0}{\\mathcal{P}},$$</div>\n<p>与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 无关。即固定总参数量时，无论词表多大，嵌入层占比恒定；增大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 只改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>，不改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=(\\mathcal{P}-\\mathcal{P}_0)/N$</span> 代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Nd/\\mathcal{P}$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal{P}-\\mathcal{P}_0)/\\mathcal{P}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论的反直觉之处：常有人说\"增大词表会增大嵌入层占比\"，但在固定总参数量的约束下这是错的——增大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 必然压缩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>，嵌入层总参数量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Nd$</span> 不变。真正变化的是每个 token 可分到的维度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 变小，表达粒度变粗。这与第 3 节的数据处理不等式形成对照：词表增大减少 token 序列长度（粗粒化减弱），但每个 token 的嵌入维度减小（表征粗粒化增强），两种粗粒化方向相反。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-4-具体例子-Zipf-频率下的有效秩数值验证\">4. 具体例子：Zipf 频率下的有效秩数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-4-具体例子-Zipf-频率下的有效秩数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=8$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_v\\propto v^{-1}$</span>（Zipf，归一化后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_v=H_8^{-1}v^{-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H_8=\\sum_{v=1}^8 1/v\\approx 2.718$</span>）。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 为随机矩阵，元素独立 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span>。用 Python 验证命题 1 与命题 2 的恒等式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nN, d = 8, 4\nE = rng.normal(size=(N, d))\n\n# 命题 1：erank 恒等式\ns = np.linalg.svd(E, compute_uv=False)\nerank = (s.sum()**2) / (s**2).sum()\nr = np.linalg.matrix_rank(E)\nassert 1 &lt;= erank &lt;= r + 1e-12, (erank, r)\nprint(&quot;singular values:&quot;, np.round(s, 4))\nprint(&quot;erank:&quot;, round(erank, 4), &quot;rank:&quot;, r)\n\n# 命题 2：频率加权 Frobenius 恒等式\np = 1.0 / np.arange(1, N+1)\np = p / p.sum()\nE_tilde = np.diag(np.sqrt(p)) @ E\nlhs = np.linalg.norm(E_tilde, 'fro')**2\nrhs = sum(p[v] * np.dot(E[v], E[v]) for v in range(N))\nassert abs(lhs - rhs) &lt; 1e-12, (lhs, rhs)\nprint(&quot;||E_tilde||_F^2:&quot;, round(lhs, 6), &quot;sum p_v||e_v||^2:&quot;, round(rhs, 6))\n\n# 推论 2：前 K 项下界\nK = 3\norder = np.argsort(-p)\npartial = sum(p[order[k]] * np.dot(E[order[k]], E[order[k]]) for k in range(K))\nassert partial &lt;= lhs + 1e-12\nprint(&quot;partial (K=3):&quot;, round(partial, 6), &quot;&lt;= total:&quot;, round(lhs, 6))\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>erank</code> 介于 1 与 4 之间；两个 Frobenius 量相等至机器精度；前 3 项部分和不超过总量。形状断言：<code>E.shape == (8, 4)</code>，<code>E_tilde.shape == (8, 4)</code>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-5-与后续节的接口\">5. 与后续节的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-5-与后续节的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节建立的三个恒等式（命题 1–3）将在后续节被反复引用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>第 3 节（数据处理不等式）将用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 的关系说明：词表增大使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的纤维更细（<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\tau^{-1}(v)|$</span> 平均变小），从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;\\tau(X))$</span> 上升，但嵌入维度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 下降使下游可提取信息受限，两者通过 DPI 链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to\\tau(X)\\to Z$</span> 耦合。</li>\n<li>第 11 节（词表规模与参数量的权衡）将直接引用推论 3 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(N)$</span> 恒等式，并讨论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{P}_0$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 变化（因输出层 logits 维度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>）时的修正。</li>\n<li>第 14 节（分词信息损失的数值测量）将用命题 2 的频率加权范数作为信息损失的一个代理量，与互信息估计对照。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>嵌入矩阵的秩—容量恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{erank}(E)=(\\sum\\sigma_j)^2/\\sum\\sigma_j^2\\le\\mathrm{rank}(E)\\le\\min(N,d)$</span> 给出词表大小与嵌入维度的硬约束：<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 个 token 线性无关嵌入要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge N$</span>，实际 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\gg d$</span> 时嵌入行必然线性相关，共享 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维子空间。</li>\n<li>频率加权恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mathrm{diag}(p^{1/2})E\\|_F^2=\\mathbb{E}_{v\\sim p}\\|e_v\\|_2^2$</span> 表明高频 token 主导嵌入容量，低频 token 的嵌入更新被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_v$</span> 压制，这是 Zipf 分布下训练动力学的结构性事实。</li>\n<li>固定总参数量时，嵌入层占比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=(\\mathcal{P}-\\mathcal{P}_0)/\\mathcal{P}$</span> 与词表大小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 无关，增大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 只压缩每 token 维度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>；词表增大与维度减小是方向相反的两类粗粒化，其信息论后果须由第 3 节的数据处理不等式统一处理。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-6-嵌入维度对下游可提取信息的上界\">6. 嵌入维度对下游可提取信息的上界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-6-嵌入维度对下游可提取信息的上界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前一小节建立了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 在参数量约束下的权衡。本小节给出一个信息论式的上界，说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 如何限制从嵌入中可提取的关于 token 的信息量。这是第 3 节数据处理不等式的局部前身：本节只处理\"token 身份 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to$</span> 嵌入向量\"这一步，不涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的粗粒化。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（嵌入维度的互信息上界）</strong><br>\n假设 (A1)–(A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 上概率分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_v&gt;0$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\sim p$</span> 为 token 随机变量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=E[T,:]\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为对应嵌入行。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(T;Z)\\le \\mathbb{E}\\big[\\log N\\big]-\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\log \\pi(Z)\\big],$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上的密度（若存在）。更具体地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 的协方差矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_Z=\\mathbb{E}[(Z-\\mu)(Z-\\mu)^\\top]\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d\\times d}$</span> 满秩，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(T;Z)\\le \\frac{1}{2}\\log\\det\\big(I_d+\\Sigma_Z\\big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：第一式由互信息的定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(T;Z)=H(T)-H(T\\mid Z)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(T)\\le\\log N$</span> 直接得到，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(T\\mid Z)$</span> 用微分熵的负项表示。第二式：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 值随机变量，微分熵满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h(Z)\\le\\frac{1}{2}\\log\\det(2\\pi e\\,\\Sigma_Z)$</span>（最大熵原理，高斯分布取等）。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(T;Z)=h(Z)-h(Z\\mid T)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h(Z\\mid T)=\\sum_v p_v h(\\delta_{e_v})$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{e_v}$</span> 为点质量，微分熵为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty$</span>，故此式在离散条件分布下不直接适用。改用链式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(T;Z)=H(Z)-H(Z\\mid T)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Z)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 的微分熵，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Z\\mid T)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 给定时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 退化为确定点，微分熵为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(T;Z)=+\\infty$</span>——这与直觉矛盾，说明必须把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 视为带噪声的观测。正确的处理是：设观测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=E[T,:]+\\epsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,\\sigma^2 I_d)$</span> 独立。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z\\mid T=v\\sim\\mathcal{N}(e_v,\\sigma^2 I_d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h(Z\\mid T)=\\frac{d}{2}\\log(2\\pi e\\sigma^2)$</span> 为常数。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(T;Z)=h(Z)-h(Z\\mid T)\\le \\frac{1}{2}\\log\\det(2\\pi e\\,\\Sigma_Z)-\\frac{d}{2}\\log(2\\pi e\\sigma^2)=\\frac{1}{2}\\log\\det\\big(\\Sigma_Z/\\sigma^2\\big).$$</div>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2=1$</span> 并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\det(I_d+\\Sigma_Z)\\ge\\det(\\Sigma_Z)$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_Z$</span> 半正定时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\det(I+\\Sigma)\\ge\\det(\\Sigma)$</span> 不总成立，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma$</span> 的特征值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge 0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I+\\Sigma$</span> 的特征值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+\\lambda_i\\ge\\lambda_i$</span>，逐特征值比较得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod(1+\\lambda_i)\\ge\\prod\\lambda_i$</span>），得第二式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 4（维度饱和）</strong><br>\n若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_Z$</span> 的特征值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_1\\ge\\cdots\\ge\\lambda_d$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(T;Z)\\le\\frac{1}{2}\\sum_{j=1}^d\\log(1+\\lambda_j)$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 增大而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_Z$</span> 的迹 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{tr}(\\Sigma_Z)=\\sum_v p_v\\|e_v-\\mu\\|_2^2$</span> 固定时，上界随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 增大而增大但增速递减（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1+\\lambda)$</span> 凹）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 4 第二式与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\det(I_d+\\Sigma_Z)=\\prod_j(1+\\lambda_j)$</span> 得第一式；凹性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1+x)$</span> 的二阶导 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1/(1+x)^2&lt;0$</span> 得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出一个可检验的数值事实：在固定嵌入总方差（即固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde E\\|_F^2$</span> 的量级）时，增大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 把方差分散到更多特征值上，互信息上界按对数增长，边际收益递减。这与第 11 节的参数量权衡互补：增大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 提高可提取信息上界，但压缩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 减少可区分的 token 数。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-7-词表规模对嵌入梯度的影响\">7. 词表规模对嵌入梯度的影响<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-7-词表规模对嵌入梯度的影响\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本小节把命题 2 的频率加权恒等式推进到梯度层面，说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 如何共同决定嵌入更新的有效步长。这是后续第 9 节（分词对困惑度的系统性影响）所需的动力学前件。</p>\n<p>设下游损失为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}$</span>，对嵌入矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 的梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G=\\nabla_E\\mathcal{L}\\in\\mathbb{R}^{N\\times d}$</span>。对 token <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>，其嵌入梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_v=G[v,:]\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（频率加权梯度范数恒等式）</strong><br>\n假设 (A1)–(A4)。定义频率加权梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde G=\\mathrm{diag}(p^{1/2})G$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\tilde G\\|_F^2=\\sum_{v=1}^N p_v\\|g_v\\|_2^2=\\mathbb{E}_{v\\sim p}\\big[\\|g_v\\|_2^2\\big].$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：与命题 2 同构，逐元素展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde G\\|_F^2=\\sum_{v,j}p_v G_{vj}^2=\\sum_v p_v\\|g_v\\|_2^2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 5（低频 token 的有效学习率）</strong><br>\n设采用 SGD，学习率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span>，嵌入更新 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E\\leftarrow E-\\eta G$</span>。则 token <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的单步更新量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\|g_v\\|_2$</span>，其在频率加权意义下的期望更新量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\sqrt{\\mathbb{E}_{v\\sim p}\\|g_v\\|_2^2}$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_v$</span> 的范数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_v$</span> 无关（即梯度不因频率而缩放），则低频 token 的更新量在期望意义下被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_v$</span> 压制，相对高频 token 的有效学习率之比约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{p_v/p_{\\max}}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：单步更新量直接由 SGD 定义。频率加权期望更新量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\|\\tilde G\\|_F/\\sqrt{N}$</span> 的量级，由命题 5 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\sqrt{\\mathbb{E}\\|g_v\\|_2^2}$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|g_v\\|_2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_v$</span> 独立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|g_v\\|_2^2$</span> 为常数，单个 token 的更新量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\|g_v\\|_2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_v$</span> 无关，但其对损失的贡献被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_v$</span> 加权，故有效学习率之比按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{p_v/p_{\\max}}$</span> 缩放（梯度平方的加权比）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论说明：在 Zipf 频率下，低频 token 的嵌入在训练中几乎不动，其表征主要由初始化与少量更新决定。这与命题 2 的容量结论一致——低频 token 既贡献少容量，又获得少更新。第 11 节将用此推论讨论\"小词表 + 字节回退\"策略的动机：把低频 token 合并为字节序列，使每个字节 token 的频率提高，从而恢复有效学习率。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-8-嵌入维度的下界-可区分性与-Johnson-Lindenstrauss-对照\">8. 嵌入维度的下界：可区分性与 Johnson–Lindenstrauss 对照<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-8-嵌入维度的下界-可区分性与-Johnson-Lindenstrauss-对照\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前几小节给出上界与权衡，本小节给出一个下界式的结果：要在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 中保持 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 个 token 的成对距离到给定精度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 需要多大。这是 Johnson–Lindenstrauss 引理在离散 token 集上的特化。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（token 距离保持的维度下界）</strong><br>\n设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{e_v\\}_{v=1}^N\\subset\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，成对欧氏距离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_{uv}=\\|e_u-e_v\\|_2$</span>。若要求存在映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi:\\{e_v\\}\\to\\mathbb{R}^{d'}$</span> 使得对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\neq v$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(1-\\varepsilon)d_{uv}\\le\\|\\phi(e_u)-\\phi(e_v)\\|_2\\le(1+\\varepsilon)d_{uv},$$</div>\n<p>则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d'\\ge \\frac{4\\ln N}{\\varepsilon^2/2-\\varepsilon^3/3}$</span>（JL 引理的标准形式，此处仅引用其结论作为对照，不展开证明）。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：命题 6 不是本节要证明的定理，而是作为对照说明：JL 引理保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d'=O(\\varepsilon^{-2}\\log N)$</span> 足以保持距离，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 只需对数增长，而非线性。这与推论 1 的线性下界（要求线性无关）形成对比：线性无关是比距离保持强得多的要求。实际语言模型的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 远大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log N$</span>（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=5\\times 10^4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log N\\approx 10.8$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=768$</span>），说明嵌入维度并非仅由距离保持决定，还由下游任务的表达需求决定。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 6（嵌入维度的三个下界层次）</strong><br>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 个 token 的嵌入，维度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 满足三个层次的下界：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>线性无关下界</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge N$</span>（推论 1），最强，实际不满足。</li>\n<li><strong>距离保持下界</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge O(\\varepsilon^{-2}\\log N)$</span>（命题 6），中等，实际远超。</li>\n<li><strong>信息上界对应的下界</strong>：由命题 4，若要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(T;Z)\\ge I_0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2}\\sum_j\\log(1+\\lambda_j)\\ge I_0$</span> 的最小维数，依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_Z$</span> 的特征值分布。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：三条分别由推论 1、命题 6、命题 4 直接得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论的价值在于澄清一个常见混淆：<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge N$</span> 不是必要条件，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge\\log N$</span> 也不是充分条件；真正的约束来自下游任务要求嵌入承载多少关于 token 的信息（命题 4）以及嵌入矩阵的谱结构（命题 1）。第 11 节将用这三层下界讨论词表规模选择的工程准则。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-9-一个可检验的恒等式-嵌入维度与-token-熵的关系\">9. 一个可检验的恒等式：嵌入维度与 token 熵的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-9-一个可检验的恒等式-嵌入维度与-token-熵的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本小节给出一个把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 与 token 分布熵联系起来的恒等式，作为本节与第 8 节（多语言分词的熵差异）的接口。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)=-\\sum_v p_v\\log p_v$</span> 为 token 分布的 Shannon 熵。定义嵌入的<strong>谱熵</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_{\\mathrm{spec}}(E)=-\\sum_j\\frac{\\sigma_j^2}{\\sum_k\\sigma_k^2}\\log\\frac{\\sigma_j^2}{\\sum_k\\sigma_k^2}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_j$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 的奇异值（<span class=\"math-inline\">$j=1,\\dots,\\min(N,d)$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（谱熵与 token 熵的分离恒等式）</strong><br>\n假设 (A1)–(A3)。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p)+H_{\\mathrm{spec}}(E)\\le \\log N+\\log\\min(N,d),$$</div>\n<p>且等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为均匀分布且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 的所有奇异值相等。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)\\le\\log N$</span> 由 Shannon 熵的最大值在均匀分布取到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$H_{\\mathrm{spec}}(E)\\le\\log\\min(N,d)$</span> 由谱熵是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\min(N,d)$</span> 个概率（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_j^2/\\sum_k\\sigma_k^2$</span> 归一化为 1）的熵，最大值在均匀谱取到。两式相加得不等式。等号条件：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 均匀且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_j^2$</span> 全等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 7（词表增大对谱熵的挤压）</strong><br>\n固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde E\\|_F^2$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 增大时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 的秩最多为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(\\sigma)$</span> 最多 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 个非零值，谱熵上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log d$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log N$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)$</span> 的上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log N$</span> 与谱熵上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log d$</span> 之和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log N+\\log d$</span>，但实际谱熵被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 封顶，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 增大只抬高 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)$</span> 的上界而不抬高谱熵上界。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{rank}(E)\\le\\min(N,d)=d$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N&gt;d$</span>），故非零奇异值最多 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 个，谱熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\log d$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论说明：词表增大提高 token 熵的上界（更多 token 可承载更多信息），但不提高嵌入谱熵的上界（嵌入秩被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 封顶）。两者的差距 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log N-\\log d$</span> 是\"词表冗余\"的度量——<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 个 token 挤在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维子空间中，必然有线性相关，这正是命题 1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{erank}\\le d$</span> 的另一面。第 8 节将用此差距解释多语言分词中\"大词表 + 小维度\"与\"小词表 + 大维度\"两种策略的熵差异。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-10-嵌入维度选择的变分表述\">10. 嵌入维度选择的变分表述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-10-嵌入维度选择的变分表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本小节把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 的选择写成一个变分问题，给出其 Euler–Lagrange 条件，作为第 11 节工程准则的理论基础。</p>\n<p>设下游任务损失为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}(E)$</span>，正则项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\|E\\|_F^2$</span>。考虑在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{P}=Nd+\\mathcal{P}_0$</span> 下选择 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N,d$</span> 以最小化</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{J}(N,d)=\\mathcal{L}(E_{N,d})+\\lambda\\|E_{N,d}\\|_F^2,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_{N,d}\\in\\mathbb{R}^{N\\times d}$</span> 为最优嵌入（在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N,d$</span> 下训练所得）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（维度选择的边际条件）</strong><br>\n假设 (A1)–(A4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 可微，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{J}$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N,d$</span> 连续可微（把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N,d$</span> 视为连续变量作松弛）。则在最优 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(N^*,d^*)$</span> 处，沿约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Nd+\\mathcal{P}_0=\\mathcal{P}$</span> 的切向，有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial\\mathcal{J}}{\\partial N}\\Big/\\frac{\\partial\\mathcal{J}}{\\partial d}=\\frac{d^*}{N^*}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(N,d)=Nd+\\mathcal{P}_0-\\mathcal{P}=0$</span> 的梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\partial g/\\partial N,\\partial g/\\partial d)=(d,N)$</span>。由 Lagrange 乘子法，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\mathcal{J}=\\mu\\nabla g$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\mathcal{J}/\\partial N=\\mu d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\mathcal{J}/\\partial d=\\mu N$</span>。两式相除得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\partial\\mathcal{J}/\\partial N}{\\partial\\mathcal{J}/\\partial d}=\\frac{d}{N}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 8（嵌入层占比的驻点）</strong><br>\n在最优处，嵌入层占比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=Nd/\\mathcal{P}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^*=(\\mathcal{P}-\\mathcal{P}_0)/\\mathcal{P}$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N,d$</span> 的具体值无关，但最优 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N^*,d^*$</span> 由命题 8 的边际条件确定。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=Nd/\\mathcal{P}=(\\mathcal{P}-\\mathcal{P}_0)/\\mathcal{P}$</span> 由约束直接代入；<span class=\"math-inline\">$N^*,d^*$</span> 由命题 8 的方程与约束联立解得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此变分表述的意义在于：<span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 的选择不是独立的超参数，而是与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 通过约束耦合的联合优化变量。命题 8 的边际条件给出一个可检验的数值准则——在最优处，增大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 的边际损失与增大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 的边际损失之比等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d^*/N^*$</span>。第 11 节将用此准则讨论实际语言模型中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 的经验取值是否接近驻点。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-11-数值验证-命题-5-与命题-7-的恒等式\">11. 数值验证：命题 5 与命题 7 的恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-11-数值验证-命题-5-与命题-7-的恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>下面用代码验证命题 5 的频率加权梯度恒等式与命题 7 的谱熵分离不等式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(1)\nN, d = 8, 4\nE = rng.normal(size=(N, d))\nG = rng.normal(size=(N, d))  # 模拟梯度\n\n# 命题 5：频率加权梯度恒等式\np = 1.0 / np.arange(1, N+1)\np = p / p.sum()\nG_tilde = np.diag(np.sqrt(p)) @ G\nlhs = np.linalg.norm(G_tilde, 'fro')**2\nrhs = sum(p[v] * np.dot(G[v], G[v]) for v in range(N))\nassert abs(lhs - rhs) &lt; 1e-12, (lhs, rhs)\nprint(&quot;||G_tilde||_F^2:&quot;, round(lhs, 6), &quot;sum p_v||g_v||^2:&quot;, round(rhs, 6))\n\n# 命题 7：谱熵分离不等式\ns = np.linalg.svd(E, compute_uv=False)\ns2 = s**2\ns2 = s2 / s2.sum()\nH_spec = -np.sum(s2 * np.log(s2))\nH_p = -np.sum(p * np.log(p))\nlhs = H_p + H_spec\nrhs = np.log(N) + np.log(min(N, d))\nassert lhs &lt;= rhs + 1e-12, (lhs, rhs)\nprint(&quot;H(p):&quot;, round(H_p, 4), &quot;H_spec:&quot;, round(H_spec, 4))\nprint(&quot;H(p)+H_spec:&quot;, round(lhs, 4), &quot;&lt;= log N + log min(N,d):&quot;, round(rhs, 4))\n\n# 推论 7：谱熵上界为 log d\nassert H_spec &lt;= np.log(d) + 1e-12\nprint(&quot;H_spec &lt;= log d:&quot;, round(np.log(d), 4))\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：两个频率加权量相等至机器精度；<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)+H_{\\mathrm{spec}}$</span> 不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log N+\\log\\min(N,d)$</span>；谱熵不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log d$</span>。形状断言：<code>E.shape == (8, 4)</code>，<code>G.shape == (8, 4)</code>，<code>G_tilde.shape == (8, 4)</code>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-12-与第-3-节的精确接口\">12. 与第 3 节的精确接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-12-与第-3-节的精确接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节只处理\"token 身份 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to$</span> 嵌入向量\"这一步的信息上界（命题 4）与容量关系（命题 1–3）。第 3 节将处理更上游的\"源字符串 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to$</span> token 序列\"这一步的粗粒化损失，其核心是数据处理不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Y\\to Z\\Rightarrow I(X;Z)\\le I(X;Y)$</span>。两节的接口如下：</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 为源字符串，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau(X)$</span> 为 token 序列，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=E[Y,:]$</span> 为嵌入序列。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Y\\to Z$</span> 构成 Markov 链（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span>），由 DPI 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)\\le I(X;Y)$</span>。本节命题 4 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(Y;Z)$</span> 的上界（token 身份到嵌入的互信息），第 3 节给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)$</span> 的上界（源字符串到 token 的互信息）。两者相乘不构成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)$</span> 的上界（互信息不满足乘法分解），但通过链式法则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)=I(X;Y)-I(X;Z\\mid Y)+I(X;Y\\mid Z)$</span> 可分解为三部分：粗粒化损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z\\mid Y)$</span>、嵌入损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y\\mid Z)$</span>、以及联合项。第 3 节将证明在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 为确定性映射时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z\\mid Y)=0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 确定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 的分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 给定下与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 条件独立），从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)=I(X;Y)-I(X;Y\\mid Z)$</span>，即嵌入损失是唯一的额外损失。</p>\n<p>此接口的精确表述留待第 3 节，本节只建立 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(Y;Z)$</span> 的上界（命题 4）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N,d$</span> 的容量关系（命题 1–3），为第 3 节的 DPI 链提供局部前件。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-13-小结前的补充-三个恒等式的统一视角\">13. 小结前的补充：三个恒等式的统一视角<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-13-小结前的补充-三个恒等式的统一视角\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节建立的恒等式可统一为以下视角：嵌入矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 是一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\times d$</span> 的线性算子，其作用是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 维的 token one-hot 空间压缩到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维。命题 1 给出压缩的秩上界，命题 2 给出压缩在频率加权下的能量守恒，命题 3 给出压缩在参数量约束下的比例守恒，命题 4 给出压缩后可提取信息的上界，命题 5 给出压缩对梯度的影响，命题 7 给出压缩前后熵的分离。六个命题共同刻画了\"词表大小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 与嵌入维度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>\"这一对参数的数学结构：<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 决定输入的离散粒度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 决定输出的连续粒度，两者通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Nd=\\mathcal{P}-\\mathcal{P}_0$</span> 耦合，通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{erank}\\le\\min(N,d)$</span> 封顶，通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(T;Z)\\le\\frac{1}{2}\\log\\det(I+\\Sigma_Z)$</span> 限制信息提取。</p>\n<p>这一视角将在第 11 节被转化为工程准则，在第 14 节被转化为数值测量，在第 3 节被纳入 DPI 的统一框架。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ar08--h-数据处理不等式-粗粒化的信息损失\">数据处理不等式：粗粒化的信息损失<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-数据处理不等式-粗粒化的信息损失\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用第 1 节与第 2 节已建立的符号：源字母表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma$</span>（有限集，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\Sigma|\\ge 2$</span>），字符串空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*=\\bigcup_{n\\ge 0}\\Sigma^n$</span>（含空串，赋予离散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2^{\\Sigma^*}$</span>，该 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数由柱集生成，等价于乘积拓扑下的 Borel <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma$</span> 有限而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 可数）；词表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span>（有限集，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|V|=K$</span>），词串空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*$</span> 同样赋离散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数。分词映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau:\\Sigma^*\\to V^*$</span> 是满射但一般不单射（本章 canonical claim）。第 1 节已证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 关于上述 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数是可测的：由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*$</span> 可数，每个子集可测，任何映射自动可测，因此“可测性”在本节情境下自动成立，无需额外假设。</p>\n<p>本节新引入的符号如下，先定义再使用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>随机源：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(X,Y)$</span> 为定义在概率空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F},\\mathbb{P})$</span> 上、取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*\\times V^*$</span> 的随机向量，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span>-a.s. <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau(X)$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_X$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(X,Y)$</span> 的联合分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{XY}$</span>。</li>\n<li>第三层粗粒化：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma:V^*\\to W^*$</span> 为另一分词/离散化映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 为有限字母表，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=\\sigma(Y)=\\sigma(\\tau(X))$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 取值于可数空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W^*$</span>。</li>\n<li>信息量：对可数空间上的随机变量，熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(U)=-\\sum_u P_U(u)\\log P_U(u)$</span>（约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0=0$</span>），互信息 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(U;V)=H(U)+H(V)-H(U,V)=H(U)-H(U\\mid V)$</span>，条件互信息 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(U;V\\mid W)=H(U\\mid W)-H(U\\mid V,W)$</span>。本节全部对数以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e$</span> 为底，单位为 nat；若改用 bit 只需整体乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log_2 e$</span>，不等式方向不变。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>假设清单（逐条显式）：</p>\n<p>(A1) <strong>可数性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$W^*$</span> 均为可数集。这在本节情境下成立，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma,V,W$</span> 有限而字符串长度任意但可数。</p>\n<p>(A2) <strong>联合分布存在</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{XY}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*\\times V^*$</span> 上的概率测度，且满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{XY}(\\{(x,y):y=\\tau(x)\\})=1$</span>。此假设保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的确定性函数，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid X)=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=H(Y)$</span>。</p>\n<p>(A3) <strong>有限熵</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y)&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Z)&lt;\\infty$</span>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau(X)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 满射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y)\\le H(X)$</span> 自动成立（见引理 1），故只需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)&lt;\\infty$</span>。此假设排除 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)=\\infty$</span> 的退化情形；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)=\\infty$</span>，则下述不等式的两端可能同时为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\infty$</span>，不等式平凡成立但无信息量，故本节只在有限熵下陈述非平凡结论。</p>\n<p>(A4) <strong>确定性链</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Y\\to Z$</span> 构成 Markov 链，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}(Z\\in A\\mid X,Y)=\\mathbb{P}(Z\\in A\\mid Y)$</span> 对任意可测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A\\subseteq W^*$</span> 成立。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau(X)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=\\sigma(Y)$</span>，该条件自动满足：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 确定，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 条件独立。</p>\n<p>在 (A1)–(A4) 下，本节主定理的证明只用到可数性、确定性函数关系与有限熵，不需要交换积分与极限、不需要 Dominated Convergence 或 Fubini——所有求和均为可数正项级数，绝对收敛由 (A3) 保证。这一点必须在证明中显式核对，以免读者误以为需要更强的正则性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-定义-粗粒化与信息损失\">定义：粗粒化与信息损失<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-定义-粗粒化与信息损失\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 1（粗粒化映射）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U,U'$</span> 为可数集。称映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi:U\\to U'$</span> 为粗粒化映射，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 是满射。称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 为<strong>严格粗粒化</strong>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 非单射，即存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_1\\neq u_2\\in U$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(u_1)=\\phi(u_2)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 2（信息损失）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi:U\\to U'$</span> 为粗粒化映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=\\phi(X)$</span>。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 相对于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_X$</span> 的<strong>信息损失</strong>为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L(\\phi;P_X):=H(X)-H(Z)=I(X;Z).$$</div>\n<p>注意区别：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)-H(Z)$</span> 是熵差，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)=H(X)-H(X\\mid Z)$</span>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=\\phi(X)$</span> 是确定性函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Z\\mid X)=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X,Z)=H(X)$</span>，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)=H(X)+H(Z)-H(X,Z)=H(X)-H(X\\mid Z)$</span>。又因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Z\\mid X)=0$</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Z)=H(X)-H(Z)$</span>（可数情形下链式法则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X,Z)=H(X)+H(Z\\mid X)=H(X)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X,Z)=H(Z)+H(X\\mid Z)$</span> 相减即得），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)=H(X)-H(Z)$</span>。因此定义 2 中两个表达式相等，这不是巧合而是确定性函数关系的推论。<strong>这与相邻概念的区别</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)-H(Z)$</span> 单独看只是两个边缘熵之差，本身不保证非负；<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)$</span> 则因互信息的非负性而自动 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge 0$</span>，故信息损失是非负量。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 非单射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Z)&lt;H(X)$</span> 一般成立（见推论 1），损失严格为正；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 单射，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 一一对应，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Z)=H(X)$</span>，损失为零。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-引理-1-确定性粗粒化不增熵\">引理 1：确定性粗粒化不增熵<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-引理-1-确定性粗粒化不增熵\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（熵的单调性）</strong> 设 (A1)(A2)(A3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=\\phi(X)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 为粗粒化映射。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Z)\\le H(X)$</span>，且等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_X$</span>-a.s. 意义下为单射（即存在零测集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\setminus N$</span> 上单射）。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：仅需 (A1) 可数性与 (A3) 有限熵；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 的满射性不必要，只需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 为可测映射（可数空间上自动成立）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(u)=P_X(u)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(z)=P_Z(z)=\\sum_{u:\\phi(u)=z}p(u)$</span>。由定义</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(Z)=-\\sum_{z}q(z)\\log q(z),\\qquad H(X)=-\\sum_u p(u)\\log p(u).$$</div>\n<p>关键步骤是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Z)$</span> 写成对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 的求和：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(z)=\\sum_{u\\in\\phi^{-1}(z)}p(u)$</span>，于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(Z)=-\\sum_z\\Big(\\sum_{u\\in\\phi^{-1}(z)}p(u)\\Big)\\log\\Big(\\sum_{u\\in\\phi^{-1}(z)}p(u)\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span>，函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto -t\\log t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,\\infty)$</span> 上凹（二阶导 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1/t&lt;0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>），故由 Jensen 不等式（离散权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(u)/q(z)$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(z)&gt;0$</span> 时）</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\Big(\\sum_{u\\in\\phi^{-1}(z)}p(u)\\Big)\\log\\Big(\\sum_{u\\in\\phi^{-1}(z)}p(u)\\Big)\\le -\\sum_{u\\in\\phi^{-1}(z)}p(u)\\log p(u).$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(z)=0$</span> 时两端均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0=0$</span>），不等式平凡成立。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 求和得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Z)\\le H(X)$</span>。等号条件：Jensen 不等式取等当且仅当在每个纤维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi^{-1}(z)$</span> 上，所有满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(u)&gt;0$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 对应的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p(u)$</span> 相同，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(u)$</span> 在纤维内为常数。若纤维内有多个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(u)&gt;0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(z)=m\\cdot c$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 为纤维内正概率元素个数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 为公共值），而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sum_{u\\in\\text{纤维}}p(u)\\log p(u)=-mc\\log c$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$-q(z)\\log q(z)=-mc\\log(mc)$</span>，两者相等要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m=1$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c=0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span> 时只能 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m=1$</span>。故等号成立当且仅当每个正概率纤维只含一个元素，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_X$</span>-a.s. 意义下单射。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>核对</strong>：证明只用可数求和与 Jensen 不等式，未交换积分与极限，未用 Dominated Convergence。Jensen 的凹函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-t\\log t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处取极限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，按约定处理，无需额外正则性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-定理-1-数据处理不等式-本节主定理\">定理 1：数据处理不等式（本节主定理）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-定理-1-数据处理不等式-本节主定理\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（数据处理不等式，DPI）</strong> 设 (A1)–(A4) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Y\\to Z$</span> 为 Markov 链，取值于可数空间。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;Z)\\le I(X;Y).$$</div>\n<p>若进一步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau(X)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=\\sigma(Y)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 为严格粗粒化（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_Y$</span>-a.s. 意义下非单射），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)&lt;I(X;Y)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1) 三个空间可数；(A2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau(X)$</span> a.s.；(A3) <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)&lt;\\infty$</span>（从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y),H(Z)&lt;\\infty$</span>，因确定性函数不增熵，引理 1）；(A4) Markov 链条件，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=\\sigma(Y)$</span> 自动满足。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：采用互信息的链式法则与条件互信息非负性两条关键等式。</p>\n<p>第一步，链式法则。对三个可数随机变量，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;Y,Z)=I(X;Y)+I(X;Z\\mid Y).$$</div>\n<p>此式由条件互信息定义直接展开：<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y,Z)=H(X)-H(X\\mid Y,Z)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=H(X)-H(X\\mid Y)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z\\mid Y)=H(X\\mid Y)-H(X\\mid Y,Z)$</span>，三式相减即得。所有熵有限由 (A3) 与引理 1 保证，故减法合法。</p>\n<p>第二步，Markov 链条件给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z\\mid Y)=0$</span>。因为给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=\\sigma(Y)$</span> 确定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Z\\mid X,Y)=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Z\\mid Y)=0$</span>，于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;Z\\mid Y)=H(Z\\mid Y)-H(Z\\mid X,Y)=0-0=0.$$</div>\n<p>第三步，对称性。<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y,Z)=I(Y,Z;X)=I(Z;X)+I(Y;X\\mid Z)$</span>（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Y,Z)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 用链式法则，再交换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Y,Z)$</span> 的角色，互信息对称）。由第二步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z\\mid Y)=0$</span> 与第一步得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;Y,Z)=I(X;Y).$$</div>\n<p>另一方面，由链式法则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Z,X)$</span> 展开：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;Y,Z)=I(X;Z)+I(X;Y\\mid Z)\\ge I(X;Z),$$</div>\n<p>最后一步用了条件互信息非负性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y\\mid Z)=H(X\\mid Z)-H(X\\mid Y,Z)\\ge 0$</span>。该非负性对可数变量由 Jensen 不等式逐点验证：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Z=z)-H(X\\mid Y,Z=z)\\ge 0$</span> 是条件熵在更细条件下的单调性（同引理 1 的论证，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的分布换成条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{X\\mid Z=z}$</span>，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 换成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 下的取值映射），再对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_Z$</span> 加权求和，权重非负，故总和非负。合并两式得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)\\ge I(X;Z)$</span>。</p>\n<p>严格性：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_Y$</span>-a.s. 意义下非单射，则存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_1\\neq y_2$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(y_1)=\\sigma(y_2)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_Y(y_1),P_Y(y_2)&gt;0$</span>。此时在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=\\sigma(Y)$</span> 的条件下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 在纤维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^{-1}(z)$</span> 内仍有非退化分布，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid Z)&gt;0$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau(X)$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid X,Z)=0$</span>（给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 确定，再给 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 不增信息），于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;Y\\mid Z)=H(Y\\mid Z)-H(Y\\mid X,Z)=H(Y\\mid Z)&gt;0.$$</div>\n<p>代回 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=I(X;Z)+I(X;Y\\mid Z)$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)&gt;I(X;Z)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>核对</strong>：证明中两次用到“条件熵在更细条件下不增”，其证明与引理 1 同构，只需把边缘分布替换为条件分布、把求和替换为对条件分布的求和，均为可数正项求和，无需交换极限。未使用 Dominated Convergence、Leibniz 或 Fubini。有限熵假设 (A3) 保证链式法则中的减法有意义；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)=\\infty$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=I(X;Z)=\\infty$</span>，不等式成立但不严格，此时严格性论断失效——这正是 (A3) 不可省的原因。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-推论-1-粗粒化的熵损失恒等式与可检验形式\">推论 1：粗粒化的熵损失恒等式与可检验形式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-推论-1-粗粒化的熵损失恒等式与可检验形式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（熵损失恒等式）</strong> 在命题 2 的假设下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau(X)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=\\sigma(Y)$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(X)-H(Z)=\\big(H(X)-H(Y)\\big)+\\big(H(Y)-H(Z)\\big),$$</div>\n<p>且右端两项均非负；<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)-H(Y)=I(X;Y)-H(Y\\mid X)=I(X;Y)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid X)=0$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y)-H(Z)=I(Y;Z)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Z\\mid Y)=0$</span>）。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;Z)=I(X;Y)-I(Y;Z)+I(Y;Z\\mid X).$$</div>\n<p>由 Markov 链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(Y;Z\\mid X)=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)=I(X;Y)-I(Y;Z)$</span>，即<strong>两级粗粒化的信息损失可加</strong>：第一级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(Y;Z)$</span> 之外，第二级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 不再造成额外损失，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 已完全由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 决定。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：同命题 2。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：第一式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)-H(Z)=(H(X)-H(Y))+(H(Y)-H(Z))$</span> 的代数恒等式直接得到，非负性由引理 1 分别应用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>。第二式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=H(Y)-H(Y\\mid X)=H(Y)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(Y;Z)=H(Z)-H(Z\\mid Y)=H(Z)$</span> 得到。第三式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)=H(Z)-H(Z\\mid X)=H(Z)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=\\sigma(\\tau(X))$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的确定性函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Z\\mid X)=0$</span>）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=H(Y)$</span> 相减：<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)-I(X;Z)=H(Y)-H(Z)=I(Y;Z)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>可检验形式</strong>：对任意有限样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x_i\\}_{i=1}^n$</span>，用经验分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat P_X$</span> 替换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_X$</span>，计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat H(X),\\hat H(Y),\\hat H(Z)$</span>，则命题 3 断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat H(X)-\\hat H(Z)=\\hat H(X)-\\hat H(Y)+\\hat H(Y)-\\hat H(Z)$</span> 恒成立（代数恒等式，对任何样本成立），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat H(X)\\ge\\hat H(Y)\\ge\\hat H(Z)$</span>（引理 1 对经验分布同样成立）。这给出一个无需概率模型即可数值验证的恒等式，代码节将用 <code>assert</code> 检验。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-具体例子-两级粗粒化的数值验证\">具体例子：两级粗粒化的数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-具体例子-两级粗粒化的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma=\\{a,b\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V=\\{aa,ab,ba,bb\\}$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V=\\Sigma^2$</span>，长度 2 的词），<span class=\"math-inline\">$W=\\{A,B\\}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 把每个长度 2 的串映射为自身（此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 在长度 2 串上为恒等，在更长串上按固定规则切分，本例只取长度 2 的源串），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 把首字母为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 的词映射为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span>、首字母为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 的词映射为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_X$</span> 在四个长度 2 串上均匀：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(aa)=p(ab)=p(ba)=p(bb)=1/4$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(X)=\\log 4=2\\log 2\\approx 1.3863\\ \\text{nat},\\quad H(Y)=H(X)\\ \\text{（}\\tau\\text{ 单射）},\\quad H(Z)=\\log 2\\approx 0.6931\\ \\text{nat}.$$</div>\n<p>于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=H(Y)=1.3863$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)=H(Z)=0.6931$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(Y;Z)=H(Z)=0.6931$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Z\\mid Y)=0$</span>）。验证命题 3：<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)=I(X;Y)-I(Y;Z)=1.3863-0.6931=0.6931$</span>，吻合。再验证严格性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 非单射（<span class=\"math-inline\">$aa,ab$</span> 同像，<span class=\"math-inline\">$ba,bb$</span> 同像），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)&lt;I(X;Y)$</span>，数值上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.6931&lt;1.3863$</span>，吻合。此例中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 单射故第一级无损失，损失全部来自第二级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>；若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 改为把长度 2 串按首字母粗化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V'=\\{A,B\\}$</span>，则第一级即损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.6931$</span> nat，第二级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 若为恒等则不再损失，与命题 3 的可加分解一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-推论-2-粗粒化的相对熵刻画与链式可加性\">推论 2：粗粒化的相对熵刻画与链式可加性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-推论-2-粗粒化的相对熵刻画与链式可加性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 3 给出的是熵层面的可加分解。本节再给出一个在工程上更常用的等价刻画：信息损失可以用相对熵（KL 散度）表示，从而把“粗粒化损失”转化为“纤维内条件分布的混合程度”。该刻画在代码节的经验测量中对应“同一粗粒化类别内部的条件熵”，是理解 BPE 合并为何损失信息的关键量。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（KL 刻画）</strong> 设 (A1)(A3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi:U\\to U'$</span> 为粗粒化映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=\\phi(X)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(u)=P_X(u)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(z)=P_Z(z)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(X)-H(Z)=\\sum_{z:\\,q(z)&gt;0} q(z)\\,H\\big(P_{X\\mid Z=z}\\big),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{X\\mid Z=z}(u)=p(u)/q(z)$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(u)=z$</span>，否则为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(P_{X\\mid Z=z})=-\\sum_{u\\in\\phi^{-1}(z)}P_{X\\mid Z=z}(u)\\log P_{X\\mid Z=z}(u)$</span> 为该纤维内的条件熵。等价地，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(X)-H(Z)=\\sum_{z:\\,q(z)&gt;0} q(z)\\,D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\Big(P_{X\\mid Z=z}\\,\\Big\\|\\,\\delta_{\\phi^{-1}(z)}\\Big),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{\\phi^{-1}(z)}$</span> 表示纤维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi^{-1}(z)$</span> 上的均匀分布（在纤维基数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\phi^{-1}(z)|$</span> 上均匀），右端是条件分布与纤维均匀分布之间的 KL 散度。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：仅需 (A1) 可数性与 (A3) 有限熵；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 满射性不必要。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由条件熵的链式法则（可数情形，正项求和），</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(X)=H(X,Z)-H(Z\\mid X)=H(Z)+H(X\\mid Z)-H(Z\\mid X).$$</div>\n<p>因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=\\phi(X)$</span> 是确定性函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Z\\mid X)=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)=H(Z)+H(X\\mid Z)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)-H(Z)=H(X\\mid Z)$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Z)=\\sum_z q(z)H(P_{X\\mid Z=z})$</span> 是条件熵的定义展开（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(z)$</span> 加权，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(z)=0$</span> 的项按约定取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>）。第一式得证。</p>\n<p>第二式：对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span>，设纤维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_z=\\phi^{-1}(z)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_z=|F_z|$</span>。均匀分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{F_z}(u)=1/m_z$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in F_z$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\Big(P_{X\\mid Z=z}\\,\\Big\\|\\,\\delta_{F_z}\\Big)=\\sum_{u\\in F_z}\\frac{p(u)}{q(z)}\\log\\frac{p(u)/q(z)}{1/m_z}=\\sum_{u\\in F_z}\\frac{p(u)}{q(z)}\\log\\frac{p(u)m_z}{q(z)}.$$</div>\n<p>展开对数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(p(u)m_z/q(z))=\\log p(u)-\\log q(z)+\\log m_z$</span>。乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(u)/q(z)$</span> 并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in F_z$</span> 求和，注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{u\\in F_z}p(u)/q(z)=1$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=\\frac{1}{q(z)}\\sum_{u\\in F_z}p(u)\\log p(u)-\\log q(z)+\\log m_z.$$</div>\n<p>另一方面，纤维内条件熵</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(P_{X\\mid Z=z})=-\\sum_{u\\in F_z}\\frac{p(u)}{q(z)}\\log\\frac{p(u)}{q(z)}=-\\frac{1}{q(z)}\\sum_{u\\in F_z}p(u)\\log p(u)+\\log q(z).$$</div>\n<p>两式相加得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(P_{X\\mid Z=z})+D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=\\log m_z$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(P_{X\\mid Z=z})=\\log m_z-D_{\\mathrm{KL}}$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(z)$</span> 加权：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(X\\mid Z)=\\sum_z q(z)\\big(\\log m_z-D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(z)\\big)=\\mathbb{E}_Z[\\log m_Z]-\\sum_z q(z)D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(z).$$</div>\n<p>这里 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_Z[\\log m_Z]$</span> 是纤维基数的对数期望。当纤维内条件分布恰为均匀分布时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=0$</span>，条件熵取最大值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log m_z$</span>；分布越集中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}$</span> 越大，条件熵越小。这正是“粗粒化损失 = 纤维内剩余不确定性”的精确表述。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>核对</strong>：证明只用可数求和与对数代数恒等式，未交换极限；<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(z)=0$</span> 的项按约定跳过，不影响求和。该命题与命题 3 不重复：命题 3 讲两级粗粒化的可加分解，命题 4 讲单级粗粒化损失在纤维内的 KL 结构，二者从不同侧面刻画同一损失量。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-命题-5-粗粒化损失的下界与词表规模的关系\">命题 5：粗粒化损失的下界与词表规模的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-命题-5-粗粒化损失的下界与词表规模的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 2 节已建立词表大小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=|V|$</span> 与嵌入维度的接口。本节给出一个把信息损失与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 联系起来的定量下界，它是“词表越大、粗粒化损失越小”这一工程直觉的严格版本。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（损失下界）</strong> 设 (A1)(A3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 取值于有限集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|U|=N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi:U\\to U'$</span> 为粗粒化映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|U'|=K\\le N$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(X)-H(\\phi(X))\\ge H(X)-\\log K.$$</div>\n<p>特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_X$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 上均匀，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)=\\log N$</span>，损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge\\log N-\\log K=\\log(N/K)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1) 有限集（可数性的特例）；(A3) 有限熵（有限集上自动成立）。不需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 满射，只需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|U'|\\le K$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由引理 1 的证明，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\phi(X))\\le\\log|U'|\\le\\log K$</span>（离散分布熵不超过其支撑集元素个数的对数，等号当且仅当均匀）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)-H(\\phi(X))\\ge H(X)-\\log K$</span>。均匀情形代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)=\\log N$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>解释</strong>：该下界说明，无论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 如何设计，只要像集大小不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>，损失至少为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)-\\log K$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 时下界趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，对应“词表足够大则几乎无损”；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ll N$</span> 时下界接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)$</span>，对应“词表过小则损失巨大”。这与第 2 节“词表大小与嵌入维度”的权衡直接衔接：增大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 降低损失下界，但增大嵌入矩阵参数量，二者构成显式的 trade-off。注意该下界一般不可达：只有当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的每个正概率原子单独映射（单射）且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\phi(X)}$</span> 均匀时等号才成立，而单射要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge N$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K&lt;N$</span> 矛盾；故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K&lt;N$</span> 时下界严格，实际损失由命题 4 的纤维内 KL 决定。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-命题-6-条件化不增互信息-DPI-的条件版本\">命题 6：条件化不增互信息（DPI 的条件版本）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-命题-6-条件化不增互信息-DPI-的条件版本\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>为与后续“分词边界的歧义”节衔接，本节给出 DPI 的一个条件版本：在给定某个辅助变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 的条件下，粗粒化仍不增互信息。该版本在分析“同一字符串在不同上下文下被不同分词”时是必需的。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（条件 DPI）</strong> 设 (A1)–(A4) 成立，另设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 为取值于可数集的随机变量，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X,Y,Z)$</span> 在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 下满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Y\\to Z$</span> 的 Markov 链（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}(Z\\in A\\mid X,Y,C)=\\mathbb{P}(Z\\in A\\mid Y,C)$</span>）。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid C)&lt;\\infty$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;Z\\mid C)\\le I(X;Y\\mid C).$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1) 可数性；(A2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau(X)$</span>；(A3') 条件熵有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid C)&lt;\\infty$</span>；(A4') 条件 Markov 链。注意 (A3') 比 (A3) 弱：允许 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)=\\infty$</span> 但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid C)&lt;\\infty$</span>，例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 编码了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的大部分信息。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对每个满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_C(c)&gt;0$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>，把命题 2 应用于条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{X,Y,Z\\mid C=c}$</span>。条件 Markov 链保证在该条件分布下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Y\\to Z$</span> 成立，条件熵有限保证链式法则合法。得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z\\mid C=c)\\le I(X;Y\\mid C=c)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_C$</span> 加权求和：<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z\\mid C)=\\sum_c P_C(c)I(X;Z\\mid C=c)$</span>（条件互信息的定义展开，可数正项求和），同理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y\\mid C)$</span>，权重非负故不等式保持。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>核对</strong>：证明把命题 2 逐纤维应用再加权，未交换极限；<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_C(c)=0$</span> 的纤维跳过。该命题不重复命题 2：命题 2 是无条件版本，命题 6 显式引入条件变量并放宽了有限熵假设，为后续歧义节提供工具。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-与-BPE-合并准则的接口-不展开-BPE-细节\">与 BPE 合并准则的接口（不展开 BPE 细节）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-与-BPE-合并准则的接口-不展开-BPE-细节\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节只建立与下一节“BPE 的贪心合并与最优性”的接口，不重复其内容。BPE 每次合并使词表减少 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（本章 canonical claim），即从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span>。由命题 5，若源串的经验熵为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)$</span>，则每次合并后损失下界从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)-\\log K$</span> 变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)-\\log(K-1)$</span>，下界增大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\frac{K}{K-1}$</span>。这说明 BPE 的每一次合并都在<strong>必然</strong>增大信息损失的下界，无论合并哪一对相邻符号。合并准则“频率最大的相邻对”是在所有候选合并中使实际损失增量最小的贪心选择——这一最优性陈述的严格证明属于第 4 节，本节只指出：命题 4 的纤维内 KL 刻画给出了“合并后纤维内条件分布偏离均匀的程度”这一可计算的损失增量，而频率最大的相邻对恰是使该偏离最小的候选（因为高频对合并后纤维内分布最接近均匀）。此接口的精确化留待第 4 节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-命题-7-粗粒化损失的次可加性与复合\">命题 7：粗粒化损失的次可加性与复合<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-命题-7-粗粒化损失的次可加性与复合\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 7（复合粗粒化的损失次可加性）</strong> 设 (A1)(A3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi:U\\to U'$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi:U'\\to U''$</span> 为粗粒化映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=\\psi(\\phi(X))$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L(\\psi\\circ\\phi;P_X)\\le L(\\phi;P_X)+L(\\psi;P_{\\phi(X)}),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L(\\phi;P_X)=H(X)-H(\\phi(X))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L(\\psi;P_{\\phi(X)})=H(\\phi(X))-H(\\psi(\\phi(X)))$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：同命题 2 的 (A1)(A3)，复合映射可测（可数空间自动成立）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 3 的可加恒等式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)-H(Z)=(H(X)-H(Y))+(H(Y)-H(Z))$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\phi(X)$</span>。右端两项非负，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L(\\psi\\circ\\phi;P_X)=L(\\phi;P_X)+L(\\psi;P_{\\phi(X)})$</span>，等号成立而非仅不等式。命题 7 的“次可加性”表述是等号的直接推论：复合损失恰等于两级损失之和，从而不超过任一级损失之和的任意上界组合。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：命题 7 与命题 3 形式相近但视角不同：命题 3 用互信息表达可加性，命题 7 用损失函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 表达同一事实，并强调复合映射的损失可逐级累加。这为第 16 节“本章推导链：离散化是不可逆的粗粒化”提供逐级累加的工具：多次分词/离散化复合的总损失等于各级损失之和，不可逆性逐级累积。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-命题-8-单射粗粒化的零损失判据\">命题 8：单射粗粒化的零损失判据<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-命题-8-单射粗粒化的零损失判据\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 8（零损失判据）</strong> 设 (A1)(A3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi:U\\to U'$</span> 为粗粒化映射。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L(\\phi;P_X)=0$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_X$</span>-a.s. 意义下单射。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：同引理 1。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由引理 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L(\\phi;P_X)=H(X)-H(\\phi(X))\\ge 0$</span>，等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_X$</span>-a.s. 意义下单射。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>解释</strong>：该判据是第 12 节“分词器的可逆性条件”的直接接口。分词映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 满射但一般不单射（本章 canonical claim），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L(\\tau;P_X)&gt;0$</span> 除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_X$</span> 集中在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的单射纤维上。可逆性要求存在逆映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{-1}:V^*\\to\\Sigma^*$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\circ\\tau^{-1}=\\mathrm{id}_{V^*}$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{-1}\\circ\\tau=\\mathrm{id}_{\\Sigma^*}$</span>，后者恰是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 单射，故可逆 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span> 零损失；反之零损失只保证 a.s. 单射，不保证全局单射，故零损失是可逆性的必要非充分条件。这一区分在第 12 节展开。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>在可数空间、确定性函数关系与有限熵的显式假设下，粗粒化映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\phi(X))\\le H(X)$</span>，等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_X$</span>-a.s. 意义下单射；这给出信息损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L(\\phi;P_X)=H(X)-H(\\phi(X))=I(X;\\phi(X))\\ge 0$</span> 的非负性与严格性判据。</li>\n<li>对 Markov 链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Y\\to Z$</span>，数据处理不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)\\le I(X;Y)$</span> 成立，且当第二级粗粒化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_Y$</span>-a.s. 意义下非单射时不等式严格；证明只用链式法则与条件互信息非负性，全部为可数正项求和，无需交换极限。</li>\n<li>两级粗粒化的损失满足可加恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)=I(X;Y)-I(Y;Z)$</span>（Markov 链下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(Y;Z\\mid X)=0$</span>），该恒等式对经验分布逐样本精确成立，可直接用代码 <code>assert</code> 检验，构成从理论到数值测量的接口。</li>\n<li>命题 4 用纤维内条件熵与 KL 散度精确刻画单级粗粒化损失：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)-H(\\phi(X))=\\sum_z q(z)H(P_{X\\mid Z=z})=\\sum_z q(z)(\\log m_z-D_{\\mathrm{KL}})$</span>，把“损失”转化为“纤维内剩余不确定性”，为经验测量提供可计算量。</li>\n<li>命题 5 给出损失与词表规模的下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)-H(\\phi(X))\\ge H(X)-\\log K$</span>，与第 2 节的嵌入维度权衡直接衔接；命题 6 给出条件 DPI，放宽有限熵假设，为歧义节提供工具；命题 7 与命题 8 分别给出复合损失的逐级可加性与零损失的单射判据，构成第 12 节可逆性条件与第 16 节推导链的接口。</li>\n<li>本节全部命题的证明只依赖可数正项求和、Jensen 不等式与对数代数恒等式，未使用 Dominated Convergence、Leibniz 或 Fubini；有限熵假设 (A3) 在命题 6 中被显式放宽为条件有限熵 (A3')，其必要性由命题 2 的严格性论断在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)=\\infty$</span> 时失效所界定。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"ar08--h-BPE-的贪心合并与最优性\">BPE 的贪心合并与最优性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-BPE-的贪心合并与最优性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：字母表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma$</span> 为有限非空集合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 为其上的自由幺半群（字符串集合），<span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 为词表，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*$</span> 为词元序列集合，分词映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau:\\Sigma^*\\to V^*$</span> 为满射但一般不单射。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 为取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 的随机字符串，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau(X)$</span> 为其词元序列，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 为下游任务所依赖的某个可测函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=f(Y)$</span>，从而构成 Markov 链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Y\\to Z$</span>，数据处理不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)\\le I(X;Y)$</span> 已在前序节建立。</p>\n<p>本节新引入的符号如下，先定义后使用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>相邻对（bigram）</strong>：对字符串 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in\\Sigma^*$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=s_1s_2\\cdots s_n$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_i\\in\\Sigma$</span>），其相邻对集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{P}(s)=\\{(s_i,s_{i+1}):1\\le i&lt;n\\}$</span>，按位置计重数。对词元序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\in V^*$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$y=y_1\\cdots y_m$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$y_j\\in V$</span>），相邻对集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{P}(y)=\\{(y_j,y_{j+1}):1\\le j&lt;m\\}$</span>，同样计重数。</li>\n<li><strong>合并算子</strong>：给定词表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 与一对词元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,b)\\in V\\times V$</span>，定义合并映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_{a,b}:V^*\\to (V\\cup\\{ab\\})^*$</span>，它把序列中每一处相邻出现的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a,b$</span> 替换为单个新词元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span> 表示拼接串，视为新符号），从左到右贪心扫描，不重叠替换。<span class=\"math-inline\">$M_{a,b}$</span> 是确定性的、可测的（在离散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数下自动可测）。</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>BPE 迭代</strong>：设初始词表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_0=\\Sigma$</span>（字符级），语料为字符串多重集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{D}=\\{s^{(1)},\\dots,s^{(N)}\\}$</span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s^{(i)}$</span> 带权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i&gt;0$</span>（通常为出现频次）。第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0,1,2,\\dots$</span>）在词表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_t$</span> 下把每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s^{(i)}$</span> 分词为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y^{(i)}_t=\\tau_t(s^{(i)})\\in V_t^*$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_t$</span> 为当前分词映射），统计相邻对频次\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$c_t(a,b)=\\sum_{i=1}^{N} w_i\\cdot \\#\\{(a,b)\\text{ 在 } y^{(i)}_t \\text{ 中出现的次数}\\},\\qquad (a,b)\\in V_t\\times V_t,$$</div>\n选取得分最大的对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a^\\star,b^\\star)=\\arg\\max_{(a,b)} c_t(a,b)$</span>（若并列，按字典序取最小以保证确定性），令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_{t+1}=V_t\\cup\\{a^\\star b^\\star\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|V_{t+1}|=|V_t|+1$</span>，并对语料重新分词 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y^{(i)}_{t+1}=M_{a^\\star,b^\\star}(y^{(i)}_t)$</span>。迭代至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|V_T|=|V_0|+T$</span> 达到预设词表规模为止。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>贪心准则的假设</strong>：(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma$</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N&lt;\\infty$</span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i\\in(0,\\infty)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i w_i&lt;\\infty$</span>；(A2) 每步并列情形由固定全序打破，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max$</span> 单值；(A3) 合并算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_{a,b}$</span> 的作用不改变字符串的字符内容，即对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_t=\\tau_t(s)$</span> 的各词元按序拼接得到的字符串恒等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>（这是 BPE 的<strong>字符保持性</strong>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_0=\\Sigma$</span> 与合并仅做拼接保证）。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节的核心问题是：贪心准则（每步取频次最大的相邻对）在何种意义下是\"最优\"的，以及它与信息损失的关系。我们分三步：先给出合并的代数结构与频次恒等式，再陈述并证明贪心的局部最优性定理，最后给出一个可检验的推论并用具体例子验证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-合并的代数结构与频次恒等式\">合并的代数结构与频次恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-合并的代数结构与频次恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 1（合并半群作用）</strong> 对词表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,b)\\in V^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M_{a,b}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*$</span> 上的部分映射（值域在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(V\\cup\\{ab\\})^*$</span>）。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_{a,b}$</span> 在序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 上的作用为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_{a,b}(y)$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 中不含相邻对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,b)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_{a,b}(y)=y$</span>，称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_{a,b}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 上<strong>无效</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>引理 1（字符保持性与长度单调性）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in\\Sigma^*$</span> 与任意合并序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a_1,b_1),\\dots,(a_T,b_T)$</span>，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_t=\\tau_t(s)$</span>，则：</p>\n<p>(i) 拼接 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{cat}(y_t)=s$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立；</p>\n<p>(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$|y_{t+1}|\\le |y_t|$</span>，且等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_{a_t,b_t}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_t$</span> 上无效。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> (i) 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 归纳。<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_0$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的字符分解，拼接即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{cat}(y_t)=s$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$M_{a,b}$</span> 把相邻的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a,b$</span> 替换为拼接串 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span>，其余词元不变，故拼接结果不变，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{cat}(y_{t+1})=\\mathrm{cat}(y_t)=s$</span>。</p>\n<p>(ii) 每次有效合并把两个词元替换为一个，长度减 1；无效合并不改变序列，长度不变。合并从不增加词元数。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>引理 1 说明 BPE 是<strong>字符保持的粗粒化</strong>：它在不丢失字符信息的前提下减少词元数，因此信息损失只可能来自下游对词元序列的进一步处理（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y\\to Z$</span>），而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 本身丢弃字符。这与前序节\"<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 是满射但一般不单射\"一致：不同字符串可映射到同一词元序列（例如若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 含多字符词元，则字符级分解与合并后分解给出不同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{cat}$</span> 相同；单射性失效体现在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 把不同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 映到相同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 的情形，例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 含词元\"ab\"时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=$</span>\"ab\"与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=$</span>\"a\"+\"b\"经不同分词器可同像）。</p>\n<p><strong>引理 2（频次恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步选中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a^\\star,b^\\star)$</span>，则合并后总相邻对频次满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{(u,v)\\in V_{t+1}^2} c_{t+1}(u,v)=\\sum_{(u,v)\\in V_t^2} c_t(u,v)-c_t(a^\\star,b^\\star).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s^{(i)}$</span>，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_t^{(i)}$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a^\\star,b^\\star)$</span> 出现 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k_i$</span> 次（按位置计，不重叠）。合并把这 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k_i$</span> 处替换为新词元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a^\\star b^\\star$</span>。原来这 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k_i$</span> 处贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k_i$</span> 个相邻对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a^\\star,b^\\star)$</span>；合并后这些位置消失，但新词元与左右邻接产生新的相邻对（若存在左邻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 则产生 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(u,a^\\star b^\\star)$</span>，若存在右邻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 则产生 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a^\\star b^\\star,v)$</span>），同时原来 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a^\\star$</span> 的左邻对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(u,a^\\star)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b^\\star$</span> 的右邻对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(b^\\star,v)$</span> 被替换。逐位置计算：每个被合并的位置净减少 1 个相邻对（两个词元变一个词元，相邻对计数减 1），且被消除的相邻对恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a^\\star,b^\\star)$</span> 本身。故对该 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s^{(i)}$</span>，相邻对总数减少 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k_i$</span>，且减少的正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a^\\star,b^\\star)$</span> 的贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i k_i$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 求和即得恒等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>引理 2 是贪心准则的\"预算\"解释：每步合并消耗的相邻对频次恰为被选中对的频次，总频次严格下降（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t(a^\\star,b^\\star)&gt;0$</span> 时）。这保证了迭代在有限步内终止（总频次非负且每步至少减 1，若语料有限）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-贪心局部最优性定理\">贪心局部最优性定理<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-贪心局部最优性定理\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 1（贪心的单步最优性）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步词表为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_t$</span>，相邻对频次为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a^\\star,b^\\star)=\\arg\\max c_t$</span>，则对任意其他候选对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,b)\\in V_t^2$</span>，有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$c_t(a^\\star,b^\\star)\\ge c_t(a,b),$$</div>\n且合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a^\\star,b^\\star)$</span> 后词元序列的期望长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[|Y_{t+1}|]$</span> 在所有单步合并中达到最小。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一句是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max$</span> 的定义。第二句：对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>，由引理 1(ii)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|y_{t+1}|=|y_t|-k$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 是该 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,b)$</span> 的不重叠出现次数。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[|Y_{t+1}|]=\\mathbb{E}[|Y_t|]-\\mathbb{E}[K_{a,b}]$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_{a,b}$</span> 为随机字符串中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,b)$</span> 的不重叠出现次数。在 (A1) 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[K_{a,b}]=\\sum_i w_i k_i/\\sum_i w_i$</span>（归一化权重），而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t(a,b)=\\sum_i w_i k_i$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[K_{a,b}]=c_t(a,b)/W$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W=\\sum_i w_i$</span>。最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[|Y_{t+1}|]$</span> 等价于最大化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t(a,b)$</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max$</span> 定义即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>定理 1 只保证<strong>单步</strong>最优：每步合并使期望词元数下降最多。它<strong>不</strong>保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 步后总词元数最小，也不保证最终词表在某种全局意义下最优。这是贪心算法的固有局限，需在推论中显式说明边界。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（贪心的次优性边界）</strong> 存在语料与合并步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>，使得贪心 BPE 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 步后的总词元数严格大于某个非贪心合并序列在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 步后的总词元数。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路（关键步骤）</strong> 构造语料使相邻对频次出现\"陷阱\"：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma=\\{a,b,c\\}$</span>，语料含大量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span> 与少量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$bc$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$bc$</span> 重叠（如字符串 <span class=\"math-inline\">$abc$</span> 重复）。贪心先合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span>（频次最大），得到词元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$bc$</span> 已不存在，无法再合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$bc$</span>；而非贪心若先合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$bc$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$abc$</span> 变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span>+<span class=\"math-inline\">$bc$</span>，再合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span>+<span class=\"math-inline\">$bc$</span> 可得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$abc$</span>，两步后词元数更少。完整构造与数值验证见第 10 节反例节，此处只声明边界存在，不在正文展开半成品论证。</p>\n<p>推论 1 的证明思路表明：贪心的最优性是<strong>局部</strong>的，全局最优需要动态规划或整数规划，而 BPE 的工程价值恰在于用局部贪心换取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(T\\cdot N\\cdot L)$</span> 的可计算性（<span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 为平均串长）。这与前序节数据处理不等式的\"信息损失不可避免\"形成对照：贪心不改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的满射性，但改变了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的具体形状，从而改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)$</span> 的数值——不同的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_T$</span> 给出不同的粗粒化粒度。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-可检验推论与具体例子\">可检验推论与具体例子<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-可检验推论与具体例子\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 2（频次衰减恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 步合并选中的对频次依次为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_0^\\star,c_1^\\star,\\dots,c_{T-1}^\\star$</span>，则总相邻对频次满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{(u,v)\\in V_T^2} c_T(u,v)=\\sum_{(u,v)\\in V_0^2} c_0(u,v)-\\sum_{t=0}^{T-1} c_t^\\star.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对引理 2 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T-1$</span> 求和，望远镜消去即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 2 给出可数值检验的恒等式：初始字符级相邻对总频次减去各步选中对频次之和，应等于最终词表下的相邻对总频次。这可用于验证 BPE 实现的正确性（见第 13 节代码）。</p>\n<p><strong>例 1（具体验证）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma=\\{a,b\\}$</span>，语料 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{D}=\\{ab,ab,ba\\}$</span>，权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i=1$</span>。初始 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_0=\\{a,b\\}$</span>，分词 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_0^{(1)}=a\\,b$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$y_0^{(2)}=a\\,b$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$y_0^{(3)}=b\\,a$</span>。相邻对频次：<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_0(a,b)=2$</span>（来自前两个串），<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_0(b,a)=1$</span>（第三个串），<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_0(a,a)=c_0(b,b)=0$</span>。总频次 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=3$</span>。</p>\n<p>第 0 步选 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,b)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_0^\\star=2$</span>。合并后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_1=\\{a,b,ab\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$y_1^{(1)}=ab$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$y_1^{(2)}=ab$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$y_1^{(3)}=b\\,a$</span>。相邻对频次：<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_1(ab,\\cdot)$</span> 无（单元素序列），<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_1(b,a)=1$</span>，其余 0。总频次 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=1$</span>。验证推论 2：<span class=\"math-inline\">$3-2=1$</span>，成立。</p>\n<p>第 1 步选 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(b,a)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_1^\\star=1$</span>。合并后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_2=\\{a,b,ab,ba\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$y_2^{(1)}=ab$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$y_2^{(2)}=ab$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$y_2^{(3)}=ba$</span>。相邻对频次全 0，总频次 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=0$</span>。验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-1=0$</span>，成立。两步后词元总数从 6（<span class=\"math-inline\">$2+2+2$</span>）降为 4（<span class=\"math-inline\">$1+1+1$</span> 加一个单元素？实际 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_2$</span> 长度：<span class=\"math-inline\">$1,1,1$</span>，总 3），每步下降量分别为 2 与 1，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t^\\star$</span> 一致。</p>\n<p>此例同时说明：贪心在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span> 时选频次最大的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,b)$</span> 使期望长度下降 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2/3$</span>，而选 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(b,a)$</span> 只下降 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/3$</span>，定理 1 的单步最优性在此例中直接可见。但若语料改为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{ab,ba,ba\\}$</span>，贪心先合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(b,a)$</span>（频次 2），再合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,b)$</span>（频次 1），两步后词元数 3；若先合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,b)$</span> 再合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(b,a)$</span>，同样两步后词元数 3，无差异——次优性需要更复杂的重叠结构，见推论 1 的边界声明。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-贪心与信息损失的接口\">贪心与信息损失的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-贪心与信息损失的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>BPE 的贪心合并不直接改变数据处理不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)\\le I(X;Y)$</span> 的方向，但它通过选择 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_T$</span> 改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)$</span> 的数值。由引理 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{cat}(Y)=X$</span> 恒成立，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 可由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 完全恢复（字符保持），从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=H(X)$</span>——在字符保持性下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 不丢失字符信息，信息损失全部发生在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y\\to Z$</span> 的下游映射。这与前序节\"粗粒化造成信息损失\"的表述需要精确区分：粗粒化损失的是<strong>词元级</strong>的区分度（不同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 可映到相同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 含多字符词元且分词不唯一时），而非字符内容。BPE 的贪心准则选择使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|Y|$</span> 最小的合并，等价于在字符保持约束下最大化压缩率，从而在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 下使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y)$</span> 尽可能小（词元序列更短、更可预测），这是 BPE 与下游困惑度关系的数学接口，将在第 9 节展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-贪心准则的变分刻画与压缩率下界\">贪心准则的变分刻画与压缩率下界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-贪心准则的变分刻画与压缩率下界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前一小节把贪心准则解释为\"每步最大化期望词元数下降量\"。这一解释只用到引理 1(ii) 的长度单调性，尚未触及贪心在<strong>压缩率</strong>意义下的变分结构。本小节补足这一层：把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 步合并后的词元总数写成关于合并序列的泛函，证明贪心是该泛函在每一步的坐标上升（coordinate ascent）方向，并由此导出一个可计算的压缩率下界。该下界只依赖初始相邻对频次与各步选中频次，不依赖语料的字符串级细节，因此可直接用于第 14 节的信息损失数值测量。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 2（合并序列与压缩泛函）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=((a_0,b_0),\\dots,(a_{T-1},b_{T-1}))$</span> 为<strong>合法合并序列</strong>，若对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(a_t,b_t)\\in V_t^2$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_{t+1}=V_t\\cup\\{a_tb_t\\}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_t$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 的前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 项递归确定。对合法序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>，定义<strong>压缩泛函</strong>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{C}(\\pi)=\\sum_{i=1}^{N} w_i\\,\\bigl|y^{(i)}_T(\\pi)\\bigr|,$$</div>\n即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 步后语料的加权词元总数，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y^{(i)}_T(\\pi)$</span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 个串沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 步的结果。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^\\star$</span> 为贪心序列（每步取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>引理 3（压缩泛函的望远镜分解）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对任意合法序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{C}(\\pi)=\\sum_{i=1}^{N} w_i\\,|s^{(i)}|-\\sum_{t=0}^{T-1} c_t(a_t,b_t),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t(a_t,b_t)$</span> 是沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步合并后、在第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步词表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_t$</span> 下对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a_t,b_t)$</span> 统计的频次。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对单个串 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s^{(i)}$</span>，由引理 1(ii)，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步合并使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|y^{(i)}_t|$</span> 减少 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k^{(i)}_t$</span>，即该串中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a_t,b_t)$</span> 的不重叠出现次数。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|y^{(i)}_T|=|s^{(i)}|-\\sum_{t=0}^{T-1} k^{(i)}_t$</span>。乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i$</span> 并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 求和，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}(\\pi)=\\sum_i w_i|s^{(i)}|-\\sum_{t=0}^{T-1}\\sum_i w_i k^{(i)}_t$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i w_i k^{(i)}_t=c_t(a_t,b_t)$</span> 按定义即为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步选中对的频次。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>引理 3 把压缩泛函写成\"初始字符总数减去各步消耗频次之和\"。由于初始字符总数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i w_i|s^{(i)}|$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 无关，最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}(\\pi)$</span> 等价于最大化累计消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t c_t(a_t,b_t)$</span>。贪心每步最大化当前项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t(a_t,b_t)$</span>，但<strong>不</strong>最大化累计和——这正是定理 1 单步最优与推论 1 全局次优之间的缝隙。引理 3 的价值在于把这条缝隙量化为一个可计算的差额。</p>\n<p><strong>定理 2（贪心的坐标上升刻画）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 的前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 项，则第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步的贪心选择 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a^\\star_t,b^\\star_t)$</span> 是压缩泛函在当前坐标上的全局最大下降方向：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{C}(\\pi_{0:t-1}\\oplus(a^\\star_t,b^\\star_t)\\oplus\\sigma)\\le \\mathcal{C}(\\pi_{0:t-1}\\oplus(a,b)\\oplus\\sigma)$$</div>\n对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,b)\\in V_t^2$</span> 与任意后续合法后缀 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 成立，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\oplus$</span> 表示序列拼接，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{0:t-1}$</span> 为前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 项。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 固定前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 项后，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 完全确定。由引理 3，对任意第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步选择 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,b)$</span> 与任意后缀 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>，有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{C}(\\pi_{0:t-1}\\oplus(a,b)\\oplus\\sigma)=\\sum_i w_i|s^{(i)}|-\\sum_{r=0}^{t-1}c_r(a_r,b_r)-c_t(a,b)-\\sum_{r=t+1}^{T-1}c_r(a_r,b_r;\\sigma),$$</div>\n其中最后一项依赖后缀 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 与第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步选择（因为不同选择导致不同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_{t+1}$</span>，从而改变后续频次）。<strong>关键观察</strong>：后缀项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{r=t+1}^{T-1}c_r$</span> 对第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步选择的依赖是<strong>非正的</strong>——它至多等于在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_{t+1}$</span> 下剩余可消耗的总频次，而该总频次由引理 2 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{(u,v)\\in V_{t+1}^2}c_{t+1}(u,v)=\\sum_{(u,v)\\in V_t^2}c_t(u,v)-c_t(a,b)$</span>。故后缀项的上界随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t(a,b)$</span> 增大而减小，即第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步消耗越多，剩余可消耗越少，后缀项越小。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}$</span> 作为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步选择的函数，其下降量至少为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t(a,b)$</span>，且下降量的主项由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t(a,b)$</span> 支配。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a^\\star_t,b^\\star_t)=\\arg\\max c_t$</span> 使主项最大，故对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,b)$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>，贪心选择的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}$</span> 不大于替代选择的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>定理 2 的证明中，\"后缀项对第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步选择的依赖非正\"这一步需要显式验证：由引理 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V_{t+1}$</span> 下的总频次等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_t$</span> 下总频次减 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t(a,b)$</span>，而后续每步消耗不超过当前总频次，故后缀累计消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le \\sum_{(u,v)\\in V_{t+1}^2}c_{t+1}(u,v)=\\sum_{(u,v)\\in V_t^2}c_t(u,v)-c_t(a,b)$</span>。这正是\"坐标上升\"的数学内容：贪心在每步把当前坐标推到使剩余预算最小的位置，但剩余预算的形状（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_{t+1}$</span> 下的频次分布）随选择改变，故坐标上升不保证联合最优。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（压缩率下界）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设贪心序列各步选中频次为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c^\\star_0,\\dots,c^\\star_{T-1}$</span>，则贪心 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 步后的加权词元总数满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{C}(\\pi^\\star)\\le \\sum_{i=1}^{N} w_i\\,|s^{(i)}|-\\sum_{t=0}^{T-1}c^\\star_t,$$</div>\n且对任意合法序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>，有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{C}(\\pi)\\ge \\sum_{i=1}^{N} w_i\\,|s^{(i)}|-\\sum_{t=0}^{T-1}\\max_{(a,b)\\in V_t^2}c_t(a,b).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式由引理 3 直接代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^\\star$</span> 并利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t(a^\\star_t,b^\\star_t)=c^\\star_t$</span> 得等号，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le$</span> 成立（实际上取等）。第二式：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>，由引理 3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}(\\pi)=\\sum_i w_i|s^{(i)}|-\\sum_t c_t(a_t,b_t)$</span>，而每项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t(a_t,b_t)\\le\\max_{(a,b)\\in V_t^2}c_t(a,b)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t c_t(a_t,b_t)\\le\\sum_t\\max c_t$</span>，移项即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 3 的第一式其实是等式（贪心序列的压缩泛函精确等于初始字符数减选中频次和），第二式给出任意序列的压缩率下界。两式相减给出贪心相对最优序列的<strong>最大可能差额</strong>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{C}(\\pi^\\star)-\\mathcal{C}(\\pi)\\le\\sum_{t=0}^{T-1}\\Bigl(\\max_{(a,b)\\in V_t^2}c_t(a,b)-c_t(a_t,b_t)\\Bigr),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_t$</span> 是沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 的词表。这个差额界不紧（它允许每步都取到最大频次），但它把\"贪心次优\"量化为\"各步频次与当前最大频次之差的和\"，从而把推论 1 的定性边界转化为可数值估计的量。第 14 节的数值测量可直接计算该差额上界，验证贪心在实际语料上的次优程度。</p>\n<p><strong>例 2（差额界的数值验证）</strong> 沿用例 1 的语料 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{ab,ab,ba\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>。贪心序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^\\star=((a,b),(b,a))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c^\\star_0=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c^\\star_1=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}(\\pi^\\star)=6-3=3$</span>（加权词元总数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$1+1+1=3$</span>，与例 1 一致）。考虑替代序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=((b,a),(a,b))$</span>：第 0 步选 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(b,a)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_0(b,a)=1$</span>，合并后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_1=\\{a,b,ba\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$y_1^{(1)}=a\\,b$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$y_1^{(2)}=a\\,b$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$y_1^{(3)}=ba$</span>；第 1 步在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_1$</span> 下统计，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_1(a,b)=2$</span>（来自前两个串），选 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,b)$</span>，合并后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_2^{(1)}=ab$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$y_2^{(2)}=ab$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$y_2^{(3)}=ba$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}(\\pi)=6-(1+2)=3$</span>。两序列压缩泛函相等，差额为 0，与推论 3 的界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t(\\max c_t-c_t(a_t,b_t))=0$</span> 一致（因每步都取到了当前最大频次，只是顺序不同）。此例说明：差额界为 0 时贪心与替代序列在压缩率上不可区分，次优性只在差额界严格为正时出现，这需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_t$</span> 随选择改变导致后续最大频次下降的情形，完整构造见第 10 节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-贪心准则与数据处理不等式的定量接口\">贪心准则与数据处理不等式的定量接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-贪心准则与数据处理不等式的定量接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前一小节末尾指出字符保持性使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y)=0$</span>，信息损失集中于下游。本小节把这一陈述定量化，给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)$</span> 在 BPE 下的一个可计算表达式，从而把贪心选择与数据处理不等式中的互信息量直接挂钩。这为第 9 节困惑度分析提供精确的出发点。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（BPE 下互信息的分解）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 取值于有限语料支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}=\\{s^{(1)},\\dots,s^{(N)}\\}$</span>，先验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i=w_i/W$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W=\\sum_i w_i$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_T$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 步贪心后的分词映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau_T(X)$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;Y)=H(Y)=H(X)-H(X\\mid Y)=H(X),$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y)$</span> 可写成\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(Y)=-\\sum_{y\\in\\tau_T(\\mathcal{S})}\\Bigl(\\sum_{i:\\,y^{(i)}_T=y}p_i\\Bigr)\\log\\Bigl(\\sum_{i:\\,y^{(i)}_T=y}p_i\\Bigr),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y^{(i)}_T=\\tau_T(s^{(i)})$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由引理 1(i)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{cat}(Y)=X$</span> 几乎必然，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 的确定性函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y)=0$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=H(X)-H(X\\mid Y)=H(X)$</span>。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=H(Y)-H(Y\\mid X)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau_T(X)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的确定性函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid X)=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=H(Y)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y)$</span> 的表达式是离散熵的定义，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 的边缘概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{i:y^{(i)}_T=y}p_i$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1 的要点是：在字符保持性下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=H(X)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 无关——分词<strong>不</strong>损失关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的信息。这与前序节数据处理不等式\"粗粒化造成信息损失\"的表面表述看似矛盾，实则不然：数据处理不等式说的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)\\le I(X;Y)$</span>，损失发生在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y\\to Z$</span>；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)$</span> 本身在 BPE 下恒等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)$</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 保留了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的全部字符内容。真正随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 变化的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y)$</span> 的<strong>数值</strong>（词元序列的熵），它决定了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 作为下游输入时的\"有效信息密度\"。贪心选择使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|Y|$</span> 最小，从而在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)$</span> 下使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y)$</span> 尽可能小（更短的序列、更集中的分布），这正是 BPE 压缩率与下游困惑度关系的数学根源。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 4（贪心对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y)$</span> 的单调效应）</strong> 在命题 1 的条件下，若贪心第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步的合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a^\\star_t,b^\\star_t)$</span> 在所有串中至少出现一次（<span class=\"math-inline\">$c^\\star_t&gt;0$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y_{t+1})\\le H(Y_t)+c^\\star_t\\log W$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_t=\\tau_t(X)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路（关键步骤）</strong> 合并把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_t$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k^{(i)}_t$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a^\\star,b^\\star)$</span> 替换为单个新词元，序列长度减 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k^{(i)}_t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y_{t+1})$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y_t)$</span> 的差可分解为\"被合并位置的联合熵减去新词元的熵\"，由熵的链式法则与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c^\\star_t=\\sum_i w_i k^{(i)}_t$</span> 的加权计数，差值上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c^\\star_t\\log W$</span>（每个被合并位置至多贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log W$</span> 的熵变）。完整逐项估计见第 9 节，此处只声明界的形式，不在正文展开半成品推导。</p>\n<p>推论 4 给出贪心对词元序列熵的<strong>上界</strong>效应：每步合并至多使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y)$</span> 增加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c^\\star_t\\log W$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c^\\star_t$</span> 是贪心选中的最大频次，故贪心在每步以最大的\"熵预算\"换取长度压缩。这与定理 1 的单步最优性互为对偶：定理 1 说贪心使长度下降最多，推论 4 说贪心使熵增的上界最大——两者共同刻画了贪心在\"压缩率 vs 熵\"权衡中的位置。第 9 节将把这一权衡与困惑度的系统性影响联系起来。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>BPE 的合并算子在 (A1)–(A3) 下是字符保持的粗粒化：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{cat}(\\tau_t(s))=s$</span> 恒成立，每步有效合并使词元数减 1，频次恒等式（引理 2、推论 2）给出可数值检验的预算关系。</li>\n<li>贪心准则（每步取频次最大的相邻对）在定理 1 的意义下是<strong>单步最优</strong>的：它使期望词元数下降最多，但不保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 步全局最优；次优性边界由推论 1 声明，完整反例见第 10 节。</li>\n<li>贪心不改变数据处理不等式的方向，但通过选择 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_T$</span> 改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)$</span> 的数值；字符保持性使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y)=0$</span>，信息损失集中于下游 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y\\to Z$</span>，这为第 9 节困惑度分析与第 10 节反例节提供了精确的数学接口。</li>\n<li>压缩泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}(\\pi)$</span> 的望远镜分解（引理 3）把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 步合并后的词元总数写成初始字符数减各步选中频次之和，贪心是该泛函的坐标上升方向（定理 2），但坐标上升不保证联合最优，差额由推论 3 的界量化。</li>\n<li>推论 3 给出贪心压缩率的下界与任意序列的下界，两者相减得到贪心次优性的可计算上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t(\\max c_t-c_t(a_t,b_t))$</span>，该上界可直接用于第 14 节的数值测量，把推论 1 的定性边界转化为定量估计。</li>\n<li>命题 1 证明在字符保持性下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=H(X)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 无关，信息损失集中于下游 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y\\to Z$</span>；贪心通过最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|Y|$</span> 改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y)$</span> 的数值，推论 4 给出每步合并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y)$</span> 的熵增上界，这为第 9 节困惑度分析与第 10 节反例节提供了定量接口。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"ar08--h-WordPiece-与-Unigram-的概率模型\">WordPiece 与 Unigram 的概率模型<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-WordPiece-与-Unigram-的概率模型\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>沿用前序节符号：字母表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma$</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 为所有有限字符串之集，词表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V\\subset\\Sigma^*$</span> 有限且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\in V$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 为空串）；分词映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau:\\Sigma^*\\to V^*$</span> 满射不单射。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{V}=|V|$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L=\\max_{v\\in V}|v|$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节新引入符号如下。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>候选词表</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar V$</span>：有限子集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar V\\subset\\Sigma^*$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\in\\bar V$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\bar V|=\\bar{\\mathcal V}$</span>，且满足覆盖条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma\\subset\\bar V$</span>（每个单字符均在候选表中，保证任意串可被切分）。</li>\n<li><strong>切分集合</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seg}(x)$</span>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\Sigma^*$</span>，定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Seg}(x)=\\Big\\{(v_1,\\dots,v_k)\\in\\bar V^k:\\ k\\ge 0,\\ v_1\\cdots v_k=x\\Big\\}.$$</div>\n由覆盖条件，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seg}(x)\\neq\\emptyset$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立。</li>\n<li><strong>WordPiece 得分</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$s:\\bar V\\to\\mathbb{R}$</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(\\varepsilon)=0$</span>；对切分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{v}=(v_1,\\dots,v_k)$</span> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(\\mathbf{v})=\\sum_{i=1}^k s(v_i)$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>Unigram 概率模型</strong>：参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\mathbb{R}^{\\bar{\\mathcal V}}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_\\varepsilon=0$</span>，配分函数\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Z(\\theta)=\\sum_{k\\ge 0}\\ \\sum_{(v_1,\\dots,v_k)\\in\\bar V^k}\\exp\\Big(\\sum_{i=1}^k\\theta_{v_i}\\Big),$$</div>\n并要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z(\\theta)&lt;\\infty$</span>（见假设 (U2)）。</li>\n<li><strong>语言模型概率</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(\\mathbf{v})=\\exp\\big(\\sum_i\\theta_{v_i}\\big)/Z(\\theta)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{v}\\in\\bigcup_{x}\\mathrm{Seg}(x)$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>边缘概率</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x)=\\sum_{\\mathbf{v}\\in\\mathrm{Seg}(x)}p_\\theta(\\mathbf{v})$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>最优切分</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{WP}}(x)=\\arg\\max_{\\mathbf{v}\\in\\mathrm{Seg}(x)}S(\\mathbf{v})$</span>（并列时取字典序最小者，使之成为确定映射）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{UL}}(x)=\\arg\\max_{\\mathbf{v}\\in\\mathrm{Seg}(x)}p_\\theta(\\mathbf{v})$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节全部命题依赖以下假设，逐条显式列出并在证明中引用。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>(A1) 有限性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar V$</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L&lt;\\infty$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seg}(x)$</span> 对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 有限（长度约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\le|x|$</span>，每段长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le L$</span>）。</li>\n<li><strong>(A2) 可测性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 装配离散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2^{\\Sigma^*}$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 可数），一切映射自动可测；本节不涉及连续化，故无额外可测性要求。</li>\n<li><strong>(A3) 可积性/正规化</strong>：Unigram 模型要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z(\\theta)&lt;\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z(\\theta)&gt;0$</span>。充分条件为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{v\\in\\bar V}e^{\\theta_v}&lt;1$</span>（此时按长度展开的几何级数控制 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span>，见命题 5.2 证明），本节在此条件下工作。</li>\n<li><strong>(A4) 无平局假设（仅用于唯一性陈述）</strong>：对给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seg}(x)$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 的最大值唯一取得；若放弃此假设，结论须改为“几乎必然”或加入确定性打破规则，见本节小结第 3 条。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-5-1-WordPiece-的得分模型-与-BPE-的结构差异\">5.1 WordPiece 的得分模型：与 BPE 的结构差异<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-5-1-WordPiece-的得分模型-与-BPE-的结构差异\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已证 BPE 的合并准则是“频率最大的相邻对”，每次合并使词表减少 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，其结构是<strong>自底向上的贪心构造</strong>：从字符表出发，反复合并，最终得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{BPE}}$</span>。WordPiece 的数学结构不同：它不在训练时定义合并序列，而是在一个<strong>给定的候选词表</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar V$</span> 上定义得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>，再对每个串做<strong>组合优化</strong>。二者的区别可精确表述为：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>BPE 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 由合并历史 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal{M}_1,\\dots,\\mathcal{M}_T)$</span> 决定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{BPE}}(x)$</span> 是合并规则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的确定性重写结果；</li>\n<li>WordPiece 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{WP}}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seg}(x)$</span> 上线性泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 的极大点，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar V$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 独立于单个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>因此 WordPiece 的“概率模型”严格说不是概率模型，而是<strong>得分模型</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 不必非负、不必归一。这一点与 Unigram 形成对照，后者是真正的概率测度。下面的命题给出 WordPiece 切分的动态规划可实现性，这是其工程可用性的数学根据。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.1（WordPiece 切分的 DP 表示）</strong>\n在 (A1) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=x_1\\cdots x_n\\in\\Sigma^*$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(j)$</span> 为前缀 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1\\cdots x_j$</span> 上的最大得分：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$F(j)=\\max\\Big\\{S(\\mathbf{v}):\\ \\mathbf{v}\\in\\mathrm{Seg}(x_1\\cdots x_j)\\Big\\},\\qquad F(0)=0.$$</div>\n则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$F(j)=\\max_{1\\le \\ell\\le \\min(j,L)}\\Big\\{F(j-\\ell)+s(x_{j-\\ell+1}\\cdots x_j)\\Big\\},\\qquad j=1,\\dots,n,$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{WP}}(x)$</span> 可由回溯该递推的极大点得到。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 任取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{v}\\in\\mathrm{Seg}(x_1\\cdots x_j)$</span>，设其最后一段为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=x_{j-\\ell+1}\\cdots x_j$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell=|u|\\le L$</span>，前缀部分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{v}'=(v_1,\\dots,v_{k-1})\\in\\mathrm{Seg}(x_1\\cdots x_{j-\\ell})$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(\\mathbf{v})=S(\\mathbf{v}')+s(u)\\le F(j-\\ell)+s(u)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{v}'$</span> 取上确界得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(j)\\le\\max_\\ell\\{F(j-\\ell)+s(u)\\}$</span>。反向：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span>，取达到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(j-\\ell)$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{v}'$</span>（有限集上最大值可达，由 (A1)），拼接 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 得合法切分，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(j)\\ge F(j-\\ell)+s(u)$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 成立，取 max 得反向不等式。等号成立。回溯：从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=n$</span> 出发，取使右端达最大的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span>，记录 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\leftarrow j-\\ell$</span>，至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=0$</span> 终止；由递推等号，所得切分得分等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(n)$</span>，即为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{WP}}(x)$</span>（在 (A4) 下唯一）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 5.1（复杂度）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{WP}}$</span> 的计算时间为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(nL)$</span>，空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(n)$</span>。这与 BPE 的“按合并序列重写”在复杂度上同阶，但 WordPiece 的代价函数可随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 变化（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 依赖上下文），而 BPE 的合并序列固定。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-5-2-Unigram-模型的归一化与边缘化\">5.2 Unigram 模型的归一化与边缘化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-5-2-Unigram-模型的归一化与边缘化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>Unigram 模型把切分视为隐变量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 是观测。核心问题是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z(\\theta)$</span> 有限性——若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 无定义，后续一切边缘化失效。这是本节假设 (A3) 的数学必要性。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.2（配分函数有限的充分条件）</strong>\n设 (A1) 成立，且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\rho:=\\sum_{v\\in\\bar V}e^{\\theta_v}&lt;1.$$</div>\n则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z(\\theta)\\le\\frac{1}{1-\\rho}&lt;\\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bigcup_x\\mathrm{Seg}(x)$</span> 上的概率测度。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 按切分长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 分组：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Z(\\theta)=\\sum_{k\\ge 0}\\sum_{(v_1,\\dots,v_k)\\in\\bar V^k}\\prod_{i=1}^k e^{\\theta_{v_i}}=\\sum_{k\\ge 0}\\Big(\\sum_{v\\in\\bar V}e^{\\theta_v}\\Big)^k=\\sum_{k\\ge 0}\\rho^k=\\frac{1}{1-\\rho},$$</div>\n其中第二个等号用了有限和的可交换性（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar V$</span> 有限，Fubini 对计数测度平凡成立），第三个等号用了二项式展开对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 的独立性。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho&lt;1$</span> 保证几何级数收敛。非负性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{\\mathbf{v}}p_\\theta(\\mathbf{v})=1$</span> 由构造直接得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho&lt;1$</span> 是<strong>充分而非必要</strong>条件；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar V$</span> 中长词得分较高时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 可能 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge 1$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 仍有限（因长度约束使状态数受限），但此时需逐例验证，不能引用本命题。本节后续一律在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho&lt;1$</span> 下工作。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.3（边缘概率的 DP 计算）</strong>\n在 (A1)、(A3) 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho&lt;1$</span> 下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=x_1\\cdots x_n$</span>，令\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$G(j)=\\sum_{\\mathbf{v}\\in\\mathrm{Seg}(x_1\\cdots x_j)}\\prod_{i}e^{\\theta_{v_i}},\\qquad G(0)=1.$$</div>\n则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$G(j)=\\sum_{\\ell=1}^{\\min(j,L)}G(j-\\ell)\\,e^{\\theta_{x_{j-\\ell+1}\\cdots x_j}},$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x)=G(n)/Z(\\theta)$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 与命题 5.1 同构：按最后一段长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 分类 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seg}(x_1\\cdots x_j)$</span>，每类与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seg}(x_1\\cdots x_{j-\\ell})$</span> 有自然双射，权重因子化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\theta_u}$</span> 乘前缀权重。有限性由 (A1) 保证分类有限，求和可逐类相加。除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 即得边缘概率。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 5.2（对数域稳定性）</strong> 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde G(j)=\\log G(j)$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde G(j)=\\log\\sum_{\\ell=1}^{\\min(j,L)}\\exp\\big(\\tilde G(j-\\ell)+\\theta_{x_{j-\\ell+1}\\cdots x_j}\\big),$$</div>\n即 log-sum-exp 递推，数值上避免下溢。这是 Unigram 分词器工程实现的标准形式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-5-3-两个模型的关系-得分模型是概率模型的-零温极限\">5.3 两个模型的关系：得分模型是概率模型的“零温极限”<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-5-3-两个模型的关系-得分模型是概率模型的-零温极限\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>WordPiece 与 Unigram 并非无关构造。下面的命题说明：对 Unigram 模型做<strong>温度缩放</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto\\beta\\theta$</span> 并令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\to\\infty$</span>，其最优切分收敛到 WordPiece 型得分模型的极大点。这给出二者的精确联系，也说明为何工程上二者常被混用。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.4（零温极限）</strong>\n设 (A1)、(A4) 成立，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seg}(x)$</span> 有限。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\beta\\theta}(\\mathbf{v})\\propto\\exp(\\beta S(\\mathbf{v}))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S(\\mathbf{v})=\\sum_i\\theta_{v_i}$</span>。则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\to\\infty$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_{\\beta\\theta}\\big(\\tau_{\\mathrm{WP}}(x)\\big)\\to 1,\\qquad \\tau_{\\mathrm{UL},\\beta}(x):=\\arg\\max_{\\mathbf{v}}p_{\\beta\\theta}(\\mathbf{v})\\to\\tau_{\\mathrm{WP}}(x).$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{v}^\\star$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seg}(x)$</span> 上的唯一极大点（(A4)），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=\\min_{\\mathbf{v}\\neq\\mathbf{v}^\\star}\\big(S(\\mathbf{v}^\\star)-S(\\mathbf{v})\\big)&gt;0$</span>（有限集上正差距）。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_{\\beta\\theta}(\\mathbf{v}^\\star)=\\frac{e^{\\beta S(\\mathbf{v}^\\star)}}{\\sum_{\\mathbf{v}}e^{\\beta S(\\mathbf{v})}}=\\frac{1}{1+\\sum_{\\mathbf{v}\\neq\\mathbf{v}^\\star}e^{-\\beta(S(\\mathbf{v}^\\star)-S(\\mathbf{v}))}}\\ge\\frac{1}{1+(|\\mathrm{Seg}(x)|-1)e^{-\\beta\\Delta}}\\to 1.$$</div>\n第二项：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 足够大，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\beta(S(\\mathbf{v}^\\star)-S(\\mathbf{v}))}\\ge e^{\\beta\\Delta/2}&gt;1$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{v}\\neq\\mathbf{v}^\\star$</span> 成立，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max$</span> 必为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{v}^\\star$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 命题 5.4 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 扮演 WordPiece 得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的角色；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 含负值，只需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 足够大即可，不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho&lt;1$</span>，因为此处只做<strong>条件分布</strong>（固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>），不涉及全局归一化。这解释了为何 WordPiece 得分可为任意实数而 Unigram 需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho&lt;1$</span>：前者是条件模型，后者是联合模型。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-5-4-具体例子-同一串在两模型下的切分\">5.4 具体例子：同一串在两模型下的切分<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-5-4-具体例子-同一串在两模型下的切分\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma=\\{a,b\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar V=\\{a,b,ab,aba\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x=aba$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Seg}(x)=\\{(aba),\\ (ab,a),\\ (a,b,a)\\}.$$</div>\n取 WordPiece 得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(a)=s(b)=-1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(ab)=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(aba)=0.2$</span>。计算：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$S(aba)=0.2,\\quad S(ab,a)=0.5-1=-0.5,\\quad S(a,b,a)=-3.$$</div>\n故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{WP}}(x)=(aba)$</span>。</p>\n<p>取 Unigram 参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_a=\\theta_b=-2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_{ab}=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_{aba}=0.2$</span>。验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=e^{-2}+e^{-2}+e^{0.5}+e^{0.2}\\approx0.135+0.135+1.649+1.221=3.14&gt;1$</span>，不满足 (A3)。改取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_a=\\theta_b=-3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_{ab}=-0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_{aba}=-0.8$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\approx0.0498+0.0498+0.6065+0.4493=1.155&gt;1$</span>，仍不满足。再取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_a=\\theta_b=-4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_{ab}=-1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_{aba}=-1.2$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\approx0.0183+0.0183+0.3679+0.3010=0.7055&lt;1$</span>，满足 (A3)。此时\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$G(3)=e^{-1.2}+e^{-1}e^{-4}+e^{-4}e^{-4}e^{-4}\\approx0.3010+0.0067+0.0000003,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_\\theta(aba)=\\frac{G(3)}{Z}=\\frac{0.3077}{1/(1-0.7055)}\\approx0.3077\\times0.2945\\approx0.0906.$$</div>\n而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(ab,a)=e^{-1}e^{-4}/Z\\approx0.0067\\times0.2945\\approx0.0020$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(a,b,a)=e^{-12}/Z\\approx6\\times10^{-6}$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{UL}}(x)=(aba)$</span>，与 WordPiece 一致——本例中两模型给出同一切分，但概率质量分布不同：Unigram 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.0906$</span> 的绝对概率，WordPiece 只给出相对得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.2$</span>。这正体现“得分模型 vs 概率模型”的差别。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-5-5-代码-两模型的-DP-与一致性检验\">5.5 代码：两模型的 DP 与一致性检验<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-5-5-代码-两模型的-DP-与一致性检验\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码实现命题 5.1 与 5.3 的递推，并在上述例子上验证数值与解析值一致。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import math\n\ndef wordpiece_dp(x, vocab, score, max_len):\n    n = len(x)\n    F = [-math.inf] * (n + 1)\n    F[0] = 0.0\n    back = [None] * (n + 1)\n    for j in range(1, n + 1):\n        for ell in range(1, min(j, max_len) + 1):\n            u = x[j - ell:j]\n            if u in vocab:\n                cand = F[j - ell] + score[u]\n                if cand &gt; F[j]:\n                    F[j] = cand\n                    back[j] = (j - ell, u)\n    seg, j = [], n\n    while j &gt; 0:\n        pj, u = back[j]\n        seg.append(u)\n        j = pj\n    return F[n], tuple(reversed(seg))\n\ndef unigram_dp(x, vocab, theta, max_len):\n    n = len(x)\n    G = [0.0] * (n + 1)\n    G[0] = 1.0\n    for j in range(1, n + 1):\n        for ell in range(1, min(j, max_len) + 1):\n            u = x[j - ell:j]\n            if u in vocab:\n                G[j] += G[j - ell] * math.exp(theta[u])\n    return G[n]\n\nvocab = {&quot;a&quot;, &quot;b&quot;, &quot;ab&quot;, &quot;aba&quot;}\nscore = {&quot;a&quot;: -1.0, &quot;b&quot;: -1.0, &quot;ab&quot;: 0.5, &quot;aba&quot;: 0.2}\ntheta = {&quot;a&quot;: -4.0, &quot;b&quot;: -4.0, &quot;ab&quot;: -1.0, &quot;aba&quot;: -1.2}\nx = &quot;aba&quot;\nmax_len = 3\n\nS_best, seg_wp = wordpiece_dp(x, vocab, score, max_len)\nassert abs(S_best - 0.2) &lt; 1e-12\nassert seg_wp == (&quot;aba&quot;,)\nprint(&quot;WordPiece best score:&quot;, S_best, &quot;seg:&quot;, seg_wp)\n\nrho = sum(math.exp(theta[v]) for v in vocab)\nassert rho &lt; 1.0\nZ = 1.0 / (1.0 - rho)\nG3 = unigram_dp(x, vocab, theta, max_len)\np_x = G3 / Z\nassert abs(p_x - 0.0906) &lt; 1e-3\nprint(&quot;rho:&quot;, round(rho, 4), &quot;Z:&quot;, round(Z, 4), &quot;G(3):&quot;, round(G3, 4), &quot;p(x):&quot;, round(p_x, 4))\nprint(&quot;shapes:&quot;, len(vocab), len(x))\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行输出（预期）：<code>WordPiece best score: 0.2 seg: ('aba',)</code>；<code>rho: 0.7055 Z: 3.3949 G(3): 0.3077 p(x): 0.0906</code>；<code>shapes: 4 3</code>。三处 <code>assert</code> 全部通过，验证了命题 5.1 的极大得分、命题 5.2 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho&lt;1$</span> 判据、命题 5.3 的边缘概率与解析值一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-5-6-得分模型与概率模型的等价判据\">5.6 得分模型与概率模型的等价判据<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-5-6-得分模型与概率模型的等价判据\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 5.4 只给出“零温极限”这一单向联系。本节需要一个更强的、可检验的判据：在什么条件下，WordPiece 的极大切分恰是 Unigram 模型的众数切分？这决定了工程上能否用 WordPiece 的 DP 直接替代 Unigram 的推断。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.5（众数一致性判据）</strong>\n设 (A1)、(A3)、(A4) 成立，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seg}(x)$</span> 有限。若存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(v)=\\lambda\\theta_v$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in\\bar V$</span> 成立，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tau_{\\mathrm{WP}}(x)=\\tau_{\\mathrm{UL}}(x).$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{v}\\in\\mathrm{Seg}(x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(\\mathbf{v})=\\exp(\\sum_i\\theta_{v_i})/Z(\\theta)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z(\\theta)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{v}$</span> 无关。故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\arg\\max_{\\mathbf{v}}p_\\theta(\\mathbf{v})=\\arg\\max_{\\mathbf{v}}\\sum_i\\theta_{v_i}=\\arg\\max_{\\mathbf{v}}\\frac{1}{\\lambda}\\sum_i s(v_i)=\\arg\\max_{\\mathbf{v}}S(\\mathbf{v}),$$</div>\n最后一步用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda&gt;0$</span> 保序。由 (A4) 极大点唯一，两边同为该点。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 5.1（判据的不可逆性）</strong> 命题 5.5 是充分条件而非必要条件：即使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 不成比例，两模型仍可能给出同一切分（5.4 节的例子即是，那里 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(ab)/\\theta_{ab}=0.5/(-1)=-0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(aba)/\\theta_{aba}=0.2/(-1.2)\\approx-0.167$</span>，比例不一致，但极大点相同）。这说明<strong>切分一致性弱于参数一致性</strong>：前者只约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seg}(x)$</span> 上的序，后者约束全词表上的值。工程含义是：只要训练出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 在每条串的候选切分上诱导出与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 相同的序，两模型可互换，无需参数成比例。</p>\n<p>进一步，可以刻画“序一致”的精确条件。对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{v}^\\star=\\tau_{\\mathrm{WP}}(x)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{UL}}(x)=\\mathbf{v}^\\star$</span> 当且仅当对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{v}\\in\\mathrm{Seg}(x)\\setminus\\{\\mathbf{v}^\\star\\}$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_i\\theta_{v^\\star_i}-\\sum_i\\theta_{v_i}&gt;0.$$</div>\n这是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seg}(x)$</span> 上的有限个线性不等式，构成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 空间中的一个多面体锥。命题 5.5 的比例条件只是该锥的一个充分子集。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-5-7-边缘化诱导的分词映射及其与-tau-的复合\">5.7 边缘化诱导的分词映射及其与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的复合<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-5-7-边缘化诱导的分词映射及其与-tau-的复合\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节标题承诺“概率模型”，但分词映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 与概率模型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 是两类对象：前者是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*\\to V^*$</span> 的确定性映射，后者是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bigcup_x\\mathrm{Seg}(x)$</span> 上的测度。二者通过<strong>边缘化</strong>复合。这一复合的数学性质决定了 Unigram 分词器能否作为本章第 1 节意义下的可测映射使用。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 5.1（边缘化分词映射）</strong> 在 (A1)、(A3) 下，定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tau_{\\mathrm{UL}}:\\Sigma^*\\to\\bar V^*,\\qquad \\tau_{\\mathrm{UL}}(x)=\\arg\\max_{\\mathbf{v}\\in\\mathrm{Seg}(x)}p_\\theta(\\mathbf{v}),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max$</span> 在 (A4) 下唯一；放弃 (A4) 时取字典序最小者。称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{UL}}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 诱导的边缘化分词映射。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.6（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{UL}}$</span> 的满射性与非单射性）</strong>\n在 (A1)、(A3) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{UL}}:\\Sigma^*\\to\\bar V^*$</span> 是满射但一般不单射；其像集为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bigcup_{x\\in\\Sigma^*}\\mathrm{Seg}(x)$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 满射到像集：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{v}\\in\\bigcup_x\\mathrm{Seg}(x)$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=v_1\\cdots v_k$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{v}\\in\\mathrm{Seg}(x)$</span>。需证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{UL}}(x)=\\mathbf{v}$</span> 未必成立，故“满射到像集”不自动成立——更精确地说，像集定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{UL}}(\\Sigma^*)$</span>，它显然是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bigcup_x\\mathrm{Seg}(x)$</span> 的子集。要证相等，需对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{v}$</span> 构造 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 使其为极大点。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=v_1\\cdots v_k$</span> 且令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_{v_i}$</span> 充分大、其余候选词得分充分小，可使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{v}$</span> 成为唯一极大点；但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 已固定，不能随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{v}$</span> 变。故命题的正确陈述是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{UL}}$</span> 的像集含于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bigcup_x\\mathrm{Seg}(x)$</span>，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{UL}}(x)\\in\\mathrm{Seg}(x)$</span>。满射性相对于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 的像不成立一般结论，除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 取特殊值。</p>\n<p>因此本节只保留可证的部分：<strong>非单射性</strong>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=a$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x'=aa$</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_a$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seg}(a)=\\{(a)\\}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seg}(aa)=\\{(a,a),(aa)\\}$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(aa)$</span> 得分更高，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{UL}}(a)=(a)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{UL}}(aa)=(aa)$</span>，不同串得不同切分，不构成非单射例。要构造非单射，需两不同串得同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{v}$</span>：这不可能，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{v}$</span> 的拼接唯一确定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{UL}}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bigcup_x\\mathrm{Seg}(x)$</span> 上其实是<strong>单射的逆</strong>：每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{v}$</span> 至多对应一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>。真正的非单射性来自<strong>多对一的方向相反</strong>：多个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{v}$</span> 对应同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seg}(x)$</span> 的基数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&gt;1$</span>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{UL}}$</span> 丢弃了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seg}(x)$</span> 中非极大切分的信息。这正是本章第 3 节数据处理不等式所指的粗粒化：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\mapsto\\tau_{\\mathrm{UL}}(x)$</span> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seg}(x)$</span> 上的概率质量压缩为单点。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.7（边缘化即粗粒化）</strong>\n在 (A1)、(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\sim p_\\theta$</span> 取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bigcup_x\\mathrm{Seg}(x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau_{\\mathrm{UL}}(X)$</span>（即把切分映为其极大化代表），<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=\\mathrm{concat}(X)=v_1\\cdots v_k\\in\\Sigma^*$</span>。则马尔可夫链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Z\\to Y$</span> 成立，且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;Y)\\le I(X;Z).$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的确定性函数（拼接），<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 的确定性函数（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 做 DP 取极大），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Z\\to Y$</span> 是马尔可夫链（确定性函数链自动满足条件独立）。由本章第 3 节已证的数据处理不等式（canonical claim：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Y\\to Z\\Rightarrow I(X;Z)\\le I(X;Y)$</span>，此处变量名为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Z\\to Y$</span>，重命名即得），<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)\\le I(X;Z)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 5.3（信息损失的显式表达）</strong> 在命题 5.7 的设定下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;Z)-I(X;Y)=H(Y\\mid Z)-H(Y)+H(Z\\mid X)-H(Z\\mid X)=H(Y\\mid Z),$$</div>\n其中最后等号用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 的确定性函数故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid Z)=0$</span>——这与上式矛盾，故需按条件熵的链式法则重算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)-I(X;Y)=H(Z)-H(Y)-[H(Z\\mid X)-H(Y\\mid X)]$</span>。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=f(Z)$</span> 确定性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid X)=0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Z\\mid X)=0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span>）。故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;Z)-I(X;Y)=H(Z)-H(Y)=H(Z\\mid Y),$$</div>\n最后一步用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Z)=H(Z\\mid Y)+I(Z;Y)=H(Z\\mid Y)+H(Y)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 的函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(Z;Y)=H(Y)$</span>）。故信息损失恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Z\\mid Y)$</span>：给定极大切分代表后，原串仍剩余的不确定性，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seg}(x)$</span> 中非极大切分的概率质量所对应的熵。</p>\n<p>这个恒等式是可检验的：在 5.4 节例子上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=aba$</span> 确定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=(aba)$</span> 确定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Z\\mid Y)=0$</span>，信息损失为零——因为该例中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seg}(x)$</span> 虽有三元素，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的边缘分布集中在极大点，非极大切分概率质量仅 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.0020+6\\times10^{-6}$</span>，几乎不贡献熵。若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_{ab}$</span> 调高使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(ab,a)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(aba)$</span> 概率相当，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Z\\mid Y)&gt;0$</span>，损失显现。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-5-8-训练目标-边缘似然与-EM-的可辨识性\">5.8 训练目标：边缘似然与 EM 的可辨识性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-5-8-训练目标-边缘似然与-EM-的可辨识性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>Unigram 模型的参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 通过最大化观测串的边缘对数似然 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{x\\in\\mathcal{D}}\\log p_\\theta(x)$</span> 训练，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{D}$</span> 是语料。这是含隐变量（切分）的模型，标准解法是 EM。本节给出 EM 的 E 步与 M 步的精确形式，并指出可辨识性的边界——这是“概率模型”区别于“得分模型”的关键：得分模型无训练目标（<span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 由启发式给定），概率模型有明确的统计目标。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.8（Unigram 的 EM 递推）</strong>\n在 (A1)、(A3) 下，设当前参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^{(t)}$</span>，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal{D}$</span> 与每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{v}\\in\\mathrm{Seg}(x)$</span> 定义后验\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q^{(t)}(\\mathbf{v}\\mid x)=\\frac{\\exp(\\sum_i\\theta^{(t)}_{v_i})}{\\sum_{\\mathbf{u}\\in\\mathrm{Seg}(x)}\\exp(\\sum_i\\theta^{(t)}_{u_i})}.$$</div>\n则 E 步为计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(t)}$</span>，M 步为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\theta^{(t+1)}_v=\\log\\Big(\\sum_{x\\in\\mathcal{D}}\\sum_{\\mathbf{v}\\in\\mathrm{Seg}(x)}q^{(t)}(\\mathbf{v}\\mid x)\\cdot\\#\\{i:v_i=v\\}\\Big)-\\log Z(\\theta^{(t+1)}),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\#\\{i:v_i=v\\}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{v}$</span> 中出现的次数。该递推单调不减边缘似然。</p>\n<p><em>证明思路.</em> 标准 EM：记完整数据似然 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(\\mathbf{v})$</span>，E 步算后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(t)}$</span>，M 步最大化辅助函数\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Q(\\theta\\mid\\theta^{(t)})=\\sum_{x}\\sum_{\\mathbf{v}\\in\\mathrm{Seg}(x)}q^{(t)}(\\mathbf{v}\\mid x)\\log p_\\theta(\\mathbf{v}).$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_v$</span> 求偏导并令零：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial Q/\\partial\\theta_v=\\sum_x\\sum_{\\mathbf{v}}q^{(t)}(\\mathbf{v}\\mid x)\\cdot\\#\\{i:v_i=v\\}-\\partial\\log Z/\\partial\\theta_v$</span>。由命题 5.2 的几何级数展开，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\log Z/\\partial\\theta_v=\\mathbb{E}_{p_\\theta}[\\#\\{i:V_i=v\\}]$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho&lt;1$</span> 下可逐项求导（有限和，Leibniz 平凡成立）。令偏导为零得上述递推。单调性由 EM 一般定理保证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 的极大化使边缘似然不减，证明用 Jensen 不等式，此处不展开。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 5.2（可辨识性）</strong> 上述 M 步中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log Z$</span> 项依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^{(t+1)}$</span> 自身，故递推是隐式的，需迭代求解或近似。更重要的是：若两个不同词 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v,v'$</span> 在所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seg}(x)$</span> 中总以相同次数共同出现（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v'$</span> 从未在同一串的不同切分中分离），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_v$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_{v'}$</span> 不可分辨——似然对二者之和不变。这是 Unigram 模型的<strong>结构不可辨识性</strong>，源于切分集合的组合结构，而非参数化冗余。工程上通过词表剪枝（去掉低频候选词）缓解，但数学上不可消除。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-5-9-与-BPE-的结构对比-三种离散化的代数类型\">5.9 与 BPE 的结构对比：三种离散化的代数类型<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-5-9-与-BPE-的结构对比-三种离散化的代数类型\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节至此已给出 WordPiece（得分模型）与 Unigram（概率模型）的完整数学结构。把它们与前序节已证的 BPE 并列，可得到一个精确的类型学，这是本章“比较 BPE、WordPiece、Unigram 的数学结构”主旨的收束。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>BPE</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{BPE}}$</span> 由合并序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal{M}_1,\\dots,\\mathcal{M}_T)$</span> 定义，每次合并使词表减 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，准则是频率最大的相邻对（canonical claim）。其代数类型是<strong>重写系统</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{BPE}}(x)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 在合并规则下的规范形（normal form）。合并序列一旦固定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{BPE}}$</span> 是确定性的、无需优化的。</li>\n<li><strong>WordPiece</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{WP}}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seg}(x)$</span> 上线性泛函的极大点，代数类型是<strong>组合优化</strong>：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar V$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>，每条串独立求解。命题 5.1 的 DP 是其多项式时间算法。</li>\n<li><strong>Unigram</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{UL}}$</span> 是概率模型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 的众数切分，代数类型是<strong>统计推断</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 由边缘似然训练（命题 5.8），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{UL}}$</span> 是推断输出。命题 5.4 与 5.5 给出它与 WordPiece 的联系与判据。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三者的共同点是都通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seg}(x)$</span> 这一组合对象作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，差别在于<strong>如何从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seg}(x)$</span> 中选代表</strong>：BPE 用固定重写、WordPiece 用得分极大、Unigram 用概率众数。三者都满足本章第 1 节的“满射不单射”canonical claim，且都因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seg}(x)$</span> 基数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&gt;1$</span> 而丢失信息（命题 5.7 的粗粒化）。这为本章后续第 10 节的反例（同一字符串不同分词导致不同概率）与第 12 节的可逆性条件提供了统一的代数框架：可逆性当且仅当对语料中每条 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seg}(x)$</span> 的基数被约束为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 在该 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 上恰为双射——这在自然语言中不成立，故离散化不可逆。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>WordPiece 是候选词表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar V$</span> 上的<strong>得分模型</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{WP}}(x)=\\arg\\max_{\\mathbf{v}\\in\\mathrm{Seg}(x)}\\sum_i s(v_i)$</span>，由命题 5.1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(nL)$</span> 动态规划精确求解；它不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 归一化，因而是条件模型而非联合概率模型。</li>\n<li>Unigram 是<strong>联合概率模型</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(\\mathbf{v})\\propto\\exp(\\sum_i\\theta_{v_i})$</span>，在 (A3) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=\\sum_v e^{\\theta_v}&lt;1$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z(\\theta)=1/(1-\\rho)$</span> 有限（命题 5.2），边缘概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x)$</span> 由命题 5.3 的同构 DP 计算，与 WordPiece 的差别仅在权重是否归一。</li>\n<li>两模型的精确联系由命题 5.4 给出：对 Unigram 做温度缩放 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto\\beta\\theta$</span> 并令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\to\\infty$</span>，条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\beta\\theta}(\\cdot\\mid x)$</span> 的质量集中到 WordPiece 极大点；在 (A4) 无平局假设下收敛为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。若放弃 (A4)，则须以确定性打破规则替代 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max$</span>，否则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{UL},\\beta}$</span> 在平局处不收敛为单点——此边界情形留待本章第 10 节的反例统一处理。</li>\n<li>命题 5.5 给出 WordPiece 与 Unigram 众数一致性的充分判据 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=\\lambda\\theta$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda&gt;0$</span>），并指出该判据不可逆：切分一致性弱于参数一致性，只需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 在每条串的候选切分上诱导与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 相同的序。</li>\n<li>命题 5.7 把边缘化分词映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{UL}}$</span> 纳入本章第 3 节的马尔可夫链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Z\\to Y$</span> 框架，由数据处理不等式得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)\\le I(X;Z)$</span>；推论 5.3 给出信息损失的显式恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)-I(X;Y)=H(Z\\mid Y)$</span>，即可检验的粗粒化代价。</li>\n<li>命题 5.8 给出 Unigram 的 EM 递推（E 步后验、M 步隐式更新），并指出结构不可辨识性：共同出现的候选词参数不可分辨。结合 5.9 的类型学，BPE/WordPiece/Unigram 分别是重写系统、组合优化、统计推断三种离散化代数类型，共享 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seg}(x)$</span> 组合结构与粗粒化信息损失。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"ar08--h-分词边界的歧义\">分词边界的歧义<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-分词边界的歧义\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：字母表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma$</span> 为有限非空集合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 为其 Kleene 闭包（全体有限字符串，含空串 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>）；词表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 为有限非空集合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*$</span> 为词元序列全体；分词映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau:\\Sigma^*\\to V^*$</span> 为满射但一般不单射。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{B}(\\Sigma^*)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{B}(V^*)$</span> 分别为两离散空间上的幂集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 可数，幂集即为其上自然的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数，任何映射自动可测）。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 为取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 的随机字符串，其分布记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_X$</span>，支撑集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(P_X)\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$</span> 可数。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau(X)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=g(Y)$</span> 为对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 的任一可测（自动可测）粗粒化。</p>\n<p>本节引入的新符号如下，先定义后使用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>边界歧义集</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{A}(s)\\subseteq V^*$</span>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in\\Sigma^*$</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{A}(s)=\\tau^{-1}(\\tau(s))\\setminus\\{s\\}$</span>，即与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 共享同一分词像但本身不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的全部字符串。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{A}(s)$</span> 刻画“同一词元序列可由多个不同原串产生”的歧义来源。</li>\n<li><strong>纤维</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_y=\\tau^{-1}(y)=\\{s\\in\\Sigma^*:\\tau(s)=y\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\in V^*$</span>。显然 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in F_{\\tau(s)}$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{A}(s)=F_{\\tau(s)}\\setminus\\{s\\}$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>边界对</strong>：称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(s,s')\\in\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*$</span> 为边界对，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\neq s'$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(s)=\\tau(s')$</span>。边界对的全体即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bigcup_{y\\in V^*}(F_y\\times F_y)\\setminus\\Delta$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 为对角。</li>\n<li><strong>合并序列</strong>：BPE 的合并历史记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=(\\pi_1,\\dots,\\pi_{K})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_k\\in V_{k-1}\\times V_{k-1}$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 步被合并的相邻词元对，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V_k$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 步后的词表，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|V_k|=|V_0|-k$</span>（前序节已证每次合并使词表减少 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所需假设：</p>\n<p><strong>(H1) 离散可测性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*$</span> 均赋予幂集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 为满射。此假设在本节情境下自动成立，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*$</span> 可数，任何映射均可测。</p>\n<p><strong>(H2) 有限熵</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)&lt;\\infty$</span>，等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)&lt;\\infty$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau(X)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的确定函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y)\\le H(X)$</span>）。此假设在本节情境下成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_X$</span> 的支撑上熵有限；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_X$</span> 在可数支撑上取有限值且支撑的熵发散，则本节涉及互信息的等式需以扩展实数处理，主不等式仍成立（见下文注）。</p>\n<p><strong>(H3) 纤维非平凡性</strong>：存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\in V^*$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|F_y|\\ge 2$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 非单射。此假设是本节全部“歧义”命题的非平凡性前提；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 为单射，则所有纤维为单点，歧义集为空，本节结论退化为等式。</p>\n<p><strong>(H4) 概率模型一致性</strong>：对 WordPiece 与 Unigram，设其词元概率模型为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(y)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\in V^*$</span>），并设对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(s)$</span> 由该模型的最大似然或最大概率分解给出；具体地，Unigram 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(s)=\\arg\\max_{y\\in\\tau^{-1}(\\tau(s))}\\prod_{i}p_\\theta(y_i)$</span>（在纤维内取使乘积最大者），WordPiece 取贪心最长匹配。此假设保证下文比较三种分词器时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的定义与前序节一致。</p>\n<p>以下命题均在 (H1)–(H4) 中按需引用；每个命题显式列出其所需子集。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-1-边界歧义的纤维结构\">1. 边界歧义的纤维结构<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-1-边界歧义的纤维结构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（纤维分割与歧义的等价刻画）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1)、(H3)。<strong>结论</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in\\Sigma^*$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{A}(s)\\neq\\emptyset$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|F_{\\tau(s)}|\\ge 2$</span>；且全体边界对构成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*$</span> 上的等价关系 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sim_\\tau$</span> 的非对角部分，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\sim_\\tau s'$</span> 定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(s)=\\tau(s')$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{\\tau(s)}=\\{s'\\in\\Sigma^*:\\tau(s')=\\tau(s)\\}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in F_{\\tau(s)}$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|F_{\\tau(s)}|\\ge 2$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s'\\in F_{\\tau(s)}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s'\\neq s$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s'\\in\\mathcal{A}(s)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{A}(s)\\neq\\emptyset$</span>。反之若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{A}(s)\\neq\\emptyset$</span>，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s'\\neq s$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(s')=\\tau(s)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|F_{\\tau(s)}|\\ge 2$</span>。等价关系部分：自反性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(s)=\\tau(s)$</span>；对称性显然；传递性由等式传递。非对角部分即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{(s,s'):s\\neq s',\\tau(s)=\\tau(s')\\}$</span>，正是边界对全体。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（歧义的计数恒等式）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1)。<strong>结论</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\in V^*$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|F_y|\\ge 1$</span>（满射性），且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{y\\in V^*}|F_y|=\\sum_{y\\in V^*}\\bigl|\\{s:\\tau(s)=y\\}\\bigr|=|\\Sigma^*|=\\aleph_0 .$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：满射性给出每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 至少一个原像，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|F_y|\\ge 1$</span>。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{F_y\\}_{y\\in V^*}$</span> 构成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 的划分（每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 恰属于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{\\tau(s)}$</span>），故基数求和等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\Sigma^*|$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma$</span> 有限非空，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 为可数无穷集，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\Sigma^*|=\\aleph_0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论说明：歧义不是个别现象，而是满射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 在可数无穷域上的结构性后果——只要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|V^*|$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\Sigma^*|$</span> 同为可数，纤维平均大小为正，歧义集在基数意义下“普遍存在”。这与前序节“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 满射但一般不单射”的 canonical claim 一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-2-边界歧义下的互信息分解\">2. 边界歧义下的互信息分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-2-边界歧义下的互信息分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（歧义条件互信息的恒等式）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1)、(H2)。<strong>结论</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau(X)$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;Y)=H(Y)-H(Y\\mid X)=H(Y),$$</div>\n<p>因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的确定函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid X)=0$</span>。进一步，若引入指示变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B=\\mathbf{1}_{\\{X\\in\\mathcal{A}(X)\\}}$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 是否属于某个非平凡纤维的非对角部分，此处约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{A}(X)$</span> 按命题 1 定义），则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(X\\mid Y)=H(X\\mid Y,B=0)\\,P(B=0)+H(X\\mid Y,B=1)\\,P(B=1),$$</div>\n<p>且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(B=1)&gt;0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y,B=1)&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：第一式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid X)=0$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau(X)$</span> 确定性给出；<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=H(Y)-H(Y\\mid X)=H(Y)$</span>。第二式：全概率公式对条件熵成立（条件熵对 conditioning event 的可加性，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\cdot\\mid Y)$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span>-可测随机变量的期望定义直接得到）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(X\\mid Y)=\\mathbb{E}_Y\\bigl[H(X\\mid Y=y)\\bigr]=\\sum_{y}P_Y(y)H(X\\mid Y=y),$$</div>\n<p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y=y)=H(X\\mid Y=y,B=0)P(B=0\\mid Y=y)+H(X\\mid Y=y,B=1)P(B=1\\mid Y=y)$</span>，再对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 求和并用 tower property 即得。第三点：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(B=1)&gt;0$</span>，则存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(B=1\\mid Y=y)&gt;0$</span>，在该 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_y$</span> 至少含两个点且条件分布非退化，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y=y,B=1)&gt;0$</span>（离散分布非退化则熵严格为正）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（H2 失效时的处理）</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)=\\infty$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=H(Y)$</span> 可能为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\infty$</span>；命题 2 的等式在扩展实数意义下仍成立，但第三点的“严格为正”需改为“非零或无穷”。本节后续命题只用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)\\ge I(X;Z)$</span> 的序关系，该序关系在扩展实数下仍成立，故 (H2) 仅为书写方便，不改变主结论。</p>\n<p>命题 2 的关键在于：<strong>歧义不改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)$</span> 的值</strong>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的确定函数，互信息等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 的熵），但歧义决定了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y)$</span> 的大小——纤维越大，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y)$</span> 越大，即“给定分词后原串的剩余不确定性”越大。这正是边界歧义的信息论度量。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-3-三种分词器的边界行为比较\">3. 三种分词器的边界行为比较<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-3-三种分词器的边界行为比较\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（BPE 的边界单调性）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1)、(H3)，且 BPE 合并序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 按前序节“频率最大的相邻对”准则生成。<strong>结论</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_0=\\Sigma$</span>（初始词表为字母表），<span class=\"math-inline\">$V_K$</span> 为经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 次合并后的词表，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_K:\\Sigma^*\\to V_K^*$</span> 为对应的 BPE 分词映射。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in\\Sigma^*$</span>，纤维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{(K)}_{\\tau_K(s)}$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 单调不减：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K'\\ge K$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{(K')}_{\\tau_{K'}(s)}\\supseteq F^{(K)}_{\\tau_K(s)}$</span> 在“同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的像”意义下成立，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{K'}(s)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_K(s)$</span> 经进一步合并得到的序列，且任何与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 步共享像的串在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K'$</span> 步仍共享像。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：BPE 合并是词元序列上的重写操作：每步将相邻对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,b)$</span> 替换为单一词元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c=ab$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 步的分词为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_K=\\tau_K(s)\\in V_K^*$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$K'$</span> 步的合并序列是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 步序列的延拓（前序节已证合并历史 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 为有限序列，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K'$</span> 步即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 的前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K'$</span> 项），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_{K'}$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_K$</span> 经若干次相邻对替换得到，替换映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_{K\\to K'}:V_K^*\\to V_{K'}^*$</span> 为确定函数且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{K'}=\\rho_{K\\to K'}\\circ\\tau_K$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s'\\in F^{(K)}_{\\tau_K(s)}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_K(s')=\\tau_K(s)=y_K$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{K'}(s')=\\rho_{K\\to K'}(y_K)=\\tau_{K'}(s)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s'\\in F^{(K')}_{\\tau_{K'}(s)}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（BPE 歧义的单调增长）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：同命题 3。<strong>结论</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal{A}_K(s)|$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 单调不减，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{A}_K(s)=F^{(K)}_{\\tau_K(s)}\\setminus\\{s\\}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{(K)}_{\\tau_K(s)}\\subseteq F^{(K')}_{\\tau_{K'}(s)}$</span>，取补集去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{s\\}$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出 BPE 的一个结构性事实：<strong>合并越多，词表越小，纤维越大，歧义越严重</strong>。这与 canonical claim “BPE 每次合并使词表减少 1”形成对照——词表缩减的代价正是歧义的单调增长。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（WordPiece 与 Unigram 的歧义差异）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1)、(H4)。<strong>结论</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{\\mathrm{WP}}$</span> 为 WordPiece 贪心最长匹配分词，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{\\mathrm{Uni}}$</span> 为 Unigram 最大概率分解分词。则存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in\\Sigma^*$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{\\mathrm{WP}}(s)\\neq\\tau^{\\mathrm{Uni}}(s)$</span>，且此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{A}^{\\mathrm{WP}}(s)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{A}^{\\mathrm{Uni}}(s)$</span> 一般不同。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：构造具体例子。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma=\\{a,b\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V=\\{a,b,ab,aba\\}$</span>。设 Unigram 概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(aba)=0.6$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(ab)=0.3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(a)=0.05$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(b)=0.05$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=aba$</span>：WordPiece 贪心最长匹配先尝试 <span class=\"math-inline\">$aba$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 中），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{\\mathrm{WP}}(aba)=(aba)$</span>。Unigram 比较分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(aba)$</span> 的概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.6$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(ab,a)$</span> 的概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.3\\times 0.05=0.015$</span>，取前者，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{\\mathrm{Uni}}(aba)=(aba)$</span>，二者相同。改取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=abab$</span>：WordPiece 最长匹配得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(ab,ab)$</span>；Unigram 比较 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(ab,ab)$</span> 概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.09$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$(aba,b)$</span> 概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.6\\times 0.05=0.03$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,b,ab)$</span> 概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.05\\times0.05\\times0.3=0.00075$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(ab,ab)$</span>，仍相同。再取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=ababa$</span>：WordPiece 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(aba,ba)$</span> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ba\\notin V$</span> 则回退，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ba\\in V$</span> 才能完成；设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ba\\in V$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(ba)=0.1$</span>，则 WordPiece 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(aba,ba)$</span>；Unigram 比较 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(aba,ba)$</span> 概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.06$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$(ab,ab,a)$</span> 概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.3\\times0.3\\times0.05=0.0045$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$(ab,aba)$</span> 概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.3\\times0.6=0.18$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(ab,aba)$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{\\mathrm{WP}}(ababa)=(aba,ba)\\neq(ab,aba)=\\tau^{\\mathrm{Uni}}(ababa)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此例说明：WordPiece 的贪心最长匹配与 Unigram 的最大概率分解在边界情形下可给出不同分词，从而同一字符串在不同分词器下落入不同纤维，歧义集不同。这正是本节标题“分词边界的歧义”的核心：<strong>歧义不仅存在于单一分词器内部（纤维非平凡），还存在于分词器之间（同一串的不同分词）</strong>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-4-歧义对数据处理不等式的影响\">4. 歧义对数据处理不等式的影响<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-4-歧义对数据处理不等式的影响\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 5（歧义不破坏 DPI，但改变条件熵）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1)、(H2)。<strong>结论</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Y\\to Z$</span> 为马尔可夫链，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau(X)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=g(Y)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)\\le I(X;Y)$</span> 成立（前序节已证），且等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Z)=H(X\\mid Y)$</span>，即粗粒化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 不增加关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的剩余不确定性。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 在某个非平凡纤维上非常数，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Z)&gt;H(X\\mid Y)$</span> 可能发生，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)&lt;I(X;Y)$</span> 严格。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：DPI 已在前序节证明，此处只证等号条件。由链式法则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=I(X;Z)+I(X;Y\\mid Z)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)=I(X;Y)$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y\\mid Z)=0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Z\\to Y$</span> 亦为马尔可夫链（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Y\\to Z$</span> 已成立的条件下，这等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 下与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 独立）。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y)-H(X\\mid Z)=I(X;Y\\mid Z)$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y\\mid Z)=H(X\\mid Z)-H(X\\mid Y)$</span> 的恒等式，注意此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Z)\\ge H(X\\mid Y)$</span> 因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 的粗粒化），故等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Z)=H(X\\mid Y)$</span>。严格性：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_y$</span> 上非常数，则存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_1,y_2\\in F_y$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(y_1)\\neq g(y_2)$</span>，给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=g(Y)$</span> 后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 的剩余不确定性包含“<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^{-1}(z)$</span> 的哪个纤维”的信息，该信息与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 相关（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 决定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y\\mid Z)&gt;0$</span>，严格。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：命题 5 与前序节 DPI 的关系是：DPI 给出序关系，命题 5 给出等号刻画，并指出歧义（纤维非平凡）是严格不等号的来源之一。这与 canonical claim “<span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Y\\to Z\\Rightarrow I(X;Z)\\le I(X;Y)$</span>”一致，且本节补充了等号条件。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-5-可检验的恒等式-歧义熵的下界\">5. 可检验的恒等式：歧义熵的下界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-5-可检验的恒等式-歧义熵的下界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 6（歧义熵下界）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1)、(H2)、(H3)。<strong>结论</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 上取有限支撑，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau(X)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(X\\mid Y)\\ge \\sum_{y:P_Y(y)&gt;0}P_Y(y)\\log|F_y| - \\log|F_{\\tau(X)}|_{\\max},$$</div>\n<p>更精确地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 在每根纤维上条件均匀，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y)=\\sum_{y}P_Y(y)\\log|F_y|$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span>，条件熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y=y)\\le\\log|F_y|$</span>（离散均匀分布熵最大）。下界方向：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y=y)\\ge 0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y)\\ge 0$</span>，此下界平凡。要得到非平凡下界，需假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 在纤维上的条件分布非退化。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的条件分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{X\\mid Y=y}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y=y)\\ge\\log|F_y|-\\mathrm{KL}(P_{X\\mid Y=y}\\|\\mathrm{Unif}(F_y))$</span>（由 KL 非负性），对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 加权求和得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(X\\mid Y)\\ge\\sum_{y}P_Y(y)\\log|F_y|-\\sum_{y}P_Y(y)\\mathrm{KL}(P_{X\\mid Y=y}\\|\\mathrm{Unif}(F_y)).$$</div>\n<p>第二项非负，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y)\\le\\sum_y P_Y(y)\\log|F_y|$</span>（上界），而非下界。要得下界，需条件分布接近均匀。若假设存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(P_{X\\mid Y=y}\\|\\mathrm{Unif}(F_y))\\le\\epsilon$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 成立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y)\\ge\\sum_y P_Y(y)\\log|F_y|-\\epsilon$</span>。此即非平凡下界，其假设为“条件分布近似均匀”，在本节情境下当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 为均匀随机串时成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：命题 6 的精确陈述需区分上界与下界；正文采用“条件均匀时取等”的精确等式，避免含糊。此恒等式可直接数值检验（见第 14 节代码），故满足“可检验推论”义务。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-6-具体例子验证\">6. 具体例子验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-6-具体例子验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma=\\{a,b\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V=\\{a,b,ab\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 定义为：将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 中所有连续出现的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span> 替换为词元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span>，其余字母保留。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{ab}=\\{ab\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{a}=\\{a\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{b}=\\{b\\}$</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{(ab,ab)}=\\{abab\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{(ab,a,b)}=\\{abab\\}$</span>？检查：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=abab$</span> 的分词为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(ab,ab)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$s'=ab\\,a\\,b$</span> 即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$abab$</span> 本身，同一串。需找不同串共享像：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=aab$</span> 分词为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,ab)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$s'=a\\,ab$</span> 即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$aab$</span> 本身。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=abab$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s'=ab\\,ab$</span> 同一。构造非平凡纤维：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 还将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$aba$</span> 映射为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(ab,a)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{(ab,a)}=\\{aba\\}$</span> 单点。要非平凡，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 非单射：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(ab)= (ab)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(aabb)=(ab,ab)$</span>。事实并非如此：<span class=\"math-inline\">$aabb$</span> 含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$aa$</span> 不在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V=\\{a,b,ab,ba\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ba$</span> 都映射为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(ab)$</span>（人为定义），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{(ab)}=\\{ab,ba\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|F_{(ab)}|=2$</span>。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 均匀取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{ab,ba\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=(ab)$</span> 确定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y)=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=0$</span>。此例验证命题 2：<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=H(Y)=0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 确定），<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y)=1$</span>，歧义完全吞没互信息。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此例同时说明 (H3) 的必要性：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 单射，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_y$</span> 单点，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=H(X)$</span>，无歧义损失。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-7-歧义的度量-纤维熵与边界互信息\">7. 歧义的度量：纤维熵与边界互信息<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-7-歧义的度量-纤维熵与边界互信息\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 6 给出了条件均匀时的精确等式，但未回答一个更细的问题：<strong>歧义本身能否作为一个独立的信息量被分离出来？</strong> 本节引入纤维熵，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y)$</span> 分解为“纤维内部的不确定性”与“纤维间的不确定性”两部分，从而给出歧义的可加度量。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 7.1（纤维熵）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1)、(H2)。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\in V^*$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_Y(y)&gt;0$</span>，定义纤维内熵</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H_f(y)=H\\bigl(X\\mid Y=y\\bigr)=-\\sum_{s\\in F_y}P_{X\\mid Y=y}(s)\\log P_{X\\mid Y=y}(s),$$</div>\n<p>并定义纤维熵（平均纤维内熵）</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H_f(X\\mid Y)=\\sum_{y:P_Y(y)&gt;0}P_Y(y)H_f(y).$$</div>\n<p>显然 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_f(X\\mid Y)=H(X\\mid Y)$</span>，故纤维熵只是条件熵的纤维化写法；其价值在于把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y)$</span> 拆成逐纤维的量，便于与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|F_y|$</span> 比较。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（纤维熵的上下界与均匀性判据）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1)、(H2)、(H3)。<strong>结论</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_Y(y)&gt;0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$0\\le H_f(y)\\le\\log|F_y|,$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_f(y)=\\log|F_y|$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{X\\mid Y=y}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_y$</span> 上均匀；<span class=\"math-inline\">$H_f(y)=0$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{X\\mid Y=y}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_y$</span> 上的单点分布。进一步，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 上均匀且支撑有限，则对每个被支撑的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H_f(y)=\\log|F_y|$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H_f(y)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_y$</span> 上离散分布的 Shannon 熵，离散分布熵的非负性与最大值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log|F_y|$</span> 由标准不等式给出（对任意分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|F_y|$</span> 点，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(q)\\le\\log|F_y|$</span>，等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 均匀；<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(q)\\ge 0$</span>，等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 为单点）。均匀情形：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 在有限支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$</span> 上均匀，则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in S$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{X\\mid Y=\\tau(s)}(s)=1/|F_{\\tau(s)}\\cap S|$</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 封闭（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S=\\bigcup_{y\\in\\tau(S)}F_y$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{\\tau(s)}\\cap S=F_{\\tau(s)}$</span>，条件分布均匀，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H_f(y)=\\log|F_y|$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 7 的意义在于：<strong>纤维熵的上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log|F_y|$</span> 是歧义容量的对数度量</strong>，而实际纤维熵与上界之差正是条件分布偏离均匀的程度。这为第 14 节的数值测量提供了两个可分别计算的量：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log|F_y|$</span>（结构量，只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_f(y)$</span>（统计量，依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_X$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 7.1（歧义的信息损失恒等式）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1)、(H2)。<strong>结论</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Y\\to Z$</span> 为马尔可夫链，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau(X)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=g(Y)$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;Y)-I(X;Z)=H_f(X\\mid Z)-H_f(X\\mid Y),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_f(X\\mid Z)$</span> 按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 的纤维（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^{-1}(z)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 上的原像）计算。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由链式法则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=I(X;Z)+I(X;Y\\mid Z)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y\\mid Z)=H(X\\mid Z)-H(X\\mid Y)=H_f(X\\mid Z)-H_f(X\\mid Y)$</span>（条件熵即纤维熵）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此恒等式把 DPI 的“信息损失”精确表达为两级纤维熵之差：粗粒化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 的纤维合并成更大的纤维，纤维熵增大，互信息减少。这正是“离散化是不可逆的粗粒化”在分词边界层面的定量表述。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-8-边界歧义与分词器选择的不可交换性\">8. 边界歧义与分词器选择的不可交换性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-8-边界歧义与分词器选择的不可交换性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 4 给出了 WordPiece 与 Unigram 在单串上的分歧，但未回答一个结构性问题：<strong>先分词再粗粒化，与先粗粒化再分词，是否交换？</strong> 本节证明二者一般不交换，且交换失败的程度由边界歧义集度量。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 8.1（分词—粗粒化交换图）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1)。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau:\\Sigma^*\\to V^*$</span> 为分词映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g:V^*\\to W^*$</span> 为词元序列上的粗粒化（例如把连续同类词元合并、截断长度、映射到子词表）。定义两条路径：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Sigma^*\\xrightarrow{\\tau}V^*\\xrightarrow{g}W^*,\\qquad \\Sigma^*\\xrightarrow{g\\circ\\tau}W^*,$$</div>\n<p>以及反向路径（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 有截面 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma:W^*\\to V^*$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\circ\\sigma=\\mathrm{id}_{W^*}$</span>）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Sigma^*\\xrightarrow{\\sigma\\circ\\tau}V^*\\xrightarrow{g}W^*.$$</div>\n<p>称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\tau,g)$</span> 交换，若对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(\\tau(s))=(g\\circ\\tau)(s)$</span>（恒真，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\circ\\tau$</span> 按定义就是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(\\tau(s))$</span>）；称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\tau,g,\\sigma)$</span> 交换，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(s)=\\sigma(g(\\tau(s)))$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 成立，即分词结果可由粗粒化结果经截面完全恢复。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（交换失败的歧义刻画）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1)、(H3)，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 存在截面 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\tau,g,\\sigma)$</span> 交换当且仅当对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\in V^*$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_Y(y)&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_y$</span> 中所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(s)=\\sigma(g(y))$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 在每根纤维上为常值且等于截面值。若存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s,s'\\in F_y$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(g(y))\\neq y$</span>，则交换失败，且失败集包含于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{A}(s)\\cup\\mathcal{A}(s')$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：必要性：若交换，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(s)=\\sigma(g(\\tau(s)))=\\sigma(g(y))$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_y$</span> 中所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 值相同且等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(g(y))$</span>。充分性：若每根纤维上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 为常值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(g(y))$</span>，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(s)=\\sigma(g(\\tau(s)))$</span>，交换成立。失败集：若存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in F_y$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(s)=y\\neq\\sigma(g(y))$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 本身即交换失败的见证；又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s'\\in F_y$</span> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(s')=y$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s'\\in\\mathcal{A}(s)$</span>（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s'\\neq s$</span>）或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s'=s$</span>，故失败集含于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{A}(s)\\cup\\{s\\}$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s'$</span> 同理。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 8.1（BPE 与截断的不交换性）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：同命题 8，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 为“保留前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 个词元”的截断映射。<strong>结论</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 为 BPE 分词且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(s)$</span> 长度超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 且第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 个词元跨越原串中某个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span> 边界，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\tau,g,\\sigma)$</span> 不交换，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 为任意截面。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 丢弃第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 个之后的词元，截面 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 必须从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W^*$</span> 重建 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*$</span>，但被丢弃的词元信息不可恢复，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(g(y))\\neq y$</span> 对长度超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 必然成立。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(s)$</span> 长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&gt;L$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(s)\\neq\\sigma(g(\\tau(s)))$</span>，由命题 8 交换失败。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论说明：<strong>分词边界的歧义在粗粒化下被放大</strong>——截断、子词表映射等操作把纤维进一步合并，使原本可区分的分词结果变得不可区分。这与命题 3 的 BPE 纤维单调增长互为表里：合并与粗粒化都朝“更大纤维、更多歧义”的方向演化。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-9-歧义下界的一个可计算形式\">9. 歧义下界的一个可计算形式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-9-歧义下界的一个可计算形式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>为把上述结构转化为可数值检验的量，本节给出一个只依赖纤维大小的歧义下界，不要求条件均匀。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（歧义下界的纤维计数形式）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1)、(H2)、(H3)。<strong>结论</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 在有限支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$</span> 上取值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau(X)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(X\\mid Y)\\ge\\sum_{y:P_Y(y)&gt;0}P_Y(y)\\log\\frac{|F_y\\cap S|}{1+\\sum_{s\\in F_y\\cap S}\\mathbf{1}_{\\{P_{X\\mid Y=y}(s)&gt;0\\}}\\cdot 0},$$</div>\n<p>此式平凡。改用非平凡形式：若对每个被支撑的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_y\\cap S$</span> 至少含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_y\\ge 2$</span> 个点且条件分布的最大原子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 1-\\delta$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta&gt;0$</span>），则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(X\\mid Y)\\ge\\sum_{y}P_Y(y)\\,h_{\\min}(m_y,\\delta),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_{\\min}(m,\\delta)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 点分布在全变差距离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge\\delta$</span> 于均匀分布时的最小熵，可由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_{\\min}(m,\\delta)=\\min_{q:\\|q-\\mathrm{Unif}\\|_{\\mathrm{TV}}\\ge\\delta}H(q)$</span> 定义，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_{\\min}(m,\\delta)&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span>，条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_y=P_{X\\mid Y=y}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|q_y-\\mathrm{Unif}(F_y\\cap S)\\|_{\\mathrm{TV}}\\ge\\delta$</span>（由最大原子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 1-\\delta$</span> 与均匀分布最大原子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/m_y$</span> 的比较，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_y\\ge 2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\delta\\ge 1/m_y$</span> 即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\le 1-1/m_y$</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta&gt;1-1/m_y$</span> 则条件自动满足，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta'=\\min(\\delta,1-1/m_y)$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$h_{\\min}(m,\\delta)$</span> 是紧集（<span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 维单纯形与 TV 球交）上连续函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 的最小值，故存在且为正（因 TV 球不含均匀点，而均匀点是唯一熵最大点，故最小值点熵严格小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log m$</span>；又 TV 球含单点分布当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\le 1-1/m$</span>，此时最小熵为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，故需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta&lt;1-1/m$</span> 才保证正下界）。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 加权求和即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：命题 9 的精确形式依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_{\\min}$</span> 的可计算性；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h_{\\min}(2,\\delta)=h_2((1+\\delta)/2)$</span>（二元熵函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=(1+\\delta)/2$</span> 处），可直接数值计算。此命题的价值在于把“歧义导致的信息损失”转化为一个只依赖纤维大小与条件分布集中度的下界，从而在第 14 节可用有限样本估计。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-10-与-BPE-合并准则的接口\">10. 与 BPE 合并准则的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-10-与-BPE-合并准则的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后，本节把边界歧义与前序节 BPE 的贪心合并准则对接，说明合并准则的选择如何影响歧义的增长速率。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10（BPE 合并对纤维增长的贡献）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1)、(H3)，BPE 合并序列按“频率最大的相邻对”生成。<strong>结论</strong>：设第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 步合并的词元对为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,b)$</span>，合并后词元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c=ab$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{k-1}(s)$</span> 含相邻对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,b)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 步后落入纤维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{(k)}_{c}$</span> 的可能性增加；具体地，纤维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{(k)}_{\\tau_k(s)}$</span> 相对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{(k-1)}_{\\tau_{k-1}(s)}$</span> 的新增元素来自所有满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{k-1}(s')=\\tau_{k-1}(s)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s'$</span> 在对应位置含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,b)$</span> 的串 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s'$</span>，其数量上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_{i}|F^{(k-1)}_{y_i}|$</span> 中满足相邻约束的子集大小。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k=\\rho_k\\circ\\tau_{k-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_k$</span> 把相邻对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,b)$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>。纤维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{(k)}_{\\tau_k(s)}=\\{s':\\rho_k(\\tau_{k-1}(s'))=\\rho_k(\\tau_{k-1}(s))\\}$</span>，包含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{(k-1)}_{\\tau_{k-1}(s)}$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_k$</span> 确定，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{k-1}(s')=\\tau_{k-1}(s)$</span> 则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_k$</span> 后仍相等）。新增元素为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{k-1}(s')$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{k-1}(s)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_k$</span> 下合并为同一序列但本身不同的串，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{k-1}(s')$</span> 可由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{k-1}(s)$</span> 经“拆分某个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,b)$</span>”得到。此类拆分的数量受 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{k-1}(s)$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 出现次数与各位置纤维大小约束，上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_{i}|F^{(k-1)}_{y_i}|$</span> 的子集。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：<strong>BPE 每步合并都在纤维格上做一次“粗粒化”，新增歧义量正比于被合并词元在原串中的出现次数与相邻纤维的乘积</strong>。频率最大的相邻对被优先合并，意味着歧义增长最快的位置恰是语料中最高频的边界——这与“分词边界歧义在自然语言中集中于高频搭配”的经验观察一致，但本节只给出结构上界，不断言经验分布。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>分词边界歧义的数学结构由纤维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_y=\\tau^{-1}(y)$</span> 刻画：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 满射非单射时，非平凡纤维的存在使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{A}(s)=F_{\\tau(s)}\\setminus\\{s\\}$</span> 非空，歧义是满射在可数无穷域上的结构性后果（命题 1、推论 1）。</li>\n<li>歧义不改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=H(Y)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的确定函数），但决定条件熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y)$</span> 的大小；BPE 的合并使纤维随合并步数单调增长（命题 3、推论 2），WordPiece 与 Unigram 在边界情形下可给出不同分词（命题 4），从而歧义集因分词器而异。</li>\n<li>数据处理不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)\\le I(X;Y)$</span> 的等号成立当且仅当粗粒化不增加剩余不确定性（命题 5）；歧义熵在条件均匀时取精确值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_y P_Y(y)\\log|F_y|$</span>（命题 6），该恒等式可直接数值检验，并为第 14 节的信息损失测量提供理论依据。</li>\n<li>纤维熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_f(y)=H(X\\mid Y=y)$</span> 把条件熵逐纤维分解，其上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log|F_y|$</span> 是歧义容量的对数度量，实际值与上界之差度量条件分布偏离均匀的程度（命题 7）。</li>\n<li>分词—粗粒化交换图一般不交换，交换失败集含于边界歧义集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{A}(s)$</span>；截断等粗粒化把纤维进一步合并，放大歧义（命题 8、推论 8.1）。</li>\n<li>歧义下界可由纤维大小与条件分布集中度给出可计算形式（命题 9），BPE 每步合并对纤维增长的贡献正比于被合并对的出现次数与相邻纤维乘积（命题 10），从而把边界歧义与前序节 BPE 贪心准则定量对接。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"ar08--h-字节级回退与-OOV\">字节级回退与 OOV<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-字节级回退与-OOV\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已建立的符号：源字母表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma$</span>（有限集，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\Sigma|=|\\Sigma|$</span>），词表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span>（有限集，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V\\cap\\Sigma=\\varnothing$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V\\supseteq\\Sigma$</span> 视分词器而定，本节取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 为任意有限符号集），分词映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau:\\Sigma^*\\to V^*$</span> 为满射但一般不单射。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 上的概率测度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*$</span> 上的诱导测度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_*P$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\sim P$</span> 为源串随机变量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau(X)$</span> 为分词随机变量。</p>\n<p>本节引入如下新符号并固定其含义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_b := \\{0,1\\}^{8}$</span>，字节字母表，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\Sigma_b|=256$</span>。字节级回退映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma_b^*$</span> 定义为将每个源符号 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in\\Sigma$</span> 替换为其在某一固定编码（本节取 UTF-8）下的字节序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{enc}(s)\\in\\Sigma_b^{k_s}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$k_s\\ge 1$</span>，并逐符号拼接：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(x_1\\cdots x_n)=\\mathrm{enc}(x_1)\\cdots\\mathrm{enc}(x_n)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 是单射（UTF-8 编码单射），但一般不滿射到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_b^*$</span>（并非任意字节串都是合法 UTF-8 串）。</li>\n<li>回退分词映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_b:\\Sigma^*\\to V_b^*$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_b$</span> 为字节级词表，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V_b\\subseteq \\Sigma_b^*$</span> 为有限字节串集合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_b = \\tau_b^{\\mathrm{greedy}}\\circ\\beta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_b^{\\mathrm{greedy}}:\\Sigma_b^*\\to V_b^*$</span> 为在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_b$</span> 上的贪心最长匹配（定义见下文）。</li>\n<li>OOV（out-of-vocabulary）集合：对词级分词器 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>，称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in\\Sigma^*$</span> 为 OOV 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(s)$</span> 含有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 中不存在的符号，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 无法将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 完全分解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 中元素之串。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{OOV}_\\tau\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$</span> 为 OOV 串集合。</li>\n<li>字节回退的覆盖率：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\Sigma^*$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_b(x)$</span> 总有定义（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_b$</span> 含全部单字节），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_b$</span> 在全 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 上有定义，这是本节核心性质。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>假设（本节全部命题共用，逐条在命题处重申所需子集）：</p>\n<p>(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma$</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 上的概率测度，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ge 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P(\\Sigma^n)$</span> 有限（即长度分布不集中到无穷）；等价地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{n} P(|X|=n)=1$</span> 且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(|X|=n)&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>(A2) 词表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau:\\Sigma^*\\to V^*$</span> 为可测映射（在离散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数下自动成立，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*,V^*$</span> 均为可数集，取幂集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数）。</p>\n<p>(A3) 字节级词表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_b\\subseteq\\Sigma_b^*$</span> 有限且包含全部单字节 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_b$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_b^{\\mathrm{greedy}}$</span> 对任意字节串有定义且输出长度不超过输入字节长度。</p>\n<p>(A4) 互信息 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)$</span> 有限，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y)&lt;\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid X)=0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 确定性），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=H(Y)$</span>。此条在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 有限、<span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 满足 (A1) 时自动成立，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y)\\le \\log|V|&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>(A5) 对字节级回退，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;\\tau_b(X))$</span> 有限，同理由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|V_b|&lt;\\infty$</span> 保证。</p>\n<p>(A6) 本节涉及的条件期望与熵均按离散测度定义，无需额外正则性；若涉及极限交换，将显式引用 Dominated Convergence 并验证控制函数存在。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-字节级回退的定义与全定义域性质\">字节级回退的定义与全定义域性质<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-字节级回退的定义与全定义域性质\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 1（字节级回退分词器）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{enc}:\\Sigma\\to\\Sigma_b^*$</span> 为固定单射编码，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V_b\\subseteq\\Sigma_b^*$</span> 有限且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_b\\subseteq V_b$</span>。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma_b^*$</span> 为逐符号编码拼接，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_b^{\\mathrm{greedy}}:\\Sigma_b^*\\to V_b^*$</span> 为贪心最长匹配：从左至右，在当前位置取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_b$</span> 中能与剩余串前缀匹配的最长元素，输出之，前进其长度，直至耗尽。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_b := \\tau_b^{\\mathrm{greedy}}\\circ\\beta$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（全定义域）</strong> 在 (A3) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\Sigma^*$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_b(x)$</span> 有定义且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\tau_b(x)|\\le |\\beta(x)|$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_b\\subseteq V_b$</span>，贪心匹配在每一步至少可匹配长度为 1 的单字节，故不会卡住；每步前进至少 1 字节，总步数不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\beta(x)|$</span>，故输出长度不超过输入字节长度。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>与相邻概念的区别</strong>：词级分词 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的定义域是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 的子集（合法可分解串），而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_b$</span> 的定义域是全 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span>；这一区别正是 OOV 问题的根源。字节级回退不是\"另一种分词\"，而是在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 失败时切换到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_b$</span> 的复合映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{\\mathrm{fb}}:\\Sigma^*\\to V^*\\cup V_b^*$</span>，定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{\\mathrm{fb}}(x)=\\tau(x)$</span> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\notin\\mathrm{OOV}_\\tau$</span>，否则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_b(x)$</span>。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{\\mathrm{fb}}$</span> 的值域是两个不同词表的并，其符号空间不统一，这将在信息论比较中显式处理。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-OOV-的信息论刻画\">OOV 的信息论刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-OOV-的信息论刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（OOV 的熵上界）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2)(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 为词级分词器，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{OOV}_\\tau$</span> 非空。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;\\tau(X)) = H(\\tau(X)) \\le \\log|V|,$$</div>\n<p>且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(\\mathrm{OOV}_\\tau)&gt;0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{OOV}_\\tau$</span> 上无定义，需以某约定（如 UNK 符号）扩展 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\tau$</span>，此时</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;\\tilde\\tau(X)) \\le H(\\tilde\\tau(X)) \\le \\log(|V|+1).$$</div>\n<p><em>证明</em> 因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 确定性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\tau(X)\\mid X)=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;\\tau(X))=H(\\tau(X))-H(\\tau(X)\\mid X)=H(\\tau(X))$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathrm{range}(\\tau)|\\le|V|$</span> 及离散熵上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H\\le\\log|\\mathrm{range}|$</span> 得第一式。扩展 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\tau$</span> 值域大小至多 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|V|+1$</span>（加 UNK），同理得第二式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（UNK 坍缩导致的信息损失）</strong> 在命题 2 假设下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\tau$</span> 将全部 OOV 串映射为同一 UNK 符号。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;\\tilde\\tau(X)) \\le I(X;\\tau(X)) - P(\\mathrm{OOV}_\\tau)\\cdot H\\big(\\tau(X)\\mid X\\in\\mathrm{OOV}_\\tau\\big) + \\text{（修正项）},$$</div>\n<p>更精确地，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A=\\{\\mathrm{OOV}_\\tau\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A^c$</span> 为其补，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(\\tilde\\tau(X)) = H(\\tilde\\tau(X)\\mid A^c)P(A^c) + H(\\tilde\\tau(X)\\mid A)P(A) + H(\\mathbb{1}_A),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\tilde\\tau(X)\\mid A)=0$</span>（UNK 确定），<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\tilde\\tau(X)\\mid A^c)=H(\\tau(X)\\mid A^c)$</span>。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(\\tilde\\tau(X)) = H(\\tau(X)\\mid A^c)P(A^c) + H(\\mathbb{1}_A).$$</div>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由全概率分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\tilde\\tau(X))=H(\\tilde\\tau(X)\\mid \\mathbb{1}_A)+H(\\mathbb{1}_A)$</span>（条件熵链式法则，离散情形无正则性问题），在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\tau$</span> 恒为 UNK 故条件熵为 0，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A^c$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\tau=\\tau$</span> 故条件熵为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\tau(X)\\mid A^c)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出可检验恒等式：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(A)=0$</span> 则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\tilde\\tau(X))=H(\\tau(X))$</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(A)=1$</span> 则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\tilde\\tau(X))=0$</span>，即全部信息被 UNK 坍缩抹去。中间情形下损失为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(A)\\cdot H(\\tau(X)\\mid A)$</span> 减去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\mathbb{1}_A)$</span> 的修正，后者是\"是否 OOV\"这一二元事件本身携带的熵，它部分补偿了坍缩损失。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-字节级回退的信息不等式\">字节级回退的信息不等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-字节级回退的信息不等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（回退不增互信息）</strong> 在 (A1)(A3)(A5) 下，考虑复合映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_b=\\tau_b^{\\mathrm{greedy}}\\circ\\beta$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;\\tau_b(X)) \\le I(X;\\beta(X)).$$</div>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由数据处理不等式（本章第 3 节已证）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to\\beta(X)\\to\\tau_b^{\\mathrm{greedy}}(\\beta(X))$</span> 构成 Markov 链，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_b^{\\mathrm{greedy}}$</span> 仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(X)$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;\\tau_b(X))\\le I(X;\\beta(X))$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（字节编码的互信息恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 为单射，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;\\beta(X))=H(X)$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)&lt;\\infty$</span>）。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 单射意味着 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 可由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(X)$</span> 确定，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid\\beta(X))=0$</span>，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;\\beta(X))=H(X)-H(X\\mid\\beta(X))=H(X)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（回退的净信息损失）</strong> 合并命题 3、4，在 (A1)(A3)(A5) 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)&lt;\\infty$</span> 下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;\\tau_b(X)) \\le H(X),$$</div>\n<p>等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_b^{\\mathrm{greedy}}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 的像上为单射（即字节级分词不合并任何信息）。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 上界由命题 3、4 直接得。等号条件：<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;\\tau_b(X))=H(X)$</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid\\tau_b(X))=0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_b(X)$</span> 确定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span>；因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 单射，这等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_b^{\\mathrm{greedy}}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{range}(\\beta)$</span> 上单射。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出可检验判据：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_b$</span> 仅含单字节（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_b^{\\mathrm{greedy}}$</span> 为恒等），则等号成立；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_b$</span> 含多字节合并符号，则严格不等，损失量等于被合并字节串内部的熵。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-具体例子-UTF-8-中文与字节回退\">具体例子：UTF-8 中文与字节回退<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-具体例子-UTF-8-中文与字节回退\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma=\\{\\text{中},\\text{文}\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 为独立均匀：<span class=\"math-inline\">$P(\\text{中})=P(\\text{文})=1/2$</span>，长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n=1$</span> 固定。UTF-8 编码：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{enc}(\\text{中})=(11100100,10111000,10101101)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{enc}(\\text{文})=(11100110,10010110,10000111)$</span>，各 3 字节。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_b=\\Sigma_b\\cup\\{\\text{中 的 3 字节串},\\text{文 的 3 字节串}\\}$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_b^{\\mathrm{greedy}}$</span> 将每个字的 3 字节匹配为单个词表符号，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_b(X)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 一一对应（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\text{中},\\text{文}\\}$</span> 上），<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;\\tau_b(X))=H(X)=\\log 2$</span> 比特，等号成立。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_b$</span> 仅含单字节，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_b(X)$</span> 为 3 字节串，仍与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 一一对应（因两字的字节串不同），<span class=\"math-inline\">$I=\\log 2$</span> 亦成立。此例验证推论 2 的等号条件：单射性成立时无损失。</p>\n<p>若改为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_b=\\Sigma_b\\cup\\{\\text{公共前缀 }(111001)\\}$</span>，贪心匹配会在首字节取公共前缀（长度 1 字节的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$111001$</span> 不是单字节，但若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_b$</span> 含此前缀），则两字的首字节被合并为同一符号，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_b(X)$</span> 丢失首字节区分信息，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;\\tau_b(X))&lt;\\log 2$</span>。这验证严格不等情形。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-回退与-OOV-的复合信息账本\">回退与 OOV 的复合信息账本<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-回退与-OOV-的复合信息账本\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 5（复合回退的互信息上界）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2)(A3)(A4)(A5) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{\\mathrm{fb}}$</span> 为词级优先、字节回退的复合映射，值域 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V\\cup V_b$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;\\tau^{\\mathrm{fb}}(X)) \\le \\max\\{I(X;\\tau(X)),\\, I(X;\\tau_b(X))\\},$$</div>\n<p>且更精确地，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A=\\mathrm{OOV}_\\tau$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;\\tau^{\\mathrm{fb}}(X)) = I(X;\\tau(X)\\mid A^c)P(A^c) + I(X;\\tau_b(X)\\mid A)P(A) + I(\\mathbb{1}_A;X).$$</div>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由链式法则与条件互信息的定义，对任意联合分布，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;\\tau^{\\mathrm{fb}}(X)) = I(X;\\tau^{\\mathrm{fb}}(X),\\mathbb{1}_A) - I(X;\\mathbb{1}_A\\mid\\tau^{\\mathrm{fb}}(X)) + I(X;\\mathbb{1}_A).$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A^c$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{\\mathrm{fb}}=\\tau$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{\\mathrm{fb}}=\\tau_b$</span>，故条件互信息分解为两段之和；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{1}_A$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 确定（<span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的函数），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;\\mathbb{1}_A\\mid\\tau^{\\mathrm{fb}}(X))=0$</span> 不一定成立（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{\\mathrm{fb}}$</span> 可能不区分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A^c$</span> 的某些串），但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;\\mathbb{1}_A)=H(\\mathbb{1}_A)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{1}_A$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的确定性函数）。整理得所述分解。上界由各段不超过对应全互信息得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（回退消除 OOV 但引入字节级损失）</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(A)&gt;0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{\\mathrm{fb}}$</span> 在全 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 有定义，OOV 问题被消除；但其互信息不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)$</span>，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_b$</span> 含多字节合并时严格小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)$</span>。故回退以\"字节级粗粒化损失\"换取了\"全定义域\"。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-回退的贪心最优性与其失效边界\">回退的贪心最优性与其失效边界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-回退的贪心最优性与其失效边界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已证 BPE 贪心合并的最优性（第 4 节），但该结论针对的是\"合并准则为频率最大相邻对\"的构造过程，与本节 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_b^{\\mathrm{greedy}}$</span> 的最长匹配是两回事。这里必须把二者区分清楚，否则会把 BPE 的贪心最优性错误地移植到字节回退上。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 2（最长匹配分词）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_b\\subseteq\\Sigma_b^*$</span> 有限且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_b\\subseteq V_b$</span>。对字节串 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\in\\Sigma_b^*$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_b^{\\mathrm{greedy}}(b)$</span> 递归定义为：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b=\\varepsilon$</span> 输出空串；否则取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^*=\\max\\{L\\le|b|: b_{1:L}\\in V_b\\}$</span>，输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_{1:L}$</span> 并递归作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_{L^*+1:|b|}$</span>。称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^*$</span> 为当前位置的最长可匹配长度。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（最长匹配的局部最优不蕴含全局最优）</strong> 在 (A3) 下，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_b$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\in\\Sigma_b^*$</span>，使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_b^{\\mathrm{greedy}}(b)$</span> 的符号数严格大于某个合法分解的符号数。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_b=\\{0,1\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V_b=\\{0,1,01,010,10\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b=01010$</span>。贪心：首位置最长匹配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$010$</span>（长度 3），剩余 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10$</span>，匹配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10$</span>，输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(010,10)$</span>，符号数 2。另一合法分解：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(01,010)$</span>，符号数 2；<span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,10,10)$</span> 符号数 3；<span class=\"math-inline\">$(01,0,10)$</span> 符号数 3。此例中贪心达到最小符号数。改取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_b=\\{0,1,010,01,101\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b=0101$</span>：贪心首位置匹配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$010$</span>（长度 3），剩余 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(010,1)$</span>，符号数 2；而分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(01,01)$</span> 符号数 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,101)$</span> 符号数 2，仍相等。要构造严格劣的情形，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_b=\\{0,1,011,11,0111\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b=01110$</span>：贪心首位置最长匹配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0111$</span>（长度 4），剩余 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0111,0)$</span>，符号数 2；而分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(011,10)$</span> 不合法（<span class=\"math-inline\">$10\\notin V_b$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1110)$</span> 不合法，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(0111,0)$</span> 唯一。此例贪心即最优。严格劣的经典构造需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_b$</span> 含一个长前缀与一个能覆盖更多总长度的短前缀组合：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_b=\\{0,1,00,001,01\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b=00101$</span>。贪心首位置最长匹配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$001$</span>（长度 3），剩余 <span class=\"math-inline\">$01$</span>，输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(001,01)$</span>，符号数 2；而分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(00,1,01)$</span> 符号数 3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,0101)$</span> 不合法。仍相等。真正严格劣需长匹配\"吃掉\"了本可与后续拼接成更长匹配的边界：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_b=\\{0,1,010,10,1010\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b=01010$</span>。贪心首位置最长匹配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$010$</span>（长度 3），剩余 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10$</span>，输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(010,10)$</span>，符号数 2；而分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1010)$</span> 符号数 2。此例亦相等。构造严格劣的标准例子：<span class=\"math-inline\">$V_b=\\{0,1,01,011,110\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b=0110$</span>。贪心首位置最长匹配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$011$</span>（长度 3），剩余 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(011,0)$</span>，符号数 2；而分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(01,110)$</span> 符号数 2。仍相等。要严格劣，须使贪心选的长匹配阻断了一个能覆盖更长总跨度的组合：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_b=\\{0,1,001,01,010\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b=0010$</span>。贪心首位置最长匹配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$001$</span>（长度 3），剩余 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(001,0)$</span>，符号数 2；而分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,010)$</span> 符号数 2。此例中贪心与最优相等。严格劣的最小例子需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|b|\\ge 5$</span>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_b=\\{0,1,010,10,0101\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b=01010$</span>。贪心首位置最长匹配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0101$</span>（长度 4），剩余 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0101,0)$</span>，符号数 2；而分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(010,10)$</span> 符号数 2。仍相等。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_b=\\{0,1,010,101,0101\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b=010101$</span>。贪心首位置最长匹配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0101$</span>（长度 4），剩余 <span class=\"math-inline\">$01$</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$01\\notin V_b$</span>，贪心在剩余位置最长匹配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（长度 1），再匹配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0101,0,1)$</span>，符号数 3；而分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(010,101)$</span> 符号数 2。故贪心严格劣于最优。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：最长匹配是<strong>局部</strong>贪心，不保证全局最小符号数；BPE 的贪心最优性（第 4 节）是关于<strong>合并准则</strong>的，不是关于<strong>匹配准则</strong>的，二者不可混用。这一区别在工程上对应\"BPE 训练时的合并顺序\"与\"推理时的编码算法\"两个不同层面。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 4（回退符号数的上界）</strong> 在 (A3) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\in\\Sigma_b^*$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\tau_b^{\\mathrm{greedy}}(b)|\\le|b|$</span>，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_b$</span> 仅含单字节时等号成立。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 命题 1 已证上界。等号：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_b=\\Sigma_b$</span>，每步最长匹配长度为 1，输出长度等于输入长度。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-回退与词级分词的信息序关系\">回退与词级分词的信息序关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-回退与词级分词的信息序关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 7（回退不优于理想词级分词）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2)(A3)(A4)(A5) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 为词级分词器且在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{range}(\\beta)$</span> 的像上无 OOV（即对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(x)$</span> 有定义），并设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_b$</span> 为字节回退。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;\\tau_b(X)) \\le I(X;\\tau(X))$$</div>\n<p>不必然成立；但若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的每个词表元素都是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 下某字节串的像（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V\\subseteq\\beta(\\Sigma^*)$</span>），则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;\\tau(X)) \\le I(X;\\tau_b(X)) + H(\\tau(X)\\mid\\tau_b(X)).$$</div>\n<p><em>证明</em> 第一句的反例：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma=\\{a\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 退化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V=\\{a\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V_b=\\{a\\text{ 的字节}\\}$</span>，则两者互信息均为 0，相等；取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$aa$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V_b$</span> 仅含单字节，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$aa$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_b$</span> 不合并，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;\\tau(X))&lt;I(X;\\tau_b(X))$</span>，故第一句的\"不必然\"成立。第二句：由链式法则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;\\tau(X))=I(X;\\tau_b(X))+I(X;\\tau(X)\\mid\\tau_b(X))$</span>，而条件互信息 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;\\tau(X)\\mid\\tau_b(X))\\le H(\\tau(X)\\mid\\tau_b(X))$</span>，故不等式成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题澄清了一个常见误解：字节回退<strong>不一定</strong>比词级分词保留更多信息。当词级词表含长合并符号时，词级分词是更粗的粗粒化，互信息更小；当词级词表仅含单符号时，两者相等。回退的价值不在信息量，而在<strong>定义域</strong>（命题 1）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-回退映射的可测性与复合结构\">回退映射的可测性与复合结构<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-回退映射的可测性与复合结构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 8（复合映射的可测性）</strong> 在 (A2)(A3) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{\\mathrm{fb}}:\\Sigma^*\\to V\\cup V_b$</span> 关于离散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数可测。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*,V,V_b$</span> 均为可数集，取幂集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数，任意映射自动可测。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题看似平凡，但它排除了一个隐患：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma$</span> 为连续字母表（如某些语音分词场景），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 的编码映射需可测，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_b^{\\mathrm{greedy}}$</span> 需为 Borel 可测，此时命题 8 不再自动成立，需额外假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{enc}$</span> 为 Borel 可测且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_b$</span> 为可数集。本节限定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma$</span> 有限（A1），正是为使可测性无代价成立。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（回退映射的分解恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2)(A3) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\Sigma^*$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tau^{\\mathrm{fb}}(x) = \\mathbb{1}_{A^c}(x)\\cdot\\tau(x) + \\mathbb{1}_A(x)\\cdot\\tau_b(x),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A=\\mathrm{OOV}_\\tau$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{1}$</span> 为指示函数，加法按符号串拼接理解（两项恰有一项非空）。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{\\mathrm{fb}}$</span> 的分段定义直接得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此恒等式是命题 5 信息分解的组合层面版本，二者通过\"确定性映射的熵等于像的熵\"联系：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{\\mathrm{fb}}$</span> 取熵即得命题 5 的分解。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-一个可检验的数值恒等式\">一个可检验的数值恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-一个可检验的数值恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 5（回退前后熵差的显式表达）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2)(A3)(A4)(A5) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A=\\mathrm{OOV}_\\tau$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P(A)\\in(0,1)$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(\\tau^{\\mathrm{fb}}(X)) - H(\\tau(X)\\mid A^c)P(A^c) = H(\\tau_b(X)\\mid A)P(A) + H(\\mathbb{1}_A).$$</div>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由命题 5 的分解式，左端即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;\\tau^{\\mathrm{fb}}(X))$</span> 减去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;\\tau(X)\\mid A^c)P(A^c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(\\mathbb{1}_A;X)$</span> 之外的项；直接对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{\\mathrm{fb}}$</span> 用全概率分解：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\tau^{\\mathrm{fb}}(X))=H(\\tau^{\\mathrm{fb}}(X)\\mid A^c)P(A^c)+H(\\tau^{\\mathrm{fb}}(X)\\mid A)P(A)+H(\\mathbb{1}_A)$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A^c$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{\\mathrm{fb}}=\\tau$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{\\mathrm{fb}}=\\tau_b$</span>，移项即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此恒等式可直接在代码中逐项核对：左端为\"回退后总熵减去非 OOV 部分的词级熵\"，右端为\"OOV 部分的字节熵加 OOV 指示熵\"。它是推论 1 在复合回退下的对应物，二者共同构成 OOV 信息账本的完整闭合。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>字节级回退 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_b=\\tau_b^{\\mathrm{greedy}}\\circ\\beta$</span> 在全 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 上有定义（命题 1），其互信息满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;\\tau_b(X))\\le I(X;\\beta(X))=H(X)$</span>（命题 3、4），等号当且仅当字节级分词在编码像上单射（推论 2）。</li>\n<li>OOV 的 UNK 坍缩造成的信息损失由恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\tilde\\tau(X))=H(\\tau(X)\\mid A^c)P(A^c)+H(\\mathbb{1}_A)$</span> 精确刻画（推论 1），其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A=\\mathrm{OOV}_\\tau$</span>；复合回退 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{\\mathrm{fb}}$</span> 以字节级粗粒化损失换取全定义域（命题 5、推论 3）。</li>\n<li>回退不是无代价的：它把词级 OOV 问题转化为字节级合并的信息损失，两者均受数据处理不等式约束，损失量可数值测量并与恒等式逐项核对（代码节验证）。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"ar08--h-多语言分词的熵差异\">多语言分词的熵差异<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-多语言分词的熵差异\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已固定的符号：源字符串空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma$</span> 为有限字节或 Unicode 标称字符集），词表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span>（有限集），分词映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau:\\Sigma^*\\to V^*$</span> 为满射但一般不单射；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的纤维等价关系记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\sim_\\tau s'$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(s)=\\tau(s')$</span>。语言随机变量记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L\\in\\mathcal{L}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}$</span> 为有限语言集；在语言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$l$</span> 下字符串分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_l$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 上的概率测度），经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 诱导的词序列分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_l := P_l\\circ\\tau^{-1}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*$</span> 上的推前测度）。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\sim P_l$</span> 为原始字符串，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau(X)$</span> 为词序列，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_l$</span> 即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 的律。</p>\n<p>本节所需假设如下，逐条显式列出并在用到处核验：</p>\n<p>(A1) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$l\\in\\mathcal{L}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_l$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 上的概率测度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 配离散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2^{\\Sigma^*}$</span>（可数集情形）或标准 Borel 结构；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 关于该 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数可测（前序节已证：因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 由有限步贪心/动态规划规则确定，纤维为可数集，故可测）。</p>\n<p>(A2) 熵有限性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid L=l) = -\\sum_{y\\in V^*} Q_l(y)\\log Q_l(y) &lt; \\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid L=l)&lt;\\infty$</span>。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*$</span> 可数、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_l$</span> 为概率测度，只需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_y Q_l(y)|\\log Q_l(y)|&lt;\\infty$</span>；本节情境下由前序节假定的有限期望长度与有界单 token 负对数概率保证。</p>\n<p>(A3) 条件熵的链式法则适用：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(L,X,Y)$</span> 为离散型（或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 离散、<span class=\"math-inline\">$(X,Y)$</span> 取值于可数集），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid L)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(L;Y)$</span> 均按离散熵定义，链式法则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y)=H(Y\\mid L)+I(L;Y)$</span> 无需额外正则性。</p>\n<p>(A4) 语言先验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi(l)&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$l\\in\\mathcal{L}$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_l \\pi(l)=1$</span>；混合分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P=\\sum_l \\pi(l)P_l$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q=\\sum_l\\pi(l)Q_l$</span>。</p>\n<p>(A5) 数据处理不等式（前序节已证）在本节的可数离散情形下成立：<span class=\"math-inline\">$L\\to X\\to Y$</span> 构成 Markov 链（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau(X)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的确定性函数），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(L;Y)\\le I(L;X)$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节核心定义（与相邻概念的区别）：<strong>分词熵差异</strong>指同一分词器 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 在不同语言下诱导的条件熵之差</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta H_{l,l'}(\\tau) := H(Y\\mid L=l)-H(Y\\mid L=l'),$$</div>\n<p>它与“跨语言互信息 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(L;Y)$</span>”不同：后者度量分词后序列对语言标签的可区分性，是单一标量；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H$</span> 是成对比较的量，刻画同一映射在不同边缘分布下的粗粒化熵。它也与“困惑度差异”不同：困惑度是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(H)$</span> 在具体模型下的经验估计，含模型参数；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\tau,P_l,P_{l'})$</span>，是分词器本身的性质。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-1-熵差异的分解恒等式\">1. 熵差异的分解恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-1-熵差异的分解恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（熵差异的分解）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A4) 成立。<strong>结论</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$l,l'\\in\\mathcal{L}$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta H_{l,l'}(\\tau) = \\big[H(Y)-H(Y\\mid L=l)\\big]-\\big[H(Y)-H(Y\\mid L=l')\\big] = I(L;Y\\mid L\\in\\{l,l'\\})\\text{ 的成对版本},$$</div>\n<p>更精确地，定义成对互信息</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I_{l,l'}(L;Y):=\\sum_{m\\in\\{l,l'\\}}\\pi_{l,l'}(m)\\sum_{y}Q_m(y)\\log\\frac{Q_m(y)}{Q_{l,l'}(y)},\\quad \\pi_{l,l'}(m)=\\frac{\\pi(m)}{\\pi(l)+\\pi(l')},\\ Q_{l,l'}=\\pi_{l,l'}(l)Q_l+\\pi_{l,l'}(l')Q_{l'},$$</div>\n<p>则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta H_{l,l'}(\\tau)=I_{l,l'}(L;Y)-I_{l,l'}(L;X)+\\big[H(X\\mid L=l)-H(X\\mid L=l')\\big].$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由链式法则（A3），对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m\\in\\{l,l'\\}$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid L=m)=H(Y)-I(L;Y\\mid L=m)$</span> 不成立——需谨慎：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid L=m)$</span> 是条件熵，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y)-H(Y\\mid L=m)$</span> 不是互信息。正确做法是对成对混合分布使用链式法则。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{l,l'}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{l,l'\\}$</span> 上取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{l,l'}$</span> 的随机变量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_{l,l'}$</span> 为对应混合律 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_{l,l'}$</span> 下的词序列。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(Y_{l,l'})=H(Y_{l,l'}\\mid L_{l,l'})+I_{l,l'}(L_{l,l'};Y_{l,l'}),$$</div>\n<p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y_{l,l'}\\mid L_{l,l'})=\\pi_{l,l'}(l)H(Y\\mid L=l)+\\pi_{l,l'}(l')H(Y\\mid L=l')$</span>。同理对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X_{l,l'}\\mid L_{l,l'})=\\pi_{l,l'}(l)H(X\\mid L=l)+\\pi_{l,l'}(l')H(X\\mid L=l')$</span>。两式相减并整理：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\pi_{l,l'}(l)\\Delta H_{l,l'}(\\tau)=I_{l,l'}(L;Y)-I_{l,l'}(L;X)+\\big[H(X_{l,l'}\\mid L_{l,l'})-H(X_{l,l'})\\big]-\\pi_{l,l'}(l')\\big[H(X\\mid L=l)-H(X\\mid L=l')\\big]\\cdot 0,$$</div>\n<p>最后一项系数为零，故直接得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\pi_{l,l'}(l)\\big[H(Y\\mid L=l)-H(Y\\mid L=l')\\big]=\\Big[I_{l,l'}(L;Y)-I_{l,l'}(L;X)\\Big]+\\pi_{l,l'}(l)\\big[H(X\\mid L=l)-H(X\\mid L=l')\\big],$$</div>\n<p>两边除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{l,l'}(l)&gt;0$</span>（A4）即得所述恒等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（粗粒化不增熵差异的上界）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：同命题 1，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_{l,l'}(L;X)&lt;\\infty$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta H_{l,l'}(\\tau)\\le \\big[H(X\\mid L=l)-H(X\\mid L=l')\\big],$$</div>\n<p>等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_{l,l'}(L;Y)=I_{l,l'}(L;X)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 在成对混合下不损失任何语言判别信息。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H_{l,l'}(\\tau)-[H(X\\mid L=l)-H(X\\mid L=l')]=I_{l,l'}(L;Y)-I_{l,l'}(L;X)$</span>。由数据处理不等式（A5，成对版本同样成立，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{l,l'}\\to X_{l,l'}\\to Y_{l,l'}$</span> 为 Markov 链），<span class=\"math-inline\">$I_{l,l'}(L;Y)\\le I_{l,l'}(L;X)$</span>，故差非正。等号条件由 DPI 等号刻画（前序节已讨论：当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的充分统计量）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个推论是本节的核心可检验结论：<strong>分词造成的跨语言熵差异，不会超过原始字符层面本身的语言熵差异</strong>；分词只会缩小、不会放大语言间的熵差距。多语言分词器若在某语言上熵显著偏低，只能解释为该语言在字符层面本就更低熵，或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 对该语言恰好接近充分统计量。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-2-具体例子-两语言-两-token-的精确计算\">2. 具体例子：两语言、两 token 的精确计算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-2-具体例子-两语言-两-token-的精确计算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>构造最小可验证例。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma=\\{a,b\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V=\\{aa,ab,b\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 按最长匹配：<span class=\"math-inline\">$aa\\mapsto aa$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$ab\\mapsto ab$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\mapsto b$</span>，其余字符串按前序节规则拼接。取两语言：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>语言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$l_1$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_1(aa)=1/2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_1(ab)=1/2$</span>，其余为零（长度 2 的字符串）。</li>\n<li>语言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$l_2$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_2(b)=1$</span>（长度 1）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_1(aa)=1/2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_1(ab)=1/2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid L=l_1)=1$</span> bit；<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_2(b)=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid L=l_2)=0$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H_{l_1,l_2}(\\tau)=1$</span> bit。而字符层面：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid L=l_1)=1$</span> bit（两个等概率长度 2 串），<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid L=l_2)=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid L=l_1)-H(X\\mid L=l_2)=1$</span> bit。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi(l_1)=\\pi(l_2)=1/2$</span>，计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_{l_1,l_2}(L;Y)$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_{l_1,l_2}(aa)=1/4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_{l_1,l_2}(ab)=1/4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_{l_1,l_2}(b)=1/2$</span>。逐项：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I_{l_1,l_2}(L;Y)=\\tfrac12\\Big[\\tfrac12\\log\\tfrac{1/2}{1/4}+\\tfrac12\\log\\tfrac{1/2}{1/4}\\Big]+\\tfrac12\\Big[1\\cdot\\log\\tfrac{1}{1/2}\\Big]=\\tfrac12(1)+\\tfrac12(1)=1\\text{ bit}.$$</div>\n<p>同理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_{l_1,l_2}(L;X)=1$</span> bit（<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{l_1,l_2}(aa)=1/4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{l_1,l_2}(ab)=1/4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{l_1,l_2}(b)=1/2$</span>，同结构）。代入命题 1：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H=1-1+1=1$</span> bit，与直接计算一致。此例中 DPI 取等号，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 在成对混合下为充分统计量。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-3-多语言熵差异的加性分解与-BPE-合并的边际效应\">3. 多语言熵差异的加性分解与 BPE 合并的边际效应<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-3-多语言熵差异的加性分解与-BPE-合并的边际效应\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已证 BPE 每次合并使词表减少 1、准则为频率最大的相邻对。本节关心：一次合并如何改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H_{l,l'}$</span>。设当前词表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span>，合并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(u,v)\\mapsto uv$</span> 得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V'=V\\setminus\\{u,v\\}\\cup\\{uv\\}$</span>，新分词映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau'$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau(X)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y'=\\tau'(X)$</span>。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau'$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的进一步粗粒化（合并只减少 token 数），有 Markov 链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L\\to X\\to Y\\to Y'$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2（单次合并的熵差异变化上界）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A5)，且合并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(u,v)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_l,Q_{l'}$</span> 下均以正概率相邻出现。<strong>结论</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big|\\Delta H_{l,l'}(\\tau')-\\Delta H_{l,l'}(\\tau)\\big|\\le \\max_{m\\in\\{l,l'\\}}\\Big|H(Y'\\mid L=m)-H(Y\\mid L=m)\\Big|\\le \\log\\frac{Q_m(uv)}{Q_m(u)Q_m(v)}\\text{ 的上界项},$$</div>\n<p>更具体地，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span>，单次合并引起的条件熵变化满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(Y'\\mid L=m)-H(Y\\mid L=m)=-\\sum_{y\\ni (u,v)\\text{ 相邻}}Q_m(y)\\log\\frac{Q_m(y\\text{ 合并后})}{Q_m(y)},$$</div>\n<p>且其绝对值不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\big(1/\\min_{y}Q_m(y)\\big)$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_m$</span> 支撑有限时）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau'$</span> 将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 中每个相邻对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(u,v)$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$uv$</span>，其余不变。这是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*\\to (V')^*$</span> 的确定性映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y'=\\sigma(Y)$</span>。由链式法则与 DPI，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y'\\mid L=m)\\le H(Y\\mid L=m)$</span>。差值等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid Y',L=m)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid L=m)=H(Y,Y'\\mid L=m)=H(Y'\\mid L=m)+H(Y\\mid Y',L=m)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y'$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 的函数故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y'\\mid Y,L=m)=0$</span>）。逐纤维计算：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y'$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 的不确定性只来自每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$uv$</span> 是否由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(u,v)$</span> 合并而来——但在确定性合并规则下这是确定的，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid Y',L=m)=0$</span>？不对：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 是多对一的，不同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 可映射到同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y'$</span>（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u,v$</span> 相邻 vs. 不相邻但恰好拼出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$uv$</span> 的情形在固定词表下不出现，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$uv$</span> 为新 token 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u,v$</span> 被移除）。在标准 BPE 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*$</span> 上确为多对一：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(u,v)$</span> 与已存在的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$uv$</span>（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$uv\\in V$</span> 则不会合并）不冲突，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u,v$</span> 可出现在不同位置。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid Y',L=m)$</span> 非零，等于合并位置的不确定性。其上界由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sum_y Q_m(y)\\log Q_m(y)$</span> 与纤维大小的组合给出；最粗的上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log|V^*|$</span>，精细上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1/\\min_y Q_m(y))$</span> 乘以纤维数。命题陈述中的等式即逐纤维的负对数比之和，绝对值受 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1/\\min Q_m)$</span> 控制。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（熵差异的单调收缩）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：同命题 2，且每步合并对两语言均正概率。<strong>结论</strong>：沿 BPE 合并序列，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H_{l,l'}(\\tau^{(k)})$</span> 的绝对值关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 不增，且极限为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 当词表收缩到单 token（此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 为常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid L=m)=0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：每步由命题 2 的 DPI 部分，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y'\\mid L=m)\\le H(Y\\mid L=m)$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 成立，故两语言条件熵同时不增，其差值的绝对值满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\Delta H^{(k+1)}|\\le\\max_m|H^{(k+1)}_m-H^{(k)}_m|+|\\Delta H^{(k)}|$</span> 的控制不直接给单调性；需用成对形式：由推论 1 应用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{(k)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{(k+1)}$</span> 的复合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H^{(k+1)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H^{(k)}$</span> 各自满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le$</span> 字符层差值，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{(k+1)}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{(k)}$</span> 的粗粒化，成对 DPI 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_{l,l'}(L;Y^{(k+1)})\\le I_{l,l'}(L;Y^{(k)})$</span>，代入命题 1 的恒等式（字符层项不变）得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H^{(k+1)}\\le \\Delta H^{(k)}$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H^{(k)}\\ge 0$</span> 时；对称地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H^{(k+1)}\\ge \\Delta H^{(k)}$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H^{(k)}\\le 0$</span> 时。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\Delta H^{(k)}|$</span> 不增。极限：词表收缩至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|V|=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 恒为单 token，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid L=m)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出多语言分词的定量图像：<strong>词表越大（合并越少），跨语言熵差异越接近字符层差异；词表越小（合并越多），熵差异被压缩向零</strong>。这解释了为何共享大词表的多语言分词器倾向于“抹平”语言间的熵差异，而小词表或语言特定分词器保留差异。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-4-代码-多语言熵差异的数值测量\">4. 代码：多语言熵差异的数值测量<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-4-代码-多语言熵差异的数值测量\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码在最小例（第 2 小节）与一个三语言合成分布上计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$I_{l,l'}(L;Y)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$I_{l,l'}(L;X)$</span>，并验证命题 1 的恒等式与推论 1 的不等式，含 assert。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nfrom collections import Counter\n\ndef entropy(prob_dict):\n    return -sum(p * np.log2(p) for p in prob_dict.values() if p &gt; 0)\n\ndef pairwise_mi(joint_lang_prob, cond_probs, langs):\n    # joint_lang_prob: {lang: prior}; cond_probs: {lang: {symbol: prob}}\n    # returns I_{l,l'}(L;Y) for the pair, using pairwise renormalized priors\n    l1, l2 = langs\n    pi = {l1: joint_lang_prob[l1] / (joint_lang_prob[l1] + joint_lang_prob[l2]),\n          l2: joint_lang_prob[l2] / (joint_lang_prob[l1] + joint_lang_prob[l2])}\n    symbols = set(cond_probs[l1]) | set(cond_probs[l2])\n    mix = {s: pi[l1] * cond_probs[l1].get(s, 0) + pi[l2] * cond_probs[l2].get(s, 0) for s in symbols}\n    mi = 0.0\n    for l in (l1, l2):\n        for s in symbols:\n            q = cond_probs[l].get(s, 0)\n            if q &gt; 0 and mix[s] &gt; 0:\n                mi += pi[l] * q * np.log2(q / mix[s])\n    return mi\n\n# --- 最小例：语言 l1 两个长度2串等概率，l2 单字符 b ---\nP1 = {&quot;aa&quot;: 0.5, &quot;ab&quot;: 0.5}\nP2 = {&quot;b&quot;: 1.0}\nQ1 = {&quot;aa&quot;: 0.5, &quot;ab&quot;: 0.5}   # tau 最长匹配后的 token 序列\nQ2 = {&quot;b&quot;: 1.0}\nprior = {&quot;l1&quot;: 0.5, &quot;l2&quot;: 0.5}\n\nH_Y_l1 = entropy(Q1); H_Y_l2 = entropy(Q2)\nH_X_l1 = entropy(P1); H_X_l2 = entropy(P2)\ndH = H_Y_l1 - H_Y_l2\ndH_X = H_X_l1 - H_X_l2\nI_Y = pairwise_mi(prior, {&quot;l1&quot;: Q1, &quot;l2&quot;: Q2}, [&quot;l1&quot;, &quot;l2&quot;])\nI_X = pairwise_mi(prior, {&quot;l1&quot;: P1, &quot;l2&quot;: P2}, [&quot;l1&quot;, &quot;l2&quot;])\nrhs = I_Y - I_X + dH_X\nassert abs(dH - rhs) &lt; 1e-12, (dH, rhs)\nassert dH &lt;= dH_X + 1e-12\nprint(&quot;minimal example: dH=%.6f, dH_X=%.6f, I_Y=%.6f, I_X=%.6f, identity_rhs=%.6f&quot;\n      % (dH, dH_X, I_Y, I_X, rhs))\nprint(&quot;shapes: len(P1)=%d, len(Q1)=%d&quot; % (len(P1), len(Q1)))\n\n# --- 三语言合成：验证成对恒等式对每对成立 ---\nlangs = [&quot;en&quot;, &quot;zh&quot;, &quot;ar&quot;]\npriors = {&quot;en&quot;: 0.4, &quot;zh&quot;: 0.35, &quot;ar&quot;: 0.25}\n# 字符层分布（合成，仅用于数值验证）\nP = {\n    &quot;en&quot;: {&quot;th&quot;: 0.3, &quot;e&quot;: 0.4, &quot; &quot;: 0.3},\n    &quot;zh&quot;: {&quot;的&quot;: 0.5, &quot;是&quot;: 0.3, &quot;。&quot;: 0.2},\n    &quot;ar&quot;: {&quot;ا&quot;: 0.4, &quot;ل&quot;: 0.35, &quot;م&quot;: 0.25},\n}\n# 分词后分布（假设 tau 将 en 的 &quot;th&quot; 合并为单 token，其余不变）\nQ = {\n    &quot;en&quot;: {&quot;th&quot;: 0.3, &quot;e&quot;: 0.4, &quot; &quot;: 0.3},\n    &quot;zh&quot;: {&quot;的&quot;: 0.5, &quot;是&quot;: 0.3, &quot;。&quot;: 0.2},\n    &quot;ar&quot;: {&quot;ا&quot;: 0.4, &quot;ل&quot;: 0.35, &quot;م&quot;: 0.25},\n}\nfor i in range(len(langs)):\n    for j in range(i + 1, len(langs)):\n        l1, l2 = langs[i], langs[j]\n        dH = entropy(Q[l1]) - entropy(Q[l2])\n        dH_X = entropy(P[l1]) - entropy(P[l2])\n        I_Y = pairwise_mi(priors, Q, [l1, l2])\n        I_X = pairwise_mi(priors, P, [l1, l2])\n        rhs = I_Y - I_X + dH_X\n        assert abs(dH - rhs) &lt; 1e-12, (l1, l2, dH, rhs)\n        assert dH &lt;= dH_X + 1e-12, (l1, l2, dH, dH_X)\n        print(&quot;pair (%s,%s): dH=%.6f, dH_X=%.6f, I_Y=%.6f, I_X=%.6f, rhs=%.6f&quot;\n              % (l1, l2, dH, dH_X, I_Y, I_X, rhs))\nprint(&quot;all pairwise identities and DPI inequalities verified&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：最小例打印 <code>dH=1.000000, dH_X=1.000000, I_Y=1.000000, I_X=1.000000, identity_rhs=1.000000</code>，三对均通过 assert，末行打印验证成功。代码中 <code>entropy</code> 以 bit 为单位，与本节公式一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-5-与后续节的接口\">5. 与后续节的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-5-与后续节的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节结论为后续三节提供定量基础：(i) 第 9 节“分词对困惑度的系统性影响”将把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H$</span> 与模型交叉熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[-\\log p_\\theta(Y)]$</span> 联系，需注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H$</span> 是数据侧量、不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，两者不可混同；(ii) 第 10 节反例节将构造同一字符串不同分词导致不同概率的实例，其机制正是本节命题 1 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_{l,l'}(L;Y)$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的非充分性；(iii) 第 12 节可逆性条件将刻画 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H=0$</span> 且 DPI 取等号的充要条件，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 在成对混合下为充分统计量。本节只做熵差异的分解与上界，不展开困惑度与反例。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-6-语言条件熵差异的变分刻画与下界\">6. 语言条件熵差异的变分刻画与下界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-6-语言条件熵差异的变分刻画与下界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1 与推论 1 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H_{l,l'}(\\tau)$</span> 的恒等式与上界，但上界只依赖字符层熵差，未给出分词器自身结构对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H$</span> 的下界约束。本节补足这一点：把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H$</span> 写成对成对混合分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_{l,l'}$</span> 的 KL 散度之差，从而得到与词表覆盖度直接相关的下界。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（熵差异的 KL 变分形式）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A4) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_l,Q_{l'}$</span> 均绝对连续于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_{l,l'}$</span>（在可数集上即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_{l,l'}(y)=0\\Rightarrow Q_l(y)=Q_{l'}(y)=0$</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_{l,l'}$</span> 的凸组合定义自动成立）。<strong>结论</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta H_{l,l'}(\\tau)=\\frac{1}{\\pi_{l,l'}(l)}\\Big[D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(Q_l\\|Q_{l,l'})-D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(Q_{l'}\\|Q_{l,l'})\\Big]+\\frac{\\pi_{l,l'}(l')}{\\pi_{l,l'}(l)}\\big[H(Y\\mid L=l')-H(Y\\mid L=l')\\big]\\cdot 0,$$</div>\n<p>即精确地</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\pi_{l,l'}(l)\\Delta H_{l,l'}(\\tau)=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(Q_l\\|Q_{l,l'})-D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(Q_{l'}\\|Q_{l,l'}).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(Q_m\\|Q_{l,l'})=\\sum_y Q_m(y)\\log\\frac{Q_m(y)}{Q_{l,l'}(y)}$</span>。展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_{l,l'}=\\pi_{l,l'}(l)Q_l+\\pi_{l,l'}(l')Q_{l'}$</span> 并利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_y Q_m(y)=1$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(Q_l\\|Q_{l,l'})-D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(Q_{l'}\\|Q_{l,l'})=\\sum_y\\big[Q_l(y)-Q_{l'}(y)\\big]\\log Q_{l,l'}(y)-\\sum_y Q_l(y)\\log Q_l(y)+\\sum_y Q_{l'}(y)\\log Q_{l'}(y).$$</div>\n<p>后两项合并为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-H(Y\\mid L=l)+H(Y\\mid L=l')$</span>。前一项需处理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log Q_{l,l'}$</span>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_{l,l'}$</span> 的定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_y Q_l(y)\\log Q_{l,l'}(y)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_y Q_{l'}(y)\\log Q_{l,l'}(y)$</span> 之差不能直接化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{l,l'}(l)\\Delta H$</span> 的倍数——需改用另一条路径。直接对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{l,l'}(l)\\Delta H$</span> 展开：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\pi_{l,l'}(l)\\big[H(Y\\mid L=l)-H(Y\\mid L=l')\\big]=-\\pi_{l,l'}(l)\\sum_y Q_l(y)\\log Q_l(y)+\\pi_{l,l'}(l)\\sum_y Q_{l'}(y)\\log Q_{l'}(y).$$</div>\n<p>而</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(Q_l\\|Q_{l,l'})-D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(Q_{l'}\\|Q_{l,l'})=\\sum_y Q_l(y)\\log\\frac{Q_l(y)}{Q_{l,l'}(y)}-\\sum_y Q_{l'}(y)\\log\\frac{Q_{l'}(y)}{Q_{l,l'}(y)}.$$</div>\n<p>将右端两项各自拆为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log Q_l(y)-\\log Q_{l,l'}(y)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log Q_{l'}(y)-\\log Q_{l,l'}(y)$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$=\\Big[-\\!H(Y\\mid L=l)+\\!H(Y\\mid L=l')\\Big]-\\sum_y\\big[Q_l(y)-Q_{l'}(y)\\big]\\log Q_{l,l'}(y).$$</div>\n<p>于是命题断言等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_y[Q_l(y)-Q_{l'}(y)]\\log Q_{l,l'}(y)=0$</span>。此式一般不成立。更精确地说，命题 3 的正确形式应把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H$</span> 写成两个 KL 之差加上一个交叉项，而非纯 KL 差。重新陈述如下。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3′（熵差异的 KL 分解，精确形式）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：同命题 3。<strong>结论</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\pi_{l,l'}(l)\\Delta H_{l,l'}(\\tau)=\\Big[D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(Q_l\\|Q_{l,l'})-D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(Q_{l'}\\|Q_{l,l'})\\Big]+\\sum_y\\big[Q_l(y)-Q_{l'}(y)\\big]\\log Q_{l,l'}(y).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由上段推导直接移项即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 3′ 的价值在于：交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_y[Q_l-Q_{l'}]\\log Q_{l,l'}$</span> 只依赖两语言在混合分布下的重叠支撑。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_l$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_{l'}$</span> 支撑不相交（多语言分词器为不同语言分配不相交 token 子集），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_{l,l'}(y)=\\pi_{l,l'}(l)Q_l(y)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_l$</span> 支撑上、<span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\pi_{l,l'}(l')Q_{l'}(y)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_{l'}$</span> 支撑上，交叉项化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{l,l'}(l)\\log\\pi_{l,l'}(l)-\\pi_{l,l'}(l')\\log\\pi_{l,l'}(l')$</span> 的常数，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 无关。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H$</span> 完全由两语言各自的 token 熵决定，分词器只通过词表划分影响支撑结构。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（不相交支撑下的熵差异下界）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：同命题 3′，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_l,Q_{l'}$</span> 支撑不相交。<strong>结论</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta H_{l,l'}(\\tau)\\ge \\log\\frac{1}{\\pi_{l,l'}(l)}-\\frac{\\pi_{l,l'}(l')}{\\pi_{l,l'}(l)}\\log\\frac{1}{\\pi_{l,l'}(l')}-\\frac{1}{\\pi_{l,l'}(l)}\\max_{y\\in\\mathrm{supp}\\,Q_{l'}}\\log\\frac{1}{Q_{l'}(y)}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：不相交时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(Q_l\\|Q_{l,l'})=\\log\\frac{1}{\\pi_{l,l'}(l)}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(Q_{l'}\\|Q_{l,l'})=\\log\\frac{1}{\\pi_{l,l'}(l')}$</span>。交叉项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_l$</span> 支撑上为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_y Q_l(y)\\log(\\pi_{l,l'}(l)Q_l(y))=\\log\\pi_{l,l'}(l)-H(Y\\mid L=l)$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_{l'}$</span> 支撑上为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sum_y Q_{l'}(y)\\log(\\pi_{l,l'}(l')Q_{l'}(y))=-\\log\\pi_{l,l'}(l')+H(Y\\mid L=l')$</span>。代入命题 3′ 并整理，再用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid L=l')\\le \\max_y\\log(1/Q_{l'}(y))$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_{l'}$</span> 支撑有限且概率和为 1，熵不超过最大负对数概率）即得所述下界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论说明：当分词器为不同语言分配不相交 token 子集（如按语言划分词表的极端情形），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H$</span> 的下界由先验比与较稀疏语言的峰值概率共同决定，与词表大小无关。这与推论 2 的“词表越小越抹平”形成对照：后者针对共享词表的连续合并，前者针对不相交划分。两者共同刻画了多语言分词器在“共享 vs. 分离”两个极端上的熵行为。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-7-多语言分词器的熵差异矩阵与正定性\">7. 多语言分词器的熵差异矩阵与正定性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-7-多语言分词器的熵差异矩阵与正定性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节定义了成对互信息 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_{l,l'}(L;Y)$</span>。本节将其推广为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal{L}|\\times|\\mathcal{L}|$</span> 矩阵，并证明其半正定性，从而给出多语言熵差异的整体约束。</p>\n<p><strong>定义（成对互信息矩阵）</strong>：对分词器 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 与语言集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}$</span>，定义矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M^\\tau\\in\\mathbb{R}^{|\\mathcal{L}|\\times|\\mathcal{L}|}$</span>，元素</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$M^\\tau_{l,l'}:=I_{l,l'}(L;Y),\\quad l,l'\\in\\mathcal{L},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_{l,l'}$</span> 按命题 1 的成对重归一化先验计算，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M^\\tau_{l,l}=H(Y\\mid L=l)$</span>（自信息即条件熵，约定成对情形退化为单语言）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（成对互信息矩阵的界与半正定性的失效）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A4)，且对每对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(l,l')$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_l,Q_{l'}$</span> 绝对连续于其混合。<strong>结论</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$M^\\tau$</span> 对称、非负、对角元为条件熵，且对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$l,l'$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$M^\\tau_{l,l'}\\le\\min\\big(M^\\tau_{l,l},\\,M^\\tau_{l',l'}\\big);$$</div>\n但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M^\\tau$</span> 一般不必半正定。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对称与非负由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_{l,l'}$</span> 的定义直接得到；上界来自互信息不超过任一边缘熵。半正定性的失效由三语言反例给出。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L=\\{1,2,3\\}$</span>、先验等权 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_1,Q_2,Q_3$</span> 各为单点且两两不同。对任意一对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(l,l')$</span>，成对重归一化后的混合分布在两个不同点上各占 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y)=\\log 2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid L)=0$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_{l,l'}=\\log 2$</span>；对角元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_{l,l}=H(Y\\mid L=l)=0$</span>。矩阵为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$M=\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;\\log 2&amp;\\log 2\\\\ \\log 2&amp;0&amp;\\log 2\\\\ \\log 2&amp;\\log 2&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}=\\log 2\\,(J-I),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 为全 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 矩阵。<span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 的特征值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3,0,0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 的特征值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\log 2$</span>（重数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log 2$</span>（重数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>），特征多项式为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\det(M-\\lambda I)=(2\\log 2-\\lambda)(-\\log 2-\\lambda)^2,$$</div>\n含负特征值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log 2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 不是半正定的。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这一反例的几何含义是：三语言两两可分，但三个“可分方向”无法同时嵌入一个欧氏空间——负特征值正是这一组合现象的谱表现。其量级也说明失效不是数值噪声：<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda_{\\min}|=\\log 2$</span> 与正特征值同阶。成对互信息矩阵因此只能作为诊断工具，其谱性质不能解释为语言间可分性的正定度量；这与分词器为每语言分配独立 token 子集时的支撑结构一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-8-熵差异对词表规模的敏感性\">8. 熵差异对词表规模的敏感性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-8-熵差异对词表规模的敏感性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>推论 2 给出沿 BPE 合并序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\Delta H|$</span> 单调不增。本节将其细化为对词表规模 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|V|$</span> 的敏感性估计，给出可检验的差分上界。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（词表规模敏感性）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A5)，BPE 合并序列共 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 步，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 步合并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(u_k,v_k)$</span> 在两语言下均正概率相邻，且每步合并后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q^{(k)}_m$</span> 的最小正概率下界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_k&gt;0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$m\\in\\{l,l'\\}$</span>）。<strong>结论</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big|\\Delta H^{(k+1)}-\\Delta H^{(k)}\\big|\\le \\sum_{m\\in\\{l,l'\\}}\\Big[\\log\\frac{1}{\\epsilon_k}\\Big]\\cdot Q^{(k)}_m\\big(\\text{含 }(u_k,v_k)\\text{ 相邻}\\big),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q^{(k)}_m(\\text{含 }(u_k,v_k)\\text{ 相邻})$</span> 为语言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 下词序列中出现该相邻对的概率。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span>。由命题 2 的逐纤维表达式，单次合并的熵变化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sum_{y\\ni(u,v)}Q^{(k)}_m(y)\\log\\frac{Q^{(k+1)}_m(\\sigma(y))}{Q^{(k)}_m(y)}$</span>。对每个被合并的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span>，比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q^{(k+1)}_m(\\sigma(y))/Q^{(k)}_m(y)$</span> 是合并后纤维总概率与单序列概率之比，其对数绝对值不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1/\\epsilon_k)$</span>（因纤维总概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 1$</span>，单序列概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge \\epsilon_k$</span>）。乘以该 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 的概率并对所有含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(u,v)$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 求和，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|H^{(k+1)}_m-H^{(k)}_m|\\le \\log(1/\\epsilon_k)\\cdot Q^{(k)}_m(\\text{含 }(u,v))$</span>。两语言相减并用三角不等式即得所述界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H$</span> 对词表规模的敏感性量化为“合并频率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\times$</span> 负对数最小概率”。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_k$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 增大而减小时（长尾 token 概率变小），敏感性上界增大，说明大词表末端的合并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H$</span> 的影响更不稳定；反之，早期高频合并（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_k$</span> 较大、合并频率高）对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H$</span> 的影响有界且可预测。这为多语言分词器设计提供了一条定量准则：若希望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H$</span> 在语言间保持稳定，应优先在低频合并处监控 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_k$</span> 与合并频率的乘积。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-9-具体例子-三语言共享词表下的熵差异演化\">9. 具体例子：三语言共享词表下的熵差异演化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-9-具体例子-三语言共享词表下的熵差异演化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>构造可手算的三步 BPE 演化例，验证命题 5 的界与推论 2 的单调性。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma=\\{a,b,c\\}$</span>，初始词表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^{(0)}=\\{a,b,c\\}$</span>，三语言分布：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$l_1$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_1(aa)=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_1(ab)=0.5$</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$l_2$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_2(bb)=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_2(bc)=0.5$</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$l_3$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_3(cc)=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_3(ca)=0.5$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>初始分词为逐字符，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q^{(0)}_m$</span> 为长度 2 的字符序列分布，各语言条件熵均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> bit，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H^{(0)}_{l_1,l_2}=0$</span>。第 1 步合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,a)\\mapsto aa$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$l_1$</span> 中频率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.5$</span>，其余语言为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，按 BPE 准则取全局最大相邻对频率——此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$l_1$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,a)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$l_2$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(b,b)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$l_3$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(c,c)$</span> 频率相同，取字典序最小者）。合并后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q^{(1)}_1(aa)=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q^{(1)}_1(ab)=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H^{(1)}_1=1$</span> bit；<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q^{(1)}_2,Q^{(1)}_3$</span> 不变，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H^{(1)}_2=H^{(1)}_3=1$</span> bit。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H^{(1)}_{l_1,l_2}=0$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H^{(0)}$</span> 相同，命题 5 的界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1/\\epsilon_1)\\cdot Q^{(0)}_1(\\text{含 }(a,a))=\\log 2\\cdot 0.5=\\log 2/2$</span> bit，实际变化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 在其内。第 2 步合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(b,b)\\mapsto bb$</span>，同理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H^{(2)}=0$</span>。第 3 步合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(c,c)\\mapsto cc$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H^{(3)}=0$</span>。三步后词表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^{(3)}=\\{aa,bb,cc,ab,bc,ca\\}$</span>，三语言条件熵仍各为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> bit，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H$</span> 恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。此例中 DPI 取等号（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 在每对语言下为充分统计量，因合并只作用于单语言高频对且不改变跨语言判别信息），验证推论 1 的等号条件。</p>\n<p>若改为第 1 步合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,b)\\mapsto ab$</span>（跨 <span class=\"math-inline\">$l_1$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$l_3$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ca$</span> 不构成同一对，故仅 <span class=\"math-inline\">$l_1$</span> 频率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.5$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q^{(1)}_1(ab)=0.5$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q^{(1)}_1(aa)=0.5$</span> 不变，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H^{(1)}_1=1$</span> bit，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H$</span> 仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。要产生非零 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H$</span>，需合并改变某语言的条件熵而不改变另一语言——例如合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,a)$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$l_1$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$aa$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span> 仍等概率（熵不变），但若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$l_1$</span> 改为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_1(aa)=0.75,P_1(ab)=0.25$</span>，合并后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q^{(1)}_1(aa)=0.75,Q^{(1)}_1(ab)=0.25$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H^{(1)}_1=0.811$</span> bit，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$l_2$</span> 不变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H^{(1)}_2=1$</span> bit，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H^{(1)}_{l_1,l_2}=-0.189$</span> bit，绝对值小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H^{(0)}=0.189$</span> bit（初始 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H^{(0)}_1=0.811$</span>），符合推论 2 的单调不增。命题 5 的界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1/0.25)\\cdot 0.75=2\\cdot 0.75=1.5$</span> bit 覆盖实际变化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$l_1$</span> 熵未变）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$l_2$</span> 熵未变，故界成立但偏松；紧界需用逐纤维精确计算。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-10-熵差异与词表覆盖度的关系\">10. 熵差异与词表覆盖度的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-10-熵差异与词表覆盖度的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后补足一个可检验恒等式，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H$</span> 与词表对两语言的覆盖度联系起来。定义语言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 在分词器 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 下的<strong>词表覆盖度</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{cov}_m(\\tau):=Q_m(\\{y: y\\in V\\})$</span>，即单 token 序列的概率质量（长度 1 的词序列）。对多语言分词器，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{cov}_m$</span> 度量该语言有多少文本被编码为单 token。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（覆盖度与熵差异的恒等式）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A4)，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_m$</span> 支撑有限。<strong>结论</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(Y\\mid L=m)=\\mathrm{cov}_m(\\tau)\\cdot H(Y\\mid L=m,Y\\in V)+(1-\\mathrm{cov}_m(\\tau))\\cdot H(Y\\mid L=m,Y\\notin V)+h_2(\\mathrm{cov}_m(\\tau)),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_2(p)=-p\\log p-(1-p)\\log(1-p)$</span> 为二元熵。从而</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta H_{l,l'}(\\tau)=\\big[\\mathrm{cov}_l-\\mathrm{cov}_{l'}\\big]\\cdot\\Delta_{\\mathrm{in}}+\\big[(1-\\mathrm{cov}_l)-(1-\\mathrm{cov}_{l'})\\big]\\cdot\\Delta_{\\mathrm{out}}+\\big[h_2(\\mathrm{cov}_l)-h_2(\\mathrm{cov}_{l'})\\big],$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{\\mathrm{in}}=H(Y\\mid L=l,Y\\in V)-H(Y\\mid L=l',Y\\in V)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{\\mathrm{out}}$</span> 类似地定义为补集上的条件熵差。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span>，将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 按事件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{Y\\in V\\}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{Y\\notin V\\}$</span> 分解，用熵的链式法则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y)=H(\\mathbb{1}_{Y\\in V})+H(Y\\mid\\mathbb{1}_{Y\\in V})$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\mathbb{1}_{Y\\in V})=h_2(\\mathrm{cov}_m)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid\\mathbb{1}_{Y\\in V})=\\mathrm{cov}_m H(Y\\mid Y\\in V)+(1-\\mathrm{cov}_m)H(Y\\mid Y\\notin V)$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H$</span> 的定义并整理即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此恒等式把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H$</span> 分解为三部分：覆盖度差乘以内部熵差、补集覆盖度差乘以外部熵差、二元熵差。对多语言分词器，若某语言覆盖度高（大量单 token），其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_2(\\mathrm{cov})$</span> 较小，条件熵被压低；若另一语言覆盖度低（大量多 token 序列），<span class=\"math-inline\">$h_2$</span> 较大，条件熵被抬高。这解释了为何共享词表的多语言分词器常在覆盖度高的语言上报告更低的 token 级困惑度——部分差异来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_2(\\mathrm{cov})$</span> 项，而非语言本身的字符熵差异。命题 6 与命题 1 不冲突：前者按覆盖度事件分解，后者按语言标签分解，两者是同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H$</span> 的不同正交分解，可联立使用。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>定义分词熵差异 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H_{l,l'}(\\tau)=H(Y\\mid L=l)-H(Y\\mid L=l')$</span>，并证明分解恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H=I_{l,l'}(L;Y)-I_{l,l'}(L;X)+[H(X\\mid L=l)-H(X\\mid L=l')]$</span>，其中成对互信息按成对重归一化先验计算。</li>\n<li>由数据处理不等式得推论：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H_{l,l'}(\\tau)\\le H(X\\mid L=l)-H(X\\mid L=l')$</span>，即分词只会缩小、不会放大语言间的熵差距；等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 在成对混合下为充分统计量。</li>\n<li>对 BPE 单次合并证明条件熵变化上界，并得推论：沿合并序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\Delta H|$</span> 单调不增、极限为零；词表越大越保留字符层熵差异，词表越小越抹平差异。数值代码在最小例与三语言合成分布上验证了恒等式与不等式。</li>\n<li>命题 3′ 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H$</span> 的 KL 分解，交叉项只依赖两语言在混合分布下的重叠支撑；推论 3 在不相交支撑下给出由先验比与峰值概率决定的下界，与推论 2 的“共享词表连续合并”形成对照。</li>\n<li>命题 4′ 修正了成对互信息矩阵的半正定性误判，给出正确界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M^\\tau_{l,l'}\\le\\min(M^\\tau_{l,l},M^\\tau_{l',l'})$</span> 与三语言不相交支撑的负特征值反例；命题 5 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H$</span> 对词表规模的敏感性量化为合并频率与负对数最小概率之积。</li>\n<li>命题 6 按词表覆盖度事件分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H$</span>，显式分离出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_2(\\mathrm{cov})$</span> 项，说明多语言分词器报告的 token 级熵差异部分来自覆盖度而非语言字符熵；三语言三步 BPE 演化例验证了推论 2 的单调性与命题 5 的界。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"ar08--h-分词对困惑度的系统性影响\">分词对困惑度的系统性影响<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-分词对困惑度的系统性影响\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>沿用前序节已建立的符号：字符串空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span>，词表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span>，分词映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau:\\Sigma^*\\to V^*$</span> 为满射非单射；语言模型在词元序列上的概率测度记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\theta$</span>，其对长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 的序列的密度（或质量函数）为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(v_{1:n})$</span>。本节引入以下记号并固定其含义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>对字符串 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in\\Sigma^*$</span>，记其字符级长度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|s|_c$</span>，词元级长度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\tau(s)|_t$</span>；分词率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(s)=|\\tau(s)|_t/|s|_c\\in(0,1]$</span>。</li>\n<li>困惑度定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{PPL}_\\theta(s)=\\exp\\!\\big(-\\tfrac{1}{|\\tau(s)|_t}\\log p_\\theta(\\tau(s))\\big)$</span>，即以词元为单位的几何平均负对数似然之指数。</li>\n<li>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_\\theta(v_{1:n})=-\\log p_\\theta(v_{1:n})$</span> 为负对数似然，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{PPL}_\\theta(s)=\\exp(\\ell_\\theta(\\tau(s))/|\\tau(s)|_t)$</span>。</li>\n<li>设字符级参考模型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 上给出概率质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(s)$</span>，其字符级困惑度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{PPL}_Q^{c}(s)=\\exp(-\\tfrac{1}{|s|_c}\\log q(s))$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所需假设显式列出如下。</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 可测性与有限性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 为可测映射（前序节已证），且对本节考虑的所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(\\tau(s))&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(s)&gt;0$</span>，从而对数有定义、困惑度有限。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 分词率的一致有界性</strong>：存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_{\\min},\\rho_{\\max}\\in(0,1]$</span>，使得对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in\\Sigma^*$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_{\\min}\\le \\rho(s)\\le \\rho_{\\max}$</span>。该条件在字节级回退（前序节）下成立：任何字符至少被一个字节词元覆盖，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\tau(s)|_t\\le |s|_c$</span>；同时 BPE/WordPiece 的合并规则保证每个词元至少覆盖一个字符，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\tau(s)|_t\\ge |s|_c/C_{\\max}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{\\max}$</span> 为单次合并所允许的最大字符跨度，于是可取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_{\\min}=1/C_{\\max}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_{\\max}=1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 交叉熵的分解合法性</strong>：字符级模型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 与词元级模型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\theta$</span> 通过分词映射耦合，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(s)=\\sum_{v_{1:n}:\\,\\tau^{-1}(v_{1:n})\\ni s}p_\\theta(v_{1:n})$</span> 不成立时，需假设存在一联合测度使链式分解合法；本节仅在 (A3) 成立时陈述涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\theta$</span> 比较的命题，否则命题只涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\theta$</span> 自身的两种归一化。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4) 对数似然的可加性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\theta$</span> 为自回归分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(v_{1:n})=\\prod_{k=1}^{n}p_\\theta(v_k\\mid v_{&lt;k})$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_\\theta$</span> 对词元可加。此为本部自回归建模的基本设定，前序节已固定。</p>\n<p>本节核心定义如下，并与相邻概念作区别。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 9.1（分词诱导的困惑度泛函）</strong>：固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_s:\\tau\\mapsto \\mathrm{PPL}_\\theta(s)$</span> 称为分词诱导的困惑度泛函。它与“模型困惑度”的区别在于：后者以固定分词器下的词元序列为随机变量，前者把分词器本身视为变量，考察同一字符串在不同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 下的困惑度变化。它与“压缩率”的区别在于：压缩率只计词元数，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_s$</span> 同时依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\tau(s)|_t$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-9-1-困惑度的分词率重参数化恒等式\">9.1 困惑度的分词率重参数化恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-9-1-困惑度的分词率重参数化恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 9.2（重参数化恒等式）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A4) 成立。<strong>结论</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log \\mathrm{PPL}_\\theta(s)=\\frac{\\ell_\\theta(\\tau(s))}{|\\tau(s)|_t}=\\frac{\\ell_\\theta(\\tau(s))}{|s|_c}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\rho(s)}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{PPL}_\\theta(s)=\\exp(\\ell_\\theta(\\tau(s))/|\\tau(s)|_t)$</span>，取对数得第一等式。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(s)=|\\tau(s)|_t/|s|_c$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\tau(s)|_t=|s|_c\\,\\rho(s)$</span>，代入第一等式右端即得第二等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 9.3（分词率的对数线性效应）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：同命题 9.2，且固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_\\theta(\\tau(s))$</span> 不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 改变（即不同分词下模型对同一字符串赋予相同的总负对数似然，此为理想化情形）。<strong>结论</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\mathrm{PPL}_\\theta(s)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\rho(s)$</span> 的弹性为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1$</span>，即</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial \\log\\mathrm{PPL}_\\theta(s)}{\\partial \\log \\rho(s)}=-1.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 9.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\mathrm{PPL}=\\ell_\\theta/|s|_c\\cdot \\rho^{-1}$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\rho$</span> 求导：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial\\log\\rho}\\big(\\ell_\\theta/|s|_c\\cdot e^{-\\log\\rho}\\big)=-\\ell_\\theta/|s|_c\\cdot e^{-\\log\\rho}=-\\log\\mathrm{PPL}$</span>。故弹性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\partial\\log\\mathrm{PPL}}{\\partial\\log\\rho}=-1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该推论给出可检验的定量预测：在总似然不变的前提下，分词率每下降一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e$</span> 倍因子，困惑度上升 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e$</span> 倍。这解释了为何粗粒度分词（词表大、词元少）在相同总似然下报告更高的词元级困惑度——它是归一化分母变小所致，而非模型变差。此即“系统性影响”的第一层含义：<strong>困惑度的量纲由分词率决定</strong>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-9-2-数据处理不等式给出的困惑度下界\">9.2 数据处理不等式给出的困惑度下界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-9-2-数据处理不等式给出的困惑度下界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 9.4（粗粒化信息损失对困惑度的约束）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A3) 成立；设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 为字符级随机变量（取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau(X)$</span> 为词元级变量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 为经某下游确定性变换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 得到的变量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Y\\to Z$</span> 构成马尔可夫链。<strong>结论</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;Z)\\le I(X;Y),$$</div>\n<p>且若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 为模型对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的预测输出，则字符级交叉熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Z)$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(X\\mid Z)\\ge H(X)-I(X;Y).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：马尔可夫链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Y\\to Z$</span> 的数据处理不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)\\le I(X;Y)$</span> 为本章第 3 节已证命题，此处直接引用其结论与假设（可测性、有限互信息）。对第二式：由互信息定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)=H(X)-H(X\\mid Z)$</span>，代入不等式得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)-H(X\\mid Z)\\le I(X;Y)$</span>，移项即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Z)\\ge H(X)-I(X;Y)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 9.5（分词信息损失的可加分解）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：同命题 9.4，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的支撑上逐字符独立作用（即每个字符的分词结果只依赖该字符及其局部上下文，此为 BPE 贪心合并的局部性所保证）。<strong>结论</strong>：记单字符信息损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_c=I(X_c;Y_c)-I(X_c;Z_c)\\ge0$</span>，则总损失满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;Y)-I(X;Z)=\\sum_{c}\\delta_c+\\Delta_{\\mathrm{ctx}},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{\\mathrm{ctx}}\\ge0$</span> 为跨字符上下文因合并而丢失的互信息。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)$</span> 按字符链式分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=\\sum_c I(X_c;Y\\mid X_{&lt;c})$</span>，同理分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)$</span>。逐项作差得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_c\\big[I(X_c;Y\\mid X_{&lt;c})-I(X_c;Z\\mid X_{&lt;c})\\big]$</span>。在逐字符独立假设下，条件互信息退化为无条件互信息，差为非负的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_c$</span>；剩余项即上下文项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{\\mathrm{ctx}}$</span>，由数据处理不等式逐项非负，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{\\mathrm{ctx}}\\ge0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 9.4 与推论 9.5 共同给出“系统性影响”的第二层含义：<strong>分词是不可逆粗粒化，其信息损失对困惑度构成不可逾越的下界</strong>。任何在词元级上训练的模型，其字符级交叉熵不可能低于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)-I(X;Y)$</span>；词表越小、合并越粗，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)$</span> 越小，下界越松，模型在字符级上的可达精度越受限。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-9-3-BPE-合并步数与困惑度上界的显式关系\">9.3 BPE 合并步数与困惑度上界的显式关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-9-3-BPE-合并步数与困惑度上界的显式关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 9.6（BPE 合并的困惑度上界）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)、(A4) 成立；BPE 按本章第 4 节所述贪心准则每次合并频率最大的相邻对，初始词表为字符集，经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 次合并后词表大小为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|V_0|+M$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_M$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 次合并后的分词映射，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{PPL}_{\\theta}^{(M)}(s)\\le \\exp\\!\\Big(\\frac{\\ell_\\theta(\\tau_M(s))}{|s|_c\\,\\rho_{\\min}}\\Big),$$</div>\n<p>且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 增大使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(s)$</span> 单调不增时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{PPL}^{(M)}(s)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 单调不减（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_\\theta$</span> 不变的前提下）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 9.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\mathrm{PPL}=\\ell_\\theta/(|s|_c\\rho)$</span>。由 (A2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\ge\\rho_{\\min}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\rho\\le1/\\rho_{\\min}$</span>，取指数得第一式。单调性：BPE 每次合并将两个相邻词元替换为一个，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\tau_M(s)|_t$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 单调不增，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(s)$</span> 单调不增；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_\\theta$</span> 不变时由推论 9.3 的弹性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1$</span> 知 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\mathrm{PPL}$</span> 单调不减。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 9.6 说明：<strong>BPE 的合并步数是困惑度的显式控制参数</strong>。合并越多，词元越少，词元级困惑度越高；但合并也增大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)$</span> 的损失，使字符级下界变松。二者构成权衡，此即后续“词表规模与参数量的权衡”节的接口。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-9-4-具体例子-同一字符串在两种分词下的困惑度\">9.4 具体例子：同一字符串在两种分词下的困惑度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-9-4-具体例子-同一字符串在两种分词下的困惑度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=\\texttt{\"low\"}$</span>，字符集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\texttt{l,o,w}\\}$</span>，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 给出词元级条件概率：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(\\texttt{l})=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(\\texttt{o}\\mid\\texttt{l})=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(\\texttt{w}\\mid\\texttt{lo})=0.5$</span>；合并后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(\\texttt{low})=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(\\texttt{lo})=0.5$</span>。两种分词：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1(s)=(\\texttt{l,o,w})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2(s)=(\\texttt{low})$</span>。</p>\n<p>字符级分词：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_\\theta(\\tau_1)=-\\log(0.5^3)=3\\log2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\tau_1|_t=3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|s|_c=3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{PPL}^{(1)}=\\exp(\\log2)=2$</span>。</p>\n<p>合并分词：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_\\theta(\\tau_2)=-\\log0.5=\\log2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\tau_2|_t=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=1/3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{PPL}^{(2)}=\\exp(\\log2)=2$</span>。</p>\n<p>此例中两分词给出相同困惑度，因总似然按词元数等比缩放；验证了推论 9.3 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_\\theta$</span> 同比变化时的中性。若改为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(\\texttt{low})=0.25$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_\\theta=2\\log2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{PPL}^{(2)}=\\exp(2\\log2)=4$</span>，高于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{PPL}^{(1)}=2$</span>，展示合并导致总似然下降时困惑度的系统性上升。数值验证见下节代码。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import math\n\ndef ppl(log_likelihood: float, n_tokens: int) -&gt; float:\n    assert n_tokens &gt;= 1\n    return math.exp(log_likelihood / n_tokens)\n\n# 例：字符级分词\nll1 = 3 * math.log(2.0)\nppl1 = ppl(ll1, 3)\nassert abs(ppl1 - 2.0) &lt; 1e-12\n\n# 例：合并分词，总似然同比\nll2 = math.log(2.0)\nppl2 = ppl(ll2, 1)\nassert abs(ppl2 - 2.0) &lt; 1e-12\n\n# 例：合并分词，总似然下降\nll3 = 2 * math.log(2.0)\nppl3 = ppl(ll3, 1)\nassert abs(ppl3 - 4.0) &lt; 1e-12\nassert ppl3 &gt; ppl1\n\nprint(&quot;ppl1, ppl2, ppl3 =&quot;, ppl1, ppl2, ppl3)\nprint(&quot;shapes: scalar, scalar, scalar&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>ppl1, ppl2, ppl3 = 2.0 2.0 4.0</code>，形状均为标量。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-9-5-系统性影响的三个来源\">9.5 系统性影响的三个来源<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-9-5-系统性影响的三个来源\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>综合命题 9.2–9.6，分词对困惑度的系统性影响可分解为三个独立来源，且每个来源均有显式数学表达：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>量纲来源</strong>（命题 9.2、推论 9.3）：困惑度的分母是词元数，分词率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 直接进入指数。此为纯归一化效应，与模型质量无关。</li>\n<li><strong>信息损失来源</strong>（命题 9.4、推论 9.5）：粗粒化使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)$</span> 下降，字符级交叉熵下界抬高，模型在字符级上的可达精度受限。此为不可逆粗粒化的代价。</li>\n<li><strong>合并步数来源</strong>（命题 9.6）：BPE 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 同时控制 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)$</span>，构成显式权衡曲线。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>三者叠加即为“系统性”之含义：困惑度差异不是随机噪声，而是由分词映射的数学结构（满射非单射、合并准则、词表大小）决定的确定性函数。后续反例节将构造同一字符串在不同分词下概率不同的完整例子，以检验本节恒等式的边界；本节不展开该构造。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>困惑度可重参数化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\mathrm{PPL}=\\ell_\\theta/(|s|_c\\rho)$</span>，分词率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 以弹性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1$</span> 系统性进入对数困惑度，此为量纲效应。</li>\n<li>数据处理不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)\\le I(X;Y)$</span> 给出字符级交叉熵下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Z)\\ge H(X)-I(X;Y)$</span>，粗粒化的信息损失对困惑度构成不可逾越的约束。</li>\n<li>BPE 的合并步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_{\\min}$</span> 给出困惑度上界，并在总似然不变时使词元级困惑度单调不减，构成词表规模与精度之间的显式权衡。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-9-6-词元级与字符级困惑度的换算恒等式\">9.6 词元级与字符级困惑度的换算恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-9-6-词元级与字符级困惑度的换算恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前一小节的例子只涉及两个分词，尚不足以刻画一般情形。本小节把命题 9.2 推广为两套分词器之间的换算恒等式，使不同分词器报告的困惑度可以相互比较，而不必重训模型。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 9.7（分词器间的换算因子）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau,\\tau'$</span> 为同一字符串空间上的两个分词映射，对给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 定义换算因子</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\kappa_{\\tau,\\tau'}(s)=\\frac{|\\tau(s)|_t}{|\\tau'(s)|_t}=\\frac{\\rho_\\tau(s)}{\\rho_{\\tau'}(s)}.$$</div>\n<p>由 (A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_{\\tau,\\tau'}(s)\\in[\\rho_{\\min}/\\rho_{\\max},\\,\\rho_{\\max}/\\rho_{\\min}]$</span>，故换算因子一致有界且远离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.8（换算恒等式）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A4) 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau,\\tau'$</span> 均满足 (A2)；且在同一模型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 下两分词给出相同的总负对数似然，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_\\theta(\\tau(s))=\\ell_\\theta(\\tau'(s))$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log \\mathrm{PPL}_\\theta^{\\tau}(s)-\\log \\mathrm{PPL}_\\theta^{\\tau'}(s)=\\log\\kappa_{\\tau,\\tau'}(s).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 9.2 分别写出两式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log \\mathrm{PPL}_\\theta^{\\tau}(s)=\\frac{\\ell_\\theta(\\tau(s))}{|\\tau(s)|_t},\\qquad\n\\log \\mathrm{PPL}_\\theta^{\\tau'}(s)=\\frac{\\ell_\\theta(\\tau'(s))}{|\\tau'(s)|_t}.$$</div>\n<p>在总似然相等假设下，右端分子相同，记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span>。作差：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log \\mathrm{PPL}_\\theta^{\\tau}(s)-\\log \\mathrm{PPL}_\\theta^{\\tau'}(s)=L\\Big(\\frac{1}{|\\tau(s)|_t}-\\frac{1}{|\\tau'(s)|_t}\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>此式一般不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\kappa$</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 未消去。故需附加条件使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 与词元数成比例，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L=c\\,|\\tau(s)|_t=c\\,|\\tau'(s)|_t$</span> 对某常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 成立——这恰是“每词元平均负对数似然相同”的情形。在此附加条件下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\mathrm{PPL}^\\tau=c$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\mathrm{PPL}^{\\tau'}=c$</span>，差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\kappa$</span> 一般非零，命题不成立。因此原陈述需要精确表述为如下形式。</p>\n<p><strong>修正命题 9.8（换算恒等式，正确形式）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：同前，但改为假设两分词下<strong>每词元平均负对数似然相同</strong>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_\\theta(\\tau(s))/|\\tau(s)|_t=\\ell_\\theta(\\tau'(s))/|\\tau'(s)|_t=:\\lambda$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：两分词报告的困惑度相等，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{PPL}_\\theta^{\\tau}(s)=\\mathrm{PPL}_\\theta^{\\tau'}(s)=e^{\\lambda}$</span>，与换算因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 无关。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由假设直接得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\mathrm{PPL}^\\tau=\\lambda=\\log\\mathrm{PPL}^{\\tau'}$</span>，取指数即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>修正命题说明：<strong>词元级困惑度在“每词元平均似然相同”的意义下是分词器不变量</strong>；真正随分词器变化的是总似然 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_\\theta$</span> 与词元数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\tau(s)|_t$</span> 的乘积结构。这与推论 9.3 的弹性结论一致——只有当总似然不变时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 的变化才直接转化为困惑度变化；当每词元平均似然不变时，困惑度对分词器中性。两种极端之间的插值由下式给出。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 9.9（一般换算公式）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：同命题 9.2 与 (A2)。<strong>结论</strong>：对任意两分词 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau,\\tau'$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log \\mathrm{PPL}_\\theta^{\\tau}(s)=\\kappa_{\\tau,\\tau'}(s)^{-1}\\cdot\\frac{\\ell_\\theta(\\tau(s))}{\\ell_\\theta(\\tau'(s))}\\cdot\\log \\mathrm{PPL}_\\theta^{\\tau'}(s).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 9.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\mathrm{PPL}^\\tau=\\ell_\\theta(\\tau(s))/|\\tau(s)|_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\mathrm{PPL}^{\\tau'}=\\ell_\\theta(\\tau'(s))/|\\tau'(s)|_t$</span>。两式相除：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\log\\mathrm{PPL}^\\tau}{\\log\\mathrm{PPL}^{\\tau'}}=\\frac{\\ell_\\theta(\\tau(s))}{\\ell_\\theta(\\tau'(s))}\\cdot\\frac{|\\tau'(s)|_t}{|\\tau(s)|_t}=\\frac{\\ell_\\theta(\\tau(s))}{\\ell_\\theta(\\tau'(s))}\\cdot\\kappa_{\\tau,\\tau'}(s)^{-1}.$$</div>\n<p>移项即得所述恒等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该推论把两分词困惑度之比分解为两个因子：<strong>似然比</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_\\theta(\\tau)/\\ell_\\theta(\\tau')$</span> 与<strong>换算因子的倒数</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa^{-1}$</span>。前者反映模型在两分词下总似然的差异（信息损失来源），后者反映归一化分母的差异（量纲来源）。这为 9.5 小节的三来源分解提供了定量骨架：量纲来源对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa^{-1}$</span>，信息损失来源对应似然比偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的部分，合并步数来源则通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 的变化进入。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-9-7-困惑度差异的非负性判据\">9.7 困惑度差异的非负性判据<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-9-7-困惑度差异的非负性判据\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 9.4 给出字符级交叉熵的下界，但未直接回答：<strong>在什么条件下，粗粒度分词的词元级困惑度必然不低于细粒度分词？</strong> 本小节给出充分判据。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.10（粗粒化困惑度非降的充分条件）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)、(A4) 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 为细粒度分词，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau'$</span> 为粗粒度分词，且对给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\tau'(s)|_t\\le|\\tau(s)|_t$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_{\\tau'}\\le\\rho_\\tau$</span>）。<strong>结论</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_\\theta(\\tau'(s))\\ge\\ell_\\theta(\\tau(s))\\cdot\\kappa_{\\tau,\\tau'}(s)^{-1}$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{PPL}_\\theta^{\\tau'}(s)\\ge\\mathrm{PPL}_\\theta^{\\tau}(s).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 9.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\mathrm{PPL}^{\\tau'}=\\ell_\\theta(\\tau')/|\\tau'|_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\mathrm{PPL}^{\\tau}=\\ell_\\theta(\\tau)/|\\tau|_t$</span>。要证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\mathrm{PPL}^{\\tau'}\\ge\\log\\mathrm{PPL}^{\\tau}$</span>，等价于</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\ell_\\theta(\\tau')}{|\\tau'|_t}\\ge\\frac{\\ell_\\theta(\\tau)}{|\\tau|_t}\n\\iff \\ell_\\theta(\\tau')\\ge\\ell_\\theta(\\tau)\\cdot\\frac{|\\tau'|_t}{|\\tau|_t}=\\ell_\\theta(\\tau)\\cdot\\kappa_{\\tau,\\tau'}(s)^{-1}.$$</div>\n<p>最后一步用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=|\\tau|_t/|\\tau'|_t$</span>。故所述条件恰为所需。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>解读</strong>：条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_\\theta(\\tau')\\ge\\ell_\\theta(\\tau)/\\kappa$</span> 的含义是——粗粒度分词的总负对数似然不能比细粒度分词小太多；具体地，其每词元平均负对数似然不得低于细粒度分词的每词元平均负对数似然。若粗粒度分词因合并而“更自信”（总似然反而更大），则词元级困惑度可能下降，此时量纲效应被似然效应抵消。这解释了为何在某些模型上增大词表反而降低报告困惑度：合并带来的似然增益超过了分母缩小的惩罚。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 9.11（BPE 合并的困惑度单调性判据）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：同命题 9.10，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau'$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 经一次 BPE 合并得到，合并的对为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,b)$</span>，合并后词元记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(ab)\\le p_\\theta(a)\\,p_\\theta(b\\mid a)$</span>（即合并后词元的概率不超过其分解概率之积），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{PPL}^{\\tau'}\\ge\\mathrm{PPL}^{\\tau}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：一次合并使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\tau'|_t=|\\tau|_t-1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa^{-1}=|\\tau'|_t/|\\tau|_t=(|\\tau|_t-1)/|\\tau|_t&lt;1$</span>。总负对数似然的变化为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\ell_\\theta(\\tau')-\\ell_\\theta(\\tau)=-\\log p_\\theta(ab)+\\log p_\\theta(a)+\\log p_\\theta(b\\mid a).$$</div>\n<p>由假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(ab)\\le p_\\theta(a)p_\\theta(b\\mid a)$</span>，取负对数得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log p_\\theta(ab)\\ge-\\log p_\\theta(a)-\\log p_\\theta(b\\mid a)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_\\theta(\\tau')-\\ell_\\theta(\\tau)\\ge0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_\\theta(\\tau')\\ge\\ell_\\theta(\\tau)$</span>。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa^{-1}&lt;1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_\\theta(\\tau')\\ge\\ell_\\theta(\\tau)&gt;\\ell_\\theta(\\tau)\\kappa^{-1}$</span>，满足命题 9.10 的条件，结论成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 9.11 把命题 9.10 的条件翻译为对单次合并的概率约束：<strong>若合并后词元的概率不超过其组成部分概率之积，则合并必然抬高词元级困惑度</strong>。此条件在 BPE 训练初期通常成立（合并对尚未被模型充分学习），在训练充分后可能失效（模型学会给合并词元更高概率），此时困惑度可能因合并而下降。这为“分词对困惑度的系统性影响”提供了方向性判据，而非仅量纲换算。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-9-8-数值验证-换算恒等式与单调性判据\">9.8 数值验证：换算恒等式与单调性判据<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-9-8-数值验证-换算恒等式与单调性判据\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码验证修正命题 9.8、推论 9.9 与推论 9.11，并打印各量的形状与预期值。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import math\n\ndef ppl(ll: float, n: int) -&gt; float:\n    assert n &gt;= 1\n    return math.exp(ll / n)\n\n# 修正命题 9.8：每词元平均似然相同 -&gt; 困惑度相等\nlam = math.log(2.0)          # 每词元平均负对数似然\nn1, n2 = 3, 1\nll1, ll2 = lam * n1, lam * n2\nassert abs(ppl(ll1, n1) - ppl(ll2, n2)) &lt; 1e-12\n\n# 推论 9.9：一般换算公式\nll_a, n_a = 3 * math.log(2.0), 3   # 细粒度\nll_b, n_b = 2 * math.log(2.0), 1   # 粗粒度\nkappa = n_a / n_b                   # = 3\nlhs = math.log(ppl(ll_a, n_a))\nrhs = (1.0 / kappa) * (ll_a / ll_b) * math.log(ppl(ll_b, n_b))\nassert abs(lhs - rhs) &lt; 1e-12\n\n# 推论 9.11：合并后概率不超过分解概率之积 -&gt; 困惑度非降\np_a, p_b_given_a, p_ab = 0.5, 0.5, 0.2   # p_ab &lt;= p_a * p_b_given_a = 0.25\nassert p_ab &lt;= p_a * p_b_given_a\nll_fine = -(math.log(p_a) + math.log(p_b_given_a))   # 细粒度总负对数似然\nll_coarse = -math.log(p_ab)                          # 粗粒度总负对数似然\nassert ll_coarse &gt;= ll_fine\nassert ppl(ll_coarse, 1) &gt;= ppl(ll_fine, 2)\n\nprint(&quot;shapes: scalars; kappa =&quot;, kappa)\nprint(&quot;ppl_fine, ppl_coarse =&quot;, ppl(ll_fine, 2), ppl(ll_coarse, 1))\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>shapes: scalars; kappa = 3.0</code>，<code>ppl_fine, ppl_coarse = 2.0 5.0</code>。所有 <code>assert</code> 通过，验证了换算恒等式与单调性判据在具体数值上的成立。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-9-9-与信息损失下界的联合约束\">9.9 与信息损失下界的联合约束<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-9-9-与信息损失下界的联合约束\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后把量纲来源与信息损失来源合并为一个联合约束，作为本节向后续“词表规模与参数量的权衡”节的接口。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.12（困惑度与互信息的联合下界）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A3)、(A4) 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 为字符级变量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau(X)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 为模型输出，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Y\\to Z$</span> 为马尔可夫链；且模型在词元级上的交叉熵为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid Z)$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(X\\mid Z)\\ge H(X)-I(X;Y),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{PPL}_\\theta^{\\tau}(X)\\ge\\exp\\!\\big(H(Y\\mid Z)/\\mathbb{E}[|\\tau(X)|_t]\\big),$$</div>\n<p>且两式联立给出字符级困惑度的下界</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{PPL}^{c}(X)\\ge\\exp\\!\\Big(\\frac{H(X)-I(X;Y)}{\\mathbb{E}[|X|_c]}\\Big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：第一式即命题 9.4 的第二式。第二式：词元级困惑度定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(\\ell_\\theta/|\\tau(X)|_t)$</span> 的期望，由 Jensen 不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\exp(\\ell/|\\tau|)\\ge\\exp(\\mathbb{E}[\\ell/|\\tau|])$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\ell]/\\mathbb{E}[|\\tau|]\\ge H(Y\\mid Z)/\\mathbb{E}[|\\tau|]$</span>（交叉熵不小于条件熵），故得第二式。第三式：字符级交叉熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Z)$</span> 与字符级困惑度满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{PPL}^c=\\exp(H(X\\mid Z)/\\mathbb{E}[|X|_c])$</span>，代入第一式即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 9.12 把两条线索拧成一股：<strong>分词率决定分母，互信息决定分子下界</strong>。词表越大，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)$</span> 越大，字符级下界越紧，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[|\\tau|_t]$</span> 越小，词元级困惑度越高；词表越小则反之。这一权衡的显式形式即为后续节“词表规模与参数量的权衡”的出发点，本节只给出约束，不展开优化。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ar08--h-反例-同一字符串的不同分词导致不同概率\">反例：同一字符串的不同分词导致不同概率<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-反例-同一字符串的不同分词导致不同概率\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已定义的符号：字母表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma$</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 为全体有限字符串之集，词表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V\\subset\\Sigma^*$</span> 有限且不含空串，分词映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau:\\Sigma^*\\to V^*$</span> 为满射但一般不单射（第 1 节）。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的像空间为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{T}=\\tau(\\Sigma^*)\\subseteq V^*$</span>。给定语言模型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 定义在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*$</span> 上（第 9 节已讨论其对困惑度的影响），对字符串 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in\\Sigma^*$</span> 诱导的概率为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$P_\\theta(s)=\\sum_{t\\in\\tau^{-1}(s)}p_\\theta(t),$$</div>\n<p>即对所有分词原像求和。本节固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，省略下标，写 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(s)$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节所需假设如下，逐条编号以便后文拆解：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>(A1) 可测性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*$</span> 上取离散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2^{V^*}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p:V^*\\to[0,1]$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{t\\in V^*}p(t)=1$</span>。离散性使一切求和绝对收敛，无需可积性额外假设。</li>\n<li><strong>(A2) 原像有限性</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in\\Sigma^*$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{-1}(s)$</span> 为有限集。此假设在本节情境下成立：因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 中每个词长度不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{\\max}=\\max_{v\\in V}|v|$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|s|=n$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\tau^{-1}(s)|\\le L_{\\max}^{n}$</span>，有限。</li>\n<li><strong>(A3) 归一性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$P(s)=\\sum_{t\\in\\tau^{-1}(s)}p(t)$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{s\\in\\Sigma^*}P(s)=1$</span>。由 (A1)(A2) 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 满射到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{T}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\tau^{-1}(s)\\}_{s}$</span> 构成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*$</span> 的一个划分（每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 恰属于一个原像，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(t)$</span> 唯一），Fubini 对有限和成立，故 (A3) 自动成立。</li>\n<li><strong>(A4) 分词歧义存在性</strong>：存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in\\Sigma^*$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\tau^{-1}(s)|\\ge 2$</span>。这是本节反例的非平凡性前提；若对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 都有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\tau^{-1}(s)|=1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 单射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P(s)=p(\\tau^{-1}(s))$</span>，无歧义可言。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节的核心断言是：即便 (A1)–(A3) 全部成立、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 是同一个分布，不同分词映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1,\\tau_2$</span> 可以给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\tau_1}(s)\\neq P_{\\tau_2}(s)$</span>。这不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的缺陷，而是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的非单射性把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*$</span> 上的质量重新分配到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 上的必然结果。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-反例构造-两个分词映射与同一字符串\">反例构造：两个分词映射与同一字符串<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-反例构造-两个分词映射与同一字符串\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma=\\{a,b\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=abab$</span>。构造两个词表：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$V_1=\\{a,b,ab\\},\\qquad V_2=\\{a,b,ba\\}.$$</div>\n<p>对应两个分词映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1,\\tau_2$</span> 均由“最长匹配、从左至右”规则确定（第 6 节已定义该规则；此处只需其确定性）。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=abab$</span>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1$</span> 的最长匹配：首位置 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_1$</span> 中且长于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span>；剩余 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span>，再取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1^{-1}(s)=\\{(ab,ab)\\}$</span>，唯一。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2$</span> 的最长匹配：首位置 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab\\notin V_2$</span>，只能取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span>；剩余 <span class=\"math-inline\">$bab$</span>，首位置 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ba\\in V_2$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ba$</span>；剩余 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2^{-1}(s)=\\{(a,ba,b)\\}$</span>，唯一。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>两个映射给出不同的唯一分词。现在定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_1^*$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_2^*$</span> 上的分布。为使比较有意义，取同一“逐词条件”生成机制：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_2$</span> 的共有词 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{a,b\\}$</span> 上单步概率相同，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(a)=0.6$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(b)=0.4$</span>；对各自特有词 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$V_1$</span>）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ba$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$V_2$</span>），设其单步概率分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_1(ab)=0.5$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_2(ba)=0.5$</span>，并相应归一化。具体地，令</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_1(ab,ab)=q_1(ab)^2=0.25,\\qquad p_2(a,ba,b)=q(a)\\,q_2(ba)\\,q(b)=0.6\\times0.5\\times0.4=0.12.$$</div>\n<p>其余质量分配到其他序列使总和为 1（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1$</span> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.75$</span> 分给含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a,b$</span> 的序列，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_2$</span> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.88$</span> 分给其余序列）。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$P_{\\tau_1}(abab)=p_1(ab,ab)=0.25,\\qquad P_{\\tau_2}(abab)=p_2(a,ba,b)=0.12.$$</div>\n<p>同一字符串、同一“单步条件”设定，诱导概率不同。差异来源不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的归一化，而是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1$</span> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$abab$</span> 压成 2 个 token、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2$</span> 压成 3 个 token，二者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*$</span> 上占据不同序列，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在这些序列上的质量本就不同。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（分词依赖的反例）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2)(A4) 成立，且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1^{-1}(s)\\cap\\tau_2^{-1}(s)=\\varnothing$</span> 且两个原像各自非空。<strong>证明</strong>：由上构造，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1^{-1}(abab)=\\{(ab,ab)\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2^{-1}(abab)=\\{(a,ba,b)\\}$</span>，交集为空。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1,p_2$</span> 如上，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\tau_1}(s)=0.25\\neq0.12=P_{\\tau_2}(s)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>注意命题 1 不违反 (A3)：两个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 各自在自己的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 上归一，只是同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 处取值不同。这正说明“字符串概率”不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 的内蕴量，而是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\tau,p)$</span> 的联合产物。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-拆解假设-A2-原像无限时求和发散\">拆解假设 (A2)：原像无限时求和发散<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-拆解假设-A2-原像无限时求和发散\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>若放弃 (A2)，即允许 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 含任意长词或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 允许空串插入，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{-1}(s)$</span> 可数无限。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(s)=\\sum_{t\\in\\tau^{-1}(s)}p(t)$</span> 的绝对收敛性不再由有限性保证，需 (A1) 之外的可积性条件。构造：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V=\\{a,aa,aaa,\\dots\\}\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 允许在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=a$</span> 中插入任意多个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=a^k$</span> 的任意组合。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{-1}(a)$</span> 可数无限。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(a^k\\varepsilon^m)=c\\cdot 2^{-(k+m)}$</span> 归一化后，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{t\\in\\tau^{-1}(a)}p(t)$</span> 为可数正项和，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 衰减不够快则发散，(A3) 失效，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 不再是概率。<strong>结论</strong>：(A2) 不是技术便利，而是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 良定义的必要条件；第 12 节可逆性条件将给出更精确的刻画。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-拆解假设-A4-单射时概率无歧义\">拆解假设 (A4)：单射时概率无歧义<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-拆解假设-A4-单射时概率无歧义\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>若 (A4) 失效，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 单射，则每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的原像至多一个元素，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P(s)=p(\\tau^{-1}(s))$</span>（若原像为空则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(s)=0$</span>）。此时不同分词映射若都单射且像相同，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 一致。这说明歧义完全来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的非单射性，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的具体形式无关。第 1 节已证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 满射但一般不单射；(A4) 是把“一般不单射”具体化为本节反例的实例。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-定量估计-歧义造成的概率质量重分配\">定量估计：歧义造成的概率质量重分配<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-定量估计-歧义造成的概率质量重分配\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 有两个分词 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_1,t_2\\in\\tau^{-1}(s)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t_1\\neq t_2$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$P(s)=p(t_1)+p(t_2)+\\sum_{t\\in\\tau^{-1}(s)\\setminus\\{t_1,t_2\\}}p(t).$$</div>\n<p>若改用只识别 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_1$</span> 的映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau'$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau'^{-1}(s)=\\{t_1\\}$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\tau'}(s)=p(t_1)$</span>。差值</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta=P_{\\tau}(s)-P_{\\tau'}(s)=p(t_2)+\\sum_{t\\in\\tau^{-1}(s)\\setminus\\{t_1,t_2\\}}p(t)\\ge p(t_2).$$</div>\n<p>在反例中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=0.25-0.12=0.13$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_2(a,ba,b)=0.12$</span> 是“被另一分词抢走的质量”。一般地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\tau^{-1}(s)|=k$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(s)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*$</span> 序列概率之和，而任一单射细化映射只取其中一项；差额至少为其余 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k-1$</span> 项之和。这给出<strong>命题 2</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2)(A4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\tau^{-1}(s)|=k\\ge2$</span>。<strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ge0$</span> 及求和定义直接得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\ge\\sum_{i\\ge2}p(t_i)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-正确表述需补的条件-分词不变性\">正确表述需补的条件：分词不变性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-正确表述需补的条件-分词不变性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>要使“字符串概率”在分词选择下不变，需补充条件：对任意两个分词映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1,\\tau_2$</span> 及任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{t\\in\\tau_1^{-1}(s)}p_1(t)=\\sum_{t\\in\\tau_2^{-1}(s)}p_2(t)$</span>。这等价于要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1,p_2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1,\\tau_2$</span> 诱导的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 前推测度下一致，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\tau_1)_\\#p_1=(\\tau_2)_\\#p_2$</span>。第 3 节的数据处理不等式给出该等式的信息论代价：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Y\\to Z$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau(X)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)\\le I(X;Y)$</span>，等号仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 的充分统计量。分词映射一般不是充分统计量，故等号不成立，这正是反例的 information-theoretic 根源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-反例的强化-同一字符串-同一-p-不同-tau-造成符号翻转\">反例的强化：同一字符串、同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>、不同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 造成符号翻转<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-反例的强化-同一字符串-同一-p-不同-tau-造成符号翻转\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上述反例中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1,p_2$</span> 分属不同词表，读者可能质疑“概率不同源于分布不同而非分词不同”。本节补一个更强的反例：固定单一分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在公共词表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V=\\{a,b,ab,ba\\}$</span> 上，仅改变分词映射的合并优先级（第 4 节 BPE 的合并准则决定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>），使同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的诱导概率发生符号翻转。这排除“<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 不同”这一混淆变量。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*$</span> 上分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 由逐词条件给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(a)=q(b)=0.4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(ab)=q(ba)=0.1$</span>，且设序列概率为逐词概率之积（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为无记忆乘积测度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*$</span> 上的限制，归一化到有限长序列）。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=abab$</span>。考虑两个分词映射：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{L}}$</span>：优先合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{L}}^{-1}(abab)=\\{(ab,ab)\\}$</span>，唯一，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\mathrm{L}}(abab)=q(ab)^2=0.01$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{R}}$</span>：优先合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ba$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{R}}^{-1}(abab)=\\{(a,ba,b)\\}$</span>，唯一，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\mathrm{R}}(abab)=q(a)q(ba)q(b)=0.4\\times0.1\\times0.4=0.016$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\mathrm{L}}&lt;P_{\\mathrm{R}}$</span>，符号由分词优先级决定，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 完全相同。<strong>命题 3</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2)(A4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{L}},\\tau_{\\mathrm{R}}$</span> 为两个不同分词映射且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{L}}^{-1}(s)\\cap\\tau_{\\mathrm{R}}^{-1}(s)=\\varnothing$</span>。<strong>证明</strong>：直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(ab)^2=0.01&lt;0.016=q(a)q(ba)q(b)$</span>，两原像不交由最长匹配规则保证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该反例说明：即便固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，分词映射的选择本身就是一个自由参数，它改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 上的前推测度。第 4 节 BPE 的贪心合并准则（每次合并频率最大的相邻对）正是决定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的机制；改变合并顺序即改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>，从而改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span>。这不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的估计误差，而是模型类的结构性自由度。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-分词映射的纤维结构与质量分配算子\">分词映射的纤维结构与质量分配算子<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-分词映射的纤维结构与质量分配算子\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>把上述观察抽象为算子。对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>，定义<strong>质量分配算子</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_\\tau:\\ell^1(V^*)\\to\\ell^1(\\Sigma^*)$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(A_\\tau p)(s)=\\sum_{t\\in\\tau^{-1}(s)}p(t).$$</div>\n<p>由 (A2) 原像有限，(A1) 绝对可和，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A_\\tau$</span> 是良定义的线性算子，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|A_\\tau p\\|_1=\\|p\\|_1$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\tau^{-1}(s)\\}_s$</span> 构成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*$</span> 的划分，Fubini 对可数划分成立，此处用 Tonelli 非负可和）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_\\tau$</span> 是保 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell^1$</span> 范数的压缩型算子，把概率单纯形映入概率单纯形。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（纤维重分配恒等式）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1,\\tau_2$</span> 为两分词映射。<strong>证明</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(A_{\\tau_1}p)(s)-(A_{\\tau_2}p)(s)=\\sum_{t\\in\\tau_1^{-1}(s)}p(t)-\\sum_{t\\in\\tau_2^{-1}(s)}p(t).$$</div>\n<p>将两和式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*$</span> 上作对称差分解：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U=\\tau_1^{-1}(s)\\setminus\\tau_2^{-1}(s)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W=\\tau_2^{-1}(s)\\setminus\\tau_1^{-1}(s)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C=\\tau_1^{-1}(s)\\cap\\tau_2^{-1}(s)$</span>。则差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{t\\in U}p(t)-\\sum_{t\\in W}p(t)$</span>。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ge0$</span>，差的符号由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U,W$</span> 上的质量和决定。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4 给出反例的一般机制：<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\tau_1}(s)\\neq P_{\\tau_2}(s)$</span> 当且仅当对称差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\cup W$</span> 上两测度质量不等。反例中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U=\\{(ab,ab)\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W=\\{(a,ba,b)\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C=\\varnothing$</span>，故差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.01-0.016=-0.006$</span>，符号为负。这比命题 2 的差额下界更精细：它给出<strong>有符号</strong>的差，而不仅是绝对值下界。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-与数据处理不等式的接口-等号条件的失效\">与数据处理不等式的接口：等号条件的失效<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-与数据处理不等式的接口-等号条件的失效\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 3 节已证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Y\\to Z\\Rightarrow I(X;Z)\\le I(X;Y)$</span>。在本节情境中取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 为字符串（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 上某分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau(X)$</span> 为分词，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=\\tau'(X)$</span> 为另一分词。数据处理不等式给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)\\le I(X;Y)$</span>，但<strong>不</strong>给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)=I(X;Y)$</span>。等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 的充分统计量，即存在可测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=g(Y)$</span> a.s.。分词映射一般不是充分统计量：反例中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{L}}(abab)=(ab,ab)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{R}}(abab)=(a,ba,b)$</span> 互不为函数，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 不能由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 恢复，等号不成立。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（等号失效的定量刻画）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 上分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\sim\\mu$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau_1(X)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=\\tau_2(X)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1^{-1}(s)\\cap\\tau_2^{-1}(s)=\\varnothing$</span> 对某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu(s)&gt;0$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 成立。<strong>证明</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=g(Y)$</span> a.s.，则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2(s)=g(\\tau_1(s))$</span>。但反例中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=abab$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1(s)=(ab,ab)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2(s)=(a,ba,b)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu(abab)&gt;0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(ab,ab)$</span> 处须取值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,ba,b)$</span>，而在其他 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s'$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1(s')=(ab,ab)$</span> 可能对应不同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2(s')$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 无定义或矛盾。因此不存在这样的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span>，等号不成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)&lt;I(X;Y)$</span> 严格。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这解释了第 3 节数据处理不等式在本节反例中的角色：它给出信息损失的上界方向，但<strong>不</strong>保证损失为零；反例正是损失严格为正的实例。第 14 节将用互信息的数值估计测量该损失。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-边界情形-分词映射的复合与信息单调性\">边界情形：分词映射的复合与信息单调性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-边界情形-分词映射的复合与信息单调性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>考虑三个分词映射的复合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_3=\\tau_2\\circ\\tau_1$</span>（先 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1$</span> 再 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2$</span>，要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2$</span> 定义在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_1^*$</span> 上）。由数据处理不等式的链式形式，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;\\tau_3(X))\\le I(X;\\tau_2(\\tau_1(X)))\\le I(X;\\tau_1(X)).$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 6（复合的单调信息损失）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1:\\Sigma^*\\to V_1^*$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2:V_1^*\\to V_2^*$</span> 均为满射。<strong>证明</strong>：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau_1(X)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=\\tau_2(Y)=\\tau_3(X)$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Y\\to Z$</span> 构成 Markov 链（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span>），数据处理不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)\\le I(X;Y)$</span> 成立。再对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_3$</span> 直接应用得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;\\tau_3(X))\\le I(X;Y)$</span>。两级不等式给出链式单调性。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题的边界情形是：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_1^*$</span> 上单射，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)=I(X;Y)$</span>，复合不增损失；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2$</span> 非单射，则损失严格增大。这与第 12 节可逆性条件直接衔接：分词器的可逆性等价于其纤维单点，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 单射，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_\\tau$</span> 为置换型算子，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P(s)=p(\\tau^{-1}(s))$</span> 无歧义。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-反例的失效边界-何时不同分词给出相同概率\">反例的失效边界：何时不同分词给出相同概率<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-反例的失效边界-何时不同分词给出相同概率\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后刻画反例不成立的充分条件，以明确本节结论的适用范围。<strong>命题 7</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1,\\tau_2$</span> 满足对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1^{-1}(s)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2^{-1}(s)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 下等质量，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{t\\in\\tau_1^{-1}(s)}p(t)=\\sum_{t\\in\\tau_2^{-1}(s)}p(t)$</span>。<strong>证明</strong>：由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\tau_1}(s)=P_{\\tau_2}(s)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 成立，故两前推测度相等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该条件等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\tau_1)_\\#p=(\\tau_2)_\\#p$</span>，即两分词映射在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 下诱导相同的前推测度。反例中此条件被违反：<span class=\"math-inline\">$0.01\\neq0.016$</span>。命题 7 说明反例不是“必然”的，而是“一般”的：存在特殊 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 使不同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 给出相同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span>（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在对称差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\cup W$</span> 上质量相等）。这为第 11 节词表规模与参数量的权衡提供边界：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 恰好使分词不变，则词表选择不影响字符串概率，但一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 不满足此对称性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-反例的谱系-从单点歧义到纤维维数\">反例的谱系：从单点歧义到纤维维数<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-反例的谱系-从单点歧义到纤维维数\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1 与命题 3 的反例均落在“原像不交”这一最尖锐的边界上，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1^{-1}(s)\\cap\\tau_2^{-1}(s)=\\varnothing$</span>。更一般的情形是两纤维部分重叠，此时质量差的符号由对称差决定（命题 4）。为把反例的谱系补全，引入<strong>纤维重叠度</strong></p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\kappa(s)=\\frac{|\\tau_1^{-1}(s)\\cap\\tau_2^{-1}(s)|}{\\max\\{|\\tau_1^{-1}(s)|,|\\tau_2^{-1}(s)|\\}}\\in[0,1],$$</div>\n<p>分母非零由 (A4) 保证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=0$</span> 对应命题 1、3 的不交反例；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=1$</span> 对应两纤维相同，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\tau_1}(s)=P_{\\tau_2}(s)$</span> 恒成立，反例退化。中间值给出部分重叠的反例。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（重叠度与质量差的上界）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1,\\tau_2$</span> 为两分词映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*$</span> 上分布，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\max}=\\max_{t\\in V^*}p(t)$</span>。<strong>证明</strong>：由命题 4 的对称差分解，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bigl|P_{\\tau_1}(s)-P_{\\tau_2}(s)\\bigr|\\le\\sum_{t\\in U\\cup W}p(t)\\le p_{\\max}\\,|U\\cup W|,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U=\\tau_1^{-1}(s)\\setminus\\tau_2^{-1}(s)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W=\\tau_2^{-1}(s)\\setminus\\tau_1^{-1}(s)$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 的定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|U|=|\\tau_1^{-1}(s)|-|\\tau_1^{-1}(s)\\cap\\tau_2^{-1}(s)|$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|W|$</span> 同理，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|U\\cup W|\\le|\\tau_1^{-1}(s)|+|\\tau_2^{-1}(s)|-2\\kappa(s)\\max\\{|\\tau_1^{-1}(s)|,|\\tau_2^{-1}(s)|\\}$</span>。代入得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bigl|P_{\\tau_1}(s)-P_{\\tau_2}(s)\\bigr|\\le p_{\\max}\\bigl(|\\tau_1^{-1}(s)|+|\\tau_2^{-1}(s)|-2\\kappa(s)\\max\\{|\\tau_1^{-1}(s)|,|\\tau_2^{-1}(s)|\\}\\bigr).$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\tau_1^{-1}(s)|=|\\tau_2^{-1}(s)|=1$</span> 时，上界退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2p_{\\max}$</span>，与反例中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|0.01-0.016|=0.006\\le 2\\times0.4=0.8$</span> 相容（此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\max}=0.4$</span> 来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(a)$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题把反例的“尖锐性”量化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 与纤维大小：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 越小、纤维越大，质量差的上界越松，反例越容易构造。命题 1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=0$</span>、纤维大小均为 1，是上界最紧的极端；命题 3 同样 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=0$</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\max}$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(ab)=0.1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(a)=0.4$</span> 共同决定，故实际差更小。这解释了为何强化反例的数值差（<span class=\"math-inline\">$0.006$</span>）小于原始反例（<span class=\"math-inline\">$0.13$</span>）：前者 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\max}$</span> 更大但纤维更短，后者纤维更长但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\max}$</span> 更小。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-分词映射的格结构与反例的极值定位\">分词映射的格结构与反例的极值定位<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-分词映射的格结构与反例的极值定位\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已把 BPE 的贪心合并刻画为词表缩减序列（第 4 节：每次合并使词表减少 1）。把这一结构抽象为<strong>分词格</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{T}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 上全体满足 (A2) 的分词映射之集，定义偏序 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1\\preceq\\tau_2$</span> 当且仅当对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1^{-1}(s)\\subseteq\\tau_2^{-1}(s)$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1$</span> 的纤维更粗，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2$</span> 更细）。此偏序使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{T}$</span> 成为格：任意两元素的交与并由纤维的交与并给出，且由 (A2) 有限性保证交并仍满足 (A2)。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（格上的质量单调性）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1\\preceq\\tau_2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ge0$</span>。<strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1^{-1}(s)\\subseteq\\tau_2^{-1}(s)$</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ge0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$P_{\\tau_1}(s)=\\sum_{t\\in\\tau_1^{-1}(s)}p(t)\\le\\sum_{t\\in\\tau_2^{-1}(s)}p(t)=P_{\\tau_2}(s).$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 9 给出反例的极值定位：在格中，最粗的分词（纤维最大）给出最大的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(s)$</span>，最细的分词（纤维最小，趋近单射）给出最小的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(s)$</span>。命题 1 的反例中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1^{-1}(abab)=\\{(ab,ab)\\}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2^{-1}(abab)=\\{(a,ba,b)\\}$</span> 不可比较（互不包含），故不在同一链上，质量差可正可负；命题 3 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\mathrm{L}},\\tau_{\\mathrm{R}}$</span> 同样不可比较。这说明反例的符号翻转恰发生在格的<strong>反链</strong>上，而非链上。若两分词映射可比，则由命题 9 质量差符号确定，不会翻转。这为第 12 节可逆性条件提供格论表述：可逆分词对应格的极小元（纤维单点），此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(s)=p(\\tau^{-1}(s))$</span> 且对任何更粗的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau'$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\tau'}(s)\\ge P_\\tau(s)$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-反例与困惑度的耦合-为何第-9-节的系统性影响不是单调的\">反例与困惑度的耦合：为何第 9 节的系统性影响不是单调的<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-反例与困惑度的耦合-为何第-9-节的系统性影响不是单调的\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 9 节已讨论分词对困惑度的系统性影响。本节反例给出一个边界情形，说明该影响<strong>不必</strong>是单调的：同一字符串在不同分词下概率可升可降，故困惑度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(-\\frac{1}{n}\\log P(s))$</span> 随分词选择非单调变化。取命题 3 的数值：<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\mathrm{L}}=0.01$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\mathrm{R}}=0.016$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n=4$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{PPL}_{\\mathrm{L}}=\\exp\\Bigl(-\\frac{1}{4}\\log 0.01\\Bigr)=e^{1.151}\\approx3.16,\\qquad \\mathrm{PPL}_{\\mathrm{R}}=\\exp\\Bigl(-\\frac{1}{4}\\log 0.016\\Bigr)=e^{1.036}\\approx2.82.$$</div>\n<p>故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{PPL}_{\\mathrm{L}}&gt;\\mathrm{PPL}_{\\mathrm{R}}$</span>，分词优先级改变使困惑度下降约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10.8\\%$</span>。<strong>命题 10</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\tau_1}(s),P_{\\tau_2}(s)&gt;0$</span>。<strong>证明</strong>：困惑度之比</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{PPL}_{\\tau_1}}{\\mathrm{PPL}_{\\tau_2}}=\\Bigl(\\frac{P_{\\tau_2}(s)}{P_{\\tau_1}(s)}\\Bigr)^{1/n}.$$</div>\n<p>由命题 4，比值由对称差质量决定，符号可正可负，故比值可大于或小于 1，非单调。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题的边界是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\tau}(s)=0$</span>：若某分词映射使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的原像为空（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 非满射到该 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\tau(s)=0$</span>，困惑度发散。第 1 节已证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 满射到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{T}$</span> 但未必满射到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 全体；字节级回退（第 7 节）正是为消除此边界而设，保证每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 至少有一个原像，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\tau(s)&gt;0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 全支撑成立。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-可计算的反例验证-有限状态枚举\">可计算的反例验证：有限状态枚举<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-可计算的反例验证-有限状态枚举\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>输出预期：<code>fibers: [('a', 'ba', 'b'), ('ab', 'ab')] count: 2</code>，<code>P: {('a', 'ba', 'b'): 0.016, ('ab', 'ab'): 0.01}</code>，断言全部通过。该代码同时验证了 (A2) 的有限性（纤维数为 2）与命题 3 的符号翻转，且不依赖任何外部库。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-反例的测度论边界-非离散词表时的失效\">反例的测度论边界：非离散词表时的失效<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-反例的测度论边界-非离散词表时的失效\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节全部构造依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 有限、<span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*$</span> 离散。若把词表推广为可数无限（如允许任意长词），则 (A2) 需替换为“纤维可数且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在纤维上可和”。构造：<span class=\"math-inline\">$V=\\{a^n:n\\ge1\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=a^N$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{-1}(a^N)$</span> 含所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a^{n_1}\\cdots a^{n_k}$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum n_i=N$</span>，其数目为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2^{N-1}$</span>（整数分拆），有限但随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 指数增长。此时命题 8 的上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\max}|U\\cup W|$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 指数膨胀，反例的数值差可任意大。<strong>命题 11</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 可数，纤维可数且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{t\\in\\tau^{-1}(s)}p(t)&lt;\\infty$</span>。<strong>证明</strong>：由 Tonelli 非负可和，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\tau(s)$</span> 良定义；若两纤维对称差上质量和不等，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\tau_1}(s)\\neq P_{\\tau_2}(s)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题说明 (A2) 的有限性只是充分条件而非必要条件；真正必要的是纤维上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的可和性。第 12 节可逆性条件将把这一点精确化为“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的纤维在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 下为原子”，即每个纤维承载有限质量。反例在非离散词表下依然成立，只是数值差不再有统一上界，需逐例计算。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>同一字符串在不同分词映射下诱导不同概率，根源是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的非单射性把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*$</span> 上的质量按不同方式分配到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span>；反例中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\tau_1}(abab)=0.25\\neq0.12=P_{\\tau_2}(abab)$</span>，且两原像不交。</li>\n<li>原像有限性 (A2) 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(s)=\\sum_{t\\in\\tau^{-1}(s)}p(t)$</span> 良定义的必要条件；放弃它可构造可数无限原像使求和发散、归一性失效。单射性 (A4) 失效则歧义消失，概率退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(\\tau^{-1}(s))$</span>。</li>\n<li>分词不变性需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\tau_1)_\\#p_1=(\\tau_2)_\\#p_2$</span>，由数据处理不等式知其一般不成；差额下界为被另一分词占据的质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{i\\ge2}p(t_i)$</span>，这为第 14 节数值测量信息损失提供了可计算的量。</li>\n<li>强化反例固定同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>、仅改分词优先级，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\mathrm{L}}(abab)=0.01&lt;0.016=P_{\\mathrm{R}}(abab)$</span>，符号翻转排除“分布不同”混淆；质量分配算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_\\tau$</span> 的纤维重分配恒等式给出有符号差的精确表达。</li>\n<li>数据处理不等式只给 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)\\le I(X;Y)$</span> 的方向，等号需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 的充分统计量；反例中原像不交使等号严格失效，复合映射的链式不等式给出损失单调增的边界。</li>\n<li>反例失效的充分条件是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\tau_1)_\\#p=(\\tau_2)_\\#p$</span>，即对称差上质量相等；一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 不满足，故分词选择是改变字符串概率的结构性自由度，与第 12 节可逆性条件和第 11 节词表权衡直接衔接。</li>\n<li>反例谱系由纤维重叠度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(s)$</span> 与纤维大小刻画：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=0$</span> 给出不交反例（命题 1、3），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=1$</span> 使反例退化；命题 8 给出质量差的上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\max}(|U|+|W|)$</span>，把尖锐性量化为可计算量。</li>\n<li>分词格上的质量单调性（命题 9）表明反例的符号翻转只发生在不可比较的反链上；可比分词的质量差符号确定，可逆分词对应格极小元，与第 12 节可逆性条件衔接。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"ar08--h-词表规模与参数量的权衡\">词表规模与参数量的权衡<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-词表规模与参数量的权衡\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>沿用前序各节已固定的符号：源字母表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma$</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\Sigma|=A$</span>；分词映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau:\\Sigma^*\\to V^*$</span> 满射但一般不单射，词表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|V|=K$</span>；嵌入维度记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>；语言模型在词元序列上的自回归分解记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(v_{1:n})=\\prod_{t=1}^{n}p_\\theta(v_t\\mid v_{&lt;t})$</span>，参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\Theta\\subseteq\\mathbb{R}^P$</span>。本节新引入两个符号，先定义如下。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 11.1（词表—参数预算）</strong> 设模型含一个词元嵌入矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K\\times d}$</span> 与一个输出投影矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d\\times K}$</span>（若权重绑定则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U=E^{\\top}$</span>，此时只计一次）。记除嵌入与投影外的主体参数数目为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\mathrm{body}}$</span>。则总参数量为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$P(K,d)=P_{\\mathrm{body}}+2Kd\\quad(\\text{不绑定}),\\qquad P(K,d)=P_{\\mathrm{body}}+Kd\\quad(\\text{绑定}).$$</div>\n<p><strong>定义 11.2（单位词元的平均码长）</strong> 对固定语料分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 诱导的词元序列长度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau(x)=|\\tau(x)|$</span>，定义平均码长</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar L(\\tau)=\\mathbb{E}_{x\\sim\\mu}\\big[L_\\tau(x)\\big],$$</div>\n<p>以及每词元承载的源字符数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(\\tau)=\\mathbb{E}_{x\\sim\\mu}\\big[|x|/L_\\tau(x)\\big]$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau(x)=0$</span> 时约定该项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，仅对非空 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 取期望）。</p>\n<p>本节所需的假设如下，逐条显式列出并在用到处引用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>(A1) 有限性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$A&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\mathrm{body}}&lt;\\infty$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>(A2) 可积性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{x\\sim\\mu}[|x|]&lt;\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{x\\sim\\mu}[L_\\tau(x)]&lt;\\infty$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar L(\\tau)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(\\tau)$</span> 有定义。</li>\n<li><strong>(A3) 正则性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(v_t\\mid v_{&lt;t})$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 连续可微，且存在与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{\\theta\\in\\Theta}\\sup_{v_{&lt;t}}|\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta(v_t\\mid v_{&lt;t})|\\le C$</span>，用于后文对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求导时交换期望与梯度（Leibniz 法则，被积函数被常数控制）。</li>\n<li><strong>(A4) 非退化</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span>-几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau(x)\\ge 1$</span>；且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(\\tau)&gt;0$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节只使用前序节已定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(\\cdot;\\cdot)$</span> 与 BPE 合并准则（频率最大的相邻对，每次合并使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|V|$</span> 减少 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>），不重复展开其证明。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-11-1-权衡的解析形式-两条竞争曲线\">11.1 权衡的解析形式：两条竞争曲线<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-11-1-权衡的解析形式-两条竞争曲线\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>固定语料 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 与分词器 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>，考虑把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_0$</span> 扩大到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_0+\\Delta K$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta K&gt;0$</span> 为整数）。由定义 11.2，扩大词表通常使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar L$</span> 下降：更长的词元覆盖更长的子串，序列变短。设平均码长的相对下降率为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\ell(K):=-\\frac{\\mathrm{d}\\log \\bar L(\\tau_K)}{\\mathrm{d}\\log K}\\ge 0,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_K$</span> 表示词表规模为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 的分词器族（例如 BPE 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 处的截断）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(K)$</span> 是词表扩容的<strong>收益弹性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 增加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1\\%$</span>，序列长度约减少 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(K)\\%$</span>。</p>\n<p>另一方面，由定义 11.1，参数量随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 线性增长：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}P}{\\mathrm{d}K}=2d\\ (\\text{不绑定}),\\qquad \\frac{\\mathrm{d}P}{\\mathrm{d}K}=d\\ (\\text{绑定}).$$</div>\n<p>于是“单位参数所换取的序列缩短”这一边际收益为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(K)/K$</span> 除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2d$</span>（或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>）。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(K)$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 递减（长尾词元覆盖率下降）时，存在一个内点使边际收益与边际成本相等。这就是本节要形式化的权衡。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 11.3（权衡的内点条件）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell:(0,\\infty)\\to[0,\\infty)$</span> 连续、严格递减，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{K\\to\\infty}\\ell(K)=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{K\\to 0^+}\\ell(K)=\\infty$</span>。定义净边际收益</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$g(K):=\\frac{\\ell(K)}{K}-\\lambda\\cdot 2d,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda&gt;0$</span> 为每单位参数量的影子价格（例如显存或算力约束的拉格朗日乘子）。则存在唯一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K^\\ast\\in(0,\\infty)$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(K^\\ast)=0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K^\\ast$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(K^\\ast)=2\\lambda d\\,K^\\ast$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 连续严格递减，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(K)/K$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,\\infty)$</span> 上连续。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\to 0^+$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(K)/K\\to\\infty$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(K)\\to\\infty$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\to 0$</span>）；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(K)/K\\to 0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(K)\\to 0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\to\\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell\\ge 0$</span> 故比值非负）。由介值定理存在零点。唯一性：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_1&lt;K_2$</span> 均为零点，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(K_1)/K_1=\\ell(K_2)/K_2=2\\lambda d$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 严格递减，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(K_1)&gt;\\ell(K_2)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(K_1)/K_1&gt;\\ell(K_2)/K_2$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_1&lt;K_2$</span> 且分子更大、分母更小），矛盾。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 11.3 的假设中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 严格递减与两端极限是<strong>建模假设</strong>，不是从 BPE 合并准则推出的定理；BPE 只保证每次合并使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|V|$</span> 减 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（本章 canonical claim），不保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 的单调性。这一点必须显式区分：命题 11.3 是条件性结论，其条件在 BPE 的实际曲线上通常近似成立（长尾效应），但本节不声称对任意语料成立。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-11-2-参数量分解恒等式\">11.2 参数量分解恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-11-2-参数量分解恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 11.4（参数—词表恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_1,K_2$</span> 与固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>，有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$P(K_2,d)-P(K_1,d)=c_d\\,d\\,(K_2-K_1),\\qquad c_d\\in\\{1,2\\},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_d=2$</span> 为不绑定、<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_d=1$</span> 为绑定。等价地，嵌入与投影参数占总参数的比例为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{P(K,d)-P_{\\mathrm{body}}}{P(K,d)}=\\frac{c_d Kd}{P_{\\mathrm{body}}+c_d Kd}.$$</div>\n<p><em>证明</em> 直接由定义 11.1 相减；比例式由分子分母同除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(K,d)$</span> 并代入定义得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 11.5（扩容的相对代价递减）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\mathrm{body}}&gt;0$</span>，则比例 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{c_d Kd}{P_{\\mathrm{body}}+c_d Kd}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 严格递增，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\to\\infty$</span> 时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；其关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 的导数为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}K}\\frac{c_d Kd}{P_{\\mathrm{body}}+c_d Kd}=\\frac{c_d d\\,P_{\\mathrm{body}}}{(P_{\\mathrm{body}}+c_d Kd)^2}&gt;0.$$</div>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由商法则直接计算，分子为正、分母为正，故导数为正；极限由分子分母同阶（均 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sim c_d Kd$</span>）得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 11.5 的工程含义是：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 很大时，嵌入层几乎吞掉全部参数预算，此时继续扩容词表的相对代价接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，而收益弹性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(K)$</span> 已很小，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(K)&lt;0$</span>，扩容不再划算。这正是命题 11.3 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K^\\ast$</span> 有限的原因。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-11-3-与数据处理不等式的接口\">11.3 与数据处理不等式的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-11-3-与数据处理不等式的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Y\\to Z\\Rightarrow I(X;Z)\\le I(X;Y)$</span>。分词是粗粒化映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau:\\Sigma^*\\to V^*$</span>，它把源串 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 映为词元序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau(X)$</span>。若下游模型只读取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span>，则任何基于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 的预测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)\\le I(X;Y)$</span>。词表扩容改变的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 本身，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Y\\to Z$</span> 的链结构。因此比较两个分词器 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1,\\tau_2$</span> 时必须固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span>，分别计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;\\tau_1(X))$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;\\tau_2(X))$</span>，不能把“换了分词器”误读为“同一条马尔可夫链上换了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span>”。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 11.6（词表扩容的信息单调性，条件性）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1$</span> 的细化，即存在可测映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma:V_2^*\\to V_1^*$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1=\\sigma\\circ\\tau_2$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2$</span> 的词元可拼接还原为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1$</span> 的词元序列）。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;\\tau_1(X))\\le I(X;\\tau_2(X)).$$</div>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1=\\sigma\\circ\\tau_2$</span> 得马尔可夫链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to\\tau_2(X)\\to\\tau_1(X)$</span>（给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2(X)$</span> 后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1(X)=\\sigma(\\tau_2(X))$</span> 确定）。对三元组应用数据处理不等式（前序节已证），取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau_2(X)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=\\tau_1(X)$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;\\tau_1(X))\\le I(X;\\tau_2(X))$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 11.6 说明：<strong>细化词表不会损失信息，只会增加或保持 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;\\tau(X))$</span></strong>。这与 11.1 的收益弹性方向一致——扩容在信息侧是单调不降的。但注意命题 11.6 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1$</span> 的细化（存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>），BPE 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K+\\Delta K$</span> 的截断族恰好满足此条件：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K+\\Delta K$</span> 的合并序列包含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 的全部合并，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{K+\\Delta K}$</span> 细于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_K$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 就是“把新增词元按合并历史拆回旧词元”。这一细化关系是 BPE 贪心合并（每次合并使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|V|$</span> 减 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，合并准则为频率最大的相邻对）的直接结构后果，不是额外假设。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-11-4-具体例子-公式验证\">11.4 具体例子：公式验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-11-4-具体例子-公式验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma=\\{a,b\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A=2$</span>。语料 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 为长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n=4$</span> 的均匀分布串（共 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2^4=16$</span> 个等概率串）。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1$</span> 为字符级分词（<span class=\"math-inline\">$V_1=\\Sigma$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K_1=2$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2$</span> 为在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1$</span> 基础上把最高频相邻对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{a,b\\}$</span> 合并为词元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span> 的分词器（<span class=\"math-inline\">$K_2=3$</span>）。由 BPE 准则，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{a,b\\}$</span> 在 16 个串的相邻位置中出现次数最多（每个串的每个相邻位置共 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\times 16=48$</span> 个位置，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{a,b\\}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{b,a\\}$</span> 各约一半，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{a,b\\}$</span> 为最大者）。计算平均码长：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1$</span>：每个串长度恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar L(\\tau_1)=4$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2$</span>：串中每出现一次子串 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span> 就缩短 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。在长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4$</span> 的串中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span> 出现次数的期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\cdot\\frac{1}{4}=\\frac{3}{4}$</span>（每个相邻位置独立地以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/4$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span>）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar L(\\tau_2)=4-\\frac{3}{4}=\\frac{13}{4}=3.25$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>验证命题 11.3 的弹性定义（离散差分形式）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell\\approx-\\frac{\\log(3.25/4)}{\\log(3/2)}=\\frac{\\log(4/3.25)}{\\log 1.5}=\\frac{0.2076}{0.4055}\\approx 0.512$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=8$</span>、不绑定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_d=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=10^{-3}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\lambda d=0.016$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(3)=0.512/3-0.016\\approx 0.155&gt;0$</span>，说明在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span> 处扩容仍划算。此例仅验证公式数值自洽，不声称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K^\\ast=3$</span>。</p>\n<p>再验证命题 11.4：<span class=\"math-inline\">$P(3,8)-P(2,8)=2\\cdot 8\\cdot(3-2)=16$</span>，与定义 11.1 直接相减一致。</p>\n<p>运行输出（预期）：<code>K 序列: [2, 3, 4, 5, 6]</code>，<code>平均码长 L(K): [4. 3.25 2.75 2.5 2.375]</code>（后几项依合并顺序而定，但首两项固定），<code>g(3) 约为 0.155</code>。断言覆盖了 11.4 的手算值与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell\\ge 0$</span> 的单调性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-11-6-边界情形与失效条件\">11.6 边界情形与失效条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-11-6-边界情形与失效条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 11.3 的结论依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 严格递减。若语料高度重复（如单一串重复），BPE 在很少的合并后即达到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar L$</span> 的平台，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(K)$</span> 在某点后恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(K)=-\\lambda 2d&lt;0$</span>，内点条件退化为“不再扩容”，命题 11.3 的介值论证失效（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(K)/K$</span> 不再趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 而是趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 的常数倍除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>，仍趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，故零点仍存在但可能落在平台起点）。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 非单调（某些 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 处扩容反而因合并顺序改变而略增 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar L$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 可能无零点，权衡曲线出现锯齿。这些失效情形不在本节展开完整反例，按纪律归入第 10 节反例节处理。</p>\n<p>命题 11.6 的细化条件不可省：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2$</span> 不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1$</span> 的细化（例如两种独立训练的 BPE 词表互不包含），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;\\tau_1(X))$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;\\tau_2(X))$</span> 之间无固定序关系，数据处理不等式不能跨分词器直接套用。这正是第 10 节“同一字符串的不同分词导致不同概率”所揭示的现象的信息论侧写。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>词表—参数权衡由两条曲线竞争决定：扩容的收益弹性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(K)$</span> 递减，参数代价 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_d d$</span> 线性，内点条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(K^\\ast)=2\\lambda d K^\\ast$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 连续严格递减且两端极限存在时唯一（命题 11.3）；嵌入占比随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 递增并趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（推论 11.5），故扩容的相对代价递增。</li>\n<li>分词细化在信息侧单调不降：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2$</span> 细于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1$</span>（存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1=\\sigma\\circ\\tau_2$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;\\tau_1(X))\\le I(X;\\tau_2(X))$</span>（命题 11.6），这是数据处理不等式在分词链上的直接应用；BPE 截断族因贪心合并的嵌套结构天然满足细化条件。</li>\n<li>权衡的解析形式与数值验证自洽：<span class=\"math-inline\">$P(K_2,d)-P(K_1,d)=c_d d(K_2-K_1)$</span> 为恒等式（命题 11.4），11.4 的二元长度 4 例子手算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar L(3)=3.25$</span> 与代码断言一致；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 非单调或语料高度重复时内点论证失效，完整反例归入第 10 节。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-11-7-权衡的拉格朗日表述与影子价格的来源\">11.7 权衡的拉格朗日表述与影子价格的来源<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-11-7-权衡的拉格朗日表述与影子价格的来源\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 11.3 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 此前作为外生影子价格引入，未说明其来源。本节补足这一环：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 可由一个显式的约束优化问题内生地产生，从而权衡不再是“两条曲线目测相交”，而是约束极值的一阶条件。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 11.7（预算约束下的词表选择）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设模型在词元序列上的负对数似然（每源字符归一化）为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}(\\theta,\\tau)=\\frac{1}{\\mathbb{E}_{x\\sim\\mu}[|x|]}\\mathbb{E}_{x\\sim\\mu}\\Big[-\\log p_\\theta\\big(\\tau(x)\\big)\\Big],$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(\\tau(x))$</span> 为自回归分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_{t}p_\\theta(v_t\\mid v_{&lt;t})$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=\\tau(x)$</span> 处的取值。给定参数预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B&gt;0$</span>，词表选择问题为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\min_{K\\ge 1,\\ \\theta\\in\\Theta}\\ \\mathcal{L}(\\theta,\\tau_K)\\quad\\text{s.t.}\\quad P(K,d)\\le B.$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设 (A5)</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}(\\theta,\\tau_K)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\theta,K)$</span> 连续可微；约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(K,d)\\le B$</span> 在最优解处起作用（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(K^\\ast,d)=B$</span>），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal{L}\\neq 0$</span> 在最优解处（非退化约束品性，LICQ 的一维特例）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 11.8（影子价格的内生表示）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A5) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(K^\\ast,\\theta^\\ast)$</span> 为定义 11.7 的局部极小点且约束起作用。则存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda^\\ast\\ge 0$</span> 使拉格朗日函数</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Lambda(\\theta,K,\\lambda)=\\mathcal{L}(\\theta,\\tau_K)+\\lambda\\big(P(K,d)-B\\big)$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(K^\\ast,\\theta^\\ast,\\lambda^\\ast)$</span> 处满足一阶条件</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal{L}(\\theta^\\ast,\\tau_{K^\\ast})=0,\\qquad \\frac{\\partial\\mathcal{L}}{\\partial K}(\\theta^\\ast,\\tau_{K^\\ast})+\\lambda^\\ast\\,c_d\\,d=0,\\qquad P(K^\\ast,d)=B,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_d\\in\\{1,2\\}$</span> 如命题 11.4。特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda^\\ast=-\\frac{1}{c_d d}\\frac{\\partial\\mathcal{L}}{\\partial K}\\big|_{K^\\ast}\\ge 0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda^\\ast$</span> 等于最优值关于预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 的导数（包络定理）。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由 (A5)，约束为单个等式（在最优解处起作用），梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{(\\theta,K)}P=c_d d\\neq 0$</span>，满足 LICQ。由 Karush–Kuhn–Tucker 定理（有限维、可微、LICQ），存在乘子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda^\\ast$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{(\\theta,K)}\\Lambda=0$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 分量即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal{L}=0$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 分量即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_K\\mathcal{L}+\\lambda^\\ast c_d d=0$</span>。约束起作用给出第三式。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_K\\mathcal{L}\\le 0$</span>（扩容不增损失，见命题 11.6 的信息单调性在损失侧的对应）得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda^\\ast\\ge 0$</span>。包络定理：定义值函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V(B)=\\min_{P\\le B}\\mathcal{L}$</span>，在约束起作用且正则时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V'(B)=-\\lambda^\\ast$</span>，由对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 求偏导并代入一阶条件得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 11.8 把 11.1 的启发式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(K)=\\ell(K)/K-2\\lambda d$</span> 落实为：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda^\\ast$</span> 不是拍脑袋的超参，而是“多给一单位参数预算能降低多少归一化损失”的边际价值。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_K\\mathcal{L}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(K)$</span> 的关系是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 的偏导通过链式法则经过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar L(\\tau_K)$</span> 起作用，因为序列变短直接减少累积负对数似然。若近似认为每词元的平均损失不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 剧烈变化，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_K\\mathcal{L}\\approx-\\bar\\ell_{\\text{tok}}\\cdot\\partial_K\\bar L$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\ell_{\\text{tok}}$</span> 为每词元平均损失；再由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(K)=-\\partial_K\\log\\bar L\\cdot K$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_K\\mathcal{L}\\approx \\bar\\ell_{\\text{tok}}\\,\\bar L\\,\\ell(K)/K$</span>。代入命题 11.8 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 分量即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\ell_{\\text{tok}}\\bar L\\,\\ell(K^\\ast)/K^\\ast=\\lambda^\\ast c_d d$</span>，与命题 11.3 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(K^\\ast)=0$</span> 在乘以正常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\ell_{\\text{tok}}\\bar L$</span> 后同解。这一步说明两个命题的一阶条件在“每词元损失局部常数”的近似下一致，而该近似正是 (A5) 可微性所允许的局部线性化，不是额外假设。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-11-8-词表规模对有效参数量的折损-一个可检验的恒等式\">11.8 词表规模对有效参数量的折损：一个可检验的恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-11-8-词表规模对有效参数量的折损-一个可检验的恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>工程上常说“大词表吃掉参数预算”，但这句话需要一个可计算的量。本节给出一个恒等式，把词表规模对<strong>有效主体参数量</strong>的折损写成闭式。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 11.9（有效主体参数占比）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，记</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\eta(K,d):=\\frac{P_{\\mathrm{body}}}{P(K,d)}=\\frac{P_{\\mathrm{body}}}{P_{\\mathrm{body}}+c_d Kd}.$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 是总参数中真正用于序列建模（而非查表）的比例。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 11.10（折损恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_1&lt;K_2$</span> 与固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\eta(K_2,d)}{\\eta(K_1,d)}=\\frac{P_{\\mathrm{body}}+c_d K_1 d}{P_{\\mathrm{body}}+c_d K_2 d}=1-\\frac{c_d d(K_2-K_1)}{P_{\\mathrm{body}}+c_d K_2 d}.$$</div>\n<p>且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\mathrm{body}}\\gg c_d K_2 d$</span> 时，相对折损近似为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{c_d d(K_2-K_1)}{P_{\\mathrm{body}}}$</span>，即折损与扩容增量成正比、与主体规模成反比。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由定义 11.9 直接作商，分子分母同乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(K_1,d)P(K_2,d)$</span> 后化简得第一式；第二式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\mathrm{body}}+c_dK_1d=(P_{\\mathrm{body}}+c_dK_2d)-c_dd(K_2-K_1)$</span> 代入第一式得到。近似式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\mathrm{body}}\\gg c_dK_2d$</span> 时对分母作一阶展开。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 11.10 是可检验的：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\mathrm{body}}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$K_1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$K_2$</span>，可直接算出扩容导致的建模参数占比下降。它把 11.1 的“相对代价递增”（推论 11.5）翻译成“有效建模容量被查表挤占”的定量陈述，且不依赖任何关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(K)$</span> 的假设——它是纯代数恒等式，只需 (A1)。这与命题 11.3 形成对照：11.3 是条件性的最优化结论，11.10 是无条件的代数事实。二者合起来才构成完整的权衡图景：代价侧是恒等式，收益侧是需要建模假设的弹性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-11-9-收益弹性-ell-K-的上界-由-BPE-合并结构导出\">11.9 收益弹性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(K)$</span> 的上界：由 BPE 合并结构导出<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-11-9-收益弹性-ell-K-的上界-由-BPE-合并结构导出\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 11.3 假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 递减且两端极限存在，但未给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 的任何上界。本节从 BPE 的贪心合并结构（每次合并使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|V|$</span> 减 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，合并准则为频率最大的相邻对）导出一个上界，使权衡的收益侧也有可证的量。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 (A6)</strong>：语料 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 的支撑中每个串长度不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n_{\\max}&lt;\\infty$</span>；BPE 在每一步合并的相邻对频率关于步数单调不增（贪心准则的直接后果：被合并的对频率最大，合并后新对频率不超过原最大频率——这是 BPE 的标准性质，此处作为结构假设列出）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 11.11（弹性上界）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4)、(A6) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_K$</span> 为 BPE 在词表规模 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 处的截断，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar L(\\tau_K)\\ge 1$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K&lt;K'$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\ell_{K,K'}:=\\frac{\\log\\bar L(\\tau_K)-\\log\\bar L(\\tau_{K'})}{\\log K'-\\log K}\\le \\frac{\\log n_{\\max}}{\\log K'-\\log K}.$$</div>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由 (A6)，每次合并至多把某个串的长度减少 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，且合并次数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K'-K$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar L(\\tau_{K'})\\ge \\bar L(\\tau_K)-(K'-K)\\cdot 1$</span> 不成立（下界方向错误），需换方向：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar L(\\tau_K)\\le n_{\\max}$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar L(\\tau_{K'})\\ge 1$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log\\bar L(\\tau_K)-\\log\\bar L(\\tau_{K'})\\le \\log n_{\\max}-\\log 1=\\log n_{\\max}.$$</div>\n<p>分子被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log n_{\\max}$</span> 控制，除以正的分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log K'-\\log K$</span> 即得上界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 11.11 的上界是粗的（它只用了长度有界，未用频率单调性），但它足以说明：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K'\\gg K$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_{K,K'}\\to 0$</span>，即<strong>扩容的收益弹性必然随词表增大而衰减到零</strong>，这与命题 11.3 所需的“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(K)\\to 0$</span>”一致，且此处是从 BPE 结构导出的，不是假设。频率单调性 (A6) 在证明中未被实质使用，仅用于保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar L$</span> 不因合并顺序抖动而上升（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_{K,K'}\\ge 0$</span>），从而分子非负、上界有意义。若去掉 (A6)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar L(\\tau_{K'})$</span> 可能大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar L(\\tau_K)$</span>，分子为负，上界平凡成立但弹性符号失控——这正是 11.6 所述“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 非单调导致锯齿”的解析来源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-11-10-一个可检验的推论-最优词表规模随主体规模增长\">11.10 一个可检验的推论：最优词表规模随主体规模增长<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-11-10-一个可检验的推论-最优词表规模随主体规模增长\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>把 11.7–11.9 串起来，得到一个关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K^\\ast$</span> 如何随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\mathrm{body}}$</span> 变化的推论，它是本节权衡结论的可检验形式。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 11.12（<span class=\"math-inline\">$K^\\ast$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\mathrm{body}}$</span> 单调）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A6) 下，设命题 11.8 的最优解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(K^\\ast,\\lambda^\\ast)$</span> 存在且约束起作用，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 严格递减。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\mathrm{body}}$</span> 增大而预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 固定，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K^\\ast$</span> 不增；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\mathrm{body}}$</span> 同比例增大（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B=P_{\\mathrm{body}}+c_dKd$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 的上界放宽），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K^\\ast$</span> 不减。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\mathrm{body}}$</span> 增大意味着留给 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_dKd$</span> 的预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B-P_{\\mathrm{body}}$</span> 减小，故可行集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{K:c_dKd\\le B-P_{\\mathrm{body}}\\}$</span> 收缩，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K^\\ast$</span> 不增（约束上界下降）。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\mathrm{body}}$</span> 同比例增大时，可行上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\le (B-P_{\\mathrm{body}})/(c_dd)$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 增大而放宽；由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 严格递减，命题 11.3 的零点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K^\\ast$</span> 随可用预算增大而右移（<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(K)$</span> 在更大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 处才变号），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K^\\ast$</span> 不减。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 11.12 给出一个明确的可检验预测：<strong>在小模型上最优词表偏小，在大模型上最优词表偏大</strong>，且这一趋势由预算约束的几何形状与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 的单调性共同决定，不依赖具体语料。它与工程直觉一致，但此处是作为命题 11.8 与 11.11 的推论推出的，而非经验断言。检验方式是：固定语料与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>，扫描 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\mathrm{body}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>，用定义 11.7 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}$</span> 找最优点，观察 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K^\\ast(P_{\\mathrm{body}})$</span> 的单调性；若观察到违反，则说明 (A6) 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 严格递减在该语料上失效，应回到 11.6 的失效条件分析，而非否定推论本身。</p>\n<p>至此，本节把权衡从“两条曲线相交”的启发式，补足为：代价侧是无条件恒等式（命题 11.4、11.10），收益侧是有结构假设的上界与单调性（命题 11.11、推论 11.12），最优点由约束极值的一阶条件内生确定（命题 11.8），并与 11.1 的启发式弹性条件在局部线性化下一致。信息侧由命题 11.6 的细化单调性保证扩容不损信息，从而收益侧的正性有信息论根据。四者合起来构成本节对“词表规模与参数量的权衡”的完整数学刻画。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ar08--h-分词器的可逆性条件\">分词器的可逆性条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-分词器的可逆性条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已定义的符号：源字符串空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma$</span> 为有限字符集，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\Sigma|&lt;\\infty$</span>），词表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span>（有限集，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|V|=K$</span>），分词映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau:\\Sigma^*\\to V^*$</span> 为满射但一般不单射；<span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 为取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 的随机字符串，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau(X)$</span> 为其分词序列，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 为下游任务所依赖的表示（例如嵌入或标签）。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{-1}(y)=\\{x\\in\\Sigma^*:\\tau(x)=y\\}$</span> 为纤维。本节新增符号如下。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>拼接映射</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma:V^*\\to\\Sigma^*$</span>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y=(v_1,\\dots,v_n)\\in V^*$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(y)=v_1v_2\\cdots v_n$</span>，其中每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_i\\in V$</span> 视为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 中的字符串（词表元素是字符序列）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 总是可定义的，且对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\in\\tau^{-1}(\\tau(x))$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(y)=x$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>可逆性</strong>：称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\Sigma^*$</span> 处可逆，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{-1}(\\tau(x))=\\{x\\}$</span>；称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 全局可逆，若对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立。等价地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 单射。</li>\n<li><strong>规范分词</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^\\ast:\\Sigma^*\\to V^*$</span>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 全局可逆，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^\\ast=\\tau$</span>；否则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^\\ast$</span> 为任一满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\circ\\tau^\\ast=\\mathrm{id}_{\\Sigma^*}$</span> 的截面（选择公理保证存在，有限字符集下可构造）。</li>\n<li><strong>歧义度</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(x)=|\\tau^{-1}(\\tau(x))|$</span>，取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{N}_{\\ge 1}$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>正则性假设：(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 有限，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*$</span> 均为可数集，配以离散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数，一切映射自动可测；(A2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 上取值于可数集的随机元，其分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 任意，故熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)$</span>、互信息 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)$</span> 在离散情形下均为有限或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，下文命题只在有限情形陈述；(A3) 下游表示 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 经可测映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g:V^*\\to\\mathcal{Z}$</span> 给出，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{Z}$</span> 为可测空间。这些假设在本节情境下自动成立，无需额外验证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-可逆性的纤维刻画\">可逆性的纤维刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-可逆性的纤维刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（可逆性等价于纤维单点）—假设 (A1)(A2)—证明</strong></p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 全局可逆当且仅当对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\in V^*$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(\\sigma(y))=1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(y)\\in\\Sigma^*$</span> 的像覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(\\Sigma^*)$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 单射，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\in\\tau(\\Sigma^*)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{-1}(y)$</span> 恰含一个元素 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(y)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(\\sigma(y))=1$</span>。反之若每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\in\\tau(\\Sigma^*)$</span> 的纤维为单点，则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\neq x'$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(x)\\neq\\tau(x')$</span>，否则二者同属一个纤维，矛盾。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题把可逆性问题化归为“每个词序列的拼接是否唯一确定原串”。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 总是满射到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(\\Sigma^*)$</span> 上（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(\\tau(x))=x$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 单射等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(\\Sigma^*)$</span> 上单射。这与“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 全局单射”不同：后者要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*$</span> 中任意两个不同词序列拼接不同，是更强的条件（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 为自由幺半群的自由生成集，无关系）。分词器通常只要求前者。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（可逆性蕴含互信息无损）—假设 (A1)(A2)(A3)—证明</strong></p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 全局可逆，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)=I(Y;Z)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=g(Y)$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 单射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 一一对应，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(X,Z)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Y,Z)$</span> 的联合分布经双射对应，故互信息相等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论说明：可逆分词不引入任何信息损失；反之，不可逆分词必损失，损失量由下一小节的数据处理不等式下界刻画。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-不可逆性的信息损失下界\">不可逆性的信息损失下界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-不可逆性的信息损失下界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（纤维熵即损失）—假设 (A1)(A2)(A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)&lt;\\infty$</span>—证明</strong></p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau(X)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=g(Y)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;Z)=I(Y;Z)-H(X\\mid Y,Z)+H(X\\mid Y).$$</div>\n<p>特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 的确定性函数（<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=g(Y)$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y,Z)=H(X\\mid Y)$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)=I(Y;Z)$</span>，即经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 中转的下游表示不额外损失。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由互信息的链式法则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;Z)=H(X)-H(X\\mid Z),\\qquad I(Y;Z)=H(Y)-H(Y\\mid Z).$$</div>\n<p>又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Z)=H(X\\mid Y,Z)+H(X\\mid Y)-H(Y\\mid Z)$</span> 可由条件熵的链式法则直接验证：将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X,Y\\mid Z)$</span> 按两种顺序展开，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(X,Y\\mid Z)=H(X\\mid Y,Z)+H(Y\\mid Z)=H(Y\\mid X,Z)+H(X\\mid Z).$$</div>\n<p>因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau(X)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的确定性函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid X,Z)=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Z)=H(X\\mid Y,Z)+H(Y\\mid Z)$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)$</span> 的定义即得所述恒等式。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=g(Y)$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y,Z)=H(X\\mid Y)$</span> 因给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 无额外信息。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（损失等于纤维的平均对数歧义度）—假设 (A1)(A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)&lt;\\infty$</span>—证明</strong></p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(X\\mid Y)=\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\log\\alpha(X)\\big]=\\sum_{y\\in V^*} \\mu(\\tau^{-1}(y))\\log|\\tau^{-1}(y)|.$$</div>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=y$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 在纤维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{-1}(y)$</span> 上取值，条件分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu(\\cdot\\mid y)$</span>，其支撑大小即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 在该纤维上的常值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\tau^{-1}(y)|$</span>。离散均匀情形下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y=y)=\\log|\\tau^{-1}(y)|$</span>；一般情形下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y=y)\\le\\log|\\tau^{-1}(y)|$</span>，等号当且仅当条件分布在纤维上均匀。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y)\\le\\mathbb{E}[\\log\\alpha(X)]$</span>，等号在均匀纤维下成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出可操作的判据：<strong>可逆 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\iff$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\equiv 1$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\iff$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y)=0$</span></strong>。任何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&gt;1$</span> 的纤维都贡献正的损失，且损失随纤维大小对数增长。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-可逆性的充分条件与必要条件\">可逆性的充分条件与必要条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-可逆性的充分条件与必要条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（前缀自由是充分条件）—假设 (A1)—证明</strong></p>\n<p>若词表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 是前缀自由的（即不存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\neq v'\\in V$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v'$</span> 的前缀），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma:V^*\\to\\Sigma^*$</span> 单射，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(\\Sigma^*)$</span> 上单射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 全局可逆。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y=(v_1,\\dots,v_n)\\neq y'=(v'_1,\\dots,v'_m)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(y)=\\sigma(y')=x$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 为第一个使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_j\\neq v'_j$</span> 的下标（若一方先结束则取较短者末尾）。由拼接相等，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_j$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v'_j$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的同一位置开始，故一个是另一个的前缀，与前缀自由矛盾。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 单射。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>前缀自由是充分非必要：例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V=\\{a,ab,b\\}$</span> 非前缀自由（<span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span> 的前缀），但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 仍单射，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 后接 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 的拼接相同，然而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 后接 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\in V$</span> 且序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,b)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(ab)$</span> 不同——此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(a,b)=ab=\\sigma(ab)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 不单射。更精确地说，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V=\\{a,ba\\}$</span>，非前缀自由（<span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ba$</span> 的后缀而非前缀），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 单射。故前缀自由确为充分条件而非必要。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（可逆性的必要条件是纤维单点，非词表性质）—假设 (A1)—证明</strong></p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 全局可逆当且仅当对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\Sigma^*$</span>，存在唯一分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=v_1\\cdots v_n$</span> 且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_i\\in V$</span>，且该分解由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 给出。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 单射，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(x)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的唯一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span>-分解，故存在性（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 满射到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*$</span> 的定义域上）与唯一性同时成立。反之若每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 有唯一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span>-分解，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(x)$</span> 由该分解唯一确定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 单射。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题表明：可逆性不是词表的局部性质，而是“每个串的唯一可分解性”这一全局性质。BPE 与 WordPiece 的词表通常不满足此性质（因合并产生的词与单字符词共存，产生多分解），故一般不可逆；字节级回退通过令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 含全部单字节并采用最长匹配或规范分解，可在字节层面恢复可逆性（见第 7 节已建立的字节回退构造，本节不重复）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-具体例子-可逆与不可逆的对照\">具体例子：可逆与不可逆的对照<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-具体例子-可逆与不可逆的对照\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma=\\{a,b\\}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>例 1（可逆）.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_1=\\{a,b,ab\\}$</span>。检查分解唯一性：串 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span> 有两种分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(ab)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,b)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span> 处不可逆，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(ab)=2$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_1$</span> 不可逆。</p>\n<p><strong>例 2（可逆）.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_2=\\{a,ba\\}$</span>。串 <span class=\"math-inline\">$aba$</span> 的分解：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,ba)$</span> 唯一；<span class=\"math-inline\">$ba$</span> 的分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(ba)$</span> 唯一；<span class=\"math-inline\">$aa$</span> 无分解（不在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2(\\Sigma^*)$</span> 中）。检查所有长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 4$</span> 的串可枚举验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2(\\Sigma^*)$</span> 上单射。一般地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V_2$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ba$</span> 的前缀，<span class=\"math-inline\">$ba$</span> 不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 的前缀，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ba$</span> 的尾字符 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 与首字符 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 不构成新歧义，可证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 单射（此即命题 3 之外的后缀自由情形）。</p>\n<p><strong>例 3（数值验证）.</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{ab,ba\\}$</span> 上均匀，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(ab)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(b,a)$</span> 各概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)=1$</span> bit，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y)=\\tfrac12\\log 2+\\tfrac12\\log 1=0.5$</span> bit，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=0.5$</span> bit，损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.5$</span> bit 恰等于推论 2 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\log\\alpha]$</span>。此例可直接在代码节复算。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-可逆性与数据处理不等式的接口\">可逆性与数据处理不等式的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-可逆性与数据处理不等式的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>由第 3 节已证的数据处理不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Y\\to Z\\Rightarrow I(X;Z)\\le I(X;Y)$</span>，结合命题 2 得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;Z)\\le I(X;Y)=H(Y)-H(X\\mid Y)+\\ldots$$</div>\n<p>更精确地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=H(Y)-H(Y\\mid X)=H(Y)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的确定性函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid X)=0$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)\\le H(Y)$</span>，且损失项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y)$</span> 正是不可逆性付出的代价。可逆时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=H(X)=H(Y)$</span>，无损。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>分词映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的可逆性等价于每个纤维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{-1}(y)$</span> 为单点，等价于每个串的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span>-分解唯一；前缀自由词表是可逆的充分条件，但可逆性本质上是全局分解唯一性而非词表局部性质。</li>\n<li>不可逆性造成的信息损失精确等于纤维的平均对数歧义度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y)=\\mathbb{E}[\\log\\alpha(X)]$</span>（均匀纤维取等），并经数据处理不等式传导至下游表示 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span>；可逆时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)=I(Y;Z)$</span>，无损。</li>\n<li>实际分词器（BPE、WordPiece）因合并词与单字符词共存而一般不满足分解唯一性，字节级回退通过在字节层强制规范分解恢复可逆性；可逆性判据 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\equiv 1$</span> 可在代码节以枚举纤维直接检验。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-可逆性判定的算法判据\">可逆性判定的算法判据<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-可逆性判定的算法判据\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前一小节以纤维枚举给出可逆性的定义式判据 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\equiv 1$</span>，但该判据在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\Sigma^*|$</span> 无限时不可直接枚举。本小节给出一个有限化的判定程序，并证明其正确性，使可逆性成为可计算的性质。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 1（歧义串）.</strong> 称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\Sigma^*$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span>-歧义串，若存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\neq y'\\in V^*$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(y)=\\sigma(y')=x$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{A}_V\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$</span> 为全部歧义串之集。显然 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 全局可逆 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\iff$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{A}_V=\\varnothing$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（歧义串的有限生成性）—假设 (A1)—证明</strong></p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{A}_V\\neq\\varnothing$</span>，则存在歧义串 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|x|\\le 2\\max_{v\\in V}|v|$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|v|$</span> 为词 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的字符长度。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 取任意歧义串 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 及两个不同分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y=(v_1,\\dots,v_n)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$y'=(v'_1,\\dots,v'_m)$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 为第一个使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_j\\neq v'_j$</span> 的下标（若一方先结束则取较短者末尾，此时对应位置为空串，视为长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 的词，仍属有限情形）。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(y)=\\sigma(y')=x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_j$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v'_j$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的同一位置开始，故二者共享起始位置，且其中较短者是较长者的前缀。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|v_j|\\le|v'_j|$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_j$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v'_j$</span> 的前缀，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v'_j=v_j w$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in\\Sigma^*$</span> 非空。此时子串 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x'=v'_j$</span> 本身即为歧义串：它有两种分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(v'_j)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(v_j,w)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 可继续分解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 中词（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y'$</span> 的后续项保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span>-可分解的；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 不可分解则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(v_j,w)$</span> 不合法，此时改用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 的后续项构造，对称论证）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x'$</span> 是长度不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_{v\\in V}|v|$</span> 的歧义串。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 不可分解，则取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 侧对称位置，得长度不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_{v\\in V}|v|$</span> 的歧义串。两种情形合并，存在长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\max_{v\\in V}|v|$</span> 的歧义串，从而命题中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\max$</span> 的界成立（更紧的界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_{v\\in V}|v|$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5 的意义：可逆性判定只需检查长度不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\max_{v\\in V}|v|$</span> 的串，这是有限集，可枚举。实际词表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max|v|$</span> 通常为数十字节，枚举量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\Sigma|^{2\\max|v|}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\Sigma|$</span> 较大时仍爆炸，故工程上改用下述基于前缀树的多分解计数。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（多分解计数的动态规划）—假设 (A1)—证明</strong></p>\n<p>对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\Sigma^*$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N(x)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span>-分解个数（<span class=\"math-inline\">$N(x)=0$</span> 表示不可分解）。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 满足递推</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$N(x)=\\sum_{v\\in V,\\,v\\text{ 是 }x\\text{ 的前缀}} N\\big(x[|v|+1:\\,]\\big),\\qquad N(\\varepsilon)=1,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 为空串，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x[k:]$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 从第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 个字符起的后缀。从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(x)=N(x)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\tau(\\Sigma^*)$</span> 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 全局可逆 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\iff$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N(x)\\in\\{0,1\\}$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 任一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span>-分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y=(v_1,\\dots,v_n)$</span> 的首项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_1$</span> 必是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的前缀，剩余 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(v_2,\\dots,v_n)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x[|v_1|+1:]$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span>-分解。按首项分组即得递推，各组互不相交故求和无重复计数。基例空串有唯一空分解。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(x)=N(x)$</span> 因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{-1}(\\tau(x))$</span> 恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的全部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span>-分解之集。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此递推是多项式时间的（对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，状态数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|x|+1$</span>，每状态至多 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|V|$</span> 次转移），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 可在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(|x|\\cdot|V|)$</span> 内计算。工程上以 trie 索引 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 可将每状态的转移数降至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\max|v|)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（可逆性的局部检验充分性）—假设 (A1)—证明</strong></p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 全局可逆当且仅当对所有长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 2\\max_{v\\in V}|v|$</span> 的串 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N(x)\\le 1$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 必要性显然。充分性：若存在歧义串，由命题 5 存在长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 2\\max|v|$</span> 的歧义串 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x'$</span>，其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N(x')\\ge 2$</span>，矛盾。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 3 把全局可逆性化归为有限多个局部检验，这是本节可操作判据的最终形式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-规范分词与最小损失截面\">规范分词与最小损失截面<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-规范分词与最小损失截面\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>不可逆时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的每个纤维含多个串，下游若只见到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span>，则无法区分纤维内成员。工程上的补救是选取一个截面 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^\\ast$</span>（规范分词），使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\circ\\tau^\\ast=\\mathrm{id}$</span>，从而把任意串映到唯一词序列。本小节证明：在所有截面中，存在一个使期望纤维熵最小的截面，且该截面可由逐纤维的 MAP 选择构造。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 2（截面与规范分词）.</strong> 截面 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^\\ast:\\Sigma^*\\to V^*$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\circ\\tau^\\ast=\\mathrm{id}_{\\Sigma^*}$</span>。给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span>，称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^\\ast$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span>-最优截面，若它最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_\\mu[\\log N(\\tau^\\ast(X))]$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 为命题 6 的多分解计数。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（最优截面的逐纤维构造）—假设 (A1)(A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)&lt;\\infty$</span>—证明</strong></p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^\\ast$</span> 满足：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\in\\tau(\\Sigma^*)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^\\ast(\\sigma(y))$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max_{y'\\in\\tau^{-1}(y)}\\mu(\\sigma(y'))$</span>（若并列取任一）。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^\\ast$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span>-最优截面。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 任意截面 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau'$</span> 在纤维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{-1}(y)$</span> 上取定一个代表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x'=\\sigma(\\tau'(\\sigma(y)))$</span>。损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_\\mu[\\log N(\\tau'(X))]$</span> 按纤维分解：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_\\mu[\\log N(\\tau'(X))]=\\sum_{y}\\sum_{x\\in\\tau^{-1}(y)}\\mu(x)\\log N(\\tau'(x)).$$</div>\n<p>对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau'$</span> 在纤维上取常值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y'$</span>，故内层和等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\big(\\sum_{x\\in\\tau^{-1}(y)}\\mu(x)\\big)\\log N(y')$</span>。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N(y')=|\\tau^{-1}(y)|$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y'$</span> 的选择无关（同一纤维的所有分解计数相同），内层和与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y'$</span> 无关，故任意截面给出相同损失。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 7 揭示一个反直觉事实：<strong>在纤维内，所有截面的期望对数歧义度相同</strong>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 在纤维上是常值。因此“最优截面”的优化目标不应是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log N$</span>，而应是下游任务相关的量（如语言模型似然）。这解释了为何工程上规范分词的选择（最长匹配、最小词数、最高频）并不改变信息损失的上界，只改变下游模型见到的序列分布。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 4（规范分词不消除损失）—假设 (A1)(A2)—证明</strong></p>\n<p>对任意截面 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^\\ast$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid \\tau^\\ast(X))=H(X\\mid Y)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau(X)$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^\\ast(X)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 的确定性函数（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^\\ast$</span> 在纤维上取常值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^\\ast(X)$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 唯一确定），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid\\tau^\\ast(X))\\ge H(X\\mid Y)$</span>；又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^\\ast(X)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid\\tau^\\ast(X))\\le H(X\\mid Y)$</span> 不成立——需注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^\\ast(X)$</span> 携带的信息不多于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span>，故给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^\\ast(X)$</span> 后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的不确定性不小于给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 后，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid\\tau^\\ast(X))\\ge H(X\\mid Y)$</span>。另一方面 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^\\ast(X)$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 决定，给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 即给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^\\ast(X)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y)\\ge H(X\\mid\\tau^\\ast(X))$</span>。两向不等式合并得等号。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论说明：规范分词只是把纤维内的选择固定下来，并不减少纤维本身的大小，故信息损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y)$</span> 原封不动。要真正消除损失，必须改变词表使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\equiv 1$</span>，即回到可逆性条件本身。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-可逆性与嵌入的单射性\">可逆性与嵌入的单射性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-可逆性与嵌入的单射性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 2 节已建立词表大小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 与嵌入维度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 的关系。本小节把可逆性条件与嵌入映射的单射性对接，给出一个可检验的接口命题，供“与嵌入章的接口”一节引用。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 3（嵌入映射）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E:V\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为词嵌入，<span class=\"math-inline\">$E(y)=(E(v_1),\\dots,E(v_n))\\in\\mathbb{R}^{n\\times d}$</span> 为词序列的嵌入。称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 上单射，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\neq v'\\Rightarrow E(v)\\neq E(v')$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（可逆分词 + 单射嵌入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span> 串级嵌入单射）—假设 (A1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 上单射—证明</strong></p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 全局可逆且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 上单射，则映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\mapsto E(\\tau(x))$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 上单射。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\neq x'$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E(\\tau(x))=E(\\tau(x'))$</span>。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 单射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(x)\\neq\\tau(x')$</span>。设二者首次不同的位置为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E(v_j)=E(v'_j)$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_j\\neq v'_j$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 单射矛盾。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 8 的逆不成立：<span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 单射但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 不可逆时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\mapsto E(\\tau(x))$</span> 仍可能单射（若纤维内不同串恰有不同嵌入），故串级嵌入单射不蕴含分词可逆。这提示工程上一个常见误解：<strong>嵌入维度足够大并不修复分词的信息损失</strong>，因为损失发生在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 这一层，嵌入层只能在其后传递已损失的信息（由数据处理不等式）。要修复损失必须在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 层，即采用可逆分词或字节级回退。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-可逆性的度量-与词表规模的两难\">可逆性的度量：与词表规模的两难<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-可逆性的度量-与词表规模的两难\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本小节把可逆性条件与第 11 节的词表规模权衡对接，给出一个显式的两难陈述，不重复第 11 节的推导，只补充可逆性视角下的新结论。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（可逆词表的最小规模）—假设 (A1)—证明</strong></p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\Sigma|=s$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 全局可逆且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$</span> 含全部单字符（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma\\subseteq V$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|V|\\ge s$</span>，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V=\\Sigma$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|V|=s$</span> 达到最小。反之，任何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|V|=s$</span> 的可逆词表必等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma\\subseteq V$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|V|\\ge s$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$V=\\Sigma$</span> 时每个串的分解为逐字符分解，唯一，故可逆。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|V|=s$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma\\subseteq V$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V=\\Sigma$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 9 说明：含全部单字符的可逆词表，其最小规模就是字符集大小，此时无任何合并词，分词退化为逐字符。任何合并（<span class=\"math-inline\">$|V|&gt;s$</span> 且含多字符词）都可能引入歧义，除非合并词满足命题 3 的前缀自由或更一般的分解唯一性。这构成可逆性与压缩率的两难：<strong>可逆性要求词表接近字符集，压缩率要求词表含高频多字符词</strong>。BPE 的贪心合并（第 4 节已证其频率最优性）正是在这一两难中偏向压缩率，故牺牲可逆性。字节级回退（第 7 节）通过在字节层保留全部单字节并强制规范分解，把可逆性恢复到字节层，代价是词表规模回到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$256$</span> 量级。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 5（可逆性对压缩率的上界）—假设 (A1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 全局可逆且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma\\subseteq V$</span>—证明</strong></p>\n<p>对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\Sigma^*$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\tau(x)|\\ge |x|/\\max_{v\\in V}|v|$</span>，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V=\\Sigma$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\tau(x)|=|x|$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 每个词至多覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max|v|$</span> 个字符，故词数至少为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|x|/\\max|v|$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$V=\\Sigma$</span> 时每词恰一字符。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 5 给出可逆分词的长度下界：可逆性越强（词表越接近字符集），分词序列越长，压缩率越低。这与第 11 节的参数-词表权衡互为补充：第 11 节从参数量角度论证大词表省参数，本推论从可逆性角度论证大词表损可逆，二者共同刻画词表规模的多目标权衡。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-例子-可逆性判定的完整演算\">例子：可逆性判定的完整演算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-例子-可逆性判定的完整演算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma=\\{a,b\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V=\\{a,b,ab,ba\\}$</span>。用命题 6 的递推算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$N(\\varepsilon)=1$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$N(a)$</span>：前缀 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N(\\varepsilon)=1$</span>，无其他前缀，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N(a)=1$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$N(b)=1$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$N(ab)$</span>：前缀 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N(b)=1$</span>，前缀 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N(\\varepsilon)=1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N(ab)=2$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$N(ba)=2$</span> 对称。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$N(aba)$</span>：前缀 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 给 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N(ba)=2$</span>，前缀 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span> 给 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N(a)=1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N(aba)=3$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{A}_V$</span> 含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$ba$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$aba$</span> 等，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 不可逆。此例说明即使词表看似“对称”，多字符词与单字符词共存即产生歧义，验证了命题 4 的全局性论断。</p>\n<p>对照 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V'=\\{a,ba\\}$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$N(ba)$</span>：前缀 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ba$</span> 给 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N(\\varepsilon)=1$</span>，前缀 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 不在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V'$</span> 中，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N(ba)=1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$N(aba)$</span>：前缀 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 给 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N(ba)=1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N(aba)=1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$N(aab)$</span>：前缀 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 给 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N(ab)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span> 不可分解（<span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 后接 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\notin V'$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N(aab)=0$</span>。所有可分解串计数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau'$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau'(\\Sigma^*)$</span> 上可逆，验证例 2。</p>\n<p>这两个演算可直接在代码节以命题 6 的递推实现并断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 值，作为可逆性判据的数值验证。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ar08--h-代码-BPE-合并的从零实现\">代码：BPE 合并的从零实现<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-代码-BPE-合并的从零实现\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：语料为有限字符串多重集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C=\\{(s_i,m_i)\\}_{i=1}^{N}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_i\\in\\Sigma^*$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_i\\in\\mathbb{N}_{&gt;0}$</span> 为重数；初始词表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_0=\\Sigma$</span>（字符集，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\Sigma|=K$</span>）；分词映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau:\\Sigma^*\\to V^*$</span> 为满射但一般不单射。BPE 的合并规则表记为有序序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R=(r_1,\\dots,r_T)$</span>，每条规则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_t=(a_t,b_t)\\in V_{t-1}\\times V_{t-1}$</span> 是相邻符号对，合并后产生新符号 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t=a_tb_t$</span>，词表更新为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_t=V_{t-1}\\cup\\{c_t\\}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|V_t|=|V_{t-1}|+1$</span>，即每次合并使词表减少 1（相对于以字符为单位的初始切分粒度）。</p>\n<p>本节引入的新符号：对词 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 按规则表顺序应用合并所得的切分记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_R(s)\\in V_T^*$</span>；单条规则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r=(a,b)$</span> 在序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in V^*$</span> 上的应用算子记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{ap}_r(u)$</span>，其定义为从左至右扫描、将每个不相交的相邻对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,b)$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span> 的确定性映射。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A1（有限性）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\Sigma|&lt;\\infty$</span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_i$</span> 长度有限，合并轮数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T&lt;\\infty$</span>。此假设保证所有计数与 argmax 在有限集上取得，无测度论层面的可积性问题。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A2（确定性扫描）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{ap}_r$</span> 采用最左优先、不重叠匹配。此约定使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{ap}_r$</span> 成为良定义的确定性函数，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_R=\\mathrm{ap}_{r_T}\\circ\\cdots\\circ\\mathrm{ap}_{r_1}$</span> 是确定性映射。若改为重叠匹配或随机顺序，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_R$</span> 不再是函数，后续断言失效。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-1-算法契约-输入输出与核心更新\">1. 算法契约：输入输出与核心更新<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-1-算法契约-输入输出与核心更新\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>输入</strong>：语料计数表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{(s_i,m_i)\\}$</span>，目标合并轮数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>。\n<strong>输出</strong>：规则表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R=(r_1,\\dots,r_T)$</span>，以及每轮的词表大小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|V_t|=K+t$</span>。</p>\n<p>核心更新分两步。第一步，对当前切分统计相邻对频率：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f_t(a,b)=\\sum_{i=1}^{N} m_i\\cdot \\#\\{(a,b)\\text{ 在 } \\tau_{R_{t-1}}(s_i)\\text{ 中作为不相交相邻对出现}\\}.$$</div>\n<p>第二步取频率最大的对（并列时按字典序取最小，保证确定性）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$r_t=\\arg\\max_{(a,b)\\in V_{t-1}^2} f_t(a,b),\\qquad \\text{并列按字典序}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 1（词表单调性）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A1、A2。<strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_t=V_{t-1}\\cup\\{a_tb_t\\}$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_tb_t\\notin V_{t-1}$</span>（否则该对已可视为单符号，不构成有效相邻对），得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|V_t|=|V_{t-1}|+1$</span>。归纳得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|V_t|=K+t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>稳定性条件：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t$</span> 的最大值在多个对上并列时，字典序 tie-break 是必需的；否则规则表依赖哈希遍历顺序，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_R$</span> 不再是良定义函数，命题 1 的归纳步骤失去确定性基础。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-2-单条规则应用的逐步推导\">2. 单条规则应用的逐步推导<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-2-单条规则应用的逐步推导\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=(u_1,\\dots,u_L)\\in V^*$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r=(a,b)$</span>。定义指针 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=1$</span>，输出列表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=\\varnothing$</span>：</p>\n<p><div class=\"math-display\">$$\\text{若 } j\\le L-1 \\text{ 且 } (u_j,u_{j+1})=(a,b):\\ w\\gets w\\oplus(ab),\\ j\\gets j+2;$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\text{否则}:\\ w\\gets w\\oplus(u_j),\\ j\\gets j+1.$$</div></p>\n<p>循环至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j&gt;L$</span>。关键等式：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathrm{ap}_r(u)|\\le |u|$</span>，且等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 中不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,b)$</span> 相邻对。此不等式是后续信息损失论证的离散对应物：每次合并严格缩短切分长度，是不可逆粗粒化的具体机制。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2（应用算子的长度单调性）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A2。<strong>证明</strong>：每执行一次合并分支，<span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 前进 2 而输出增加 1 个符号，净长度贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1$</span>；否则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 前进 1、输出增加 1，净贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。故总长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=|u|-\\#\\text{合并次数}\\le|u|$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-3-可运行实现与断言\">3. 可运行实现与断言<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-3-可运行实现与断言\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码自包含，仅用 numpy 与 itertools。数值对象为小规模语料，所有断言期望值由本节公式手算得出：初始词表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=4$</span>（字符 <code>a,b,c,d</code>），语料计数使首轮频率最大对为 <code>(a,b)</code> 频次 3、<code>(c,d)</code> 频次 2，故按命题 1 与 argmax 定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_1=(a,b)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|V_1|=5$</span>；第二轮在 <code>(ab,c)</code> 与 <code>(c,d)</code> 之间取频次较大者，手算得 <code>(ab,c)</code> 频次 2 大于 <code>(c,d)</code> 频次 2 时按字典序取 <code>(ab,c)</code>，此处构造使 <code>(ab,c)</code> 频次 3，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_2=(ab,c)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|V_2|=6$</span>。断言比较两条独立路径：路径一按规则表顺序调用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{ap}$</span>；路径二直接对最终规则表做一次合并展开，二者对同一字符串的输出必须逐符号相等。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nfrom itertools import product\n\ndef apply_rule(u, a, b):\n    w, j, L = [], 0, len(u)\n    while j &lt; L:\n        if j + 1 &lt; L and u[j] == a and u[j+1] == b:\n            w.append(a + b); j += 2\n        else:\n            w.append(u[j]); j += 1\n    return tuple(w)\n\ndef count_pairs(corpus):\n    f = {}\n    for s, m in corpus:\n        u = tuple(s)\n        for j in range(len(u) - 1):\n            key = (u[j], u[j+1])\n            f[key] = f.get(key, 0) + m\n    return f\n\ndef bpe_train(corpus, T):\n    rules, vocab = [], set(&quot;abcd&quot;)\n    seg = [(tuple(s), m) for s, m in corpus]   # 每轮在已切分的语料上计数\n    for _ in range(T):\n        f = count_pairs(seg)\n        best = max(f.items(), key=lambda kv: (kv[1], tuple(-ord(c[0]) for c in kv[0])))  # 多字符符号取首字符定序\n        rules.append(best[0]); vocab.add(best[0][0] + best[0][1])\n        seg = [(apply_rule(u, *best[0]), m) for u, m in seg]\n    return rules, vocab\n\ncorpus = [(&quot;abab&quot;, 1), (&quot;abcd&quot;, 1), (&quot;abcc&quot;, 1)]\nrules, vocab = bpe_train(corpus, 2)\nassert rules[0] == (&quot;a&quot;, &quot;b&quot;), &quot;首条规则应为 (a,b)，频次 3 最大&quot;\nassert rules[1] == (&quot;ab&quot;, &quot;c&quot;), &quot;第二条规则应为 (ab,c)，频次 2 最大&quot;\nassert len(vocab) == 4 + 2, &quot;词表大小应为 K+T=6&quot;\n\ns = &quot;ababcd&quot;\nu1 = tuple(s)\nfor a, b in rules:\n    u1 = apply_rule(u1, a, b)\nu2 = tuple(s)\nu2 = apply_rule(apply_rule(u2, *rules[0]), *rules[1])\nassert u1 == u2, &quot;两条路径的切分必须逐符号相等&quot;\nassert len(u1) == len(s) - 3, &quot;两次合并各缩短 1，长度应为 6-2=4 再并 (ab,c) 得 3&quot;\nprint(&quot;rules:&quot;, rules, &quot;|V_T|:&quot;, len(vocab), &quot;seg:&quot;, u1)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>rules: [('a', 'b'), ('ab', 'c')] |V_T|: 6 seg: ('ab', 'abc', 'd')</code>。误差量级：本段全为整数计数与元组比较，无浮点运算，断言为精确相等，容差为 0；若将来扩展到浮点频率，容差应取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 量级并配合 tie-break 显式化。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-4-数值误差来源与量级\">4. 数值误差来源与量级<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-4-数值误差来源与量级\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节实现的误差来源仅两类。其一，若频率改为对数域累加以避免溢出（大规模语料时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_i$</span> 可达 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^9$</span>），则比较 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t$</span> 需在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 域进行，此时 argmax 的并列判定受浮点舍入影响，量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_{\\text{mach}}\\cdot\\max\\log f\\approx 10^{-16}\\cdot 30\\approx 3\\times10^{-15}$</span>，远小于任何整数频次差，故不影响规则选择。其二，若以概率归一化频率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=f_t/\\sum f_t$</span> 存储，则求和误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(n\\epsilon_{\\text{mach}})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\le K^2$</span> 很小，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-15}$</span>。本节的整数实现完全规避这两类误差，断言可用精确相等。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-5-与数据处理不等式的接口\">5. 与数据处理不等式的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-5-与数据处理不等式的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2 的离散长度单调性是第 3 节数据处理不等式的组合对应物：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_R$</span> 把长切分粗粒化为短切分，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\tau_R(s)|\\le|s|$</span>，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R$</span> 非空时对含相应相邻对的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 严格缩短。这为第 14 节数值测量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)\\le I(X;Y)$</span> 提供了可枚举的有限状态实例：把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 取为原始字符序列、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 取为字符级切分、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=\\tau_R(Y)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Y\\to Z$</span> 构成马尔可夫链，数据处理不等式给出信息损失的严格上界。第 12 节的可逆性条件恰是命题 2 中等号成立的充要条件在整条规则表上的推广。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>BPE 的输入输出契约由规则表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R$</span> 与词表序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{V_t\\}$</span> 完全确定，命题 1 证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|V_t|=K+t$</span>，即每次合并使词表相对字符粒度减少 1，且该结论依赖 A1 的有限性与 A2 的确定性扫描。</li>\n<li>单条规则应用算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{ap}_r$</span> 满足长度单调性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathrm{ap}_r(u)|\\le|u|$</span>，这是粗粒化不可逆性的离散机制，直接对接第 3 节数据处理不等式与第 12 节可逆性条件。</li>\n<li>代码以两条独立路径（顺序应用 vs 展开应用）互验切分结果，断言覆盖规则顺序、词表大小与长度缩短三项手算解析值，整数实现下容差为 0，浮点扩展时容差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_{\\text{mach}}$</span> 与频次差共同界定。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-6-合并准则的最优性刻画\">6. 合并准则的最优性刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-6-合并准则的最优性刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1 只保证词表大小按步增长，未说明频率最大的相邻对为何是贪心准则的合法选择。此处给出 BPE 贪心准则的一个精确刻画，它把“频率最大”还原为一个可证明的局部最优条件，而不诉诸经验直觉。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 3（合并收益）</strong>：设当前切分下相邻对频率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t$</span>，总符号数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t=\\sum_{i}m_i|\\tau_{R_{t-1}}(s_i)|$</span>。定义合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r=(a,b)$</span> 的收益为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$G_t(r)=\\frac{f_t(a,b)}{L_t}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 4（贪心准则的似然解释）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A1、A2，且把当前切分视为一个二元马尔可夫链的样本，其转移概率由相邻对频率的经验分布估计。<strong>证明</strong>：在该模型下，相邻对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,b)$</span> 出现的对数似然贡献为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t(a,b)\\log p_t(a,b)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(a,b)=f_t(a,b)/L_t$</span> 是经验转移概率。对单个对做合并等价于把该对的两个符号折叠为一个新符号，折叠后该对的全部质量集中于一个自转移，其对似然的改变量为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta_t(r)=f_t(a,b)\\bigl[\\log 1-\\log p_t(a,b)\\bigr]=-f_t(a,b)\\log p_t(a,b).$$</div>\n<p>由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log p_t(a,b)$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(a,b)$</span> 递减，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_t(r)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t(a,b)$</span> 最大时取最大（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 单调的意义下），故频率最大的对是使折叠后似然增益最大的对。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明贪心准则不是任意选择，而是“最大化单步似然增益”的精确解；但它只是单步最优，不保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 步全局最优，这正是第 4 节“贪心合并与最优性”所讨论的边界。本节代码只验证单步最优性，即首条规则必须等于频率最大的对。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-7-规则表顺序的不可交换性\">7. 规则表顺序的不可交换性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-7-规则表顺序的不可交换性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2 的长度单调性对单条规则成立，但对整条规则表，应用顺序不可交换。这一点必须在代码断言中显式体现，否则“按插入顺序断言”会掩盖顺序依赖。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（顺序依赖）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A1、A2，且存在两条规则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_1=(a,b)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$r_2=(b,c)$</span> 同时出现在某字符串中。<strong>证明</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=(a,b,c)$</span>。先应用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_1$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(ab,c)$</span>，再应用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_2$</span> 无匹配（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 已并入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span>），结果为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(ab,c)$</span>；先应用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_2$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,bc)$</span>，再应用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_1$</span> 无匹配，结果为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,bc)$</span>。两者不等，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{ap}_{r_2}\\circ\\mathrm{ap}_{r_1}\\neq\\mathrm{ap}_{r_1}\\circ\\mathrm{ap}_{r_2}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的直接后果是：规则表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R$</span> 必须作为有序序列存储，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_R$</span> 的定义中复合顺序不可省略。若实现中以集合或字典存储规则，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_R$</span> 不再是函数，命题 1 的归纳基础失效。代码中 <code>rules</code> 为列表、按 <code>append</code> 顺序应用，正是对这一要求的落实。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-8-边界情形-空规则表与全匹配\">8. 边界情形：空规则表与全匹配<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-8-边界情形-空规则表与全匹配\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 6（退化情形）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A1、A2。<strong>证明</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R=\\varnothing$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_R$</span> 为恒等映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|V_0|=K$</span>，命题 1 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处平凡成立。若某字符串 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 不含任何规则对，则对全部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{ap}_{r_t}(u)=u$</span>，长度不变，命题 2 取等号。这两种情形是第 12 节可逆性条件的两个端点：<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_R$</span> 单射（恒等），全匹配时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_R$</span> 严格缩短且一般不单射。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>代码断言 <code>len(u1) == len(s) - 2</code> 对应的是“两条规则均命中”的非退化情形；若把 <code>s</code> 改为 <code>\"dddd\"</code>，则两条规则均不命中，断言应改为 <code>len(u1) == len(s)</code>。这一对照说明长度缩短量恰等于命中次数，与命题 2 的证明逐字对应。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-9-复杂度与数值稳定性\">9. 复杂度与数值稳定性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-9-复杂度与数值稳定性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>单轮统计相邻对的代价为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sum_i m_i|s_i|)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 轮总计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(T\\sum_i m_i|s_i|)$</span>。本节代码规模下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>、总符号数不超过 12，远低于 30 秒限制。数值稳定性方面，整数计数无溢出风险（<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_i\\le 10^9$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$|s_i|\\le 10^3$</span> 时单对频次上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{12}$</span>，仍在 int64 范围内）；若改用 float64 存储归一化频率，则需在比较前做 <code>np.clip(p, eps, 1.0)</code> 以避免 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log 0$</span>，其中 <code>eps=1e-12</code> 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log$</span> 的量级约 27.6，与第 4 小节的对数域误差估计一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-10-断言设计的独立路径原则\">10. 断言设计的独立路径原则<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-10-断言设计的独立路径原则\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节代码的两条路径并非冗余：路径一按规则表逐条调用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{ap}$</span>，路径二把两条规则展开为一次复合调用。二者在数学上由命题 5 保证只在顺序一致时相等，故断言 <code>u1 == u2</code> 同时验证了（i）规则表顺序被正确保留，（ii）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{ap}$</span> 的确定性扫描约定被两条路径一致实现。若实现中误用重叠匹配，则路径二在 <code>\"abab\"</code> 上会得到 <code>(ab,ab)</code> 而路径一得到 <code>(ab,a,b)</code>，断言立即失败。这一设计使断言成为对 A2 的可执行检验，而非对随机结果的统计断言。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ar08--h-代码-分词信息损失的数值测量\">代码：分词信息损失的数值测量<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-代码-分词信息损失的数值测量\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：源字母表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma$</span>、词表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span>、分词映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau:\\Sigma^*\\to V^*$</span>（满射、一般不单射），以及随机变量三元组 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Y\\to Z$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 取值为原始字符串、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau(X)$</span> 为分词序列、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=\\sigma(Y)$</span> 为下游粗粒化（例如把相邻词符合并成块、或截断到固定长度）。本节新增符号如下。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$p_X$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 上有限支撑的概率质量函数，支撑集记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}_X$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal{S}_X|=n&lt;\\infty$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$p_Y$</span>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_Y(y)=\\sum_{x:\\tau(x)=y}p_X(x)$</span> 诱导的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*$</span> 上分布；因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 满射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_Y$</span> 的支撑非空。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma:V^*\\to\\mathcal{Z}$</span>：确定性可测映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_Z(z)=\\sum_{y:\\sigma(y)=z}p_Y(y)$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\cdot)$</span> 为 Shannon 熵（以 nat 为单位，即自然对数），<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=H(X)+H(Y)-H(X,Y)$</span> 为互信息。</li>\n<li>数值测量对象：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{\\tau,\\sigma}:=I(X;Y)-I(X;Z)\\ge 0$</span>，即粗粒化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 造成的信息损失。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>假设：(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_X$</span> 有限支撑且严格正于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}_X$</span>，故所有熵有限；(A2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 为确定性映射，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Y\\to Z$</span> 构成 Markov 链；(A3) 数值实现中所有概率以 float64 存储，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 计算前对零概率位置做屏蔽（仅对正质量项求和），避免 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log 0$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-测量框架-从联合表到互信息\">测量框架：从联合表到互信息<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-测量框架-从联合表到互信息\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_X$</span> 与映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau,\\sigma$</span>，联合分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{X,Z}(x,z)=p_X(x)\\cdot\\mathbf{1}[\\sigma(\\tau(x))=z]$</span>。互信息由下式给出：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;Z)=\\sum_{x\\in\\mathcal{S}_X}\\sum_{z\\in\\mathcal{Z}}p_{X,Z}(x,z)\\log\\frac{p_{X,Z}(x,z)}{p_X(x)\\,p_Z(z)}.$$</div>\n<p>由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=\\sigma(\\tau(X))$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的确定性函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Z\\mid X)=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)=H(Z)$</span>；同理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=H(Y)$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta_{\\tau,\\sigma}=H(Y)-H(Z).$$</div>\n<p>这一等式把互信息损失化为熵差，是本节数值测量的核心恒等式。数据处理不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)\\le I(X;Y)$</span> 在此等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Z)\\le H(Y)$</span>，而后者由确定性粗粒化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 的熵不减性保证：对任意确定性映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(g(Y))\\le H(Y)$</span>（等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_Y$</span> 的支撑上单射）。证明思路：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_Y$</span> 支撑划分为纤维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{g^{-1}(z)\\}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y)=H(g(Y))+\\sum_z p_Z(z)H(Y\\mid Z=z)$</span>，条件熵非负，故结论成立。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-算法契约与核心更新\">算法契约与核心更新<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-算法契约与核心更新\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>输入：概率向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_X\\in\\mathbb{R}^n$</span>（非负、和为 1）、分词映射表 <code>tau</code>（长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 的整数数组，取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 的下标）、粗粒化映射表 <code>sigma</code>（长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|V|$</span> 的整数数组）。输出：标量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\Delta\\in\\mathbb{R}_{\\ge 0}$</span> 与中间量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\hat H_Y,\\hat H_Z)$</span>。</p>\n<p>核心更新分三步：(i) 聚合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_Y$</span>：对每个词表下标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_Y[v]=\\sum_{i:\\tau_i=v}p_X[i]$</span>；(ii) 聚合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_Z$</span>：对每个块下标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_Z[z]=\\sum_{v:\\sigma_v=z}p_Y[v]$</span>；(iii) 熵计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)=-\\sum_{k:p_k&gt;0}p_k\\log p_k$</span>。数值稳定性条件：熵求和对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_k&gt;0$</span> 的项进行，等价于约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0=0$</span>；聚合用 <code>np.bincount</code> 保证索引不越界；断言前用 <code>np.clip</code> 把概率归一到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 并检查 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum p=1$</span> 的偏差小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span>。</p>\n<p>误差来源与量级：float64 下每次加法相对误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lesssim 2^{-53}\\approx 1.1\\times 10^{-16}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\le 2000$</span> 时累加误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lesssim n\\cdot 2^{-53}\\approx 2\\times 10^{-13}$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 的相对误差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0.5,1]$</span> 区间内 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lesssim 10^{-16}$</span>。故解析值与数值值的差应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lesssim 10^{-12}$</span>，断言容差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-9}$</span> 远大于误差上界、远小于任何有意义的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 量级。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-可运行实现与断言\">可运行实现与断言<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-可运行实现与断言\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码在单一代码块内自包含，验证三条等式：(E1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=H(Y)-H(Z)$</span> 与直接按定义算出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)-I(X;Z)$</span> 一致；(E2) 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_Y$</span> 支撑上单射时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=0$</span>；(E3) 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 把全部词符合并为单一符号时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Z)=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=H(Y)$</span>。解析期望值全部用 <code>sympy</code> 在块内算出。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np, sympy as sp, itertools\n\n# ---- 输入契约 ----\n# p_X: shape (n,), 非负, sum=1; tau: shape (n,), 取值 0..V-1\n# sigma: shape (V,), 取值 0..K-1; 输出标量 Delta 与 (H_Y, H_Z)\ndef entropy(p):\n    p = np.asarray(p, dtype=np.float64)\n    assert p.ndim == 1 and np.all(p &gt;= 0)\n    mask = p &gt; 0                      # 0 log 0 := 0\n    return float(-np.sum(p[mask] * np.log(p[mask])))\n\ndef measure(p_X, tau, sigma):\n    p_X = np.asarray(p_X, np.float64); tau = np.asarray(tau); sigma = np.asarray(sigma)\n    n, V, K = p_X.size, int(tau.max()) + 1, int(sigma.max()) + 1\n    assert p_X.shape == (n,) and tau.shape == (n,) and sigma.shape == (V,)\n    assert abs(p_X.sum() - 1.0) &lt; 1e-12 and np.all(p_X &gt;= 0)\n    p_Y = np.bincount(tau, weights=p_X, minlength=V)   # shape (V,)\n    p_Z = np.bincount(sigma[tau], weights=p_X, minlength=K)  # 直接聚合 X-&gt;Z\n    assert abs(p_Y.sum() - 1.0) &lt; 1e-12 and abs(p_Z.sum() - 1.0) &lt; 1e-12\n    H_Y, H_Z = entropy(p_Y), entropy(p_Z)\n    # 按定义算 I(X;Y)=H(Y)-H(Y|X)=H(Y)（确定性 tau），I(X;Z)=H(Z)\n    return H_Y - H_Z, H_Y, H_Z\n\n# ---- 解析基准：3 个源符号，2 个词符，2 个块 ----\n# p_X = (1/2, 1/3, 1/6); tau = (0,0,1); sigma = (0,1)\np_X = np.array([sp.Rational(1,2), sp.Rational(1,3), sp.Rational(1,6)], dtype=object)\np_Xf = np.array([float(v) for v in p_X])\ntau = np.array([0, 0, 1]); sigma = np.array([0, 1])\n# 手算: p_Y=(5/6,1/6), H_Y=-(5/6)ln(5/6)-(1/6)ln(1/6)\n# p_Z=(5/6,1/6) 同分布, 故 Delta=0 (sigma 在支撑上单射)\nH_Y_ana = float(-(sp.Rational(5,6)*sp.log(sp.Rational(5,6))\n                 + sp.Rational(1,6)*sp.log(sp.Rational(1,6))))\nDelta, H_Y, H_Z = measure(p_Xf, tau, sigma)\nprint(&quot;shapes:&quot;, p_Xf.shape, tau.shape, sigma.shape, &quot;H_Y,H_Z:&quot;, H_Y, H_Z)\nassert abs(H_Y - H_Y_ana) &lt; 1e-9          # 解析值由 sympy 给出\nassert abs(Delta - 0.0) &lt; 1e-9            # E2: 单射粗粒化无损\n\n# ---- E1: Delta 与逐点定义 I(X;Y)-I(X;Z) 一致（用联合表）----\n# 联合表 p_{X,Y}: shape (3,2); p_{X,Z}: shape (3,2)\nP_XY = np.zeros((3, 2)); P_XZ = np.zeros((3, 2))\nfor i in range(3):\n    P_XY[i, tau[i]] += p_Xf[i]; P_XZ[i, sigma[tau[i]]] += p_Xf[i]\ndef mutual(P, px):\n    py = P.sum(axis=0); I = 0.0\n    for i, j in itertools.product(range(P.shape[0]), range(P.shape[1])):\n        if P[i, j] &gt; 0:\n            I += P[i, j] * np.log(P[i, j] / (px[i] * py[j]))\n    return I\nI_XY, I_XZ = mutual(P_XY, p_Xf), mutual(P_XZ, p_Xf)\nprint(&quot;I(X;Y),I(X;Z):&quot;, I_XY, I_XZ)\nassert abs((I_XY - I_XZ) - Delta) &lt; 1e-9  # E1: 两条路径互验\n\n# ---- E3: sigma 把所有词符合并为单一符号 -&gt; H_Z=0, Delta=H_Y ----\nsigma_triv = np.array([0, 0])\nD3, HY3, HZ3 = measure(p_Xf, tau, sigma_triv)\nassert abs(HZ3 - 0.0) &lt; 1e-9 and abs(D3 - HY3) &lt; 1e-9\nassert D3 &gt;= 0.0                          # 数据处理不等式方向\nprint(&quot;Delta_triv:&quot;, D3, &quot;== H_Y:&quot;, HY3)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>H_Y≈0.6500</code>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac56\\ln\\tfrac56-\\tfrac16\\ln\\tfrac16$</span>），首个 <code>Delta≈0</code>；<code>I(X;Y)=I(X;Z)≈0.6500</code>；<code>Delta_triv≈0.6500</code>。所有断言容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-9}$</span>，远大于 float64 累加误差上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\times10^{-13}$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-退化情形与数值边界\">退化情形与数值边界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-退化情形与数值边界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>三个断言分别覆盖：形状契约（<code>p_X.shape==(n,)</code>、<code>tau.shape==(n,)</code>、<code>sigma.shape==(V,)</code>）、数值等价（定义路径 vs 熵差路径）、退化情形（单射粗粒化给零损失、平凡粗粒化给满损失）。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 非单射但把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_Y$</span> 支撑的两个不同词符合并，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Z)&lt;H(Y)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta&gt;0$</span>；此时若某纤维内 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_Y$</span> 质量相等，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 恰等于该纤维的熵贡献，可直接由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y)-H(Z)$</span> 读出。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_X$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}_X$</span> 上有零分量时，<code>mask</code> 屏蔽保证不产生 <code>-inf</code>；若强行对零概率取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span>，将得到 <code>nan</code>，这是必须用屏蔽而非 <code>np.log(p+eps)</code> 的原因——后者会引入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\text{eps})$</span> 的系统偏差，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-16}$</span> 但方向不可控。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>在确定性分词 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 与确定性粗粒化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Y\\to Z$</span> 为 Markov 链，互信息损失恒等于熵差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=H(Y)-H(Z)$</span>，数值测量只需两次聚合与两次熵求和。</li>\n<li>代码以三条独立路径互验：熵差路径、联合表定义路径、退化情形解析路径；解析期望值由 <code>sympy</code> 在块内给出，断言容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-9}$</span> 与 float64 误差阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-13}$</span> 匹配。</li>\n<li>数值稳定性的关键是零概率屏蔽（<span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0:=0$</span>）与 <code>np.bincount</code> 的显式 <code>minlength</code>，避免索引错位与 <code>nan</code>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\ge 0$</span> 的断言同时验证了数据处理不等式在本节离散设定下的方向。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-命题-熵差恒等式与数据处理不等式的等价性\">命题：熵差恒等式与数据处理不等式的等价性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-命题-熵差恒等式与数据处理不等式的等价性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 14.1（熵差表示）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 取值于有限集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}_X$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_X$</span> 在其上严格正，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau:\\mathcal{S}_X\\to V$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma:V\\to\\mathcal{Z}$</span> 为确定性映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau(X)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=\\sigma(Y)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;Y)-I(X;Z)=H(Y)-H(Z).$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal{S}_X|&lt;\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_X(x)&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal{S}_X$</span>；(A2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau,\\sigma$</span> 确定性。两条假设保证所有熵有限且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid X)=H(Z\\mid Y)=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由链式法则，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=H(Y)-H(Y\\mid X)$</span>。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau(X)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的确定性函数，给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 无不确定性，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid X)=0$</span>，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=H(Y)$</span>。同理，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=\\sigma(Y)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 的确定性函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Z\\mid Y)=0$</span>，且由 Markov 链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Y\\to Z$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Z\\mid X)=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)=H(Z)-H(Z\\mid X)=H(Z)$</span>。两式相减即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题把互信息损失的计算完全化为边缘熵的计算，绕开了联合表。其代价是：命题只对确定性映射成立。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 是随机的（例如带 dropout 的分词、或采样式 subword regularization），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid X)&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=H(Y)-H(Y\\mid X)&lt;H(Y)$</span>，熵差不再等于互信息损失。这一点在 Unigram 的采样分词中真实出现，故数值测量必须区分「确定性分词」与「随机分词」两种契约。本节代码只实现前者；后者需在联合表上直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)$</span>，代价是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(n|V|)$</span> 的存储。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 14.2（数据处理不等式的熵形式）</strong> 在命题 14.1 的假设下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Z)\\le H(Y)$</span>，等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_Y$</span> 的支撑上单射。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_Y$</span> 的支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}_Y$</span> 划分为纤维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^{-1}(z)\\cap\\mathcal{S}_Y$</span>。由链式法则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y)=H(Z)+H(Y\\mid Z)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid Z)=\\sum_{z}p_Z(z)H(Y\\mid Z=z)$</span>。每个条件熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid Z=z)$</span> 是纤维内条件分布的熵，非负；故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y)\\ge H(Z)$</span>。等号要求每个被访问的纤维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_Z(z)&gt;0$</span>）内条件分布退化，即纤维至多含一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_Y$</span> 正质量元素，这正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}_Y$</span> 上单射。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{\\tau,\\sigma}=H(Y\\mid Z)$</span> 的精确解释：信息损失恰是「已知块标号后对词符的残余不确定性」。它不是抽象上界，而是可逐纤维计算的量。若某纤维含词符 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_1,\\dots,v_m$</span>，其内条件概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i=p_Y(v_i)/p_Z(z)$</span>，则该纤维贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_Z(z)H(q)$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span>。这为工程上诊断「哪一次合并损失了多少信息」提供了直接公式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-逐纤维分解与-BPE-合并的损失核算\">逐纤维分解与 BPE 合并的损失核算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-逐纤维分解与-BPE-合并的损失核算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>BPE 的每次合并把两个相邻词符合并为一个新词符，等价于在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 上增加一次非单射粗粒化。设合并前词表为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span>、合并后为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V'$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|V'|=|V|-1$</span>（与本章 canonical claim「每次合并使词表减少 1」一致）。设被合并的对为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,b)$</span>，新词符 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma:V\\to V'$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(a)=\\sigma(b)=c$</span>，其余词符恒等。由推论 14.2，损失为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta_{\\text{merge}}=p_Y(c)\\,H\\!\\left(\\frac{p_Y(a)}{p_Y(c)},\\frac{p_Y(b)}{p_Y(c)}\\right),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_Y(c)=p_Y(a)+p_Y(b)$</span>（合并后新词符的概率等于两旧词符概率之和，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 在字符串层面不变）。这正是二元熵乘以纤维质量。BPE 的贪心准则「频率最大的相邻对」在概率语言下即「使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_Y(a)+p_Y(b)$</span> 最大的对」；它最大化被合并纤维的质量，但不最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{\\text{merge}}$</span>——后者还依赖纤维内的条件分布。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_Y(a)=p_Y(b)$</span> 时二元熵取最大值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ln 2$</span>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{\\text{merge}}=p_Y(c)\\ln 2$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_Y(a)\\gg p_Y(b)$</span> 时二元熵趋近 0，合并几乎无损。这解释了为何高频但分布极不均衡的对合并后困惑度上升很小，而均衡对合并会显著改变下游分布。</p>\n<p>数值上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{\\text{merge}}$</span> 的量级由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_Y(c)\\ln 2$</span> 控制。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_Y(c)\\approx 0.01$</span>，则单次合并损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lesssim 7\\times10^{-3}$</span> nat；若词表从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|V|$</span> 缩到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|V'|$</span> 需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|V|-|V'|$</span> 次合并，总损失上界为各次 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{\\text{merge}}$</span> 之和（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 复合的熵减可加：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y)-H(Z)=\\sum_{\\text{steps}}H(Y_{\\text{step}}\\mid Z_{\\text{step}})$</span>，每步条件熵非负）。此上界在代码中可通过逐次调用 <code>measure</code> 累加验证，误差仍为 float64 累加阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-13}$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-可逆性条件的数值判据\">可逆性条件的数值判据<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-可逆性条件的数值判据\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本章第 12 节给出分词器可逆性条件：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_X$</span> 支撑上单射当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{\\tau,\\mathrm{id}}=0$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{id}$</span> 为恒等粗粒化。数值上，判据为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y)=H(X)$</span>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau(X)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 确定性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y)\\le H(X)$</span> 恒成立，等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 在支撑上单射。代码中可加一条断言：对单射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>，<code>measure(p_X, tau, np.arange(V))</code> 返回的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 应为 0（恒等 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 不损失）。这与 E2 的断言互补：E2 检验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 单射，此判据检验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 单射。二者合起来给出「分词无损」的充分必要条件：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_X$</span> 支撑上单射。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 非单射（例如两个不同字符串映射到同一词符序列，如大小写折叠、Unicode 规范化），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y)&lt;H(X)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{\\tau,\\mathrm{id}}=H(X)-H(Y)&gt;0$</span>。此损失不可由任何下游 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 恢复，因为它发生在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Y$</span> 这一步。字节级回退（本章第 7 节）正是为把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 拉回单射而设计：以字节为字母表时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 是恒等映射的复合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y)=H(X)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=0$</span>；代价是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|V|$</span> 增大到 256 以上，与第 11 节的参数量权衡冲突。数值测量把这一权衡量化为：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_X$</span>，比较字节级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_b$</span> 与 BPE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_g$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y_b)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y_g)$</span>，差值即 BPE 引入的不可逆损失下界。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-有限样本估计的偏差与方差\">有限样本估计的偏差与方差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-有限样本估计的偏差与方差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以上均为总体量。工程中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_X$</span> 未知，只能由长度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 的样本估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_X$</span>，进而得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat H(Y)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat H(Z)$</span>。插入式估计量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat H=-\\sum_v\\hat p_Y(v)\\log\\hat p_Y(v)$</span> 的偏差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{|V|-1}{2N}+O(N^{-2})$</span>（|V| 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_Y$</span> 支撑大小），这是经典结果，此处只引用其形式不展开证明。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\Delta=\\hat H(Y)-\\hat H(Z)$</span> 的偏差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{|V|-|Z|}{2N}+O(N^{-2})$</span>，即词表越大、块越少，偏差越负（低估损失）。方差量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/N)$</span>。数值上若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=2000$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$|V|=50$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$|Z|=10$</span>，偏差约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{40}{4000}=-0.01$</span> nat，与单次合并损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$7\\times10^{-3}$</span> 同量级，故小样本下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\Delta$</span> 不可靠。代码中的解析基准用精确 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_X$</span> 而非样本，正是为把偏差项置零；若改用样本，断言容差须放宽到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/N)$</span> 阶，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-9}$</span>。这一区分是本节「解析期望值必须手算」纪律的直接体现：容差只能由误差阶推出，不能由「看起来差不多」推出。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ar08--h-与嵌入章的接口\">与嵌入章的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-与嵌入章的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>沿用前序各节符号：字母表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma$</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\Sigma|=A&lt;\\infty$</span>；字符串空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*=\\bigcup_{n\\ge 0}\\Sigma^n$</span> 配离散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2^{\\Sigma^*}$</span>（可数集，故一切子集可测）；词表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|V|=K$</span>；分词映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau:\\Sigma^*\\to V^*$</span> 为满射，一般非单射（第 1 节）。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{-1}(w)=\\{s\\in\\Sigma^*:\\tau(s)=w\\}$</span> 为词序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的原像纤维。嵌入章将给出嵌入映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E:V\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 为嵌入维度（第 2 节已讨论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 的约束关系）。本节新引入的唯一符号是纤维上的条件分布与嵌入诱导的随机变量，定义如下。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 15.1（纤维条件分布）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Sigma^*,2^{\\Sigma^*})$</span> 上的概率测度，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu(\\tau^{-1}(w))&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in V^*$</span> 成立（称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 纤维正）。定义纤维条件分布\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_w(S):=\\frac{\\mu\\big(S\\cap\\tau^{-1}(w)\\big)}{\\mu\\big(\\tau^{-1}(w)\\big)},\\qquad S\\in 2^{\\Sigma^*}.$$</div>\n即给定词序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 时原串 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在纤维内的条件分布。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 15.2（嵌入诱导变量）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E:V\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 可测（有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 上自动成立），对词序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=(w_1,\\dots,w_m)\\in V^*$</span> 定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi_E(w):=\\frac{1}{m}\\sum_{i=1}^{m}E(w_i)\\in\\mathbb{R}^d,$$</div>\n并对原串定义复合变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_E:=\\Phi_E\\circ\\tau:\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_E$</span> 称为词序列的嵌入读出（readout），<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_E$</span> 称为原串的嵌入读出。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 15.3（本节正则性）</strong> (i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 纤维正；(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|E(v)\\|_2\\le B_E&lt;\\infty$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in V$</span>；(iii) 各节所需的可积性由 (i)(ii) 联合保证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_E$</span> 有界故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_E$</span> 有界，一切期望与互信息有限。这三条在本节情境下均成立：<span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 有限使 (ii) 自动成立，纤维正性是第 1 节满射性的直接推论在测度层面的加强，若某纤维测度为零则该词序列在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 下不可观测，可从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*$</span> 中剔除而不影响下文。</p>\n<p>本节的任务是精确回答一个问题：嵌入章在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 上定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 并把词序列映为向量，这一接口在信息上损失了什么、保留了什么。核心结论是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的粗粒化损失发生在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\mapsto w$</span> 这一步，<span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 的线性读出不再引入新的信息损失（在读出可逆的意义下），但纤维内部的残余不确定性被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 完全丢弃，且这一丢弃量可由纤维条件分布的熵精确刻画。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-15-1-接口的因子分解\">15.1 接口的因子分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-15-1-接口的因子分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 15.4（读出因子分解）</strong> 在假设 15.3 下，复合变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_E=\\Phi_E\\circ\\tau$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(\\tau)$</span> 可测，且对任意有界可测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_\\mu[f(Z_E)]=\\mathbb{E}_{\\tau_\\#\\mu}\\Big[f\\big(\\Phi_E(w)\\big)\\Big],$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_\\#\\mu$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 推送测度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_\\#\\mu(w)=\\mu(\\tau^{-1}(w))$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 可测、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_E$</span> 在有限集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*$</span> 的每个长度层上可测（有限和），<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_E$</span> 可测且关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(\\tau)$</span> 可测。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 有界，按纤维分解：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_\\mu[f(Z_E)]=\\sum_{w\\in V^*}\\int_{\\tau^{-1}(w)}f(\\Phi_E(\\tau(s)))\\,\\mu(ds)=\\sum_{w\\in V^*}\\mu(\\tau^{-1}(w))\\,f(\\Phi_E(w)),$$</div>\n第一个等号用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 的可数分割与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-可加性（无需 Fubini，因分割可数且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 有界保证绝对收敛），第二个等号用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(s)=w$</span> 在纤维上为常数。右端即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\tau_\\#\\mu}[f(\\Phi_E(w))]$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 15.4 说明接口是两步复合：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\mapsto w$</span>（分词，粗粒化）再 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\mapsto\\Phi_E(w)$</span>（读出，确定性线性映射）。信息损失只可能来自第一步与读出非单射的部分。下一命题把“读出非单射”排除。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.5（读出在长度层上的单射性判据）</strong> 固定长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^m$</span> 为长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 的词序列。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_E$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^m$</span> 上单射当且仅当对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w,w'\\in V^m$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\ne w'$</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i E(w_i)\\ne\\sum_i E(w'_i)$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 中线性无关（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{E(v)\\}_{v\\in V}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维空间中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个向量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\le d$</span> 且任意有限子集线性无关），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_E$</span> 在每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^m$</span> 上单射。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 第一句为定义展开。第二句：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i E(w_i)=\\sum_i E(w'_i)$</span>，移项得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{v\\in V}n_v E(v)=0$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n_v$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w'$</span> 中出现次数之差，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n_v\\in\\mathbb{Z}$</span> 且不全为零。这与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{E(v)\\}$</span> 任意有限子集线性无关矛盾（取支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{v:n_v\\ne 0\\}$</span> 即有限子集）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 15.5 给出接口的第一个工程含义：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\le d$</span> 且嵌入向量处于一般位置时，读出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_E$</span> 不丢失词序列层面的信息；此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(s;Z_E)=I(s;w)$</span>，接口的全部信息损失来自分词。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K&gt;d$</span> 时（第 2 节讨论的典型情形），读出必然有碰撞，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(s;Z_E)&lt;I(s;w)$</span> 可能严格成立，这是嵌入章压缩的代价。本节后续只处理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\le d$</span> 的一般位置情形，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K&gt;d$</span> 的碰撞损失由第 2 节的维度约束刻画，不在此重复。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-15-2-接口处的互信息恒等式\">15.2 接口处的互信息恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-15-2-接口处的互信息恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 15.6（纤维熵分解）</strong> 在假设 15.3 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_E$</span> 于各 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^m$</span> 单射下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W=\\tau(S)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S\\sim\\mu$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(S;Z_E)=I(S;W)=H(W)-H(W\\mid S)=H(W),$$</div>\n且纤维残余熵为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(S\\mid W)=\\sum_{w\\in V^*}\\mu(\\tau^{-1}(w))\\,H(\\mu_w),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\mu_w)$</span> 为纤维条件分布的 Shannon 熵（离散，有限或可数）。从而\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(S)=H(W)+H(S\\mid W).$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_E=\\Phi_E(W)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_E$</span> 在支撑上单射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(Z_E)=\\sigma(W)$</span>（单射可测映射生成的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数相等），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(S;Z_E)=I(S;W)$</span>。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 的确定性函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(W\\mid S)=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(S;W)=H(W)-H(W\\mid S)=H(W)$</span>。纤维分解：按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 的值分组，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(S\\mid W)=\\sum_{w}\\mu(W=w)\\,H(S\\mid W=w)=\\sum_w \\mu(\\tau^{-1}(w))\\,H(\\mu_w),$$</div>\n这里用了条件熵的定义与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_w$</span> 的定义 15.1；求和绝对收敛因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\mu_w)\\le \\log|\\tau^{-1}(w)|\\le \\log A^{\\infty}$</span> 需谨慎——实际上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\mu_w)$</span> 可数无穷时取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup$</span> 截断极限，由单调收敛定理（非负项）保证定义良好，无需 Dominated Convergence。最后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(S)=H(W)+H(S\\mid W)$</span> 是链式法则。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>定理 15.6 是本节的核心接口结论：<strong>分词损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(S\\mid W)$</span> 是纤维内部的条件熵，嵌入读出在单射情形下不改变它</strong>。这给出一个可检验的恒等式：若在有限样本上估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat H(S)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat H(W)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat H(S\\mid W)$</span>，三者应满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat H(S)-\\hat H(W)-\\hat H(S\\mid W)\\to 0$</span>（在一致估计下）。代码节将数值验证这一点。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 15.7（接口的信息单调性）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1,\\tau_2$</span> 为两个分词映射，且存在可测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi:V_1^*\\to V_2^*$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2=\\phi\\circ\\tau_1$</span>（称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1$</span> 的进一步粗粒化）。则在假设 15.3 下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(S;Z_{E_2})\\le I(S;Z_{E_1}),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_i$</span> 为对应词表上的单射读出。等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{1\\#}\\mu$</span> 的支撑上单射。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2=\\phi\\circ\\tau_1$</span> 得马尔可夫链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S\\to W_1\\to W_2$</span>，数据处理不等式（第 3 节已证）给 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(S;W_2)\\le I(S;W_1)$</span>。由定理 15.6，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(S;Z_{E_i})=I(S;W_i)$</span>，代入即得。等号条件：数据处理不等式取等当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_1$</span> 下条件独立，而此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2=\\phi(W_1)$</span> 确定性依赖，条件独立等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_1$</span> 的支撑上单射（否则两个不同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_1$</span> 值合并，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_1$</span> 的额外信息在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 中丢失）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 15.7 把第 3 节的数据处理不等式具体化为接口语言：<strong>更粗的分词器在嵌入读出下单调地损失互信息，损失量等于被合并的纤维之间的条件熵</strong>。这为第 12 节的可逆性条件提供了信息论表述：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 可逆（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 支撑上单射）当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(S\\mid W)=0$</span>，即接口无损失。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-15-3-具体例子-二元字母表上的两种分词\">15.3 具体例子：二元字母表上的两种分词<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-15-3-具体例子-二元字母表上的两种分词\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma=\\{a,b\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V_1=\\{a,b\\}$</span>（字符级），<span class=\"math-inline\">$V_2=\\{a,b,ab\\}$</span>（含合并词）。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 为长度 2 的均匀分布：<span class=\"math-inline\">$aa,ab,ba,bb$</span> 各概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/4$</span>。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1$</span> 为逐字符分词（恒等，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_1=S$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2$</span> 为优先匹配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span> 的分词：<span class=\"math-inline\">$ab\\mapsto(ab)$</span>，其余逐字符。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2=\\phi\\circ\\tau_1$</span> 不成立（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1$</span> 是恒等，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 需把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,b)$</span> 映为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(ab)$</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,b)$</span> 也来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span> 以外的串？检查：<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_1=(a,b)$</span> 仅来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S=ab$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(a,b)=(ab)$</span> 良定义；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(a,a)=(a,a)$</span> 等）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1$</span> 的粗粒化。</p>\n<p>计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(W_1)=H(S)=\\log 4=2$</span> bit（自然对数下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ln 4$</span>，以下用 bit）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 的分布：<span class=\"math-inline\">$aa\\mapsto(a,a)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$ab\\mapsto(ab)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$ba\\mapsto(b,a)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$bb\\mapsto(b,b)$</span>，四个值各 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/4$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(W_2)=2$</span> bit。纤维：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2^{-1}((ab))=\\{ab\\}$</span> 单点，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\mu_{(ab)})=0$</span>；其余纤维均单点。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(S\\mid W_2)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(S;W_2)=2=I(S;W_1)$</span>。此例中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 在支撑上单射（四个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_1$</span> 值映到四个不同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 值），故推论 15.7 取等——粗粒化未损失信息，因为合并恰好是双射。</p>\n<p>若改 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ba$</span> 等概率且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2$</span> 把两者都映为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(ab)$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(a,b)=\\phi(b,a)=(ab)$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 三个值：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,a),(ab),(b,b)$</span>，概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/4,1/2,1/4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(W_2)=1.5$</span> bit，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(S\\mid W_2)=0.5$</span> bit，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(S;W_2)=1.5&lt;2$</span>。损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.5$</span> bit 正是纤维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{(a,b),(b,a)\\}$</span> 上的条件熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(1/2,1/2)=1$</span> bit 乘以纤维概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>。此例直接验证定理 15.6 的分解式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-15-5-接口对嵌入章的约束\">15.5 接口对嵌入章的约束<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-15-5-接口对嵌入章的约束\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定理 15.6 与推论 15.7 把嵌入章的设计约束写成两条可检验的不等式：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>读出单射性约束</strong>：若希望嵌入章不额外损失分词层信息，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\le d$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{E(v)\\}$</span> 处于一般位置（命题 15.5）。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K&gt;d$</span> 时，碰撞损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(S;W)-I(S;Z_E)$</span> 由第 2 节的维度约束给出上界，嵌入章不得声称读出无损。</li>\n<li><strong>粗粒化单调性约束</strong>：任何在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 上进一步合并词元的分词器（如 BPE 的后续合并、WordPiece 的继续合并）在接口处单调降低 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(S;Z_E)$</span>，降低量等于被合并纤维间的条件熵（推论 15.7）。嵌入章若报告“更大词表带来更好表示”，必须区分这是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(W)$</span> 的增加（词表扩大减少粗粒化损失）还是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 的增加（减少读出碰撞），二者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(S;Z_E)$</span> 上的作用方向相反，不可混为一谈。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这两条约束是本节与嵌入章的唯一接口内容；嵌入章的具体构造（位置编码、层归一化、注意力读出）不在本节展开，本节只保证：无论嵌入章内部如何设计，只要其最终读出经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_E$</span> 因子分解，上述信息恒等式与单调性即成立。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-15-6-读出碰撞的定量刻画\">15.6 读出碰撞的定量刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-15-6-读出碰撞的定量刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 15.5 只给出单射的充分条件，未量化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K&gt;d$</span> 时碰撞造成的信息损失。本节补上这一缺口，因为嵌入章在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K&gt;d$</span> 的典型情形下必须知道读出损失的确切形式，否则接口的两条约束中第一条只是定性的。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 15.8（读出碰撞等价关系）</strong> 固定长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^m$</span> 上定义等价关系\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w\\sim_E w' \\iff \\Phi_E(w)=\\Phi_E(w').$$</div>\n记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_E:=V^m/\\!\\sim_E$</span> 为碰撞类集合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_E:V^m\\to\\mathcal{C}_E$</span> 为商映射。称读出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_E$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^m$</span> 上诱导的碰撞变量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_E:=\\kappa_E\\circ\\tau$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.9（读出损失等于碰撞类内条件熵）</strong> 在假设 15.3 下，对任意长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 的词序列层，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_m$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{-1}(V^m)$</span> 上的条件化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_m=\\tau(S)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_m$</span> 下取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^m$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(S;Z_E\\mid S\\in\\tau^{-1}(V^m))=H(C_E)-H(C_E\\mid S)=H(C_E),$$</div>\n且读出损失为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(S;W_m)-I(S;Z_E\\mid S\\in\\tau^{-1}(V^m))=H(W_m\\mid C_E)=\\sum_{c\\in\\mathcal{C}_E}\\mu_m(C_E=c)\\,H\\big(\\kappa_E^{-1}(c)\\big),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\kappa_E^{-1}(c))$</span> 为类 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 内 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_m$</span> 的条件分布熵。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_E=\\Phi_E(W_m)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_E$</span> 的纤维恰为碰撞类，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(Z_E)=\\sigma(C_E)$</span>（商映射生成的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_E$</span> 生成的相同，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_E$</span> 在每个类上取常值且不同类取不同值）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(S;Z_E\\mid\\cdot)=I(S;C_E\\mid\\cdot)$</span>。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_E$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 的确定性函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(C_E\\mid S)=0$</span>，得第一式。第二式：链式法则给 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(W_m)=H(W_m,C_E)=H(C_E)+H(W_m\\mid C_E)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(S;W_m)=H(W_m)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_m$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 的函数），<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(S;Z_E)=H(C_E)$</span>，相减即得。类内条件熵按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_E$</span> 的值分组求和，与定理 15.6 的纤维分解同构。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 15.9 与定理 15.6 结构平行：分词损失是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>-纤维内的条件熵，读出损失是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_E$</span>-碰撞类内的条件熵，二者复合即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(S\\mid Z_E)=H(S\\mid W_m)+H(W_m\\mid C_E)$</span>。这给出接口的总账本\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(S)=H(Z_E)+H(S\\mid Z_E)=H(C_E)+H(W_m\\mid C_E)+H(S\\mid W_m),$$</div>\n三项分别对应：读出保留的信息、读出碰撞损失、分词粗粒化损失。嵌入章的任何设计决策只影响中间项与第一项的相对大小，末项由分词器单独决定，与嵌入无关。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 15.10（碰撞损失的维数上界）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 有界且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{E(v)\\}_{v\\in V}\\subset\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\mathcal{C}_E$</span>，类内条件熵满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H\\big(\\kappa_E^{-1}(c)\\big)\\le \\log\\big|\\kappa_E^{-1}(c)\\big|\\le \\log|V|^m=m\\log K.$$</div>\n从而总读出损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(W_m\\mid C_E)\\le m\\log K$</span>，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge m\\log K$</span> 时该上界不紧（此时可望单射）。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 第一不等式为离散熵的平凡上界；第二不等式因类内元素是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^m$</span> 的子集，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|V^m|=K^m$</span>。第三句：<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge m\\log K$</span> 仅是维数超过信息量的必要条件，非充分，故上界“不紧”指碰撞类平均大小可小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K^m$</span>，具体紧性依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 的几何排布，不在本节展开。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 15.10 说明：读出碰撞损失的上界随序列长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 线性增长，而嵌入维度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 固定，故长序列的读出必然碰撞——这是嵌入章用池化读出（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_E$</span> 为平均）替代逐位置读出的根本代价。若嵌入章改用逐位置读出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E(w_i)$</span> 而非池化，则碰撞只发生在单词层，损失上界降为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log K$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 无关；本节定义 15.2 选择池化读出是为了与嵌入章的平均池化接口对齐，逐位置读出的账本可由命题 15.9 逐层应用得到，不另立定义。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-15-7-接口的可加性与序列长度的影响\">15.7 接口的可加性与序列长度的影响<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-15-7-接口的可加性与序列长度的影响\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 15.11（长度层分解）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 上任意，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 逐层作用（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(s)$</span> 的长度由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的长度决定，第 1 节已隐含此性质）。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L=|S|$</span> 为原串长度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M=|\\tau(S)|$</span> 为词序列长度。则在假设 15.3 下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(S)=H(L)+H(S\\mid L),\\qquad H(W)=H(M)+H(W\\mid M),$$</div>\n且接口恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(S)=H(W)+H(S\\mid W)$</span> 按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L,M$</span> 分层成立：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(S\\mid L=\\ell)=H(W\\mid M=m_\\ell)+H(S\\mid W,\\,L=\\ell),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_\\ell$</span> 为长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 的串在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 下的词序列长度（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 长度确定）。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 第一式与第二式为链式法则。第三式：在条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L=\\ell$</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^{m_\\ell}$</span>，对该层应用定理 15.6 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(S\\mid L=\\ell)=H(W\\mid L=\\ell)+H(S\\mid W,L=\\ell)$</span>；又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L=\\ell$</span> 下的分布即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W\\mid M=m_\\ell$</span>（长度确定时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 一一对应），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(W\\mid L=\\ell)=H(W\\mid M=m_\\ell)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 15.11 的工程含义：分词损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(S\\mid W)$</span> 可分解为“长度层间损失”与“层内纤维损失”两部分。层间损失来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 改变长度（如 BPE 把两个字符合并为一个词元，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M&lt;L$</span>），层内损失来自同一长度层内不同串映到同一词序列。第 4 节 BPE 的每次合并使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 减一，故 BPE 主要制造层间损失；WordPiece 与 Unigram 的概率模型（第 5 节）在层内也制造损失。嵌入章若按固定长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 池化，则只观测到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=m$</span> 的层，层间损失被完全丢弃——这是池化读出的第二重代价，与 15.6 的碰撞损失独立。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 15.12（长度确定时的损失下界）</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 长度确定且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s,s'\\in\\Sigma^\\ell$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(s)=\\tau(s')$</span> 但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\ne s'$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(S\\mid W)&gt;0$</span>，且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(S\\mid W)\\ge \\min_{\\ell}\\mu(L=\\ell)\\cdot H\\big(\\mu_\\ell\\text{ 在某个非平凡纤维上}\\big)&gt;0.$$</div>\n<em>证明</em> 取使纤维非平凡的层 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span>，该层内 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(S\\mid W,L=\\ell)&gt;0$</span>（因纤维内至少两个点各有正概率，条件分布非退化）。由命题 15.11 第三式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(S\\mid W)\\ge \\mu(L=\\ell)H(S\\mid W,L=\\ell)&gt;0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 15.12 把第 12 节的可逆性条件量化为：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 支撑上单射当且仅当对所有层 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(S\\mid W,L=\\ell)=0$</span>，即每个纤维单点。这与定理 15.6 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(S\\mid W)=0$</span> 等价，但分层表述便于逐层检验分词器的可逆性——工程上只需检查每个长度层的最长纤维是否单点。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-15-8-与嵌入章读出设计的对接\">15.8 与嵌入章读出设计的对接<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-15-8-与嵌入章读出设计的对接\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后把上述账本翻译成嵌入章可直接使用的两条设计判据，作为接口的收束。</p>\n<p><strong>判据一（池化 vs 逐位置）</strong> 设嵌入章在词序列上产生逐位置表示 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_i\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d'}$</span>，最终读出为池化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=\\frac{1}{m}\\sum_i h_i$</span> 或拼接。由命题 15.9 与推论 15.10，池化读出的碰撞损失上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m\\log K$</span>，逐位置读出的碰撞损失上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log K$</span>。若嵌入章声称池化不损失信息，必须证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_E$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^m$</span> 上单射，而这要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d'\\ge m\\log K$</span>，通常不成立。故池化读出的信息损失是结构性的，不是实现细节。</p>\n<p><strong>判据二（词表扩大 vs 维度增加）</strong> 由推论 15.7，扩大词表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 减少分词损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(S\\mid W)$</span> 但增加读出碰撞损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(W_m\\mid C_E)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^m$</span> 变大而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 不变）；增加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 减少碰撞损失但不影响分词损失。二者对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(S;Z_E)$</span> 的作用方向相反，净效应由\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta I=\\Delta H(W)-\\Delta H(W_m\\mid C_E)$$</div>\n决定。嵌入章报告“更大词表更好”时，必须给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H(W)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta H(W_m\\mid C_E)$</span> 的分别估计，否则该结论在接口账本下不成立。第 11 节词表规模与参数量的权衡已从参数量角度讨论此消长，本节从信息角度给出同一消长的精确形式，二者一致但不重复。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>嵌入读出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_E=\\Phi_E\\circ\\tau$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(\\tau)$</span> 可测，接口按命题 15.4 因子分解为分词粗粒化与确定性线性读出两步；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_E$</span> 在长度层上单射（<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\le d$</span> 且嵌入向量一般位置）时，读出不引入额外信息损失。</li>\n<li>定理 15.6 给出接口的精确信息账本：<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(S;Z_E)=H(W)$</span>，分词损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(S\\mid W)$</span> 等于纤维条件熵的加权和，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(S)=H(W)+H(S\\mid W)$</span>；该恒等式在有限样本上可数值检验（代码节已验证）。</li>\n<li>推论 15.7 把第 3 节的数据处理不等式具体化为接口单调性：进一步粗粒化的分词器在嵌入读出下单调损失互信息，等号当且仅当粗粒化映射在支撑上单射；这为第 12 节可逆性条件提供了信息论等价表述，并约束嵌入章不得混淆词表扩大与维度增加的相反作用。</li>\n<li>读出碰撞损失由命题 15.9 精确刻画为碰撞类内条件熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(W_m\\mid C_E)$</span>，与分词损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(S\\mid W)$</span> 结构平行，二者复合给出接口总账本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(S)=H(C_E)+H(W_m\\mid C_E)+H(S\\mid W)$</span>；推论 15.10 给出碰撞损失随序列长度线性增长的上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m\\log K$</span>，说明池化读出的损失是结构性的。</li>\n<li>命题 15.11 把接口恒等式按长度层分解，区分层间损失（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 改变长度，如 BPE 合并）与层内纤维损失；推论 15.12 据此把第 12 节可逆性条件量化为逐层纤维单点判据，工程上可逐层检验。</li>\n<li>接口对嵌入章给出两条设计判据：池化读出的碰撞损失上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m\\log K$</span> 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d'\\ge m\\log K$</span> 才能声称无损；词表扩大与维度增加对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(S;Z_E)$</span> 的作用方向相反，净效应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta I=\\Delta H(W)-\\Delta H(W_m\\mid C_E)$</span> 必须分别估计，不可用“更大词表更好”一句带过。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"ar08--h-本章推导链-离散化是不可逆的粗粒化\">本章推导链：离散化是不可逆的粗粒化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-本章推导链-离散化是不可逆的粗粒化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已固定之符号，不引入任何新记号，仅作汇总以便推导链自洽。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>字符表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma$</span> 为有限集，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\Sigma|=c$</span>；字符串空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*=\\bigcup_{n\\ge 0}\\Sigma^n$</span>，配离散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2^{\\Sigma^*}$</span>（幂集，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 可数）。</li>\n<li>词表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 为有限集，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|V|=K$</span>；词序列空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*=\\bigcup_{m\\ge 0}V^m$</span>，配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2^{V^*}$</span>。</li>\n<li>分词映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau:\\Sigma^*\\to V^*$</span> 为满射但一般不单射（本章第 1 节已证）。</li>\n<li>随机字符串 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Sigma^*,\\sigma(\\Sigma^*))$</span>，其诱导的词序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau(X)$</span> 取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(V^*,\\sigma(V^*))$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 为任一取值于可测空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal{Z},\\sigma(\\mathcal{Z}))$</span> 的下游变量，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Y\\to Z$</span> 构成 Markov 链，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{Z\\mid X,Y}=P_{Z\\mid Y}$</span>。</li>\n<li>互信息 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(Y;Z)$</span> 均按标准定义，要求相应边缘与条件分布绝对连续于各自计数测度，从而所有求和绝对收敛；本节所有命题均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)&lt;\\infty$</span> 下陈述，以保证互信息有限。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>假设 A1（有限熵）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)&lt;\\infty$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sum_{x}P_X(x)\\log P_X(x)$</span> 绝对收敛。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 可数，此假设等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x P_X(x)|\\log P_X(x)|&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A2（Markov 性）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Y\\to Z$</span>，即对任意可测集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A\\subseteq\\mathcal{Z}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P(Z\\in A\\mid X=x,Y=y)=P(Z\\in A\\mid Y=y)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{XY}$</span>-几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,y)$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A3（满射性）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 满射，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(\\Sigma^*)=V^*$</span>。此假设保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 的支撑为整个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y)$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_Y$</span> 完全决定，不存在“词表外”质量。</p>\n<p>本节要完成四项证明义务：(i) 核心定义辨析——粗粒化与一般可测映射的区别；(ii) 主定理——数据处理不等式在分词情境下的完整证明；(iii) 可检验推论——信息损失的下界恒等式；(iv) 具体例子验证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-1-粗粒化的定义及其与一般可测映射的区别\">1. 粗粒化的定义及其与一般可测映射的区别<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-1-粗粒化的定义及其与一般可测映射的区别\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 1.1（粗粒化映射）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal{X},\\sigma(\\mathcal{X}))$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal{Y},\\sigma(\\mathcal{Y}))$</span> 为可测空间，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathcal{X}\\to\\mathcal{Y}$</span> 可测。称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 为<strong>粗粒化映射</strong>，若存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 上的等价关系 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sim_f$</span>，使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x)=f(x')$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\sim_f x'$</span>，且每个等价类在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(\\mathcal{X})$</span> 中可测。等价地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的纤维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{f^{-1}(y):y\\in\\mathcal{Y}\\}$</span> 构成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 的一个可测划分。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1.2（分词映射是粗粒化）</strong>：在假设 A3 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau:\\Sigma^*\\to V^*$</span> 是粗粒化映射。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\sim_\\tau x'$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(x)=\\tau(x')$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 可测（第 1 节已证：因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*$</span> 均为可数集配幂集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数，任意映射自动可测），每个纤维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{-1}(v)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 的可数子集，故属于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2^{\\Sigma^*}$</span>。纤维族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\tau^{-1}(v)\\}_{v\\in V^*}$</span> 两两不交且并为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span>（满射性保证无空纤维被遗漏），构成可测划分。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>与相邻概念的区别</strong>：(a) 一般可测映射不要求纤维构成划分的“信息压缩”语义——例如恒等映射是可测映射但非粗粒化（纤维为单点，无压缩）；(b) 粗粒化与“商映射”拓扑概念不同，此处仅在测度论层面，不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 连续或开；(c) 粗粒化与“充分统计量”方向相反：充分统计量是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to T(X)$</span> 保留关于某参数的全部信息，而粗粒化一般损失信息，本节主定理将量化此损失。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-2-主定理-分词情境下的数据处理不等式\">2. 主定理：分词情境下的数据处理不等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-2-主定理-分词情境下的数据处理不等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 2.1（数据处理不等式，分词形式）</strong>：在假设 A1、A2、A3 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 为随机字符串，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau(X)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Y\\to Z$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;Z)\\le I(X;Y).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：分三步。</p>\n<p><strong>第一步（互信息的链式分解）</strong>。由互信息链式法则（对可数空间成立，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)&lt;\\infty$</span> 保证各量有限）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;Y,Z)=I(X;Y)+I(X;Z\\mid Y).$$</div>\n<p>由 Markov 性 A2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{Z\\mid X,Y}=P_{Z\\mid Y}$</span>，故条件互信息</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;Z\\mid Y)=\\sum_{y}P_Y(y)\\sum_{x,z}P_{X,Z\\mid Y}(x,z\\mid y)\\log\\frac{P_{X,Z\\mid Y}(x,z\\mid y)}{P_{X\\mid Y}(x\\mid y)P_{Z\\mid Y}(z\\mid y)}.$$</div>\n<p>在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=y$</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 条件独立（Markov 性），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{X,Z\\mid Y}(x,z\\mid y)=P_{X\\mid Y}(x\\mid y)P_{Z\\mid Y}(z\\mid y)$</span>，对数项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log 1=0$</span>，求和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z\\mid Y)=0$</span>，从而</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;Y,Z)=I(X;Y).\\qquad (2.1)$$</div>\n<p><strong>第二步（对称性与非负性）</strong>。由互信息对称性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y,Z)=I(Y,Z;X)$</span>，再用链式法则反向分解：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(Y,Z;X)=I(Y;X)+I(Z;X\\mid Y).$$</div>\n<p>由第一步，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(Z;X\\mid Y)=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(Y,Z;X)=I(Y;X)=I(X;Y)$</span>，与 (2.1) 一致。</p>\n<p><strong>第三步（关键不等式）</strong>。由互信息链式法则的另一分解：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(Y,Z;X)=I(Z;X)+I(Y;X\\mid Z).$$</div>\n<p>因条件互信息非负（对可数空间，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(Y;X\\mid Z)=\\sum_z P_Z(z)\\,I(Y;X\\mid Z=z)\\ge 0$</span>，每项为 KL 散度），故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(Z;X)\\le I(Y,Z;X)=I(X;Y).$$</div>\n<p>即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)\\le I(X;Y)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 2.2（等号条件）</strong>：等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(Y;X\\mid Z)=0$</span>，即给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 条件独立。在分词情境下，这要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 已完全“吸收”了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的全部信息，一般仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 的可逆函数时发生（见第 12 节可逆性条件）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-3-可检验推论-信息损失的下界恒等式\">3. 可检验推论：信息损失的下界恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-3-可检验推论-信息损失的下界恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 3.1（粗粒化损失分解）</strong>：在定理 2.1 假设下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;Y)-I(X;Z)=I(Y;X\\mid Z)\\ge 0.$$</div>\n<p>特别地，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=Y$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)-I(X;Y)=0$</span>；取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 为常数得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)=0$</span>，损失为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由第三步分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(Y,Z;X)=I(Z;X)+I(Y;X\\mid Z)$</span> 与第一步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(Y,Z;X)=I(X;Y)$</span> 直接相减。非负性由条件互信息非负。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 3.2（熵形式的下界）</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 的确定性函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=g(Y)$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;Y)-I(X;Z)=H(Y\\mid Z)-H(Y\\mid X,Z).$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Y\\to Z$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=g(Y)$</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid X,Z)=H(Y\\mid X)$</span>（因给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 已定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=g(Y)$</span> 不提供额外信息），故损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=H(Y\\mid Z)-H(Y\\mid X)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由互信息定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=H(Y)-H(Y\\mid X)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)=H(Z)-H(Z\\mid X)$</span>。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=g(Y)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Z\\mid X)=H(g(Y)\\mid X)=H(g(Y)\\mid Y)$</span>（给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 确定，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(Y)$</span> 确定）<span class=\"math-inline\">$=0$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 确定性。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)=H(Z)$</span>。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Z)=H(Y)-H(Y\\mid Z)$</span>，代入得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)=H(Y)-H(Y\\mid Z)$</span>。相减即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出<strong>可数值检验的恒等式</strong>：对任意分词器，若取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 为词序列的某个确定性粗粒化（如仅保留词表索引的哈希桶），则损失恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid Z)-H(Y\\mid X)$</span>，可在第 14 节代码中直接测量。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-4-具体例子验证公式\">4. 具体例子验证公式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-4-具体例子验证公式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>例 4.1</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma=\\{a,b\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V=\\{aa,ab,ba,bb\\}$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V=\\Sigma^2$</span>，固定长度 2 的分词），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 将字符串按每 2 字符切分，尾部不足补特殊符（此处忽略补符，仅考虑长度为偶数的串）。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 为长度 2 的均匀随机串，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_X(x)=1/4$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\Sigma^2$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau(X)=X$</span>（因长度 2 恰为一个词），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 在长度 2 子集上为双射。</p>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 的首字符：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=g(Y)=Y_1\\in\\{a,b\\}$</span>。计算：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)=\\log 4=2$</span> 比特（以 2 为底）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y)=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid X)=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=2$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Z)=1$</span>（首字符均匀），<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Z\\mid X)=0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 确定），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)=1$</span>。</li>\n<li>损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)-I(X;Z)=1$</span>。</li>\n<li>由推论 3.2：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid Z)=H(Y)-H(Z)=2-1=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid X)=0$</span>，损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=1-0=1$</span>。恒等式验证通过。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>例 4.2（非单射情形）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma=\\{a,b\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V=\\{a,b,ab\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 将连续出现的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span> 合并为词 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span>，其余单字符成词。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 为长度 2 的均匀串：<span class=\"math-inline\">$aa,ab,ba,bb$</span> 各 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/4$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(aa)=aa$</span>（两词 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a,a$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(ab)=ab$</span>（一词），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(ba)=ba$</span>（两词 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,a$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(bb)=bb$</span>（两词 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,b$</span>）。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(aa)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(bb)$</span> 的词序列长度均为 2，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(ab)$</span> 长度为 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(ba)$</span> 长度为 2。<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 的分布：<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_Y(aa)=1/4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_Y(ab)=1/4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_Y(ba)=1/4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_Y(bb)=1/4$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y)=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=2$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 在此子集上单射）。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=|Y|$</span>（词序列长度），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z\\in\\{1,2\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P(Z=1)=1/4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P(Z=2)=3/4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Z)=h(1/4)\\approx 0.811$</span> 比特。<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Z\\mid X)=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)=H(Z)\\approx 0.811$</span>。损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx 1.189$</span>。此例说明：即使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 在受限子集上单射，下游粗粒化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=g(Y)$</span> 仍造成损失，且损失量由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid Z)$</span> 精确给出。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-5-推导链的闭合-不可逆性的三重含义\">5. 推导链的闭合：不可逆性的三重含义<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-5-推导链的闭合-不可逆性的三重含义\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节推导链将前序各节的结论串为一条闭合逻辑：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>映射层</strong>（第 1 节）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 满射非单射，纤维构成可测划分，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 是粗粒化（命题 1.2）。</li>\n<li><strong>信息层</strong>（第 3 节 + 本节定理 2.1）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Y\\to Z$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)\\le I(X;Y)$</span>，等号仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 可逆吸收 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span>（注 2.2）。</li>\n<li><strong>损失层</strong>（本节推论 3.1、3.2）：损失恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(Y;X\\mid Z)$</span>，对确定性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=g(Y)$</span> 化为熵差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid Z)-H(Y\\mid X)$</span>，可数值测量（第 14 节代码）。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>“不可逆”在此有三重精确含义：(a) <strong>映射不可逆</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 非单射，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\ne x'$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(x)=\\tau(x')$</span>，故不存在左逆 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{-1}$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{-1}\\circ\\tau=\\mathrm{id}_{\\Sigma^*}$</span>（第 12 节给出可逆性条件）；(b) <strong>信息不可逆</strong>：一旦取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau(X)$</span>，任何下游 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)\\le I(X;Y)$</span>，损失不能通过后处理恢复（数据处理不等式的方向性）；(c) <strong>概率不可逆</strong>：同一字符串的不同分词导致不同概率（第 10 节反例），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_X$</span> 不能由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_Y$</span> 唯一恢复，除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_X$</span> 的支撑上单射。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.1（不可逆性的等价刻画）</strong>：在假设 A1–A3 下，以下三条等价：(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(P_X)$</span> 上单射；(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=H(X)$</span>；(iii) 存在可测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s:V^*\\to\\Sigma^*$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\circ\\tau=\\mathrm{id}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(P_X)$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_X$</span>-几乎处处成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：(i)<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span>(ii)：单射下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid X)=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y)=0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 确定），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=H(X)-H(X\\mid Y)=H(X)$</span>。(ii)<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span>(iii)：<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=H(X)$</span> 推出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y)=0$</span>，即在可数空间上存在确定性解码 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X=s(Y)$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span>-a.s.，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(\\tau(X))=X$</span>。(iii)<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span>(i)：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\ne x'$</span> 均在支撑上且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(x)=\\tau(x')$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(\\tau(x))=s(\\tau(x'))$</span> 推出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=x'$</span>，矛盾。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题把“不可逆”精确锚定在支撑集上：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_X$</span> 支撑退化（如仅一个字符串），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 在支撑上恒单射，信息无损，但这是平凡情形；实际语言分布支撑为整个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 的子集且通常含多个原像，故损失严格为正。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nfrom collections import Counter\nfrom math import log2\n\ndef entropy(counts, total):\n    return -sum((c/total)*log2(c/total) for c in counts if c &gt; 0)\n\n# 例 4.1：Sigma={a,b}, V=Sigma^2, tau 为长度2切分\nX = ['aa','ab','ba','bb']\nP_X = {x: 0.25 for x in X}\ntau = {x: x for x in X}          # 长度2上恒等\ng = lambda y: y[0]               # Z = 首字符\n\n# 计算 H(X), H(Y), H(Z), I(X;Y), I(X;Z)\nH_X = entropy([1,1,1,1], 4)\nY_counts = Counter(tau[x] for x in X)\nH_Y = entropy(Y_counts.values(), 4)\nZ_counts = Counter(g(tau[x]) for x in X)\nH_Z = entropy(Z_counts.values(), 4)\n# H(Y|X)=0, H(Z|X)=0（确定性）\nI_XY = H_Y - 0.0\nI_XZ = H_Z - 0.0\nloss = I_XY - I_XZ\n# 推论3.2: loss = H(Y|Z) - H(Y|X) = (H_Y - H_Z) - 0\nloss_formula = (H_Y - H_Z) - 0.0\n\nassert abs(H_X - 2.0) &lt; 1e-12\nassert abs(H_Y - 2.0) &lt; 1e-12\nassert abs(H_Z - 1.0) &lt; 1e-12\nassert abs(I_XY - 2.0) &lt; 1e-12\nassert abs(I_XZ - 1.0) &lt; 1e-12\nassert abs(loss - 1.0) &lt; 1e-12\nassert abs(loss - loss_formula) &lt; 1e-12\n\nprint(&quot;H(X) =&quot;, H_X, &quot; H(Y) =&quot;, H_Y, &quot; H(Z) =&quot;, H_Z)\nprint(&quot;I(X;Y) =&quot;, I_XY, &quot; I(X;Z) =&quot;, I_XZ, &quot; loss =&quot;, loss)\nprint(&quot;推论3.2 恒等式验证: loss == H(Y|Z)-H(Y|X) -&gt;&quot;, abs(loss-loss_formula)&lt;1e-12)\n\n# 例 4.2：非单射情形，Z=|Y|\nX2 = ['aa','ab','ba','bb']\ntau2 = {'aa':('a','a'), 'ab':('ab',), 'ba':('b','a'), 'bb':('b','b')}\nY2 = [tau2[x] for x in X2]\nH_Y2 = entropy([1,1,1,1], 4)     # 四个不同词序列，各1/4\nZ2 = [len(y) for y in Y2]        # 长度\nZ2_counts = Counter(Z2)\nH_Z2 = entropy(Z2_counts.values(), 4)\nI_XY2 = H_Y2 - 0.0\nI_XZ2 = H_Z2 - 0.0\nloss2 = I_XY2 - I_XZ2\nloss2_formula = (H_Y2 - H_Z2) - 0.0\n\nassert abs(H_Y2 - 2.0) &lt; 1e-12\nassert abs(H_Z2 - (-(0.25*log2(0.25) + 0.75*log2(0.75)))) &lt; 1e-12\nassert abs(loss2 - loss2_formula) &lt; 1e-12\nassert loss2 &gt; 0\n\nprint(&quot;例4.2: H(Y) =&quot;, H_Y2, &quot; H(Z) =&quot;, H_Z2, &quot; loss =&quot;, loss2)\nprint(&quot;形状检查: len(X)=&quot;, len(X), &quot; len(Y2)=&quot;, len(Y2), &quot; len(Z2)=&quot;, len(Z2))\nprint(&quot;全部断言通过&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>分词映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau:\\Sigma^*\\to V^*$</span> 在满射性（A3）下是粗粒化映射，其纤维构成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 的可测划分；这与一般可测映射、充分统计量有严格区别（命题 1.2、定义 1.1）。</li>\n<li>在有限熵（A1）与 Markov 性（A2）下，数据处理不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)\\le I(X;Y)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Y=\\tau(X)\\to Z$</span> 成立，等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(Y;X\\mid Z)=0$</span>（定理 2.1、注 2.2）；损失恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)-I(X;Z)=I(Y;X\\mid Z)$</span> 对确定性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=g(Y)$</span> 化为熵差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid Z)-H(Y\\mid X)$</span>，可数值检验（推论 3.1、3.2、例 4.1、4.2）。</li>\n<li>不可逆性有三重精确含义——映射非单射、信息损失不可后处理恢复、概率不可由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_Y$</span> 唯一恢复——三者通过命题 5.1 在支撑集上等价刻画，并与第 12 节可逆性条件、第 10 节反例、第 14 节数值测量直接接口。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-6-粗粒化的算子表述与损失的可加性\">6. 粗粒化的算子表述与损失的可加性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-6-粗粒化的算子表述与损失的可加性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前五小节把不可逆性建立在互信息层面，但互信息是标量泛函，无法刻画“逐纤维”的损失结构。本节引入一个算子视角，使损失可加性成为可逐项验证的恒等式，而非仅整体不等式。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 6.1（纤维条件化算子）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau:\\Sigma^*\\to V^*$</span> 为粗粒化映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_X$</span> 满足 A1。定义算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_\\tau$</span> 作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 上的函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(\\mathcal{C}_\\tau f)(v)=\\mathbb{E}_{P_X}\\big[f(X)\\mid \\tau(X)=v\\big],\\qquad v\\in\\mathrm{supp}(P_Y).$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\notin\\mathrm{supp}(P_Y)$</span> 约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal{C}_\\tau f)(v)=0$</span>。此算子把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^*$</span> 上的可测函数映为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^*$</span> 上的函数，是条件期望在纤维划分下的实现。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6.2（算子与熵的关系）</strong>：在 A1、A3 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathrm{supp}(P_X)$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_v=P_Y(v)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{x\\mid v}=P_{X\\mid Y}(x\\mid v)$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(X\\mid Y)=\\sum_{v\\in\\mathrm{supp}(P_Y)}p_v\\Big(-\\sum_{x\\in\\tau^{-1}(v)}p_{x\\mid v}\\log p_{x\\mid v}\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y)$</span> 是各纤维内条件熵按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_v$</span> 加权的和，权重之和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由条件熵定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y)=\\sum_v p_v H(X\\mid Y=v)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y=v)=-\\sum_{x}P_{X\\mid Y}(x\\mid v)\\log P_{X\\mid Y}(x\\mid v)$</span>，在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=v$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的支撑含于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{-1}(v)$</span>，故求和遍历该纤维。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题给出<strong>逐纤维损失</strong>的精确表达式：纤维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{-1}(v)$</span> 内部的熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y=v)$</span> 正是该纤维被粗粒化“压掉”的信息量，按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_v$</span> 加权求和即总损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y)$</span>。当纤维为单点（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 在该处单射）时该项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>；纤维越大且内部分布越均匀，损失越大。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 6.3（损失的可加分解）</strong>：在定理 2.1 假设下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=g(Y)$</span> 为确定性下游，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;Y)-I(X;Z)=\\underbrace{H(X\\mid Z)-H(X\\mid Y)}_{\\text{纤维间重组损失}}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由推论 3.1，损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=I(Y;X\\mid Z)=H(X\\mid Z)-H(X\\mid Y,Z)$</span>。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=g(Y)$</span>，给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 确定，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y,Z)=H(X\\mid Y)$</span>。代入即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此分解的语义是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 自身的纤维内损失，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Z)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 进一步合并纤维造成的额外损失，两者之差即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 层面引入的新粗粒化损失。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 为单射（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=Y$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Z)=H(X\\mid Y)$</span>，损失为零，与注 2.2 一致。</p>\n<p><strong>例 6.4（可加性数值验证）</strong>：沿用例 4.2 的设定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 均匀于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{aa,ab,ba,bb\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span> 为单词。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y)$</span>：四个纤维分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{-1}((a,a))=\\{aa\\}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{-1}((ab,))=\\{ab\\}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{-1}((b,a))=\\{ba\\}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{-1}((b,b))=\\{bb\\}$</span>，每个纤维单点，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y)=0$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=|Y|$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=1$</span> 对应纤维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{ab\\}$</span>（单点），<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=2$</span> 对应纤维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{aa,ba,bb\\}$</span>（三点，条件分布均匀 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/3$</span> 各），故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(X\\mid Z)=\\tfrac14\\cdot 0+\\tfrac34\\cdot\\log_2 3=\\tfrac34\\log_2 3\\approx 1.189.$$</div>\n<p>损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=H(X\\mid Z)-H(X\\mid Y)=\\tfrac34\\log_2 3$</span>，与例 4.2 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)-I(X;Z)=2-0.811\\approx 1.189$</span> 一致（注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.811=h(1/4)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2-h(1/4)=\\tfrac34\\log_2 3$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h(1/4)=\\tfrac14\\log_2 4+\\tfrac34\\log_2\\tfrac43=0.5+\\tfrac34(2-\\log_2 3)$</span> 化简可得）。此例把“纤维内损失为零、纤维间重组损失为正”的结构显式算出。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-7-不可逆性的单调性-粗粒化复合的损失不减\">7. 不可逆性的单调性：粗粒化复合的损失不减<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-7-不可逆性的单调性-粗粒化复合的损失不减\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序命题 5.1 刻画了单次粗粒化的可逆性条件，但实际分词管线常为多级复合（如字节级回退 + BPE 合并 + 后处理规范化）。本节证明复合粗粒化的损失对复合顺序单调，从而“不可逆”在复合下不会被稀释。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 7.1（粗粒化复合）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1:\\Sigma^*\\to W^*$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2:W^*\\to V^*$</span> 均为粗粒化映射，定义复合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{2\\circ 1}=\\tau_2\\circ\\tau_1:\\Sigma^*\\to V^*$</span>。称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{2\\circ 1}$</span> 为两级粗粒化。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7.2（复合的纤维结构）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{2\\circ 1}$</span> 的纤维为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1$</span>-纤维在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2$</span>-纤维下的并：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(\\tau_2\\circ\\tau_1)^{-1}(v)=\\bigcup_{w\\in\\tau_2^{-1}(v)}\\tau_1^{-1}(w).$$</div>\n<p>且该并为不交并（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2^{-1}(v)$</span> 两两不交，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1^{-1}(w)$</span> 对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 内两两不交，跨 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 亦不交）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in(\\tau_2\\circ\\tau_1)^{-1}(v)$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2(\\tau_1(x))=v$</span>，即存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=\\tau_1(x)$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2(w)=v$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\tau_1^{-1}(w)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in\\tau_2^{-1}(v)$</span>。不交性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2^{-1}(v)$</span> 的两两不交与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1^{-1}(w)$</span> 的两两不交直接推出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>定理 7.3（复合损失不减）</strong>：在 A1、A3 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_1=\\tau_1(X)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_2=\\tau_2(Y_1)=\\tau_{2\\circ 1}(X)$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;Y_2)\\le I(X;Y_1)\\le I(X;X)=H(X).$$</div>\n<p>且第二不等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(P_X)$</span> 上单射时取等。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：第一不等号即定理 2.1 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=Y_1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=Y_2$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Y_1\\to Y_2$</span> 构成 Markov 链：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_1$</span> 后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_2=\\tau_2(Y_1)$</span> 确定）。第二不等号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;X)=H(X)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y_1)=H(X)-H(X\\mid Y_1)\\le H(X)$</span>，等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y_1)=0$</span>，由命题 5.1 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1$</span> 在支撑上单射。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 7.4（复合损失的分解）</strong>：在定理 7.3 下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(X)-I(X;Y_2)=\\underbrace{H(X\\mid Y_1)}_{\\tau_1\\text{ 的纤维内损失}}+\\underbrace{H(Y_1\\mid Y_2)}_{\\tau_2\\text{ 在 }Y_1\\text{ 层面的损失}}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由链式法则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)-I(X;Y_2)=H(X\\mid Y_2)$</span>，再用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y_2)=H(X\\mid Y_1)+H(Y_1\\mid Y_2)-H(Y_1\\mid X,Y_2)$</span>。因给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_1$</span> 确定、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_2$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_1$</span> 确定，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y_1\\mid X,Y_2)=0$</span>。代入即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论把复合损失拆为两级：第一级是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1$</span> 在字符层面的纤维内损失，第二级是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2$</span> 在词层面的纤维内损失（注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y_1\\mid Y_2)$</span> 正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2$</span> 的纤维内熵）。两级损失均为非负，故复合不会“抵消”不可逆性——这与工程直觉一致：字节级回退（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1$</span> 为字节到字符的粗粒化）后再 BPE（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2$</span> 为字符到子词的粗粒化），损失是两级纤维熵之和，不可能通过调换顺序减少。</p>\n<p><strong>例 7.5（两级复合的数值）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma=\\{a,b\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1$</span> 为恒等（字符到字符，单射），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2$</span> 为 BPE 式合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab\\to\\langle ab\\rangle$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 均匀于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{aa,ab,ba,bb\\}$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_1=X$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y_1)=0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_2$</span> 的纤维为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\langle ab\\rangle\\}$</span> 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{ab\\}$</span>（单点）、其余三个词序列各对应单点，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y_1\\mid Y_2)=0$</span>，总损失为零。若改取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1$</span> 为“首字符投影”<span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\mapsto x_1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_1\\in\\{a,b\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y_1)=1$</span>（每纤维两点均匀）；再取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2$</span> 为恒等，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y_1\\mid Y_2)=0$</span>，总损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。此例说明：复合损失的来源可精确定位到具体一级，而非笼统的“分词损失”。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-8-与第-10-12-14-节的接口-不可逆性的三条可检验路径\">8. 与第 10、12、14 节的接口：不可逆性的三条可检验路径<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-8-与第-10-12-14-节的接口-不可逆性的三条可检验路径\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节推导链的闭合依赖三条下游接口，此处仅陈述接口的数学形式，不展开各节内容。</p>\n<p><strong>接口 8.1（第 10 节反例）</strong>：命题 5.1 的逆否形式给出反例构造准则——若存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\ne x'$</span> 均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(P_X)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(x)=\\tau(x')$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)&lt;H(X)$</span>，且同一字符串的不同分词导致不同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{Y\\mid X}$</span>。第 10 节将据此构造具体反例，其数学本质即本节命题 6.2 中某纤维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y=v)&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>接口 8.2（第 12 节可逆性条件）</strong>：命题 5.1 的 (iii) 给出可逆性的充要条件：存在可测解码 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\circ\\tau=\\mathrm{id}$</span> 在支撑上几乎处处成立。第 12 节将把此条件细化为对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的纤维大小与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_X$</span> 支撑的联合约束，其证明直接引用本节命题 5.1，不重复。</p>\n<p><strong>接口 8.3（第 14 节数值测量）</strong>：推论 3.2 与推论 6.3 给出损失的两个可计算表达式——<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid Z)-H(Y\\mid X)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Z)-H(X\\mid Y)$</span>，二者在确定性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=g(Y)$</span> 下相等（由例 6.4 验证）。第 14 节代码将任选其一实现，并以本节例 4.1、4.2、6.4 为单元测试基准。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8.4（三接口的一致性）</strong>：在 A1–A3 下，以下三条陈述等价：(i) 第 10 节反例存在（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 在支撑上非单射）；(ii) 第 12 节可逆性条件不成立（不存在解码 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>）；(iii) 第 14 节测量的损失严格为正（<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)&lt;H(X)$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 5.1，(i)<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Leftrightarrow$</span>(ii)。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=H(X)-H(X\\mid Y)$</span>，(iii)<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Leftrightarrow H(X\\mid Y)&gt;0$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y)&gt;0$</span> 当且仅当存在纤维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_v&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y=v)&gt;0$</span>，即该纤维含至少两个支撑点，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 在支撑上非单射，故 (iii)<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Leftrightarrow$</span>(i)。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题确保本节推导链与后续三节不会出现逻辑分叉：反例、可逆性、数值测量是同一数学事实的三种呈现，其共同根源是命题 6.2 的纤维内熵非零。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nfrom collections import Counter\nfrom math import log2\n\ndef entropy(counts, total):\n    return -sum((c/total)*log2(c/total) for c in counts if c &gt; 0)\n\ndef cond_entropy(X, Y, P_X):\n    # H(X|Y) = sum_v p_v H(X|Y=v)\n    fibers = {}\n    for x, y in zip(X, Y):\n        fibers.setdefault(y, []).append(x)\n    total = sum(P_X[x] for x in X)\n    H = 0.0\n    for y, xs in fibers.items():\n        p_v = sum(P_X[x] for x in xs) / total\n        inner = Counter(xs)\n        n = len(xs)\n        H_v = entropy(inner.values(), n)\n        H += p_v * H_v\n    return H\n\n# 例 6.4：验证 H(X|Y)=0, H(X|Z)=3/4*log2(3), loss 可加\nX = ['aa','ab','ba','bb']\nP_X = {x: 0.25 for x in X}\ntau = {'aa':('a','a'), 'ab':('ab',), 'ba':('b','a'), 'bb':('b','b')}\nY = [tau[x] for x in X]\nZ = [len(y) for y in Y]\n\nH_X_given_Y = cond_entropy(X, Y, P_X)\nH_X_given_Z = cond_entropy(X, Z, P_X)\nloss_additive = H_X_given_Z - H_X_given_Y\n\nassert abs(H_X_given_Y - 0.0) &lt; 1e-12\nassert abs(H_X_given_Z - 0.75*log2(3)) &lt; 1e-12\nassert abs(loss_additive - 0.75*log2(3)) &lt; 1e-12\n\nprint(&quot;H(X|Y) =&quot;, H_X_given_Y, &quot; H(X|Z) =&quot;, H_X_given_Z, &quot; loss =&quot;, loss_additive)\nprint(&quot;推论6.3 可加分解验证通过:&quot;, abs(loss_additive - 0.75*log2(3))&lt;1e-12)\n\n# 例 7.5：两级复合损失分解\n# 情形一：tau1 恒等，tau2 合并 ab\nX1 = ['aa','ab','ba','bb']\ntau1_id = {x: x for x in X1}\nY1_a = [tau1_id[x] for x in X1]\ntau2_bpe = {'aa':('a','a'), 'ab':('ab',), 'ba':('b','a'), 'bb':('b','b')}\nY2_a = [tau2_bpe[y] for y in Y1_a]\nloss1 = cond_entropy(X1, Y1_a, P_X) + cond_entropy(Y1_a, Y2_a, {y:0.25 for y in Y1_a})\nassert abs(loss1 - 0.0) &lt; 1e-12\n\n# 情形二：tau1 首字符投影，tau2 恒等\ntau1_proj = {'aa':'a', 'ab':'a', 'ba':'b', 'bb':'b'}\nY1_b = [tau1_proj[x] for x in X1]\ntau2_id = {y: y for y in set(Y1_b)}\nY2_b = [tau2_id[y] for y in Y1_b]\nP_Y1 = {'a':0.5, 'b':0.5}\nloss2 = cond_entropy(X1, Y1_b, P_X) + cond_entropy(Y1_b, Y2_b, P_Y1)\nassert abs(loss2 - 1.0) &lt; 1e-12\n\nprint(&quot;例7.5 情形一 loss =&quot;, loss1, &quot; 情形二 loss =&quot;, loss2)\nprint(&quot;两级损失分解形状: len(X1)=&quot;, len(X1), &quot; len(Y1_b)=&quot;, len(Y1_b), &quot; len(Y2_b)=&quot;, len(Y2_b))\nprint(&quot;全部断言通过&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<h4 id=\"ar08--h-9-粗粒化损失的信息几何解释\">9. 粗粒化损失的信息几何解释<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar08--h-9-粗粒化损失的信息几何解释\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后给出损失的一个几何刻画，使“不可逆”在信息几何层面获得坐标无关的表述，并与后续嵌入章的接口（第 15 节）对齐。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 9.1（纤维单纯形）</strong>：对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in\\mathrm{supp}(P_Y)$</span>，记纤维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{-1}(v)$</span> 上的条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\cdot\\mid v}=(p_{x\\mid v})_{x\\in\\tau^{-1}(v)}$</span>。该分布位于维数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\tau^{-1}(v)|-1$</span> 的概率单纯形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_v$</span> 内。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.2（损失为纤维单纯形上的 KL 散度加权和）</strong>：在 A1、A3 下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(X\\mid Y)=\\sum_{v}p_v\\Big(\\log|\\tau^{-1}(v)|-\\mathrm{KL}(p_{\\cdot\\mid v}\\,\\|\\,\\mathrm{Unif}_v)\\Big),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Unif}_v$</span> 为纤维上的均匀分布。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对单纤维，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y=v)=-\\sum_x p_{x\\mid v}\\log p_{x\\mid v}$</span>。写 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{x\\mid v}=\\frac{1}{|\\tau^{-1}(v)|}\\cdot\\frac{p_{x\\mid v}}{\\mathrm{Unif}_v(x)}$</span>，取对数分解：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(X\\mid Y=v)=\\log|\\tau^{-1}(v)|-\\sum_x p_{x\\mid v}\\log\\frac{p_{x\\mid v}}{\\mathrm{Unif}_v(x)}=\\log|\\tau^{-1}(v)|-\\mathrm{KL}(p_{\\cdot\\mid v}\\,\\|\\,\\mathrm{Unif}_v).$$</div>\n<p>按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_v$</span> 加权求和即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的几何语义清晰：纤维内损失由两部分组成——纤维大小的对数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log|\\tau^{-1}(v)|$</span>（“粗粒化的分辨率代价”）减去条件分布偏离均匀的 KL 散度（“分布集中带来的节省”）。当条件分布退化为单点（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 在该纤维单射）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log 1=0$</span> 且 KL 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，损失为零；当条件分布均匀且纤维大小为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 时，损失为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log m$</span>，达到该纤维的最大值。这解释了为何 BPE 合并高频相邻对（第 4 节）在信息层面是“用纤维大小换频率集中”：合并使纤维变大（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log|\\tau^{-1}(v)|$</span> 增），但高频对的纤维内分布往往集中（KL 项抵消部分损失），故净损失小于盲目合并。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 9.3（损失的上界）</strong>：在命题 9.2 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y)\\le\\sum_v p_v\\log|\\tau^{-1}(v)|\\le\\log\\max_v|\\tau^{-1}(v)|$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：第一不等号由 KL 非负；第二不等号由加权平均不超过最大项。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此上界给出工程上的可检验约束：若分词器的最大纤维大小被限制为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span>，则单字符层面的信息损失不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log m$</span> 比特。第 14 节代码可直接以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_v p_v\\log|\\tau^{-1}(v)|$</span> 为上界基准，验证实测损失不超过它。</p>\n<p><strong>例 9.4（BPE 合并的几何代价）</strong>：设某步 BPE 合并相邻对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a,b)$</span> 为词 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span>，合并前纤维为单点（损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>），合并后纤维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{-1}(ab)$</span> 含原字符串 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span> 及其可能的更长原像（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span> 作为子串出现在更长串中且被同一规则切分）。若该纤维在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_X$</span> 下条件分布均匀于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 个原像，则新增损失恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log m$</span>；若分布集中于一个原像（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span> 几乎总以独立词出现），则新增损失接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。这与第 4 节 BPE 贪心准则“频率最大的相邻对”形成信息论对照：高频对的纤维内分布集中，故 KL 项大、净损失小，贪心合并因此在信息效率上合理。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.5（几何解释与命题 6.2 的一致性）</strong>：命题 9.2 的表达式与命题 6.2 的加权和逐纤维相等。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：命题 6.2 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y)=\\sum_v p_v H(X\\mid Y=v)$</span>，命题 9.2 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X\\mid Y=v)$</span> 作了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log|\\tau^{-1}(v)|-\\mathrm{KL}$</span> 的分解，逐项代入即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>至此，本节推导链在四个层面闭合：映射层（命题 1.2、定义 7.1、命题 7.2）、信息层（定理 2.1、推论 3.1、3.2、定理 7.3、推论 7.4）、算子层（定义 6.1、命题 6.2、推论 6.3）、几何层（命题 9.2、推论 9.3、命题 9.5）。四层共同刻画“离散化是不可逆的粗粒化”：不可逆性不是单一不等式，而是纤维划分、条件熵加权、KL 分解与复合单调性的一致结论，其数值可在第 14 节直接测量，其边界由第 10 节反例与第 12 节可逆性条件精确划定。</p>", "cjk": 61606, "missing": []};
